    ('0fde531d-8f17-52f4-8449-671407da2ca7', '7eb3480a-3d08-595c-a51b-cbf7a2d4f5b2', 'Flutter App Development for iOS; Flutter App Development for Android', 'I have an Android app built with Flutter, and I need help adapting it for iPhone. The work includes porting the existing app to iOS, ensuring it runs smoothly on Apple devices, and helping with the setup of an iOS developer account. I’m looking for someone who can handle the technical side of the transition and guide me through the initial steps of iOS development and account creation. android app: https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=ge.suvereni.khelisupali&hl=ka', 1, 'HOURLY', 387000.00, 775000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('51b1fb57-2d8f-58c1-97be-655e6d14dd7d', '977fe687-3b20-5470-8223-fa22e7643b09', 'Android App Development', 'We are seeking an experienced Android app developer to create a high-quality mobile application for our business. The ideal candidate will have a strong background in Android development and be able to deliver a functional, user-friendly app. Experience with mobile app design and development is essential. Please share your portfolio and relevant experience.', 1, 'HOURLY', 387000.00, 904000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('d9f0b83d-a311-525c-b8e9-622e67f8faf6', 'aa97b13b-b4d4-5142-b611-7e9c849e4529', 'Senior React Native Developer Needed to Enhance an Existing iOS & Android App', 'We are looking for an experienced React Native developer to help improve and expand an existing mobile application available on iOS and Android. The core application is already built, and we need a reliable developer who can work with our existing codebase, implement new features, integrate APIs, resolve bugs, and prepare stable releases for both platforms. We are looking for someone who can take ownership of assigned features, communicate clearly, and deliver clean, maintainable code. Responsibilities - Develop and maintain cross-platform mobile applications using React Native and TypeScript. - Integrate REST APIs and third-party services. - Implement secure authentication, user registration, and account management. - Build payment flows and subscription features where required. - Improve app performance, troubleshoot bugs, and handle edge cases. - Implement push notifications and real-time features when needed. - Manage iOS and Android builds, testing, and release preparation. - Collaborate with our backend developer and provide regular progress updates. Requirements - Proven experience with React Native for iOS and Android. - Strong knowledge of JavaScript, TypeScript, React Navigation, and state management. - Experience integrating REST APIs and handling authentication. - Familiarity with payment integrations such as Stripe or in-app subscriptions through RevenueCat. - Experience debugging existing codebases and resolving production issues. - Knowledge of App Store and Google Play deployment processes. - Ability to work independently and deliver features in clearly defined milestones. Nice to Have - Node.js and Express backend development. - Firebase authentication, push notifications, and real-time databases. - Experience with fintech, SaaS, e-commerce, logistics, or booking applications. Project Scope We will begin with a defined set of features and bug fixes. If the collaboration goes well, there may be opportunities for ongoing development and additional projects. When applying, please include: 1. Examples of React Native applications you have worked on. 2. Your experience integrating APIs, payments, or subscriptions. 3. An example of a challenging bug or production issue you resolved. 4. Your availability and estimated hourly rate. We value practical experience, clear communication, and reliable delivery over generic proposals.', 1, 'HOURLY', 310000.00, 517000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('77ebaedf-38ad-5f6e-a09a-55187c83a29f', 'a1c10c79-a0d4-5ea8-aaed-91c1082dec9c', 'Android App for Robot Interface', 'I am looking for an experienced Android/mobile app developer to build a custom Android app (.apk) named "AURA". AURA is an interactive desktop study companion robot engineered by Abdus Samad. The mobile application acts as the robot’s cognitive interface and voice: it communicates with Google Gemini API, transcribes voice commands, speaks responses, and sends real-time status signals over Bluetooth Low Energy (BLE) to an ESP32 microcontroller that drives animated OLED robot eyes.', 1, 'FIXED', 1292000.00, 1292000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('b9d54d89-095f-5d29-b116-4847b755df01', '45f0c620-99df-56d2-b732-7447276a4cba', 'Viết app cho thiết bị quét cầm tay chạy android 11', 'Tôi cần tìm người viết app cho thiết bị quét QR để truyền trực tiếp dữ liệu Https về sever. Giao diện do tôi cung cấp. Yêu cầu kỹ thuật - Có kinh nghiệm phát triển ứng dụng Android (Android 11 trở lên) - Thành thạo Java hoặc Kotlin Yêu cầu ứng viên - Có sản phẩm/demo hoặc dự án Android thực tế đã từng triển khai - Ưu tiên ứng viên đã từng làm app cho: Kho vận, bán lẻ, thiết bị phần cứng chuyên dụng...', 1, 'FIXED', 5000000.00, 10000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00');

