    updated_at = EXCLUDED.updated_at; testing bundles, pricing, subscription offers, upsells, cohorts, or retention; direct-response copywriting and wireframing; HTML/CSS/JavaScript or Shopify Liquid; international-market experience; and sensible use of AI with output validation. We’re interested in evidence of what you can do. Your application should show relevant CRO case studies, work samples, or examples and explain what you personally owned. How We Work We agree on priorities, responsibilities, quality standards, and deadlines. You’ll be expected to communicate progress, flag blockers early, and bring recommendations when something needs to change. You’ll have ownership within the agreed experimentation roadmap. Changes to product claims, pricing, discount limits, subscription terms, material spending, or major site functionality require the relevant approval. Working arrangement: Remote and output-based with a flexible schedule. Overlap with the Founder/creative strategists is not required; the Founder’s active times are GST. Why Work With Us - Meaningful ownership of a CRO program that is not yet being run consistently. - Direct collaboration with creative strategists and the team responsible for customer experience. - Remote, flexible, output-based working arrangement. Sounds like you? We''re keen to get to know how you fit with who we''re looking for for this role!', 1, 'HOURLY', 258000.00, 646000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('3e0e5b89-37bc-5b79-bd23-22b273cddb22', '37a632f7-b278-51fd-9620-00f2ea7c8226', 'Webflow Ecommerce Website Build', 'I run an ecommerce business and need a Webflow developer to build a custom online store that helps increase sales. The site should include home, collection, product, cart, and checkout pages, with a mobile-friendly design and clean structure for SEO and fast loading. I also need a Webflow CMS so I can update products and content myself, plus integrations for payments and analytics. The goal is a conversion-focused site that makes it easy for customers to browse and buy.', 1, 'HOURLY', 387000.00, 1550000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('4a2003a3-4e57-5cd2-b458-a05f0171c2ff', 'c649c5a8-d4b0-5a70-a365-a3888cecafda', 'THIẾT KẾ WEBSITE TMDT CHO WEBSITE ĐIỆN MÁY SỬ DỤNG LARAVEL', 'THIẾT KẾ WEBSITE TMDT CHO WEBSITE ĐIỆN MÁY SỬ DỤNG LARAVEL Chức năng giống web https://dungcuchinhhang.com Giao diện tham khảo cellphones Ưu tiên đầy đủ tính năng, thời gian bàn giao nhanh.', 1, 'FIXED', 10000000.00, 15000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('f34f5e97-776e-5197-9121-dec24e3635f0', '5ca154d4-1354-500c-9ff3-8dad6ac5442b', 'Xây dựng hệ thống quản lý đơn hàng & khách hàng (Order Management System – OMS)', 'Mình cần thuê Freelancer lập trình xây dựng một hệ thống quản lý đơn hàng và khách hàng phục vụ cho hoạt động kinh doanh nội bộ (quy mô nhỏ – vừa). Mục tiêu hệ thống Quản lý khách hàng Quản lý đơn hàng Theo dõi trạng thái xử lý đơn Xuất báo cáo cơ bản phục vụ quản lý ️ Phạm vi công việc chi tiết 1. Chức năng chính Đăng nhập / đăng xuất (Admin) CRUD Khách hàng (tên, SĐT, email, ghi chú) CRUD Đơn hàng Mã đơn Khách hàng Sản phẩm / dịch vụ Giá trị đơn Trạng thái: Mới → Đang xử lý → Hoàn thành / Huỷ Tìm kiếm, lọc đơn theo: Thời gian Trạng thái Khách hàng Dashboard tổng quan: Tổng số đơn Tổng doanh thu Số đơn theo trạng thái 2. Công nghệ (gợi ý – có thể trao đổi) Backend: Java Spring Boot hoặc NodeJS Frontend: ReactJS / NextJS hoặc VueJS Database: MySQL / PostgreSQL Có thể triển khai dạng: Web admin (responsive, không cần app mobile) 3. Yêu cầu khác Code rõ ràng, dễ bảo trì Có hướng dẫn setup & bàn giao source code Ưu tiên freelancer từng làm hệ thống quản lý nội bộ (CRM, OMS, ERP mini)', 1, 'FIXED', 10000000.00, 30000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('852b050b-ba8f-5d54-84a3-4cd8ef44143e', '9ca929ad-240b-5678-848f-00d7046f5775', 'Senior Shopify Developer: custom Theme, Vendor API Integration & B2B Gated showroom Setup', 'Project Overview: We are seeking an elite, U.S.-based Senior Shopify Developer for a strategic, long-term technical partnership with a fast-growing startup luxury brokerage firm. We already have all the ingredients ready—including our branding, high-resolution media, content, logo, and opening video assets. We do not need someone to build from scratch; we need an expert technical chef to assemble and engineer these elements into a spectacular, high-performing digital storefront and client portal. This is a dynamic brokerage platform involving complex moving parts—including private vault access, custom design workflows, and high-value transactions. This is a long-term collaboration, not a one-off build-and-leave assignment, built on a modular infrastructure that expands alongside our monthly growth. Core Architectural Requirements & Tiers: 1. Tier 1 — Core E-Commerce & Flexible Transaction Codes: Setup robust public commerce functionality supporting credit cards, Apple Pay, and Escrow.com. Crucially, the system must support custom transaction discount/tracking codes dynamically generated by our team for specific events or individual client sessions. 2. Tier 2 — Gated Vault & Diamond Showroom (Identity & Access Architecture): While general store areas are publicly accessible for immediate transactions, high-value sections (Diamonds, Vault items, and exclusive assets) require visitors to submit their information. Upon verification, the system must generate a unique, permanent client identification code that stays tied to that customer''s identity for all future transactions. 3. App-First Strategy & Custom Code Protocol: Developers must utilize established, high-quality Shopify ecosystem apps first. If custom code or external software is deemed necessary, it must be thoroughly reasoned for, formally pre-approved by the company in writing, and licensed strictly under company ownership. 4. Future-Proof API Extensibility: The backend architecture must be engineered so that our company can seamlessly plug in future vendor APIs down the line without altering core software or breaking existing code. 5. Non-Technical Daily Management: The entire storefront must be designed so that a non-technical employee can easily manage, update, and merchandise the site on a daily or hourly basis without developer intervention. 6. Pre-Launch Soft Opening (First 30 Days): The contract includes a mandatory 30-day limited public access window for stress-testing and operational smoothness prior to full general public launch. Strict Ownership & Partnership Standards: Absolute IP Ownership: Every detail of the website, code, database, customer data, software licenses, and assets are 100% the exclusive property of JDC. Upon termination or conclusion of the contract, zero proprietary rights remain with the developer. Long-Term Engagement & Real-Time Support: We reject "build-and-leave" freelancers. Candidates must provide realistic estimates for real-time troubleshooting and commit to ongoing platform optimization as our brokerage expands monthly. Budget & Terms: Fixed-Price Budget: $2,300 USD (structured across performance milestones). Location & Availability: U.S. only, with strong communication skills and availability for ongoing collaboration during U.S. business hours. Contract-to-hire potential for the right partner.', 1, 'FIXED', 59414000.00, 59414000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('eb38c1ee-d2d0-5a5c-bf2a-1e7c0605f2bc', '665cf855-b9d2-55f2-becd-78d2932fd2fc', 'Tuyển Shopify Developer build website B2B Custom Uniform Store cho thị trường Mỹ', 'Tôi cần thuê Shopify Developer có kinh nghiệm build website bán hàng quốc tế, đặc biệt là Shopify store có sản phẩm custom/personalized.', 1, 'FIXED', 3000000.00, 5000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
