    ('b1bb122a-401f-5cf1-bec6-109c9ccf5835', 'da2841c8-4e15-5bc2-b6cb-ece13f40e315', 'Paid consulting: Shopify AI support - review double-refund risk guard', 'Hiring Shopify AI experts for paid consulting call (30 min - $50). Context: I''m building a tool (Linden Guard) that verifies Shopify order status live before AI acts, to prevent double refunds when AI uses stale data. 1 line: await linden.verify(proposal) What I need from you: - 30 min call about how you handle refunds in Gorgias/Zendesk/Tidio + Shopify AI - Review my approach - does stale data cause double refunds for your clients? - If you can share (anonymized) last 100 refund actions, I''ll run analysis and return risk report - part of paid consulting This is paid user research, not a store build. Looking for 10 experts. Requirements: - Built AI agents for Shopify support (any helpdesk) - Manage refunds / order actions via AI - Top Rated / strong history $50 fixed for 30 min call + report review.', 1, 'FIXED', 1292000.00, 1292000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('ae768420-9817-5a74-8f63-6558ad10b968', '0a5fd41f-bc0a-5d53-9bf0-dc71d663220b', 'Shopify Store Design & Setup', 'Hi there， We are launching a premium DTC lifestyle brand and are looking for a highly communicative Shopify designer/developer based in Australia (Adelaide / ACST time zone preferred). Project Scope & Deliverables: 1. Theme Customization: Select and refine a premium Shopify theme fitting a clean, modern aesthetic with neutral/warm tones. 2. Design First: Must create and review page wireframes/layouts in Figma before live implementation on Shopify. 3. Page Creation: High-converting Homepage, Collections, Product Pages (7 SKUs), About Us, Contact & FAQ. 4. Local Setup: Australia GST, local shipping rules, and mobile responsiveness. Communication & Collaboration Rules (STRICT): - Location & Timezone: Australia-based (or able to align strictly with Adelaide / ACST working hours) for smooth, real-time collaboration. - High-touch Collaboration: Regular Zoom/Google Meet video calls are MANDATORY to review progress and align on visual execution. - Image Asset Review: Willingness to review photoshoots and visual assets live on screen shares to guarantee brand alignment. - Reliability: Strictly no unannounced ghosting, unexcused delays, or missing scheduled video calls. Payment Terms: - Project will be structured via Milestone Payments on Upwork (Design/Setup/Final Handover). Please share 3-5 links to minimalist Shopify stores you have designed.', 1, 'FIXED', 18082000.00, 18082000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('ee1ef20c-d9d8-520b-8199-466d2f64657f', 'a273a843-ca85-584b-b389-aa8fdd041369', 'Shopify Developer Needed: Replace Bundles + Record Setup Tutorial', 'I’m looking for a Shopify developer to build a reusable alternative to a Bundles app for the Shrine theme, without an ongoing revenue based app fee. You’ll work on ONE product in ONE small store. Once the solution is working, you’ll record a clear Loom walkthrough screen recording showing me how to implement it for other products and stores myself in a simple way. What I need: - A bundle selector with Buy 1, Buy 2, Buy 3 and Buy 4 options, each with an editable fixed total price. - Correct quantities, discounts and free-shipping eligibility through cart and checkout, not just displayed on the product page. - Compatibility with Shrine’s existing Add to Cart button and cart drawer. - A clean mobile-friendly design. I can provide a reference and starter Liquid code. - Reusable code and a step-by-step Loom covering installation, changing offers, any required Shopify settings, testing and safely replacing the old app. You’ll handle implementation and testing on the small store. I’ll handle replication across my other stores using your tutorial. Please include in your application: 1. Your proposed approach 2. Your delivery time Please apply only if you’re comfortable with both Shopify theme development and checkout discount behavior.', 1, 'FIXED', 1808000.00, 1808000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('b898b49c-d548-550a-9bca-d1d7747ccbe0', '09903dfc-d6bb-5489-a036-26c2ecb392e0', 'Tuyển Freelancer Thiết Kế & Triển Khai Website Shopify', 'Chúng tôi đang tìm freelancer có kinh nghiệm triển khai website thương mại điện tử trên nền tảng **Shopify** cho một thương hiệu mới trong lĩnh vực cao cấp/luxury. **Phạm vi công việc:** 1. Thiết lập và triển khai website bán hàng online trên **Shopify**. 2. Sử dụng và tùy chỉnh giao diện dựa trên Shopify theme **Valhalla**. 3. Xây dựng layout theo phong cách tham khảo từ một website skincare/luxury quốc tế, yêu cầu giao diện tinh gọn, sang trọng, dễ sử dụng và tối ưu trải nghiệm mua hàng. 4. Thiết lập các trang cơ bản, bao gồm: * Trang chủ * Trang danh mục sản phẩm * Trang chi tiết sản phẩm * Trang giỏ hàng / thanh toán * Trang giới thiệu thương hiệu * Trang liên hệ / chính sách cơ bản 5. Tối ưu hiển thị responsive trên desktop và mobile. 6. Hỗ trợ chỉnh sửa màu sắc, font, hình ảnh, bố cục theo nhận diện thương hiệu được cung cấp. 7. Bàn giao website hoàn chỉnh, dễ quản trị sản phẩm và nội dung. **Yêu cầu freelancer:** * Có kinh nghiệm thực tế với Shopify. * Biết tùy chỉnh theme Shopify, ưu tiên đã từng làm với các theme cao cấp hoặc layout luxury/minimal. * Có mắt thẩm mỹ tốt, hiểu UX/UI cho website bán hàng. * Có khả năng làm theo website tham khảo nhưng không sao chép y nguyên. * Giao tiếp rõ ràng, đúng deadline, có portfolio hoặc website đã từng thực hiện. **Khi ứng tuyển vui lòng gửi:** * Portfolio/các website Shopify đã làm. * Thời gian dự kiến hoàn thành. * Báo giá trọn gói hoặc theo từng giai đoạn. * Quy trình làm việc đề xuất.', 1, 'FIXED', 1000000.00, 10000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('f0eb76d1-50cd-5d8a-a683-c386784ba3ac', '09903dfc-d6bb-5489-a036-26c2ecb392e0', 'Mình cần làm website shopify', 'Mình cần làm website shopify bán hàng ở USA Bạn nào master phần này ib nhé', 1, 'FIXED', 3000000.00, 5000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('dc92499a-1425-5ac7-bae1-2f11eaf0c659', '09903dfc-d6bb-5489-a036-26c2ecb392e0', 'Dựng website bán hàng trên shopify', 'M cần dựng thiết kế hoàn chỉnh từ A đến Z cho website shopify bán hàng LGbt cho Mẽo gồm 1 trang shopify , 1 trang facebook và hệ thống marketing email theo chuỗi + popup này nọ nhìn chuyên nghiệp, thân thiện, và đẹp và dĩ nhiên là chốt sales cao Nói chung dự án phụ làm chơi nhưng cũng cần chỉnh chu ... Bạn nào làm dc thì ib m bàn thêm', 1, 'FIXED', 1000000.00, 2000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('84043346-aaff-5b95-b345-f9f46989daa7', '36eb4edd-804a-5ba6-98c3-6701612f8372', 'Xây hệ thống vận hành ứng dụng AI cho doanh nghiệp Ecommerce POD (Amazon, Etsy, Shopify, Tiktok...)', 'Chúng tôi là công ty thương mại điện tử Print-on-Demand, bán trên Amazon/Etsy/TikTok Shop, đang xây hệ thống vận hành tự động ứng dụng AI. Cần một freelancer giỏi đồng hành xây dựng hệ thống này, làm việc từ xa. Không gò bó công cụ — bạn có thể dùng nền tảng no-code (n8n, Make...), tự code, hoặc kết hợp. Quan trọng là hệ thống chạy ổn định, an toàn và dễ bàn giao. VIỆC GIAI ĐOẠN ĐẦU (1 quy trình mẫu để hai bên đánh giá nhau): Xây quy trình tự động nối khâu nghiên cứu sản phẩm sang khâu viết listing. Luồng việc: lấy dữ liệu sản phẩm từ công cụ → đưa qua AI (LLM) phân tích & chấm điểm → tạo bản nháp listing chuẩn SEO → đẩy vào nơi người duyệt kiểm tra. Quy trình có điểm dừng cho người kiểm duyệt trước các bước quan trọng. YÊU CẦU: - Có kinh nghiệm thực tế xây hệ thống/quy trình tự động (no-code hoặc tự code, có sản phẩm đã làm) - Biết tích hợp API và kết nối LLM (Claude/GPT/Gemini) - Hiểu nguyên tắc bảo mật: quản lý API key an toàn, không để lộ khóa - Làm việc có kỷ luật: test trước khi chạy thật, viết tài liệu bàn giao được - Ở tại Hà Nội, thuận tiện cho việc trao đổi trực tiếp khi cần. ƯU TIÊN: - Từng làm automation/hệ thống cho thương mại điện tử / Amazon / dropshipping - Hiểu nghiệp vụ listing, PPC, fulfill CÁCH LÀM VIỆC: Từ xa hoặc tại văn phòng. Gặp trao đổi khi cần. Bắt đầu bằng 1 quy trình mẫu, nếu hợp sẽ đồng hành dài hạn xây trọn bộ hệ thống. KHI CHÀO GIÁ, VUI LÒNG GỬI KÈM: 1. Link/mô tả 1-2 hệ thống tự động bạn từng xây 2. Một lần hệ thống của bạn từng gặp sự cố/gãy và cách bạn xử lý 3. Báo giá cho quy trình mẫu đầu tiên + cách tính phí dự án dài hạn', 1, 'FIXED', 30000000.00, 50000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('a82299a1-b511-526b-a414-e892c21ece6e', '8612dcfa-581e-5d39-8a1a-f04716e6314a', 'Thiết kế website Shopify bán đồ khô châu Á tại Bắc Âu tích hợp POS và Kho', 'Mục tiêu: Xây dựng website thương mại điện tử chuyên nghiệp trên nền tảng Shopify cho cửa hàng đồ khô châu Á hoạt động tại thị trường Bắc Âu. Phạm vi công việc: - Thiết kế giao diện website hiện đại, tối ưu trải nghiệm người dùng và tương thích thiết bị di động. - Cấu hình cửa hàng cho khoảng 1000 mặt hàng sản phẩm. - Tích hợp các cổng thanh toán và đơn vị vận chuyển phổ biến tại khu vực Bắc Âu. - Kết nối website với hệ thống POS và phần mềm quản lý hàng tồn kho hiện có của cửa hàng để đồng bộ dữ liệu thời gian thực. Yêu cầu đối với freelancer: - Có kinh nghiệm thực chiến triển khai Shopify cho các dự án thương mại điện tử quốc tế. - Có năng lực kỹ thuật trong việc tích hợp API, kết nối POS và hệ thống quản lý kho. - Ưu tiên ứng viên từng làm việc với các đơn vị vận chuyển và thanh toán', 1, 'FIXED', 5000000.00, 20000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('a6fa7db1-2672-5866-be46-fcfd4701e52c', '7961fc76-3a05-5ba4-babf-7cf63200cb55', 'Expert Meta Ads Media Buyer Needed | Scaling Shopify & E-commerce Brands | Long-Term', 'We are looking for a highly experienced and results-driven Meta Ads Media Buyer who specializes in scaling Shopify and e-commerce brands through Facebook and Instagram advertising. We need someone who goes beyond simply launching campaigns. You should have a deep understanding of performance marketing, creative testing, campaign optimization, and profitable scaling. Our goal is to work with an expert who can consistently identify winning strategies, improve advertising performance, and drive sustainable revenue growth. This is a potential long-term opportunity for the right candidate. Key Responsibilities * Campaign Management: Build, manage, and optimize Meta Ads campaigns focused on e-commerce purchases and revenue growth. * Profitable Scaling: Develop strategies to increase advertising spend while maintaining strong profitability and efficient customer acquisition costs. * Creative Testing: Continuously test new ad creatives, hooks, angles, formats, and messaging to identify winning combinations. * Performance Optimization: Monitor and optimize ROAS, CPA, CPM, CTR, CPC, conversion rates, and other key performance indicators. * Audience Strategy: Develop effective prospecting, retargeting, broad targeting, and Advantage+ campaign strategies. * Tracking & Attribution: Ensure accurate tracking through Meta Pixel, Conversion API (CAPI), and Shopify integrations. * Data Analysis: Analyze campaign performance and make strategic decisions based on actual results. * Creative Strategy: Provide actionable insights and recommendations for UGC videos, static images, and other high-performing ad formats. * Reporting: Provide clear performance reports explaining results, optimizations, and next steps. Requirements * Proven track record managing and scaling Meta Ads for Shopify or other e-commerce brands. * Extensive hands-on experience with Meta Ads Manager. * Strong understanding of e-commerce customer acquisition, profitability, and scaling strategies. * Experience managing substantial monthly advertising budgets. * Deep knowledge of creative testing frameworks and identifying winning ads. * Strong understanding of Meta Pixel, CAPI, attribution, and Shopify analytics. * Ability to analyze data and proactively improve campaign performance. * Experience with both prospecting and retargeting strategies. * Excellent communication skills and the ability to work independently. What Makes You a Great Fit We are looking for someone who thinks like a growth partner, not just an ads manager. You understand that successful media buying is not only about achieving a high ROAS, but also about acquiring customers profitably, testing consistently, and building scalable advertising systems. You know when to scale, when to optimize, and when to stop underperforming campaigns. Most importantly, you can explain your decisions using real data and measurable results. Important: Please include real examples, screenshots, or case studies demonstrating your previous results. Applications without relevant e-commerce experience will not be prioritized. Long-Term Opportunity We are looking for a reliable, proactive, and experienced media buyer interested in building a long-term working relationship. If you have a proven ability to scale Shopify brands profitably and are confident in your media buying skills, we would love to hear from you.', 1, 'HOURLY', 904000.00, 1937000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('a5750c6c-efb9-5f4d-a87c-3776c223449e', '84494675-0f5f-54aa-afec-35f4249f7358', 'WooCommerce Website Developer Needed', 'We’re looking for a reliable, experienced freelance developer who we can work with on an ongoing, as-needed basis. We need someone who can step in whenever technical work arises, whether that involves fixing bugs, making changes to existing systems, developing new features, or supporting new projects. This is not a full-time role or a monthly retainer. Instead, we’re looking to build a long-term relationship with a dependable developer who can become familiar with our systems and be available to take on work as and when required. We want someone we can return to whenever we have a development need, without having to recruit a new freelancer for every project.', 1, 'HOURLY', 258000.00, 646000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('bafdbc90-77a9-5b9d-b1f7-575bfe5a4658', '84494675-0f5f-54aa-afec-35f4249f7358', 'WordPress/WooCommerce Expert Needed', 'We need a reliable freelancer to diagnose and fix checkout and payment issues on our WordPress/WooCommerce website. The work includes identifying the root cause of errors, resolving broken payment flows, and ensuring the checkout process works smoothly for customers. You should be able to test the fixes thoroughly and confirm that payments complete without errors. This is a small, focused project for someone who can quickly troubleshoot and improve the checkout experience.', 1, 'FIXED', 646000.00, 646000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('8aace4ce-22ac-57b0-9418-0e5cf2837380', '667099e5-7d42-5281-bb50-028853edb574', 'WordPress/WooCommerce Developer Needed – Add E-Commerce Store to Existing Website (No Redesign)', 'We are looking for an experienced WordPress developer to help us expand our existing website, GeniusDentalSystems.com, by adding e-commerce functionality. Our website currently focuses on educational content, including blogs, videos, and professional resources. We would like to preserve its existing structure and functionality while introducing an online store to sell merchandise, books, and digital educational materials. We are considering WooCommerce as a potential solution but are open to other recommendations that offer a good balance of functionality, simplicity, and cost. Project Scope: Integrate an e-commerce store into our existing WordPress website. Create a professional storefront consistent with our current branding. Set up product categories for merchandise, books, and digital resources. Configure product variations, including sizes, colors, and pricing. Integrate secure payment processing and checkout. Configure shipping, applicable sales taxes, and automated order notifications. Provide basic inventory and order management capabilities. Ensure mobile compatibility and ease of navigation. Allow us to independently add products, update pricing, and manage orders. Ideally, support future integration with print-on-demand services such as Printful or Printify. Budget and Project Expectations This is a new business initiative, and we plan to begin with a relatively small selection of products, expanding gradually as demand develops. Since the store is not yet generating revenue, we want to be mindful of our initial investment. Our preference is to leverage existing WordPress functionality, established e-commerce plugins, and cost-effective solutions rather than invest in unnecessary custom development. That said, we value quality, reliability, and a professional customer experience. We are open to reasonable recommendations that provide meaningful benefits and support future growth. We would appreciate the following information: Your recommended approach for integrating e-commerce into our existing website. An estimated fixed project cost, including any required plugins or subscriptions. An estimated timeline for completion. Examples of similar projects you have completed. Any anticipated ongoing maintenance costs. Whether basic training on managing products and orders is included. If possible, we would also appreciate a distinction between the essential features needed for an initial launch and any optional enhancements that could be implemented later. Our goal is to establish a functional, attractive, and scalable online store while keeping the initial investment proportionate to the current stage of the business. Thank you for your time. We look forward to reviewing your proposal. Best regards,', 1, 'FIXED', 19374000.00, 19374000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('66878bfe-fa9b-5fc4-ad0a-233c14a3f43a', '9a984f50-fed1-5974-b4a7-4285d494f184', 'WooCommerce Store Setup on Namecheap VPS', 'I need help building and configuring a fast, secure WooCommerce digital key and software store on my Namecheap VPS. The work includes setting up the store, enabling automated license delivery, routing external emails properly, and migrating products from OpenCart to WooCommerce. I’m looking for someone who can handle the technical setup, ensure smooth operation, and help make the store reliable and easy to manage.', 1, 'FIXED', 7750000.00, 7750000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('0a7b4980-1e63-59d0-84d8-c9a406451518', '41e1c862-7a0d-5ca3-a146-5eca5dcd251a', 'Customily + WooCommerce Specialist Needed', 'We need a specialist to build a personalized product store for a small business (Production‑Ready Build). The work includes setting up the store, integrating Customily for product personalization, and ensuring the checkout and order process works smoothly. You should be able to handle product setup, customization options, and support for a simple, reliable customer experience. Please share relevant examples of similar stores or e-commerce projects you have completed. We have launched a personalized product line and needs an expert who can fully configure Customily + WooCommerce for a production‑ready storefront. This is NOT a basic plugin setup — we need someone who understands Customily’s personalization logic, variant mapping, and print‑ready output workflows. Platform Requirements WooCommerce Variable product architecture with attributes (size, color, material, style). Variation‑specific SKU logic aligned with production workflow. Theme compatibility and UI optimization for Customily’s personalization iframe. Checkout flow optimized for custom products (validation, preview confirmation, error handling). Plugin conflict testing and performance optimization. Customily Template creation for each product type. Variant‑specific mockups and dynamic layer mapping. Conditional personalization logic (e.g., text fields, image uploads, clipart, color selectors). Real‑time preview accuracy across desktop + mobile. Print‑ready output configuration (DPI, bleed, safe zones). Automated production file routing. Responsibilities: Build Customily templates for multiple product types. Configure variant‑specific mockups and dynamic layers. Map WooCommerce variations to Customily templates. Ensure accurate real‑time previews. Set up print‑ready file generation and routing. Optimize product pages for UX and performance. Test full order → production workflow. Requirements: Proven Customily experience (show live examples). Strong WooCommerce variable product knowledge. Experience with POD workflows and print‑ready files. Ability to optimize Customily’s mobile UI. Strong communication and documentation skills. Nice to Have: Experience with glass/acrylic printing. PHP/JS for Customily customization. Deliverables 1. Product Architecture Define product attributes and variations. Build variable products in WooCommerce. Map each variation to the correct Customily template. Ensure SKU → Template → Production file alignment. 2. Customily Template Development For each product: Build base template. Add personalization fields. Configure dynamic layers. Upload mockups and align artwork zones. Test live preview accuracy. Configure print‑ready output. 3. Integration & Sync Connect WooCommerce → Customily. Sync templates to products. Validate variation mapping. Test order flow end‑to‑end. 4. UX & UI Optimize product page layout. Add clear personalization instructions. Ensure mobile responsiveness. Improve load performance for Customily iframe. 5. Operational Workflow Production file automation. Order management workflow. Fulfillment routing. QA testing across devices. 6. Launch‑Readiness Security, backups, caching. Checkout testing. Production file validation. Final UX review. Go‑live support. To Apply: Send: Links to similar Customily projects you’ve built. Explanation of how you handle variant‑specific mockups. Example of a print‑ready output you configured.', 1, 'FIXED', 12916000.00, 12916000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('0b210113-0c2e-51f1-b73b-267144074e23', '9e3f103f-bf70-59d1-b5ba-d9a5d3eae21f', 'Cần làm tool đăng sản phẩm từ shopee sang woocommerce', 'Như tiêu đề, mình cần lấy thông tin sản phẩm từ Shopee về Woocommerce tự động, dễ dùng. Trước đây bên mình có làm tool scrape rồi nhưng hay bị lỗi và cũng rất mất công. Mình thấy trên Haravan có thể link sản phẩm từ shopee trực tiếp về website, không biết Woocomerce thì có làm được như vậy không? Có thể cài plugin nào trên woo không? Nhờ bạn nào có kinh nghiệm tư vấn giúp bên mình ạ.', 1, 'FIXED', 200000.00, 2000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('df580081-584d-5adc-b3bb-09657de9fa3e', '826256d6-6038-55ee-8cc9-5ab589e169c9', 'THIẾT KẾ & XÂY DỰNG WEBSITE BÁN HOA ONLINE', 'Cần build website cho shop bán hoa. Có giỏ hàng mua bán được. Ngoài ra, website cần đảm bảo giao diện thân thiện, phù hợp với ngành hoa – quà tặng, hiển thị tốt trên máy tính và bản di động và ốc độ tải trang ổn định. Yêu cầu ứng viên - Có kinh nghiệm thiết kế và xây dựng website bán hàng / website thương mại điện tử - Nắm được quy trình triển khai từ giao diện đến chức năng đặt hàng - Có khả năng tư vấn giải pháp phù hợp với quy mô shop - Chủ động trao đổi, làm rõ yêu cầu và đề xuất phương án tối ưu - Ưu tiên ứng viên từng thực hiện website cho lĩnh vực bán lẻ, quà tặng, F&B (không bắt buộc)', 1, 'FIXED', 1000000.00, 3000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('447549f4-ab59-5a5a-8dee-6e12f3b66d1f', 'c38c91d6-1e30-56cf-af7e-58401b7e0840', 'Thiết kế và xây dựng website bán hàng hóa chuyên nghiệp', 'Thiết kế giao diện,các trang cần thiết , tính năng cho khách hàng, trang quản trị Yêu cầu đối với freelancer: + Bản giao đầy đủ mã nguồn + Code sạch, cguaanr SEO và bảo mật tốt + Hổ trợ bảo hành', 1, 'FIXED', 5001000.00, 10001000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('9560a5e6-e3f1-5503-aa59-4538cf150fcc', '9f5c60b5-893b-5181-be47-272681812e23', 'RevenueCat assistance IOS Paywall and Payment', 'I''m looking for an experienced RevenueCat and Apple App Store Connect specialist to help troubleshoot and finalise in-app purchase configurations for two existing iOS applications. Important: I am the developer and will handle all application code changes myself. I do not need development services and will not provide source code access. Most of the work is already completed. I need someone who understands RevenueCat and Apple''s in-app purchase systems to identify what isn''t configured correctly and guide me through fixing it. App 1: Telepromptify (Priority) Telepromptify is an existing teleprompter application using RevenueCat for monthly and yearly subscriptions. I''ve already completed most of the RevenueCat setup, including products, offerings and the paywall. However, something isn''t quite right, and I need an experienced person to review my existing configuration, identify the issue and guide me through resolving it. Areas to review: Existing RevenueCat products, entitlements and offerings. Monthly and yearly subscription configurations. 3-day free trial for eligible yearly subscribers only. Existing RevenueCat paywall configuration and behaviour. Restore Purchases functionality and requirements. App Store Connect subscription configuration. Sandbox testing and subscription verification. Any configuration issues affecting App Store approval. I''m not looking to rebuild the integration. I want to understand and fix the remaining issues. App 2: Photo Cull Photo Cull is an existing iOS application with a one-time purchase rather than a subscription. I need help with: Verifying the non-consumable in-app purchase configuration. Checking RevenueCat configuration, where applicable. Understanding and verifying Restore Purchases. Confirming correct App Store Connect configuration. Guidance on sandbox purchase testing. How I Want to Work Ideally, we will have a live screen-sharing session where you can review my RevenueCat and App Store Connect configurations. I will perform any application code changes myself. You will help identify issues, explain the correct configuration and guide me through fixing them. No source code access is required or provided. Most of the implementation is already completed. This is targeted troubleshooting and expert guidance, not a development project. When applying, please confirm your RevenueCat experience and whether you are comfortable working through screen sharing without accessing source code.', 1, 'FIXED', 1292000.00, 1292000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('8b5a6266-f5eb-557d-af2f-3f25ac06c90b', 'cac570df-3f11-594d-9c87-b72682c474cb', 'Payment & Checkout UX Tester – Bosnia', 'We''re looking for testers based in Bosnia to evaluate the checkout and payment experience on iGaming platforms. The goal is to identify usability issues, errors, and friction points in the payment flow for local users. No prior testing experience is needed. Requirements -Currently living in Bosnia -A payment card issued by a Bosnian bank -Able to follow written instructions carefully -Clear, detailed written feedback -Testing must be done from your normal connection (no VPN or proxy) What you''ll do -Create an account on a website we provide -Complete a checkout/payment flow following our instructions -Evaluate how smooth, clear, and reliable the process is -Note any errors, delays, or unexpected behavior -Record a screen video or provide other evidence of the test Payment -Full fee paid for each successfully completed test -If the test can''t be completed due to a technical or payment-side issue, 50% of the agreed fee is paid', 1, 'FIXED', 517000.00, 517000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('5e17097c-2930-546e-acf1-c19c79f4cfa9', 'c212022b-db46-599a-9dbe-0fb2400848bf', 'Payment & Checkout UX Tester – Slovenia', 'We''re looking for testers based in Slovenia to evaluate the checkout and payment experience on iGaming platforms. The goal is to identify usability issues, errors, and friction points in the payment flow for local users. No prior testing experience is needed. Requirements -Currently living in Slovenia -A payment card issued by a Slovenian bank -Able to follow written instructions carefully -Clear, detailed written feedback -Testing must be done from your normal connection (no VPN or proxy) What you''ll do -Create an account on a website we provide -Complete a checkout/payment flow following our instructions -Evaluate how smooth, clear, and reliable the process is -Note any errors, delays, or unexpected behavior -Record a screen video or provide other evidence of the test Payment -Full fee paid for each successfully completed test -If the test can''t be completed due to a technical or payment-side issue, 50% of the agreed fee is paid', 1, 'FIXED', 1033000.00, 1033000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('956781ed-1402-5223-8867-3d81aa751310', '50f40e75-8692-530f-8b9d-acca93c03d75', 'Payment & Checkout UX Tester – Montenegro', 'We''re looking for testers based in Montenegro to evaluate the checkout and payment experience on iGaming platforms. The goal is to identify usability issues, errors, and friction points in the payment flow for local users. No prior testing experience is needed. Requirements -Currently living in Montenegro -A payment card issued by Montenegro bank -Able to follow written instructions carefully -Clear, detailed written feedback -Testing must be done from your normal connection (no VPN or proxy) What you''ll do -Create an account on a website we provide -Complete a checkout/payment flow following our instructions -Evaluate how smooth, clear, and reliable the process is -Note any errors, delays, or unexpected behavior -Record a screen video or provide other evidence of the test Payment -Full fee paid for each successfully completed test -If the test can''t be completed due to a technical or payment-side issue, 50% of the agreed fee is paid', 1, 'FIXED', 1033000.00, 1033000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('e15ca876-83ec-5d9b-9742-be106a383a3f', 'ee15aee2-0061-551b-8119-8aa291b169c5', 'QA Payment Tester in Greece', 'We are looking for freelance testers based in Greece to help us verify the checkout and payment flows of various websites. You will be testing how local payment methods perform for real users. What you will do: - Register on a website and navigate to the payment section. - Perform a deposit using a local Visa card. - Complete a withdrawal of the funds. - Record your screen during the process and report any issues you encounter. Requirements: - You must reside in Greece. - You must have access to a local Visa card (local BIN). - You must have an Android phone and a Windows computer with the Chrome browser. - You must be able to communicate in Greek and English. - You must not use a VPN while testing. How pay works: - Payment is made for each completed test assignment. - Money needed for the test itself is provided separately. You will never use your own money for the deposits. - Reliable testers who provide high-quality reports will receive more assignments and can earn more over time. This job post was prepared with AI assistance and reviewed by our team.', 1, 'FIXED', 129000.00, 129000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('0801f9f5-2cad-5628-bf4a-a5058cda0871', 'bcc32bf7-7ad7-50ee-a5c0-f1304cf3ca0f', 'iGaming App Studio (Agencies Only)', 'Hey there! We''re planning three iGaming apps back to back, all aimed at players in the US and Canada. Instead of hiring a new team each time, we want one solid studio we can grow with across all three. Ideally you''ve already shipped iGaming apps to the App Store or Google Play. Native or cross-platform both work for us. What matters most to us: - **Paywalls.** You know how to build purchase and subscription screens that people actually buy from, and you''ve tested and tweaked them. - **Onboarding.** You know how to get a new player hooked in their first few minutes. - **Micro-animations.** Not required, but a big plus. We care about the small moments that make an app feel alive. We''re looking for companies only this time, not solo freelancers. Our team works on European time (CET), so you''ll need to be available during EU working hours. Your players will be in North America, but we''ll be talking to you from Europe. If this sounds like your kind of work, I''d love to see what you''ve built! ## Screening questions 1. Can you share links to 2–3 live iGaming apps you''ve built, and tell us what your team did on each? 2. Tell us about a paywall or onboarding flow you worked on. What changed after launch? 3. How big is your team, where are you based, and how many of your working hours overlap with CET (Central European Time)? 4. Do you have 2D artists or animators in-house? (Not a requirement, just good to know.)', 1, 'HOURLY', 517000.00, 1033000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('2b630b0b-7ea1-529a-807b-2e00d7799909', 'd04c0fd5-1e18-57d8-9ed8-e93e4a19b948', 'Funnelish Expert for Ongoing Funnel Builds (3-4 per Week)', 'Hey there We are an e-commerce company running multiple product funnels, and we are looking for a reliable Funnelish expert for ongoing work. You will not be starting from scratch. For every funnel we give you: - A pre-built Funnelish template - Product details, copy, and images - A clear layout reference so you know exactly what to do YOUR TASKS - Set up and customize funnels inside Funnelish - Replace text, visuals, and offers for each product - Connect the integrations we use (Pixel, email, etc.) - Test everything so it works smoothly on mobile and desktop THE WORKLOAD AND BUDGET We need 3 to 4 funnels per week, ongoing. Because everything is prepared for you, each funnel should take under an hour once you know our template. Our budget is around $25 per week for this volume. Please only apply if that works for you. YOU ARE A GOOD FIT IF YOU - Have real, hands-on experience with Funnelish - Understand e-commerce funnels and conversion logic - Communicate clearly and pay attention to detail - Can show examples of funnels you have built BONUS IF YOU HAVE - Experience with Shopify, Meta Ads, or automations WHAT WE OFFER - Continuous work, new funnels every week - Clear briefs and fast communication - A friendly, long-term collaboration We already have people doing this work. We are adding one more person to help with the volume. TO APPLY Please answer the questions below and include links to funnels you have built.', 1, 'HOURLY', 181000.00, 258000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('b7865ce2-a4d0-5519-8d94-bc9a5a434322', 'a7408f09-2013-5ea7-86e8-af2a50fa278c', 'Lovable + Supabase Developer Needed to Build Automated Onboarding Funnel (ASAP)', 'We’re looking for an experienced Lovable developer / automation specialist to build a multi-step onboarding funnel with backend integrations. Must be available to start immediately and deliver a working MVP within 1–3 days. We already have the workflow mapped out and need someone who can execute quickly with minimal hand-holding. Project Scope * Build a multi-step onboarding funnel in Lovable * Lead registration and data collection * External signup flow with screenshot verification * Admin dashboard to review and approve submissions * Automated approval/rejection notifications * Discord community access workflow * CRM and email marketing integrations * Basic lead tracking and status management Tech Stack * Lovable * Supabase / Lovable Cloud * Zapier * Close CRM * Kit (ConvertKit) * Discord * Webhooks / APIs Requirements * Proven experience with Lovable and backend integrations * Strong understanding of Zapier and API workflows * Ability to work independently and troubleshoot issues * Clear communication and fast turnaround * Available to start immediately To Apply Please include: 1. Examples of Lovable projects you’ve built. 2. Experience integrating Zapier, Close CRM, Kit, or Discord. 3. Confirmation you can start immediately. 4. Whether you can deliver a functional MVP within 1–3 days. We’re looking for someone reliable who can potentially support additional development and automation projects.', 1, 'HOURLY', 517000.00, 1033000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('07d88617-a05c-56e8-8023-b6b6ab49a5f4', '91834814-74b6-5a87-bc73-720856d4e24c', 'Web Architect for Funnel and Sales', 'I need a web architect fluent in funnels and Go High Level who can build a website for wealth-building-series focused on selling e-books and assessments related to student loan debt and financial literacy. The site should include funnel integrations with payment processors and a product store for books hosted on Lulu and Amazon. The role includes a guaranteed base of $150 per month, plus a 10% net commission (after business overhead and marketing commissions) once monthly sales reach $3,000 or more.', 1, 'FIXED', 46498000.00, 46498000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('46a5163c-7828-53f9-8bec-eb13dfae8b89', '1e8c7cc2-7e59-5f39-93c1-c97e3ebeeeb8', 'Senior Flutter + Node.js Developer', 'P2P Fit Tech AI is entering its final development and go-to-market stage. We need a senior full-stack mobile engineer to take our existing codebase through final production, QA, TestFlight, and App Store submission. This is not a rebuild. You will audit the current build, complete remaining integrations, fix production blockers, and deliver a stable launch-ready application. Responsibilities include stabilizing the Flutter iOS app and Node.js backend, securing checkout and Apple IAP, handling entitlements, promo codes, webhooks, refunds, cancellations, and account restoration. You will also complete gym membership logic, preserve existing UI/UX and APIs, fix bugs and crashes, test subscriptions and security, and prepare the final TestFlight build for App Store submission.', 1, 'HOURLY', 646000.00, 1214000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('d7206b5f-72de-51be-bcfb-84affdef0cc2', '9bd96068-6e8a-59d0-b51d-412a3a1a687e', 'Web Developer: Set Up Toast Online Ordering Store (Grocery, Liquor, Meat, Deli & Catering)', 'We are looking for a freelance web developer with deep experience in the Toast POS ecosystem to launch our online ordering platform. We currently use Toast POS in-store and have an existing informational website. We need an expert to set up the website template integrated into Toast, style it to match our current site, and cleanly separate our daily store ordering from our Catering department. Our business features groceries, liquor, a full meat department, custom deli sandwiches, and a dedicated catering service. The freelancer will be responsible for creating an organized online ordering flow that routes regular store orders to the correct in-store printers and catering orders to our catering fulfillment pipeline. Key Responsibilities: • Toast Template Setup & Styling: Activate, style, and customize the Toast-integrated website template to match the exact branding, colors, and logo of our existing informational website. • Website Connection: Seamlessly link our existing informational website to the Toast online ordering page (e.g., creating distinct "Order Food/Groceries" and "Order Catering" entry points). • Multi-Department Menu Configuration: Organize our Toast backend menus for a smooth customer experience across five major categories: • Catering: Large platters, bulk packages, and advanced scheduling/notice requirements. • Deli Sandwiches: Complex modifier groups for custom sandwich builds (bread, toppings, sauces). • Meat Department & Groceries: Clean categorization for standard grocery and butcher items. • Liquor: Age-restricted settings with clear checkout disclaimers or prompts. • Testing & Routing: Test the entire ordering process on mobile and desktop to ensure that regular orders and catering orders are accurately routed to the correct prep stations/printers with correct lead times.', 1, 'HOURLY', 258000.00, 646000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00');

