    updated_at = EXCLUDED.updated_at; stop = 50%, targets T1–T7, add after a fast T1 - we rebuilt their report (14/17 numbers match) and their screen Our replica fires ~10 signals per night; the bot takes ~4 and skips the rest. We need the missing FILTER that decides which signals it takes, plus the few entries that are not prev-hour breaks (e.g. rebounds to a Murrey line). You get: every signal since 5 Oct labeled taken/skipped, 1-s SPX and option quotes, our live screen fields per minute, all daily reports (theirs and ours), chart images, and the bot''s entry/exit times. Acceptance: 1) fit on 5–19 Oct only; we score once on unseen days (20–23 Oct) 2) Final acceptance is LIVE: your rule runs on our live screen data for 3 trading days (day + overnight) and must match the bot''s real entries as they happen. Pass = precision ≥ 40% and recall ≥ 50% per session, entry within 60 s. The rule must be causal and delivered as plain logic + a Python function. Payment: fixed price in 2 milestones; the second is paid only after the live test passes. Skills: Python, pandas, scikit-learn, intraday options trading; TradingView/Pine Script a plus.', 1, 'FIXED', 25832000.00, 25832000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('21b949a3-c1ab-586e-bf2f-74b3b33ab80b', 'b8c4b641-6d09-5f22-a476-1367168f5331', 'Grok Bot Expert', 'We’re looking for an experienced Grok bot developer to consult with us on a part-time, as-needed basis. This is an hourly, pay-as-you-go engagement. You bill only for the time we actually use, with no minimum commitment to start. What you’ll help with: Advising on building, configuring and improving bots powered by Grok / the xAI API Reviewing our current setup and recommending best practices (prompting, tool use, integrations, cost and performance) Troubleshooting issues and answering technical questions as they come up Joining occasional calls to walk through ideas and solutions What we’re looking for: Hands-on experience building with Grok / the xAI API (real projects, not just experimenting) Solid understanding of LLM bot architecture: prompts, function calling, APIs and integrations Clear communicator who can explain things simply and give direct recommendations Reliable and responsive for ad-hoc requests Long-term opportunity: We’re starting small, but this could grow into a full-time position down the road for the right person. We’re looking for someone we can build a lasting working relationship with. ⚠️ How to apply (required): Include a 30-second Loom video showing something you’ve built or done with Grok. A quick screen share and walkthrough is perfect. Applications without a Loom will not be considered.', 1, 'HOURLY', 517000.00, 1033000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('f16fe951-825c-5906-894e-ec47d93ac734', '1f678765-6de2-5e79-9e55-f3024ddbdeec', 'Need Expert in Email Bot Automation - Create Bot Filtering System', 'We are a custom marketing platform Evolved Office. We provide custom content and bulk marketing servies. Lately we have noticed a large uptick in the number of automated engagments being generated from customer broadcasts. We need to refine our existing system to identify and separate out automated from human / organic engagments so that our customers can continue to trust the leads generated. Our platform is .NET MVC based with an MSSQL 2019 database. We use a third party service to do the sending and engagment capture via webhooks. We capture all information including user agent, IP address and events for opens, clicks, bounces and unsubscribes. We are looking for someone who is an expert in identifying automated / bot patterns in the incoming data in order to build a system that is scalable and adaptable as new bot patterns emerge. This is a position that we would like to retain long-term to help maintain this system and make / suggest changes where needed. This would include: 1) Identifyting data-center IPs 2) Identifying User Agents likely to be used by bots 3) Click / Open frequency densities 4) Clicks for all template links (unlikely for humans)', 1, 'HOURLY', 646000.00, 1033000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('faebeb46-5ce2-5a2c-8027-dde711122ecc', 'ad4fbc24-0278-51fa-8053-e17d224324e8', 'Thiết kế website check acc bị back, có tích hợp bot telegram và discord', 'Mình cần làm một website để check acc game có tiền sử bị back (nhiều game), cho user sử dụng. + Tìm kiếm, tra cứu xem acc đó có từng bị back hay chưa. + User có thể báo cáo những tk game bị back. + Kết hợp được với bot (telegram, discord) để tra cứu. + Có thể quảng bá dịch vụ khác ở website này (không buôn bán gì ở website này cả). ......... Có thể tư vấn thêm cho mình vài task phù hợp khác. - Tài chính khoảng 10m - Ưu tiên khu vực HCM có thể làm việc trực tiếp. - Hỗ trợ xây thêm nếu mình có thêm ý tưởng mới (trả phí theo task xây dựng thêm sau này).', 1, 'FIXED', 1000000.00, 10000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('f5968ac7-7fe9-5bb9-bd58-c9c05fc18752', '19062c2b-bfe9-5661-92b5-995643f81c42', 'Cần người viết chương trình bot bằng Python giao dịch crypto trên binance', 'Giới thiệu bài toán: Thị trường có 2 trạng thái là swing hoặc trend. Bot này là market maker nên sẽ chạy tốt trong swing, gặp vấn đề khi gặp trend. Cần giải quyết bài toán “trend detection” với tỉ lệ 75% cho coin BTCUSDT binance future. Có đính kèm sample code Yêu cầu output: Nhập vào khoảng thời gian từ a tới b (tối thiểu 1 năm) , interval tùy chọn phù hợp với chiến lược của mình (15m, 1h, ..) In ra file csv danh sách kline, mỗi kline gồm thời gian, các giá trị OHLCV, và một nhãn status. Status = 0: kline nằm trong swing, status = 1: kline nằm trong trend tăng, status = -1: kline nằm trong trend giãm. Bạn chỉ cần gửi output, sau khi review output nếu giải thuật có tiềm năng, tôi sẽ phỏng vấn để chắc chắn output đó không phải hardcode, bạn sẽ được thuê theo tháng để tiếp tục improve, nếu giải thuật hoạt động perfect chúng tôi sẽ mua giải thuật trọn gói. Một câu hỏi là: chương trình của bạn hiên đang tỉ lệ dán nhãn chính xác là bao nhiêu? Bạn nghĩ là có thể cái tiến lên được bao nhiêu trong thời gian bao lâu? Trong project tôi có kèm 2 chương trình: sample_trend_detection.py, sẽ cho ra output csv. trend_visualize.py: chương trình này sẽ vẽ đồ thị BTC với status từ file input csv để các bạn check tính hiệu quả của program. Ví dụ trên đồ thị các bạn thấy giá tăng tạo thành trend mà output các bạn, nhấp nháy 0,1 liên tục là không đúng, nó phải là số 1 liên tục. Sau khi các bạn chỉnh program OK, thì có thể gửi tôi output, như vậy tôi đỡ phải review. Nếu bạn có phiên bản tạm được để improve thì chúng ta bàn tiếp hợp đồng. Một cách khác không cần nhìn đồ thị để kiểm tra, các bạn thực hiện trade đơn giản như sau: trend = 0: close all position at close price of kline trend = 1: open long position at close price of kline trend = -1: open short position at close price of kline Sau đó tính lời lỗ khi trade theo tín hiệu của bạn, xem lời lỗ bao nhiêu %, vì còn phải trừ phí giao dịch, nên kì vọng mỗi năm lời 30% (là perfect) vì trừ phí giao dịch và trượt giá do lệnh market khoảng 10%.', 1, 'FIXED', 5000000.00, 100000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('e65fc0ff-c7ec-5c5f-a8e8-e6b02348fbbe', 'eb68ce2f-df63-5b23-b29f-a8f7f3356bcd', 'Tạo rô bốt phun thuốc tự động', 'Thiết kế cụm camera ai thu và truyền dữ liệu tọa độ xyz các quả dứa trên cánh đồng sang 1 trung tâm xử lý, ở đây sẽ tính toán và truyền tín hiệu điều khiển rô bốt thực hiện nhiệm vụ phun thuốc vào lần lượt những quả dứa đã phát hiện.', 1, 'FIXED', 2000000.00, 5000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('fa271448-ce9d-5777-bd7c-b7ca1673cc93', '568e3739-ab2f-5406-af26-6739b094b3b9', 'Lập trình con bot theo yêu cầu', 'Lập trình công nhân AI theo kịch bản viết sẵn. Bot này chạy trên trang web online', 1, 'FIXED', 200000.00, 5000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('679ef12d-930b-51be-90ba-d92450e6c19b', 'd82523ce-c9c5-58f6-ac4a-4abfd014af4b', 'Xây dựng AI xử lý dữ liệu tự động = N8N', 'làm 3 dự án 1. AI Agent phân tích, báo cáo Chất lượng mạng. Lấy dữ liệu từ file excel, pdf, word đặt local trên máy tính cá nhân. Đọc thông tin nhưng không tải file excel, pdf, word lên mạng internet. Sử dụng ngôn ngữ tự nhiên để báo cáo Xây dựng workflow trên nền tảng hỗ trợ tốt hiện nay như N8N, Dify hoặc tương đương thực hiện các nhiệm vụ: - Theo dõi KPI trên hệ thống (từ thư mục local), phát hiện khi KPI tồi/suy giảm vượt ngưỡng. - Phân tích, đánh giá dữ liệu để chỉ ra khu vực tồi, thời gian tồi. - Thống kê, phân tích kết quả đạt được hiện tại, so sánh với quá khứ và các nguồn dữ liệu độc lập để đánh giá xu thế, vấn đề. - Điều hành nhân sự phụ trách KPI xử lý, tối ưu và cập nhật kết quả. - Lập báo cáo đánh giá CLM. 2. AI Agent điều hành công tác quản lý vấn đề/rủi ro: Chuẩn hóa dữ liệu, lấy dữ liệu tự động từ GNOC - Xây dựng Workflow trên N8N: - Xử lý dữ liệu - Phân tích, hỏi Netmind - Đẩy tin nhắn cảnh báo lên nhóm Netchat - Phân tích được xu thế ticket , từ đó đánh giá được vấn đề bất thường trên mạng lưới. 3. Xây dựng AI Agent lập báo cáo phân tích kết quả KCS tự động theo quý/năm Xây dựng Workflow trên N8N: - Trích xuất dữ liệu thông tin KCS (hàng mới, hàng cũ, nghiệm thu) trên các hệ thống SAP, GNOC (Khi chưa liên thông được với SAP thì dữ liệu đầu vào là các file excel được lấy thủ công từ SAP). - Xử lý, phân tích dữ liệu, so sánh với cùng kỳ, phân tích chuyên sâu theo các lĩnh vực chuyên môn (cơ điện, vô tuyến, truyền dẫn,...) hoặc theo lịch sử nhà cung cấp/hãng. - Lập báo cáo theo cấu trúc định dạng sẵn, đánh giá, cảnh báo theo các KPI cho từng nhóm, giải pháp.', 1, 'FIXED', 4500000.00, 5000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('8c0c2679-db68-5653-96c6-0e353fd1b05c', 'a7fd08be-dc8d-5452-93cb-7ebe5ab33ab6', 'Build CHANTY & ADUMI System with n8n', '**Project: AI-Powered Content Automation Using n8n** We are looking for an experienced n8n developer to build a fully automated AI content creation system for two brands: CHANTY and ADUMI. **Project requirements:** - Generate 20 unique content ideas per brand daily using Claude AI. - Automatically produce up to 5 videos per brand daily using Creatify. - Save all content to Google Drive and track it in Google Sheets. - Send videos to Telegram for approval or rejection. - Automatically schedule approved videos on Facebook, Instagram and TikTok via Metricool. - Connect Meta Ads data to analyze ROAS, CTR and winning creatives. - Use performance data to continuously improve future content. - Support multiple brands and languages. **Goal:** A reliable, scalable system requiring no more than 10 minutes of manual work daily. We already have n8n experience but need a professional developer to handle implementation. We operate five businesses and are looking for a long-term automation partner. Please provide your **best fixed price, estimated delivery time, and expected monthly operating costs**. The full technical brief is attached.', 1, 'HOURLY', 129000.00, 904000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('9814b254-ad08-522c-887c-f635cf97558c', '3ad03c2b-1e45-5020-942e-85980f34eb3e', 'FlutterFlow Expert Needed: MVP Development for Dark-Mode Personal Growth App (Make.com API)', 'PROJECT OVERVIEW: We are looking for an experienced FlutterFlow developer to build the MVP frontend and workflow integrations for a premium, dark-themed personal growth & identity analytics mobile application targeting the US/UK markets. The core backend logic, AI prompting, and automation scenarios (Make.com / OpenAI) are already built and tested. Your primary role will be implementing a sleek, high-converting UI/UX in FlutterFlow and linking it to our existing API webhooks. KEY RESPONSIBILITIES: 1. Onboarding & Input Flow: - Build a minimalist, multi-step onboarding screen collecting user birth parameters (Name, Date of Birth, Time of Birth, Location). - Implement clean input validation and date/time pickers. 2. API & Webhook Integration: - Connect FlutterFlow form submissions to a Make.com Webhook via HTTP POST. - Handle incoming JSON payloads containing custom text summaries and structure them visually onto the result screens. 3. Results Dashboard & UI: - Design an elegant, premium Dark Mode dashboard featuring data visualization cards (energy scores, core trait cards, actionable daily insights). - Ensure clean typography, smooth page transitions, and responsive layout for both iOS and Android. 4. RevenueCat & Paywall Setup (Phase 2): - Configure RevenueCat integration within FlutterFlow for native iOS/Android subscription paywalls (Monthly / Annual / One-time IAPs). REQUIRED SKILLS & QUALIFICATIONS: - Proven experience with FlutterFlow (Must provide portfolio or links to live published apps). - Deep understanding of REST APIs, JSON parsing, and Make.com / Zapier webhooks inside FlutterFlow. - Experience setting up RevenueCat / In-App Purchases (IAP) in FlutterFlow. - Strong eye for UI/UX design (Modern, Dark Mode, clean executive aesthetics). - Excellent English communication skills and ability to meet deadlines. TO APPLY, PLEASE PROVIDE: 1. Examples of mobile apps you have built using FlutterFlow (App Store / Google Play links or Figma/video demos). 2. Brief description of your experience connecting FlutterFlow to external APIs or Make.com. 3. Your estimated timeline to complete a 5-6 screen MVP. (Note: NDAs will be required before sharing the complete brand identity and full feature spec sheet.)', 1, 'FIXED', 7750000.00, 7750000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('341f68e4-4a6c-5024-99a7-f789fd7c86af', '408e81f3-27ab-5ae8-ab86-bcb86dd3222c', 'AI Engineer to build a full AI Automation SaaS. AI flow with n8n and Zapier', 'We are looking for an experienced AI Engineer / Full-Stack Developer to help plan and build an AI-powered SaaS platform using Node.js, React, and AI Automation tools like n8n and Zapier. The project is currently at an early stage, so we need someone who can provide technical consultation, evaluate requirements, propose the right architecture, and break the project into clear, actionable development tasks before implementation begins. Project Scope Technical Consultation: Discuss the product idea, business requirements, technical feasibility, and possible implementation approaches. Solution Architecture: Design a scalable SaaS architecture using Node.js, React, APIs, databases, and cloud infrastructure. AI Integration: Recommend and plan integrations with LLMs, AI Agents, OpenAI, Claude, and other AI services where relevant. Workflow Automation: Design automated business processes using n8n, Zapier, webhooks, and third-party API integrations. Project Planning: Break down the development process into actionable tasks, milestones, priorities, and estimated effort. MVP Development: Define the essential features for the first release and prepare a practical implementation roadmap. Required Skills Strong experience with Node.js, TypeScript, React, and Next.js AI Engineering, LLM Integration, and AI Agents AI Automation, n8n, Zapier, and Workflow Automation REST APIs, Webhooks, and Third-Party API Integration SaaS Architecture, PostgreSQL, and Cloud Infrastructure Experience designing and launching production-ready MVPs Ability to translate business ideas into technical solutions Initial Deliverables The first engagement will focus on consultation and technical planning, rather than immediately starting full development. We expect: Initial technical consultation and requirements review High-level system architecture and technology stack recommendations AI integrations and automation workflow design Development backlog with prioritized, actionable tasks MVP roadmap, effort estimates, and implementation phases Ideal Candidate We prefer a senior engineer or AI Solutions Architect who combines hands-on development experience with strong architectural thinking. You should be comfortable working with an early-stage product, identifying technical risks, recommending cost-effective solutions, and potentially continuing into full implementation after the initial planning phase. Please share examples of AI SaaS platforms, AI integrations, or n8n/Zapier automation projects you''ve worked on, and briefly explain how you would approach the initial consultation and architecture planning.', 1, 'HOURLY', 775000.00, 1421000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('071d177d-19ae-5689-847d-066a6fcff525', '1e1a1d94-a4fe-58cb-92a3-a7c04ef99937', 'Power Automate Expert Needed – BigChange API to Excel Integration', 'Power Automate Expert Needed – BigChange API to Excel Integration I''m looking for an experienced Microsoft Power Automate developer to help troubleshoot, complete and test an automation I''ve already started building. Project overview I have an existing Power Automate flow that runs on a schedule and retrieves contact data from the BigChange API, using pagination to collect all records. The goal is to combine the retrieved contacts into a single JSON dataset and pass that data to an Excel Office Script for processing and updating an Excel workbook. What I need help with Review and debug my existing Power Automate flow. Ensure API pagination retrieves all contact records correctly. Confirm the flow only continues once all pages have been retrieved successfully. Correctly format and pass the datasetJson parameter to the Office Script. Ensure the syncRunId parameter is handled correctly. Resolve any JSON formatting, variable or expression issues. Test the complete process to ensure the scheduled sync works reliably. Add appropriate error handling to prevent incomplete data being processed. Required experience Microsoft Power Automate (advanced) REST API integrations and HTTP requests JSON parsing and pagination Excel Office Scripts / TypeScript Microsoft 365 / Excel Online Important The flow is already partially built. I do not want to start from scratch unless absolutely necessary. I would prefer to work together through screen sharing so you can review my existing setup, resolve the issues and explain the changes. Please let me know: Have you completed similar API-to-Excel integrations? Are you experienced with Power Automate pagination and Office Scripts? What would you estimate the cost and time required to complete this project? I''m looking for someone reliable who can get the integration working correctly and help make it maintainable. Thank you!', 1, 'FIXED', 9041000.00, 9041000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('0782848d-8e10-59a4-9559-de5d52e9e333', '1e1a1d94-a4fe-58cb-92a3-a7c04ef99937', 'Power Automate Flow Developer', 'Need help building a Power Automate flow to process mediation case assignments, use the case number to assess the fee retainer, extract parties and counsel if possible, and then send two template agreements with the case number and name, and also generate a template invoice using the case number letter and one of two retainer amounts. The email to the counsel/parties would come from through Outlook. I have a very basic sense of flows and tried on my own. I have a power automate trial account which I can license of course. Anything else if it makes sense is a plus.', 1, 'HOURLY', 517000.00, 1033000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('58678beb-9108-55c2-ba6c-4e2c44172a43', '8c04c386-10b5-5491-a3ce-9a520cd74c24', 'AI Automation and API Workflow (Python/n8n)', 'We need a freelancer to build and maintain an AI-powered automation workflow that connects multiple APIs and handles data processing tasks. The work includes designing the workflow, setting up integrations, testing reliability, and improving performance over time. You should be comfortable working with Python and n8n, troubleshooting issues, and ensuring the system runs smoothly. This is a full-time project for 1 to 3 months, with a strong focus on accuracy, efficiency, and long-term maintainability.', 1, 'FIXED', 258000.00, 258000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('06517950-67f7-5a49-85e5-cc29a28ccf4a', '3f300bc7-3702-5b74-9660-fca6d603352c', 'Make.com + WhatsApp automation for contractor lead tracking (Google Sheets)', 'I run a construction/repair company in Dallas-Fort Worth with a partner. We get 20-25 leads a week from Angi, Thumbtack, Networx and Google, and we lose track of who to call back and what happened with each job. I need a simple automation built on Make.com, Google Sheets and WhatsApp Business Cloud API. WHAT I NEED 1) Lead intake New lead emails from Angi / Thumbtack / Networx are parsed automatically and added as a new row in my Google Sheet (date, source, name, phone, job type, lead cost). 2) Morning reminder Every day at 8:00 AM (Central Time), each partner gets a WhatsApp message listing only the leads assigned to them that need a follow-up today. 3) Update by WhatsApp (the main feature) We write or send a voice message to the business WhatsApp number, for example: "Dave from Plano, quote 8,500, started demolition". An AI step (OpenAI or similar, with voice transcription) understands it and updates the correct row: status, price, job stage, next follow-up date, and income/expense when mentioned. The system replies with a short confirmation. If two customers match, it asks which one. IMPORTANT: we write and speak in HEBREW and sometimes English, so the AI step must handle both. Only our two phone numbers may update the sheet. WHAT I PROVIDE A ready Google Sheet template (tabs: Leads, Jobs, Permits, Subcontractors, Transactions, Refunds, Summary). You can adapt it. REQUIREMENTS - Proven experience with Make.com and the official WhatsApp Business Cloud API (not unofficial WhatsApp tools that risk a number ban) - Help with Meta Business verification and WhatsApp template approval - All accounts (Make, Meta, Google, AI) created under MY name; you join as a user - Error handling: I get notified if something fails - A short video walkthrough and a one-week test period with real leads, with fixes included PLEASE REPLY WITH - A fixed price for the whole project and your estimated timeline - A similar project you''ve done - Your expected monthly running costs (Make, WhatsApp, AI) Thank you!', 1, 'FIXED', 7750000.00, 7750000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('408c345e-3d1a-5732-8aa3-0dbc2b478667', 'b8e25bd0-6339-5a96-90e5-258de03615ff', 'Full-Stack Developer Needed to Automate Weekly Sales Reports (Laravel, Next.js, n8n)', 'I''m looking for a reliable full-stack developer to automate the weekly sales reporting process for an existing project built with Laravel on the backend and Next.js on the frontend. The goal is to streamline the reporting workflow by developing the necessary APIs and integrating an automation workflow that generates and sends weekly sales report notifications with minimal manual intervention. I''m looking for someone who can understand the existing codebase, suggest practical solutions, and deliver clean, maintainable work. Responsibilities Review the existing Laravel backend and Next.js frontend to understand the current sales data and reporting workflow. Develop or update Laravel APIs required to retrieve and process sales data for automated reporting. Set up the weekly sales report automation workflow using n8n. Configure scheduled report generation and notifications so reports are delivered reliably each week. Work with the existing MySQL and/or PostgreSQL database structure as required. Test the complete workflow, handle potential errors, and ensure the automation runs consistently. Communicate progress clearly and document any important setup or configuration details. Required Skills and Experience Strong experience with PHP and Laravel. Solid knowledge of Next.js and JavaScript/TypeScript. Experience designing and integrating REST APIs. Good working knowledge of MySQL and PostgreSQL. Hands-on experience with n8n or similar workflow automation tools. Experience working with existing applications and extending their functionality without disrupting current features. Good English communication skills and the ability to provide regular updates. What I''m Looking For I''m looking for someone who is dependable, communicates clearly, and pays attention to detail. You should be comfortable working independently, asking questions when requirements need clarification, and suggesting better approaches when appropriate. Please focus on delivering a reliable, well-tested solution rather than a quick workaround. To Apply Please briefly share: Your relevant experience with Laravel, Next.js, and n8n. One or two examples of similar API development or workflow automation projects you''ve worked on. Your proposed approach to automating a weekly sales report. Your estimated timeline for completing the work. Potential for Future Work This project may lead to ongoing collaboration for future improvements, new features, and additional development work if we''re a good fit. I''m looking forward to working with someone who can help make this reporting process reliable and easy to maintain.', 1, 'HOURLY', 387000.00, 517000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('dca22649-c483-5353-83f4-837857f4da36', 'aaa99db1-6d7a-5c8a-9b46-01fbc6ba302a', 'SharePoint Intranet Build – Microsoft 365, Lists and Power Automate (Allied Health Clinic)', 'Hi! I run an allied health clinic and I''m looking for an experienced SharePoint / Microsoft 365 specialist to build our staff intranet from a detailed build plan I already have (shared with the successful applicant). We''re on Microsoft 365 Business Standard (3 users now, planning to grow to 30–40 staff). The intranet replaces our current onboarding/policy platform and Asana. WHAT YOU''LL BUILD - 5 SharePoint sites joined under a hub: Home, Knowledge Base, Training & Onboarding, a Teams-connected team site, and a private Compliance & HR site - Security groups and a permissions setup that scales (add a new hire to one group and they get the right access everywhere) - Microsoft Teams team with channels, a restricted Admin & Finance library, and a Planner plan - Moving our current OneDrive shared folder into SharePoint - About 15 Microsoft Lists with set columns and views: SOP & Policy Register (document control), Injury & Condition Database, Credentials Register (expiry tracking), Incident, Complaints, Risk and WHS registers, Performance Reviews, Onboarding lists and Training Records - Page templates (SOP, Program, Training Module) and home pages wired to the lists - 4 Microsoft Forms and about 8 Power Automate flows: incident, hazard and complaint reporting, weekly credential expiry alerts, SOP review reminders, policy read-and-sign approvals, and an automatic onboarding checklist builder - Security defaults (MFA), a no-delete permission level on the HR site, and backup recommendations I''ll write the content (SOPs, policies etc.) myself. You build the structure and automations. REQUIREMENTS - Proven experience building SharePoint Online intranets, Microsoft Lists and Power Automate flows (including approvals) - Clear English and good communication; Australian time zone (AEST/AEDT) or overlapping hours preferred for screen-share check-ins - Healthcare, NDIS or compliance experience is a bonus HOW IT WILL WORK - You''ll get a temporary admin account (not my personal login), removed at the end - Build and test with dummy data only; no real staff or client records - All flows must be owned by my account and tested before final payment - Fixed price, paid in 3 milestones: 1. Sites, groups, permissions, Teams and file move 2. All lists, views and page templates 3. Forms, flows, security setup and handover - Handover: a short screen-recorded walkthrough and a one-page guide (how to add a new staff member, edit a list, run the sign-off flow) Please include in your proposal: - Your fixed-price quote and timeframe for each milestone - 2–3 examples of intranets or Power Automate flows you''ve built - Your time zone and availability Thanks so much, looking forward to hearing from you!', 1, 'HOURLY', 258000.00, 904000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00');

