    ('8e1d051e-4536-5f8c-abf8-dca07f9653f9', '00e88076-1b87-5a42-8789-6a86786643bd', 'CRM Telehealth Platform Development', 'Need a developer to build a CRM telehealth platform for Canada, including marketing, calendar and payment integrations, invoicing, customer service data, medical data, SMS and email outbound marketing, webpages, intake forms, and merchant terminals. The project requires strong experience with CRM systems and telehealth workflows, plus a clear understanding of HIPAA compliance and related privacy requirements. This project is about speed to market so experience and familiarity with the right telehealth CRM plafform that you are recommending is essential. Must have experience in full scope Telehealth platform development with reputable CRM systme.', 1, 'HOURLY', 517000.00, 1033000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('8b5c1dd8-576e-5429-915b-49249b6a66cb', '3e912893-a34e-5ccc-b3d9-6cbd65311be1', 'Website Design / Build for Longevity / Health Spa', 'In search of a web designer/developer to create a professional website for longevity / health spa. The website should showcase our services, about us, and a booking calender while making it easy for potential customers to request information and contact us Project scope: - Design and build a modern, professional website - Create pages for our main services - Include an About page and contact information - Add click-to-call buttons for mobile visitors - Ensure the website works well on desktop, tablet, and mobile - Complete basic on-page and local SEO setup - Connect the website to our domain We are looking for someone who has experience building websites for health and wellness and local service businesses. Please include relevant examples, estimated timeline, and total project cost.', 1, 'FIXED', 129000.00, 129000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('4f00818b-5447-573d-b7d9-5de40cce8b7d', '1104c9d9-e778-583f-af37-85e90b1415db', 'Tuyển dev/nhóm dev làm “Safety Wearable” (GPS 4G + SOS) – có phần cứng sẵn', 'Mình đang triển khai dự án Safety Wearable cho nhóm người cần hỗ trợ khi di chuyển cho trung tâm người lớn tuổi. Phần cứng (thiết bị đeo 4G GPS có nút SOS) mình sẽ nhập từ Trung Quốc và sẽ làm việc trực tiếp với vendor để lấy tài liệu giao thức/SDK. Yêu cầu MVP: Quản lý User ↔ Device (ai đang dùng thiết bị nào, log gán thiết bị) GPS realtime + lịch sử di chuyển Geofence + dwell time để xác nhận “đã tới/ở bao lâu/rời đi” Heartbeat: cảnh báo mất kết nối/tắt thiết bị khi đang phiên hoạt động SOS 2 chế độ: Nhấn 1 lần: thiết bị hú còi + gửi event SOS về server Nhấn 2 lần: thiết bị gọi hotline qua SIM 4G → PBX/server của mình ghi âm (giới hạn 10–20 phút) → lưu trên hệ thống Ưu tiên: có kinh nghiệm IoT (MQTT/HTTPS), map/geofence, PBX Asterisk/FreeSWITCH hoặc cloud telephony. Sẵn sàng ký NDA, làm theo milestone rõ ràng. Inbox giúp mình: stack + portfolio + estimate thời gian/báo giá.', 1, 'FIXED', 10000000.00, 30000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('3e47fb28-6b7b-5dd4-9a6e-038a90d44afc', 'fba69a06-03b8-59fa-8f6d-567c664177e2', 'US beta testers with an Apple Watch or Garmin: health app testing (2 weeks)', 'We''re about to launch a health and wellness app that works with the wearable you already have. Before launch, we need real people in the US to use it on their own phones and tell us what breaks. What''s involved - You''ll need to be based in the United States, with an Apple Watch (paired with an iPhone) or a Garmin watch (with an iPhone or Android phone) that you wear day and night. - Install the beta (TestFlight on iPhone, or Google Play testing on Android), create an account and connect your Apple Health (iPhone) or Health Connect (Android) data [ We will share the link] - Milestone 1, setup: do your first voice and tongue scans and check that your results and dashboard load and collate(screenshot would be best) about any UI/UX & functionality glitches or improvements needed. - Milestone 2, week 1: use the app for about 10 minutes a day for 7 days, doing the scans and checking your results and dashboard, then send the week 1 feedback form. - Milestone 3, week 2: keep using the app daily through day 14, then send the week 2 feedback form. - Throughout, report bugs with steps and screenshots or screen recordings. - Clear written English and an eye for detail matter. Past app beta testing is a plus.', 1, 'FIXED', 775000.00, 775000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('ff0cd743-5b8b-531f-a06c-dd4701e1a990', 'fba69a06-03b8-59fa-8f6d-567c664177e2', 'Beta testers wanted: health app that works with your wearable (iPhone or Android)', 'We''re about to launch a health and wellness app that works with the wearable you already have. Before launch, we need real people to use it on their own phones and tell us what breaks. What''s involved - You''ll need an iPhone or Android phone, and a wearable such as a Samsung Galaxy Watch, Fitbit, Pixel Watch, Garmin or Apple Watch that you wear day and night. - Install the beta (TestFlight on iPhone, or Google Play testing on Android), create an account and connect your Apple Health (iPhone) or Health Connect (Android) data. - Milestone 1, setup: do your first voice, tongue scans, check that your results and dashboard load and check the user flow and collate any glitches or UI/UX glitches - Milestone 2, week 1: use the app for about 10 minutes a day for 7 days, doing the scans and checking your results and dashboard, then send the week 1 feedback form. - Milestone 3, week 2: keep using the app daily through day 14, then send the week 2 feedback form. - Throughout, report bugs with steps and screenshots or screen recordings. - Clear written English and an eye for detail matter. Past app beta testing is a plus.', 1, 'FIXED', 517000.00, 517000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('d196df91-4ac9-59b3-949d-619f3316acb9', '5b1ac71d-5ce0-504d-8149-662370785c60', 'Develop and manage my calorie tracking app - FamWell', '📋 Freelancer Job Description: Feature Roadmap & Scope Project Title: Backend Developer / Integrator – Multi-Channel Family Health & Affiliate App (MVP Handoff) Project Overview: We are launching a cross-platform family wellness application. The frontend UI wireframes, core layouts, and database structures are planned to be designed by you using AI (OpenAI GPT-4o). We need a developer to stand up the backend, host the database, connect the core third-party APIs, and prepare the app for global deployment. Phase 1: Environment Setup & Database Integration Phase 2: AI Core Features & Tracker Logic Phase 3: Affiliate Dynamic Display & Click Tracking Phase 4: Final Testing & Deployment Build and market an all-in-one health, family activity, and affiliate-connected app with advertisement of goods that can help the user exercise, meal prep and live a better home, work and outdoor life. You as the freelancer can combine low-code AI development tools with specialized APIs. Using AI software to build the initial prototype and integrate this app into use throughout the world. * The Scope of Work: API integrations and database setup (connecting the OpenAI API for tracking, and the Amazon/Impact affiliate links), rather than building the app designs from scratch. * The Tracking Setup: Integrate Google Analytics for Firebase or Mixpanel to track user conversions, ad clicks, and affiliate link clicks natively within the platform.. -You can use these conversational AI platforms to build the front-end interface and core logic without writing code from scratch. * Bolt.new / Lovable.dev: * FlutterFlow: * v0.dev by Vercel: -Calorie & Exercise Personalization * OpenAI GPT-4o or Anthropic Claude 3.5 Sonnet: * LogMeal API or Passio.ai: Specialized AI computer vision tools. -Affiliate & Big Box Integration To link major retail networks, you do not need separate AI for each store; instead, use Unified Affiliate API Aggregators: * Datafiniti / ScrapingBee: * Amazon Associates API: * TikTok Shop Partner API / Impact.com: 🌍 AI Tools to Market Globally Once the app is functional, use these AI tools to handle global localized marketing with minimal upfront overhead: * HeyGen / ElevenLabs: * CapCut AI / Opus Clip: * Perplexity / ChatGPT:', 1, 'HOURLY', 77000.00, 258000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('0435789c-8886-513e-a854-ad7ec5e6d5bc', '46669493-f706-54db-9a80-f5aa79eeb338', 'Website Development Continuation', '- Complete the remaining service pages (approx. 7-10 service pages for dental services) build-out - Connect SEO tools to the existing websites (google AdSense, rankSEO) - Update ''Our Doctors Page'' with additional providers - Make website ADA compliant - Make further formatting changes as needed during QC/QA Priority to change based on business need.', 1, 'FIXED', 12916000.00, 12916000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('d5132087-b69a-5172-b107-f788c62f1843', 'e5b7e688-5082-5d7c-a0b0-215542b735cc', 'Fix critical bug in our Flutter healthcare mobile app', '"We are a software development team maintaining a Flutter mobile app for the healthcare sector (iOS and Android). A critical bug has appeared in production and we need an experienced mobile developer to find the root cause and fix it fast. What we need: Reproduce and diagnose the bug together with our team Fix it in the existing Flutter codebase (native iOS/Android code in Swift or Kotlin if the issue requires it) Verify the fix on both iOS and Android devices Share a short summary of the root cause and what was changed Requirements: Strong, proven Flutter experience (production apps, not only tutorials) Solid understanding of iOS and Android platform specifics Experience debugging complex issues: state management, platform channels, API integration, device-specific behavior Experience with healthcare or other data-sensitive apps is a big plus Familiarity with React Native or native Swift is a plus Good communication and ability to start right away Please do the work yourself without AI code generation tools. We need a developer who understands the code and can explain the fix If the work is good, there is a real chance of long-term, full-time cooperation on this and other projects To apply, please include: A short description of a similar bug you fixed in a Flutter app Your availability to start this week Any healthcare or regulated-industry apps you worked on"', 1, 'FIXED', 1292000.00, 1292000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('26f986fe-255b-5a8d-95fe-97b37357ce5c', '4f5b11a4-8688-55cd-97e6-96c07f3a15ec', 'Technical Leader for AI Blockchain MVP', 'We need an experienced technical leader to guide the development of an AI-powered blockchain MVP. You will lead architecture decisions, coordinate development, and ensure the solution is scalable, secure, and aligned with business goals. The ideal freelancer should have a strong background in AI and blockchain, with experience managing technical teams and delivering high-quality products. This is a part-time role for 1 to 3 months, with potential for future collaboration.', 1, 'HOURLY', 1033000.00, 1679000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('8da1fbf1-e53b-582e-809e-a4037a211946', '161d184e-d087-58e8-8284-ca2f04bb1f6e', 'Senior blockchain developer', 'We''re looking for a senior blockchain developer to complete a Web3 NFT content marketplace and take it to production. You must have experience with blockchain, NFTs, and Web3. Experience with NFT marketplaces is a plus. The role involves auditing existing contracts, implementing new features, and preparing for mainnet deployment. We''re looking for someone who can lead the technical side and deliver high-quality code. To apply, share your GitHub and relevant projects.', 1, 'HOURLY', 1033000.00, 1550000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('63e9576b-cbc2-599e-bf33-831b1e7ce0bb', '63117a5d-2b44-5ab8-b9e2-c7c08855b275', 'NFT Designer | Digital Collectibles & Web3', 'We''re looking for an NFT Designer to create distinctive, high-quality digital collectibles for a web3 project. You''ll work on the visual identity, NFT artwork, traits/attributes, and collection consistency from concept to final assets. What we''re looking for: - Strong NFT / digital art portfolio - Experience creating collectible collections and trait systems - Strong sense of style, composition, and visual consistency - Familiarity with web3 / crypto projects - Some web development experience is a plus - Ability to turn concepts into polished, production-ready assets Please share your portfolio and examples of your NFT or digital collectible work.', 1, 'HOURLY', 775000.00, 1162000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('fa869676-804e-5df4-abde-2af7d7bc1ce3', 'ef004ce1-6509-5ae0-b605-77e3290dde08', 'Solana DEX Smart Contract Architect', 'We need an expert to design and build a perpetual DEX on Solana, focusing on oracle integration, liquidation logic, and solvency modeling. The role includes shaping the smart-contract architecture, ensuring efficient execution, and supporting a reliable trading environment. You should be able to translate complex financial mechanics into secure, scalable blockchain solutions and collaborate closely with the development team to deliver a production-ready system.', 1, 'FIXED', 51664000.00, 51664000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('155758a7-fdc8-5b62-97ac-12a7d6b579b4', 'fd1d2b07-2170-59f1-9af5-d2626d4416cf', 'Lead Blockchain Developer', 'We need a lead blockchain developer to guide the development of a decentralized application. You will oversee architecture, coordinate with the team, and ensure the project is delivered on time and to a high standard. The ideal candidate has strong experience building and managing blockchain-based products and can lead technical decisions throughout the project lifecycle.', 1, 'HOURLY', 646000.00, 1214000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('936539b7-232d-595b-8ed3-b66601cac9e8', '4b53f5f6-8d51-5c59-8d99-5c098a7d3c5b', 'Lead Web3 Frontend Engineer', 'We’re seeking a Lead Web3 Frontend Engineer to lead the development of a decentralized application for a growing Web3 company. You’ll be responsible for building and maintaining the frontend, collaborating with product and backend teams, and ensuring a smooth user experience. This role is ideal for someone who can take ownership of frontend architecture, drive implementation, and help shape the product vision. We’re looking for a proactive, detail-oriented engineer who can work independently and contribute to long-term growth.', 1, 'HOURLY', 646000.00, 1033000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('112082f6-dbb4-5022-9aee-56649f919e48', '4b53f5f6-8d51-5c59-8d99-5c098a7d3c5b', 'Web3 Development Expert Needed', 'We’re seeking an expert to build a Web3-based platform for a new project. The work includes developing core platform features, integrating blockchain functionality, and ensuring a smooth user experience. You’ll collaborate with our team to deliver a reliable, scalable solution and help shape the technical direction. Experience with similar Web3 projects is highly valued. This is a long-term opportunity for someone who can contribute to ongoing development and growth.', 1, 'HOURLY', 1162000.00, 1989000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('04390c2b-93eb-556f-a519-88f8e44b555e', '5c474de1-f784-54ed-8103-131f74697c77', 'Blockchain Backend Engineer', 'We are looking for a skilled Blockchain Backend Developer to design, develop, and maintain scalable backend systems and blockchain-based applications. The ideal candidate will have strong backend development experience, a solid understanding of blockchain technologies, and expertise in building secure, reliable, and high-performance APIs and services.', 1, 'HOURLY', 1808000.00, 2842000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('373b6175-d5f9-58cb-809b-b9ea09fbe272', '36d5ad83-efb2-54d9-bd7b-a0bfbf0eabe8', 'Lead Blockchain Engineer for Marketplace', 'We’re seeking a Lead Blockchain Engineer to help build and scale a marketplace platform. You’ll lead the development of core blockchain features, design secure and efficient systems, and guide technical decisions for a growing product. This role involves working closely with the team to deliver reliable solutions, improve platform performance, and support long-term growth. If you have strong experience building blockchain-based applications and leading technical initiatives, we’d love to hear from you.', 1, 'HOURLY', 646000.00, 1214000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('c72a5a33-f4d4-5ac6-9629-b67be0600322', '4c7c47cc-a7cf-5998-bdb9-f3008996e204', 'Senior Full Stack Engineer to Build a Web3 Product', 'We''re looking for a Senior Full Stack Developer to join our web3 project and build reliable, production-ready applications from frontend to backend. You''ll work closely with the team on product development, integrations, APIs, and blockchain-related features. What we''re looking for: - Strong experience with React / Next.js and Node.js - Solid TypeScript experience - Strong backend and API development skills - Experience integrating blockchain / web3 functionality - Good understanding of wallets, smart contracts, and web3 libraries - Experience working with databases and scalable systems - Strong problem-solving skills and ability to work independently Please share your GitHub, portfolio, and a few relevant web3 projects you''ve worked on.', 1, 'HOURLY', 646000.00, 1214000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('0b7e9754-9053-51b1-ad1b-22798fe08806', '6cef9cda-dc31-5c69-a982-03ed88e2255c', 'Try crypto tax software with sample data and share your feedback (Australia, about 45 minutes)', 'pafin Inc. is a Japanese fintech company that provides crypto tax software to users in multiple countries, including Australia. To improve the user experience for Australian users, we are looking for people in Australia who own or trade crypto and can try our service and share their feedback on its design and ease of use. About crypto tax software: Crypto tax software supports tax reporting for cryptocurrency transactions. It imports transaction history from exchanges, calculates capital gains and losses, and generates reports that can be used to prepare a tax return or be provided to an accountant or tax agent. This reduces the manual work and the risk of errors involved in calculating crypto tax, particularly for those who trade frequently or across multiple exchanges. ----- About the task (about 45 minutes, on a computer): 1. Try our service from start to finish, using the sample data and step-by-step guide we provide after hiring: - Create a free test account (share your sign-up email with us on Upwork so we can activate your test code and confirm your activity) - Import the sample trade history - Check the calculated results, such as gains, losses and holdings - Download the tax summary report 2. Answer a survey about your experience with our tax tool (about 15 minutes). 3. Share the downloaded report with us via Upwork messages so we can confirm your activity on the sample account. Please complete the task within [3] days after we set up your test account. You don''t need to use your actual crypto transaction records. You will not be asked to connect your own exchange account or wallet, or to pay anything. Who we are looking for: Because this task is about Australian crypto tax reporting, you need to: -Be an Australian tax resident -Have bought, sold or held cryptocurrency during the past two financial years (1 July 2024 to 30 June 2026) -No QA or UX-related experiences are required. We are looking for honest feedback from the perspective of an everyday crypto user. Payment: -US$20 (fixed price) -Payment will be released within [2] business days once we have checked the downloaded report, the sample account activity and your survey answers. ----- Please note: -Please answer in your own words, based on what you actually experienced during the test. Answers that are generic or do not reflect the test may not be approved. -The only personal information we will ask for is the email address you used to create your test account. We will not use it to contact you or for any other purpose. -The survey also includes general questions about your crypto experience, such as how often you trade and which exchanges you use. We will not ask for account details, balances or transaction records. -Your responses will remain confidential within pafin Inc. and will never be shared with any third parties. We will use them only for product development.', 1, 'FIXED', 517000.00, 517000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('e51d89ee-4439-5b7d-a7ea-aef0f5465e97', '858ae0c2-b836-5a13-8f22-2dac25f816b1', 'Long-term Tech Partner / Agency for Joint EU Grant Application (Anti-AI Platform / Estonia Entity)', 'We are looking for an established software development agency (SME) based in Eastern Europe (Romania, Poland, Bulgaria, etc.) to act as our technical partner and joint-applicant for upcoming EU Deep-Tech Grants (Eurostars / EIC Accelerator). [About the Project]: We are building a next-generation content protection and data sovereignty platform under an Estonia entity. Our mission is to defend European journalism and Asian creative media from unauthorized GAFA AI scraping. [Our Technology Stack (Tool-Integration Model)]: To speed up time-to-market, we focus on integrating existing market-leading tools rather than building from scratch: - Cloudflare Bot Management & Flutter Web (Canvas/WebAssembly) for front-end security. - University of Chicago''s "Nightshade / Glaze" Python CLI on OVHcloud for back-end anti-AI poisoning. - Implementing an escrow licensing system using Stripe + Web3 Payment SDKs (LI.FI/Helio) to charge AI corporations a 100x premium license fee for legitimate, authorized data access via Base chain USDC payments. [Budget & Compensation Model]: Please note that this is a ZERO-UPFRONT budget project. We are looking for an agency to co-apply for the grant. Upon successful approval of the grant, your company will be awarded the exclusive development contract (valued at $80,000 USD) paid via Upwork milestones, along with dedicated budgets for documentation and training. [Requirements]: - Must be a registered agency/company (not a solo freelancer) with a proven track record in cybersecurity, Web3, or Python/Flutter. - Comfortable with 100% text-based asynchronous communication via Slack/Jira. - Experience with EU-funded projects or grant documentation is a huge plus. Please apply with your company profile and brief examples of your past security/Web3 integration work.', 1, 'FIXED', 2066560000.00, 2066560000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('88da6b66-e20b-556f-94a1-c5ce259f3815', '90227552-3816-5a51-8f73-abc8bc3f4f3b', 'Fix lỗi chống copy token trong Cookie', 'Tôi đang có source code .Net zero Frontend là Angular Backend lad C# cần người fix lỗi copy token ở Cookie', 1, 'FIXED', 200000.00, 1000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('7f9535d9-4a52-5a02-bc6f-276d7d81a1b7', '0acae65e-e060-5ca0-99ed-d21357d4f4e2', 'Tìm Developer Python làm App Quét Ảnh Trang Bị Diablo 4 + Tích hợp API DeepSeek AI', 'Mình cần tìm một bạn lập trình viên Python (có kinh nghiệm làm OCR và tích hợp API AI) để phát triển một công cụ quản lý, đổi tên trang bị tự động từ ảnh chụp màn hình game Diablo 4. Các tính năng chính của App: Xử lý ảnh & OCR: Nhận diện ảnh chụp vật phẩm, dùng OpenCV tự động crop cắt lấy vùng chỉ số chính, dùng thư viện OCR quét ra text thô (bỏ qua phần chữ rác xung quanh để tiết kiệm token). Kết nối API DeepSeek: Đẩy text thô qua DeepSeek AI để bóc tách chỉ số ( Greater Affix - GA, thuộc tính thường), kết hợp đối chiếu với một bảng Excel từ viết tắt do mình cung cấp để tự động đổi tên file/bản ghi theo công thức định sẵn. Quản lý & Xuất dữ liệu Excel: App hiển thị danh sách dạng bản ghi, có thanh tìm kiếm nhanh dạng bộ lọc đa tầng (Ví dụ gõ: "Ring Str Crit" là phải lọc ra đúng đồ thỏa mãn). Có nút bấm xóa nhanh sau khi bán đồ. Xuất file báo cáo Excel đầu ra: Gồm cột Tên mới, cột Dịch, và quan trọng là phải chèn được ảnh Thumbnail thu nhỏ của món đồ vào ô Excel. Yêu cầu kỹ thuật: Python, OpenCV, thư viện OCR (EasyOCR/Tesseract), kết nối OpenAI/DeepSeek API, xử lý Excel (OpenPyXL/Pandas), làm giao diện cơ bản (PyQt/Tkinter hoặc Streamlit). Mình đã chuẩn bị sẵn Tài liệu đặc tả yêu cầu chi tiết (PRD), file Excel mẫu, bộ ảnh mẫu để test. Bạn nào làm được xin vui lòng nhắn tin báo giá và thời gian hoàn thiện giúp mình nhé. Cảm ơn các bạn!', 1, 'FIXED', 1000000.00, 5000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('b7664c87-0ecd-56bc-919c-d252576f3ec7', 'd1b5caac-34f1-57df-92c8-8d8d7bfc256e', 'Automation Developer — Discord, CRM & Sales Workflows', 'VEXERA is building a lead nurturing and sales system for our growing sales operation. We are looking for an experienced Automation Developer to build the backend, CRM workflows, Discord workspace, and integrations that will support our sales team. This is a project-based role with defined milestones, with the possibility of ongoing support after the initial build. What You’ll Build You will create a reliable system connecting our Discord workspace, CRM, backend/database, Calendly, and email/newsletter activity. The system should allow sales representatives to: * Clock in and out through a private Discord ticket * Receive their next eligible lead * View relevant lead history * Record call outcomes, notes, next actions, and follow-up dates * Receive follow-up reminders * Book demos through the correct Calendly flow * View their personal performance statistics * Close their shift and receive a shift summary Managers should be able to view team-level performance, including leads assigned, calls, follow-ups, appointments, qualified meetings, sales, collections, and working time. Key Responsibilities * Build the Discord workspace, private tickets, actions, forms, and notifications * Configure the CRM, lead stages, permissions, ownership, and activity history * Build a fair lead-assignment system that prevents duplicate claims * Create an import framework for future lead researchers or scrapers * Integrate Calendly bookings, cancellations, and reschedules * Connect newsletter signup and supported engagement events * Build KPI reporting, personal statistics, sales notifications, and leaderboards * Implement follow-up reminders and ownership rules * Build safeguards against duplicate leads, activities, appointments, and sales records * Handle partial integration failures with safe retries and appropriate alerts * Test the complete workflow before launch * Provide clear documentation and handover instructions', 1, 'HOURLY', 387000.00, 1033000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('fb666f77-bb17-5205-80e6-55bf2ad0608d', 'efec1c7e-058c-5a59-a1ac-18bb22c11bec', 'Product Integrations Engineer (TypeScript/Node.js) - Microsoft 365, Google, DMS, CRM & Slack', 'We''re building native integrations for a legal SaaS product and need an engineer who has shipped reliable integrations inside a multi-tenant SaaS application. This is a product engineering role, not a no-code automation project. You''ll build a shared integration core for connections, tokens, import and sync, with an adapter for each provider. Integration scope Microsoft 365 first: SharePoint, OneDrive, Outlook and Sign in with Microsoft Google Drive and Gmail Legal document management systems, including iManage and NetDocuments Other document management tools, including Box and Dropbox CRM platforms and Slack, with specific providers and priorities to be agreed Tools our AI legal agent can call Our stack: Next.js 16, TypeScript/Node.js, Postgres/Drizzle, better-auth and BullMQ. What you will do: Build provider adapters behind a shared interface, following our architecture plan. Implement OAuth 2.0/OIDC connections, PKCE and admin consent. Store tokens securely and handle refresh with locking. Build imports and incremental sync using delta/cursor-based approaches. Handle deleted and moved files, throttling, retries and failed jobs. Implement write-back with conflict detection using eTags where supported. Write tests, document the implementation and work through pull requests with our engineering team. Must have: Shipped native integrations in a SaaS product with at least two different providers Strong TypeScript/Node.js and OAuth 2.0/OIDC experience Experience with background job queues and reliable data synchronization Ability to explain technical trade-offs and work within an existing codebase Relevant experience: Microsoft Graph, Google Drive API, iManage/NetDocuments APIs, multi-tenant SaaS and MCP/agent tools. Zapier, Make or MuleSoft-only experience is not sufficient for this role. We need someone who can implement the integrations directly in our product. In your proposal: 1. Two native SaaS integrations you personally shipped, the providers involved and your responsibility. 2. An example of how you handled token refresh, incremental sync, retries or write-back conflicts. 3. Your relevant Microsoft Graph, Google and document management API experience. 4. Earliest start date and weekly availability. We''ll agree the first integration milestone and acceptance criteria with the selected engineer before starting work.', 1, 'FIXED', 38748000.00, 38748000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('36d58f58-bd56-5599-9516-9d06a80a0d11', '75d5c07e-2b97-560b-87be-9f3d195ad1be', 'CRM Build E-Commerce Store', 'Title: Shopify Email + Zoho Inventory Setup for Luxury Fragrance Brand About us À Sa Peau is a luxury fragrance brand launching six fragrances in 10 mL travel sizes, sold through Shopify, TikTok Shop and wholesale to boutiques. We’ve already designed our customer and inventory system. We need an experienced specialist to build it, test it and hand it over ready to run. This is a setup project, not ongoing marketing. The design, email copy, SKU list and setup checklists are written. Your job is to put them into Shopify and Zoho correctly. Phase 1: Shopify customer system and newsletter (due by November 4) Set up Shopify Messaging (Shopify Email) with a branded template: espresso and cream, gold accents, our logo. Build a newsletter signup page at /pages/the-art-of-desire for an event giveaway, with tagging so event signups are tracked separately. Create the customer tags and five segments from our spec. Build the welcome sequence (3 emails) and the purchase thank-you email using the copy we provide. Build the template for our weekly newsletter, The Art of Desire. Set up abandoned checkout recovery (2 emails, no discount). Test every automation end to end and show us the results. Phase 2: Zoho Inventory (due within 2 weeks of hire) Set up Zoho Inventory with our SKU list: 12 fragrance SKUs, 3 bundles built as composite items, jewelry, and packaging and event items. Set up item groups, a wholesale price list, adjustment reasons and reorder points. Connect Shopify to Zoho Inventory and test that orders take stock out correctly. Match SKUs across Shopify, TikTok Shop and Zoho. Record a short walkthrough video showing how to log TikTok orders, samples and new production batches. Optional Phase 3: a Zoho CRM retail pipeline for wholesale prospecting. Tell us if you’ve built one before. We’ll scope it separately. You’re a fit if you have: Built Shopify Email automations for an ecommerce brand Set up Zoho Inventory, including composite items and the Shopify connection Clear communication and a fast start: Phase 1 has a hard deadline A bonus if you have beauty, fragrance or luxury retail experience To apply, answer these: Share 2 Shopify stores where you set up email automations, and what you built for each. Have you set up Zoho Inventory composite items or bundles? Briefly explain how. Does Zoho Inventory’s free or Standard plan include the Shopify connection, and what happens to stock when a bundle sells? Can you finish Phase 1 by November 4? What’s your fixed price for each phase?', 1, 'HOURLY', 129000.00, 697000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('ec6ead95-4a4f-5af6-99fb-d97dc85839bb', '553ef6ca-568d-50d9-a591-a642493c872b', 'AI Automation Engineer Needed for Lead Qualification & CRM Integration Using n8n', 'We are looking for an AI Automation Engineer to build a reliable workflow that captures incoming enquiries, qualifies leads using our business criteria, and creates or updates the correct CRM records. Our team currently reviews enquiries manually and transfers information between tools. We want to reduce repetitive data entry, improve lead routing, and flag incomplete enquiries for human review. The project will be completed in three phases under one fixed price of $500. Phase 1: Lead Capture and Data Validation Connect one existing website form or webhook to n8n and prepare incoming lead information for processing. Scope includes: - Review sample enquiries and confirm the required fields. - Capture contact details and enquiry information where available. - Normalize email addresses and phone numbers using agreed rules. - Validate required fields before processing. - Identify repeated submissions using a submission ID or another agreed identifier. - Route incomplete or invalid enquiries for manual review. - Record processing status so failed submissions can be identified. Phase 2: AI Lead Qualification and CRM Integration Use OpenAI or Claude to evaluate enquiries against our supplied qualification criteria and send validated information to our CRM. Scope includes: - Configure one LLM provider. - Extract relevant information from each enquiry. - Classify leads into agreed categories such as qualified, needs review, and not a fit. - Return structured outputs with a category and short explanation. - Flag missing information rather than inventing details. - Validate AI outputs before updating CRM records. - Search for existing contacts using an agreed matching rule. - Create or update contacts while preventing duplicates. - Map up to ten agreed CRM fields. - Apply the appropriate qualification status or tag. - Route ambiguous enquiries for human review. The integration will connect to one CRM, such as HubSpot, GoHighLevel, Pipedrive, or Zoho, using authorized access. Phase 3: Notifications, Testing and Handoff Complete the workflow with notifications, failure handling, and documentation. Scope includes: - Notify the team through one agreed channel, such as an internal notification system or email. - Generate one suggested follow-up message for human review. - Keep customer messages as drafts until approved. - Add appropriate retries for temporary API failures. - Prevent repeated executions from creating duplicate records. - Log successful and failed executions without exposing credentials. - Alert the team when a lead cannot be processed. - Test valid leads, missing information, invalid AI outputs, duplicate submissions, and CRM API failures. - Deliver the n8n workflow export without embedded credentials. - Provide setup documentation and a recorded walkthrough. Expected Lead Flow 1. A new enquiry arrives through the connected form or webhook. 2. n8n validates and normalizes the submitted information. 3. The AI evaluates the enquiry using our qualification criteria. 4. The workflow validates the AI output. 5. The correct CRM contact is created or updated. 6. The team receives a notification for qualified leads or enquiries needing review. 7. Failed executions are logged and flagged for follow-up. Acceptance Criteria - Valid sample leads reach the correct CRM record with accurate field mapping. - Repeat submissions do not create duplicate contacts. - Qualification follows the agreed business criteria. - Missing or unclear information is flagged for review. - Invalid AI outputs and API failures are handled clearly. - No AI-generated customer message is sent without approval. - Our team can understand and operate the workflow using the supplied documentation. Preferred Experience - n8n workflow automation. - AI automation and LLM integration. - OpenAI API or Anthropic Claude. - CRM integrations. - REST APIs and webhooks. - JSON and structured output validation. - Lead qualification and duplicate prevention. - Error handling, retries, and execution logging. - JavaScript or Python for custom processing where necessary. What We Will Provide - Access to an existing n8n environment. - One configured lead source or webhook. - Qualification criteria and representative sample enquiries. - Authorized CRM access, API documentation, and test credentials. - LLM API credentials. - Required field mappings and notification requirements. The project includes one lead source, one CRM, one LLM provider, up to ten mapped fields, and one notification channel. Platform subscriptions, hosting, and API usage costs are separate. Lead scraping, unauthorized data collection, historical CRM cleanup, custom dashboards, and extended follow-up campaigns are outside scope. Please Include in Your Proposal - One relevant AI automation or n8n project you have completed. - Your approach to qualification and duplicate prevention. - How you would handle invalid AI outputs and CRM API failures. - Your estimated delivery time after receiving the required access.', 1, 'FIXED', 12916000.00, 12916000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('e50fa63d-ac79-58b7-89f0-034e90f50e96', '553ef6ca-568d-50d9-a591-a642493c872b', 'Microsoft Dynamics CRM Expert for Custom Fields, Lead Mapping & Data Updates', 'Shipley Associates is seeking an experienced Microsoft Dynamics CRM administrator or consultant to improve our CRM configuration and support reliable data updates. We need help with three priorities: • Custom fields: Create and configure fields to capture the information our sales team needs. • Lead-to-opportunity data flow: Review and configure field mappings and the lead qualification process so relevant information carries through correctly when leads become opportunities. • Data enhancement: Use data we provide to update and enrich existing records while preserving valuable information already in the CRM. Establish clear matching and update rules to prevent unintended overwrites, blank replacements, or duplicate records. Scope includes reviewing our current configuration, recommending improvements, implementing agreed changes, testing representative scenarios, and documenting the setup. Before updating existing records, we expect a backup or recovery approach and validation using a small sample. Required experience: • Hands-on Microsoft Dynamics 365 Sales/CRM administration and configuration. • Custom fields, Dataverse tables, forms, and field mappings. • Lead qualification and opportunity management. • Data imports, record matching, duplicate prevention, and controlled updates. Please describe similar projects you have completed, how you preserve existing data during updates, your availability, and your hourly rate.', 1, 'HOURLY', 1421000.00, 2067000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('1b2a4f02-a67f-50a8-9a03-4a8076052f60', '889f55d2-a6db-5f72-806c-1463b015cc70', 'Custom CRM and Website Integration', 'We’re looking for a freelancer to build a custom CRM and website and connect them together. The work includes developing the CRM, creating the website, and ensuring the two systems communicate smoothly. You should be comfortable handling both the backend and frontend of the project and able to deliver a reliable, integrated solution. Please share relevant experience with similar projects and your approach to connecting systems.', 1, 'HOURLY', 387000.00, 904000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('550057c9-3107-5fc9-9374-f4d073fcd61e', 'ceb069a3-5a0d-508b-aab1-ce35ebf5dea3', 'Australian Salesforce Consultant for Discovery and Build (Sales and Service Cloud)', 'Australian Salesforce Consultant for Discovery and Build (Sales and Service Cloud) We''re a Melbourne-based CRM and AI consultancy. We''re looking for an experienced Australian Salesforce consultant to join us on a client engagement with an established, fast-growing Australian business. The situation - The client moved onto Salesforce this year. The build is early-stage and largely undocumented. - Customer, asset, payment and communication data sits across a legacy finance platform, Salesforce, banking and staff mobile phones. - An incumbent technical partner is migrating legacy functionality into Salesforce. You''ll work alongside them, not replace them. - The business is expanding interstate in the next 12 months and needs Salesforce to become the single source of truth before then. Step 1: Discovery workshop (one day) Your first commitment is to join our full-day discovery workshop with the client''s leadership and operational team. On site in Melbourne is preferred, but joining virtually is fine. Your role on the day: - Listen as the team walks through the customer journey, from enquiry to settlement, servicing, collections and renewal. - Ask the questions that matter from a Salesforce perspective: current build, data model, integrations, automation gaps and constraints. - Flag what''s realistic, what''s quick and what depends on the legacy migration. Step 2: Four-week discovery If the workshop goes well, we''d like you to stay on for the rest of discovery. What we provide: - Workshop facilitation, stakeholder interviews and the pre-workshop questionnaire - Product strategy, prioritisation and the commercial and ROI view - The joint 12 to 18 month roadmap and the final presentation to the client''s leadership - Client management, scheduling and access coordination What we need from you: - A review of the current Salesforce org, documented as a baseline - A map of where data lives, how it flows and where it''s moved manually - Working sessions with the incumbent partner to agree ways of working (environments, change control, release timing, build standards and documentation) - Scoping of up to four quick wins we can start without waiting on the migration - Technical input into the roadmap, including effort estimates and dependencies Estimated commitment for Step 2 is 20 hours. Step 3: Delivery (ongoing, subject to discovery) Based on the acceptance of roadmap and continuation of the agreement. What we''re looking for - Australian-based and available during AEST/AEDT business hours - Five or more years hands-on Salesforce experience (Sales Cloud, Service Cloud and Flow essential) - Experience integrating payment gateways, telephony/SMS and third-party or legacy systems - Experience in financial services, lending or asset finance (strongly preferred) - Familiarity with Australian credit and collections compliance (hardship, default notices) is a big plus - Experience Cloud and Agentforce/AI experience are a bonus - Comfortable working alongside another delivery partner in the same org - Strong documentation habits. The client must own everything we build. - Able to join the workshop on site in Melbourne or virtually - Salesforce certifications (Admin, Platform App Builder, Sales/Service Cloud Consultant) preferred To apply Please answer the screening questions below and share one or two examples of similar Salesforce work in financial services or asset-heavy businesses. Screening questions 1. Where are you based in Australia, and what''s your availability over the next six weeks? 2. Describe a Salesforce org you inherited with little or no documentation. What did you do first? 3. Have you integrated a payment gateway or telephony/SMS provider with Salesforce? Which ones, and what was the outcome? 4. How do you manage change control when another partner is building in the same org? 5. Which Salesforce certifications do you hold? Note: Do not reach out via email or Whatsapp. Should you do this, without invitation, your application will be immediately disqualified. Please keep all applications to Upwork.', 1, 'HOURLY', 646000.00, 1550000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('7fb8b1b0-c802-5361-bd12-4169fec97877', '78dc4ec8-5805-5148-8995-2ef62120b400', 'Tester, đánh giá hệ thống crm', 'Tester, đánh giá hệ thống crm. Kiểm tra toàn diện website, tổng hợp các chức của web và đưa ra các đánh giá. Góp ý và đưa ra ý kiến thêm các phần còn thiếu để hoàn thiện hệ thống. Mô hình nạp tiền tài khoản Super admin > User', 1, 'FIXED', 500000.00, 1000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('d6f061de-abed-5257-b281-b0cde7271e70', '1079b3e8-8eac-5bce-9aef-92e0ebbf183b', 'Cài đặt , việt Hóa Vtiger lên VPS', 'Cài đặt và Việt Hóa theo yêu cầu source Vtiger lên VPS', 1, 'FIXED', 3000000.00, 6000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('b6636e2c-1b9f-5a06-bdd8-9b75a0aaf28c', '23ebf163-ce96-5ba6-998d-44edf328d76d', 'Customize Module CRM cho ERP Odoo', 'Công ty chúng tôi đang dung ERP Odoo V.19 cumminity, đang cần hoàn thiện phân hệ CRM, customs dashboard theo nhu cầu của công ty. Yêu cầu: Có kinh nghiệm làm việc CRM, ERP Odoo, ứng viên tại Sài Gòn, vì có thể trao đổi offline.', 1, 'FIXED', 30000000.00, 50000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('9be29f87-6fcc-5a67-a139-0b4bc1dda2e6', '6c5f437c-009b-5086-90ac-d5b73c228f55', 'PostgreSQL Table Partitioning and Performance Optimization', 'project involves analyzing large tables, identifying performance issues, and implementing range-based partitioning using date columns. Key Responsibilities: 1. Analyze existing PostgreSQL tables and identify performance bottlenecks. 2. Implement range-based partitioning to manage large datasets more efficiently. 3. Optimize SQL queries to improve data retrieval speed. 4. Create and optimize indexes for partitioned tables. 5. Improve database maintenance, including data archiving and partition management. 6. Test query performance before and after the changes to measure improvements. I''m looking for someone with good experience in PostgreSQL database optimization and table partitioning.', 1, 'FIXED', 129000.00, 129000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('525bd36d-e1e9-5af6-8049-1b27a50b7cb5', 'a6b39641-55dc-565e-82a1-1205f3d6aaf4', 'DBA Certified Engineer in PostgreSQL, MySQL, MongoDB, Redis, or SQL Server', '## About the Role Do you have experience managing databases and are looking for a challenging project with a remote, part-time arrangement? **This opportunity could be for you!** ### What will your challenge be? - Administer, monitor, and maintain databases in production and testing environments. - Manage backups, recovery, and service continuity. - Optimize database performance and ensure database security. - Provide support to development teams and participate in incident resolution. ### What do you need to apply? - More than 2 years of experience administering at least two database management systems, such as PostgreSQL, MySQL, MongoDB, Redis, or SQL Server. - Certifications or training courses totaling at least 50 hours in the relevant database technologies, obtained or completed within the last 5 years. **Experience with the following is also a plus:** AWS RDS/Aurora or Azure, high availability, replication, and automation. ### What do we offer? - 100% remote work. - Part-time commitment. - A 1-year project-based contract. If you meet the requirements and are interested in being part of this project, we''d love to hear from you! **Apply now and share this opportunity with anyone who might be looking for a challenge like this.**', 1, 'HOURLY', 517000.00, 1033000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('4c0bb85c-3981-5cb6-83c8-c8c5550508f9', '2eb95694-dc42-5f5c-b244-14f29748a363', 'Senior DBA Consultant for Oracle/Postgres', 'We are seeking a senior DBA consultant for 5–10 hours per week. Responsibilities include database installation, configuration, patching, and upgrades; performance monitoring and tuning; backup and recovery management, including RMAN and DR/restore testing; high availability administration; storage and capacity planning; and security hardening. The ideal freelancer should be able to support ongoing database operations and help maintain reliable, secure, and high-performing environments. (Certifications required)', 1, 'HOURLY', 258000.00, 904000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('39b93a65-c90f-5169-9c69-e5bc91281365', '692da31a-82c0-5264-93b9-882f320eeb95', 'Senior Full Stack Developer (React, Node.js, PostgreSQL) to Build a SaaS Web App MVP', 'We are a small startup building a subscription-based web application that helps small businesses manage clients, invoices and recurring payments in one dashboard. We have a finished product spec and wireframes, and we need an experienced full stack developer to turn them into a production-ready MVP.', 1, 'FIXED', 258000.00, 258000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('8cee42a7-786a-5c36-ad4f-8684e7293c93', 'dce7801d-04c2-5c94-ad87-a1dd6ff4c199', 'Odoo 17 Enterprise developer (Odoo.sh) for on-call support of custom modules, ongoing', 'We’re an industrial electric motor repair shop in Memphis, TN, with about 22 people. We run Odoo 17 Enterprise on Odoo.sh with several custom modules, including job costing, repair jobs, manufacturing orders and payments. Our outside Odoo partner is leaving, and we handle day-to-day support in-house. We need one experienced developer on call for custom-module work we can’t handle ourselves. What you’d do: Diagnose and fix bugs in our custom modules (Python, XML views, access rules, scheduled jobs) Work only on branches and staging, and open a pull request for every change. We review and merge to production; you never deploy to production. Write short notes on what you changed and why Typical volume: a few hours a month, with occasional urgent requests Start with a paid trial (fixed price, about 4–6 hours): Get our code running on an Odoo.sh staging branch Read the custom modules and send a 1–2 page summary: what each module does, code quality concerns, and what would need to change to upgrade to Odoo 19 Requirements: 3+ years with Odoo, recent work on version 17 Odoo.sh and GitHub pull request workflow Custom module development, not just configuration Accounting or manufacturing module experience is a strong plus Available during US Central business hours for urgent issues, with same-day response on emergencies Willing to sign an NDA and an agreement that all code belongs to us Nice to have: has done a v17 → v19 migration. That may become a separate project. Contract: Hourly, ongoing. Fixed-price trial first. Must be able to respond to request in US Central Time Zone', 1, 'HOURLY', 1033000.00, 2067000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('83e2c6fc-9f3f-59bf-a4bb-d2c4bcff0459', 'f63b5db8-2528-5db7-928d-c4c8f6e2f55e', 'SAP SD Lead Consultant (S/4HANA Cloud Public Edition), Remote', 'SAP SD Lead Consultant (S/4HANA Cloud Public Edition), Remote Workload: 70–100% Duration: Until June 2027 Start: ASAP About the role We are looking for an experienced SAP SD Lead Consultant to lead the Order-to-Cash (O2C) work stream in an SAP S/4HANA Cloud Public Edition implementation for one of our clients. You will be responsible for the design, configuration and delivery of the SD scope and work closely with the project team and the business to bring the O2C processes live. Your responsibilities - Lead the O2C work stream, including planning, coordination and quality of the SD deliverables - Run fit-to-standard workshops with the business and translate requirements into configuration within the SAP Best Practices scope - Configure and test sales, pricing, delivery and billing processes - Coordinate with neighbouring work streams such as Finance, Logistics and Master Data - Support testing, data migration, cutover and go-live - Document the solution and support knowledge transfer to key users Must-have requirements - Hands-on experience in implementing SAP S/4HANA Cloud Public Edition. Experience limited to ECC, on-premise or private cloud is not sufficient. We are looking for real project experience from at least one full implementation in the Public Edition. - Proven lead experience in Order-to-Cash (O2C): you have led the SD / O2C work stream, not only worked within it, and you can show end-to-end responsibility for design, configuration and go-live. - Strong English in speaking and writing, as you will work with international stakeholders. Ideally, you also bring - Experience with the SAP Activate methodology and fit-to-standard workshops - Good knowledge of the standard O2C scope: sales orders, pricing, availability check, delivery, billing, credit management and integration with Finance (revenue recognition) - Experience with the self-service configuration of the Public Edition and with key-user extensibility - Experience with data migration tools and cutover planning - Experience in testing and user acceptance support - Ability to lead a small team of consultants and to coordinate with other work streams - A structured, independent working style and clear communication with both business and IT ⚠️ Important: Candidates who attach a CV to their application and have relevant skills will be prioritized.', 1, 'HOURLY', 775000.00, 1292000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00');

