    ('e1f45d47-c06a-5604-8cef-25c2c73f7045', '8baa4579-daae-5193-aec1-77686464a932', 'Senior AI/ML Full Stack Engineer', 'Job Description: We are seeking a highly skilled AI/ML Full Stack Engineer to join our growing technical consulting and recruitment initiative. We collaborate with US-based clients to deliver enterprise-grade AI solutions, and we need a strong communicator who is fluent in English. Requirements: Strong experience as a Full Stack Engineer with AI/ML focus Hands-on experience with: Python (NumPy, Pandas, PyTorch or TensorFlow) LLM frameworks (LangChain, LlamaIndex, OpenAI APIs) Vector databases (Pinecone, FAISS, Weaviate) Frontend frameworks (React, Next.js, TypeScript) Experience building end-to-end AI applications (UI → API → Model → Data) Knowledge of RAG pipelines, embeddings, and model evaluation Experience with REST/GraphQL APIs and microservices architecture Cloud experience (AWS, Azure, or GCP) Strong communication skills with fluent English and professional video presence Availability during US EST business hours (9 AM – 5 PM) Nice to Have: Experience with MLOps (MLflow, Kubeflow, Docker, Kubernetes, CI/CD) Experience building AI SaaS products or internal platforms Prior experience in client-facing or technical interview roles Why Join Us: Work on real-world AI applications at scale Own end-to-end system design (frontend to AI models) Engage directly in client-facing technical strategy Opportunity for long-term, high-impact collaboration', 1, 'HOURLY', 775000.00, 1033000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('a25d35b0-dfeb-57a7-b8cc-588fb505340a', '2ca19c29-d960-54b2-af9a-ae9c8edfca20', 'FullStack Developer (Core Application Integration)', 'The role is for a FullStack Developer with Core Application Integration Skills; Beginners or Entry-Level need not apply please. The platform is built, live, and gaining traction with over 3,000 views and approximately 1,000 likes across the first two applications. What is needed now is a developer who can connect it to the services, APIs, and distribution channels that will take it to the next stage of commercial growth.', 1, 'FIXED', 12916000.00, 12916000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('062e84e3-0bc5-538e-9fe2-2290567db12e', '7f6320c3-de83-59bf-b81d-6e8575420419', 'Mid-Level AI Full-Stack Engineer (LLMs, APIs & SaaS)', 'We are looking for a mid-level AI Full-Stack Engineers with strong experience in building AI-powered applications and scalable software solutions. The ideal candidate has proven experience working remotely with US- or Canada-based companies and is proficient in modern frontend and backend technologies, LLM integrations, and API development. Strong communication skills, a proactive mindset, and the ability to work independently in a remote environment are essential.', 1, 'HOURLY', 387000.00, 1033000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('a0c2d826-d30f-570e-8108-7f82cd4720cb', '6744e019-8824-5c39-a8db-c71fd99ed01a', 'Senior Full Stack Developer (React, Next.js, Node.js) - OpenAI API Integration for SaaS Web App', 'We have a web application and want to add AI-powered features using the OpenAI API. We’re looking for an experienced full stack developer who can work inside our existing codebase, solve problems independently, and keep us updated without being chased. What you’ll work on Build and improve features in React and Next.js with TypeScript Develop Node.js / Express services with clean REST API endpoints, documented with OpenAPI Integrate the OpenAI API into our existing app (AI features, prompt handling, error handling, cost control) Manage and optimize our PostgreSQL database (Supabase experience is a plus) Integrate third-party APIs Implement authentication and role-based access Fix bugs and leave clear notes so the next developer isn’t guessing Required React.js / Next.js Node.js / TypeScript / JavaScript PostgreSQL REST API design and integration OpenAI API / AI integration Git / GitHub Nice to have Vercel or AWS deployment Tailwind CSS or Material UI Stripe payments or subscriptions MongoDB / MERN stack experience How we work Fixed-price milestones, starting with one small paid milestone. If it goes well, we continue. A plain-English plan and written scope before coding starts Regular progress updates, and early warning if anything threatens the deadline Readable, maintainable code with handover notes To apply, please include: One project where you integrated an API or AI feature into an existing app, and what the result was Your availability and how soon you can start Your proposed first milestone We’re happy to hire for the long term if the first milestone goes well.', 1, 'FIXED', 2583000.00, 2583000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('365fab9b-c72a-50cf-914a-0d3c6df76c80', 'e60e6922-bfd7-55aa-93a6-cd52bf276001', 'Node.js / React Solo Developer for 1-1 Web App Configuratio', 'Hi, I am looking for an experienced individual Full-Stack developer (Node.js/React) to work directly with me 1-1, with zero agencies or middlemen. • Scope of Work: Configure layouts and parameters inside a secured Linux server sandbox directory (/var/www/fanclub68). • Fixed Budget: Hard-capped at $400 USD, split strictly into 2 milestones ($200 / $200). • Security Standards: Mandatory delivery of 100% clean source code in a .zip archive, completely free of backdoors or malware. Please confirm if you are fully aligned with this 2-milestone $400 budget structure and let me know your absolute minimum estimated timeline to complete this from scratch. Thank you!', 1, 'FIXED', 10333000.00, 10333000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
