    ('53d1fa6a-69d5-56d0-b4d6-7630eb6eb2bf', 'de334e75-f694-525f-981f-f8fba9d885b8', 'Freelancer Fullstack Developer', '[TUYỂN DỤNG FREELANCER FULLSTACK DEVELOPER] Phường An Khánh, TP.HCM Lương thỏa thuận theo năng lực Yêu cầu kỹ thuật Thành thạo ReactJS (v18+ hoặc 19) Sử dụng tốt TypeScript Có kinh nghiệm với TailwindCSS Có kinh nghiệm với các game framework construct 3, Phaser, Cocos, HTML5 Làm việc với React Router Biết sử dụng State Management (Zustand hoặc tương đương) ⭐ Điểm cộng Kinh nghiệm với Radix UI / shadcn UI Sử dụng React Hook Form + Zod Có hiểu biết về Web3 (TON, Wallet Connect) Kinh nghiệm triển khai i18n (react-intl) ⏰ Thời gian làm việc Thời gian: 1 tháng - Từ 11/05/2026 – 11/06/2026 Hình thức: Làm việc trực tiếp tại công ty', 1, 'FIXED', 20000000.00, 30000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('743d03d4-df0e-5d05-bd17-2d36621abcef', '6c8d4626-7581-5c49-be14-3c686bfbf712', 'Cần tuyển Java full stack developer', 'Công ty phần mềm Odyssey cần tuyển Java full stack developer. Xem JD đính kèm. Lương thỏa thuận.', 1, 'FIXED', 20000000.00, 50000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('ec5a562e-f608-585f-b564-e93f6127558e', '7bc483a7-30f9-5a53-9a83-859d2a423925', 'Cần AI Full-Stack Engineer tư vấn theo giờ', 'Công việc chính: Tư vấn và thiết kế web portal nội bộ cho công ty sự kiện tích hợp AI, bao gồm - Thiết lập hạ tầng: backend, cơ sở dữ liệu, xác thực người dùng, hosting (ưu tiên dùng dịch vụ managed để nhanh và an toàn). - Xây dựng RAG (tìm kiếm ngữ nghĩa trên kho tài liệu cũ): xử lý dữ liệu, embedding, vector database, API truy xuất. - Xây dựng hệ thống AI agent điều phối theo pipeline (Brief → Research → Proposal), dùng framework như LangGraph / OpenAI Agents SDK. - Tích hợp LLM (Claude / GPT) và image generation (tạo key visual, moodboard). - Xây giao diện web cho người dùng (upload brief, xem bản nháp, chỉnh sửa, phê duyệt). - Tư vấn lựa chọn nhà cung cấp AI (buy-vs-build) và kiểm soát chi phí vận hành. Yêu cầu bắt buộc - 3+ năm kinh nghiệm full-stack (ưu tiên Python backend + một framework frontend hiện đại như React/Next.js). - Đã từng xây sản phẩm thực tế có tích hợp LLM API (OpenAI, Anthropic, hoặc tương tự). - Kinh nghiệm thực chiến với RAG / vector database (Pinecone, Weaviate, pgvector…). - Hiểu về AI agent / orchestration (LangGraph, CrewAI, OpenAI Agents SDK, hoặc tương đương). - Biết triển khai trên cloud (AWS / GCP / Azure) và các dịch vụ managed (auth, hosting, database). - Làm việc độc lập, tự quản lý tiến độ, và giải thích được vấn đề kỹ thuật cho người không chuyên. Điểm cộng (không bắt buộc) - Kinh nghiệm với image generation (Stable Diffusion, Flux, DALL·E, Midjourney API…). - Hiểu về bảo mật dữ liệu: RBAC, tenant isolation, audit logging. - Đã từng làm với agency sáng tạo / sự kiện, hoặc sản phẩm SaaS đa khách hàng (multi-tenant). - Có sản phẩm demo / GitHub / portfolio để tham khảo. Khối lượng: khoảng [] giờ/tuần trong [] tuần đầu (Giai đoạn 1), có thể tiếp tục các giai đoạn sau. Thù lao: theo giờ hoặc theo giai đoạn, thỏa thuận dựa trên kinh nghiệm. Quy trình phỏng vấn & lựa chọn Vòng hồ sơ: Gửi CV / portfolio và 1-2 dự án AI/LLM bạn đã xây (kèm vai trò của bạn). Phỏng vấn 45 phút: Trao đổi về kinh nghiệm, cách tiếp cận kỹ thuật, và khả năng giải thích vấn đề cho người không chuyên. Giao việc: Sau khi phỏng vấn đạt, chúng tôi sẽ thống nhất phạm vi công việc Khối lượng: 1 tháng đầu tiên chỉ cần tư vấn cho khách hàng (khoảng 2 giờ 1 tuần), sau đó bắt đầu triển khai dự án (40 giờ/ tuần) Cách ứng tuyển Gửi cho chúng tôi: (1) CV / portfolio, (2) 1-2 dự án AI/LLM bạn đã xây và vai trò của bạn, (3) mức phí mong muốn cho phần phát triển (theo giờ hoặc theo dự án)', 1, 'FIXED', 200000.00, 1000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('a3f70790-8481-56f1-9a6f-b9c31bc250b1', '29b84ace-3d67-5807-9859-b6837862cd83', 'Cần tạo web app phần mềm giống pancake.vn', 'Mình Cần tạo web app phần mềm giống pancake.vn Chủ yếu kết nối các kênh chat mạng xã hội về một mối để thuận tiện cho việc rep tin nhắn của cửa hàng. Mục đích. Có web app tích hợp các kênh mxh riêng. Chủ yếu để rep tin nhắn. Và lưu đơn hàng. Mình chỉ cần sản phẩm cơ bản. CÁC BƯỚC - Đưa ra đề xuất và ngân sách - Thực hiện - Chỉnh sửa - Duyệt', 1, 'FIXED', 1500000.00, 6500000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('89b32cff-88b4-59b8-874b-9e1d022f05a5', 'fcb1114b-005e-562b-b091-708e63dab9b9', 'Tìm người hoàn thiện app React Native đang được chuyển đổi qua AI từ web app React', 'Chúng tôi cần tìm người hoàn thiện mobile app React Native đã được chuyển đổi tự động từ web app React sang bằng AI. Mức độ hoàn thiện hiện tại 60%. Cần sửa lại giao diện tinh chỉnh UX. Tất cả các API đã sẵn sàng như bản web. Ứng dụng web tại https://earlysigns.net', 1, 'FIXED', 1000000.00, 3000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('c4e0c270-46c9-5b83-983f-d8337aa14337', '9b140e7d-97f9-56d0-aeb7-0e28d98c37e4', 'Full-Stack Developer (Freelance) – 1 Month, Renewable – HCMC-based Only', 'Full-Stack Developer (Freelance) — 1-Month Mission, Renewable HCMC-based only — on-site meetings required About: HYGILOG is a hospitality SaaS platform for HACCP compliance. Already live on iOS & Android. We need a senior dev to stabilize, secure, and document the existing codebase. Stack: React/Next.js, Node.js/NestJS, Flutter, MongoDB, AWS Amplify, Cloudflare, NFC. Mission: Priority #0: Fix AWS Amplify ↔ Cloudflare DNS/SSL issue. Priority #1: Implement RBAC — 6 roles, permissions, protected routes, dynamic menus, login redirect. Priority #2: Web ↔ Mobile synchronization and critical bug fixes. Priority #3: Technical documentation and handover. Milestones (1 month): J1 (10–12 days): Audit + RBAC complete J2 (7–10 days): Sync + critical bugs J3 (3–5 days): Documentation + training Payment by milestone after written validation. No payment without validation. Must-have: Based in HCMC (able to come to office) 5+ years full-stack (React/Next, Node/NestJS, Flutter) Proven RBAC & multi-tenant experience Hands-on AWS Amplify & Cloudflare Fluent English, available immediately Working model: Freelance, deliverables-based, daily 15-min sync, 1 month renewable, HCMC office 1 day/week. Code pushed to GitHub weekly. How to apply: Include (1) years of experience with the stack, (2) an RBAC example, (3) AWS/Cloudflare experience, (4) availability, (5) confirmation you are HCMC-based. Shortlisted candidates will have a technical interview and short test. Only HCMC-based candidates considered. This is a freelance mission, not employment.', 1, 'FIXED', 30000000.00, 45000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('5948f0cd-12a8-51f8-934a-38c569d88d01', '567b63d6-04ed-51e0-809b-65215d09860e', 'UI/UX designer + front-end dev to polish a live health tracking app (web app wrapped for iOS)', 'I have a live iOS app, Body Journal (https://apps.apple.com/us/app/body-journal-health-tracker/id6811468593), and I''m looking for someone to redesign the UI so it looks clean, modern, and feels like a premium native app. About the app: it syncs wearable data (WHOOP, Oura, Apple Watch), smart scale weight and body composition, and nutrition logging (photo, recent meals, or text), then gives AI insights like your calorie deficit/surplus. Everything works; the design just needs a serious upgrade. What I need: - Redesign of the app''s UI: Overview/dashboard, food logging, body/weight tracking, and settings - A consistent design system (spacing, typography, colors, components) - Implementation in the existing codebase (HTML/CSS/JavaScript web app wrapped for iOS with Capacitor), or polished Figma designs plus help implementing them Process: we''ll hop on a call first to walk through the app and discuss the direction before you start. Budget: $400 fixed price. Must have: - Portfolio with mobile app UI work (health/fitness apps a big plus) - Strong eye for detail and modern iOS design - Comfortable with CSS / front-end (Capacitor or mobile web experience is a plus) In your proposal, please include 2-3 app UIs you''ve designed or built and your availability for a call this week.', 1, 'FIXED', 10333000.00, 10333000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('00823c6a-8b9c-5a36-abbe-f52f8e0e1001', '70896310-96a3-51dc-9254-7296c8f4551f', 'AI / SaaS Expert to Evaluate App Ideas', 'Looking for an experienced developer, AI expert, startup founder, or app marketer to discuss my AI and SaaS ideas and assess their potential to make money, build a loyal niche audience, or go viral. E.g Cal AI, Prayerlock, Mon AI etc We''ll evaluate market demand, competition, monetisation, growth potential, and development costs to identify which ideas are worth pursuing. Practical experience launching, growing, or monetising apps or SaaS products is a plus. I value honest feedback, critical thinking, and actionable recommendations.', 1, 'FIXED', 517000.00, 517000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('f9d34c2e-5dcd-5a5a-9215-0f710256d8c6', 'a3845c40-14f7-5662-b8e8-93baa33f8177', 'Flutter/iOS and Next.js Developer', 'Small product studio seeking mid-level developers to support ongoing client projects for iPhone apps and websites. Work is assigned as projects come in, with fixed pricing per project. We’re looking for someone who can contribute consistently and help deliver reliable, production-ready work. Please include a portfolio with live App Store apps or live websites.', 1, 'HOURLY', 258000.00, 517000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('0aec5f86-80c8-5609-8a30-0a4cc295289e', 'c852c6e3-1578-5a77-b5e1-6a8b2f7aad4a', 'Senior iOS & Full-Stack Developer | App Optimization, UI/UX, Security & Admin Panel', 'We are looking for an experienced Senior iOS Developer and Full-Stack Engineer (or a qualified development team) to improve and finalize an existing mobile application and its web-based administration platform. This is NOT a project being developed from scratch. We already have an existing application, backend infrastructure, and administration panel. Our objective is to identify and resolve outstanding issues, significantly improve the overall design and user experience, strengthen security, and bring the entire platform to a professional, stable, production-ready standard. The application operates in the transportation and service-booking sector. Further business details and technical documentation will only be shared with shortlisted developers under a Non-Disclosure Agreement (NDA). Main Responsibilities: 1. iOS Application Improvements - Review the existing iOS application and source code. - Identify and resolve bugs, incomplete features, and performance issues. - Improve application stability, responsiveness, and reliability. - Enhance the existing UI/UX with a premium, modern, and intuitive design. - Optimize navigation, screen transitions, loading times, and overall usability. - Ensure compatibility with current iOS versions and supported iPhone devices. 2. Security Audit & Vulnerability Fixes - Perform a comprehensive security assessment of the mobile application, backend APIs, and admin panel. - Identify authentication, authorization, data protection, and API security vulnerabilities. - Review session management, access permissions, and sensitive data handling. - Fix identified vulnerabilities following industry best practices. - Provide a documented security assessment and remediation report. 3. Admin Panel Redesign & Development - Review the existing web-based administration panel. - Redesign the interface to achieve a modern, premium, enterprise-level appearance. - Improve navigation, dashboards, forms, tables, filters, and data management workflows. - Identify and fix existing admin panel errors and broken functionality. - Ensure fast performance and responsive compatibility across desktop, tablet, and mobile devices. - Improve role-based access control and administrative usability. 4. Backend & System Optimization - Review existing frontend-to-backend integrations. - Identify incomplete or malfunctioning API connections. - Resolve technical inconsistencies and improve system reliability. - Optimize performance, error handling, and data synchronization. - Preserve the existing architecture wherever possible and avoid unnecessary rebuilding. 5. Testing & Quality Assurance - Conduct functional, integration, security, and performance testing. - Identify and resolve critical defects. - Verify that existing working features remain fully operational. - Deliver clean, maintainable, well-documented code. Important Project Requirements: - Existing functionality and user data must be preserved. - We are looking for improvements to an existing product, not a complete rebuild. - All changes must be properly tested before deployment. - The project must be handled professionally and confidentially. - Source code ownership and all completed deliverables must remain with the project owner. - Full technical details will be disclosed only after initial evaluation and NDA agreement. Ideal Candidate: Strong experience with Swift/SwiftUI, iOS development, modern web technologies, backend APIs, enterprise admin dashboards, UI/UX design, security auditing, and production application maintenance. Please include examples of similar projects, your relevant experience, your proposed development approach, and an estimated timeline and budget after an initial technical assessment. Our goal is to transform an already-developed platform into a polished, secure, highly reliable, and professionally designed product.', 1, 'FIXED', 129160000.00, 129160000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('a28161b5-ff15-5326-9c29-c48c615e04d0', 'bfbd6a73-41b0-5882-83ff-83ca39705c72', 'Full-Stack Developer Needed to Build Minimalist Sports Logging Web App Prototype (MVP)', 'Couch Coach — M1 Stabilisation & Approved UI Implementation PROJECT OVERVIEW I am looking for an experienced developer to stabilise and refine an existing web-based football tactical insights application called Couch Coach. The original Bolt.new build is available in my own GitHub account and is intended to be the starting point for this engagement. The approved HERO design and detailed visual references will be made available to the selected developer once the engagement and appropriate confidentiality arrangements have been agreed. Applicants should assess the existing code and propose the most practical, cost-effective approach, avoiding an unnecessary rebuild. I am seeking a reliable, maintainable implementation of the agreed functionality and interface, with clear communication, realistic timescales and demonstrable testing. Please review the requirements below and provide your proposed technical approach, fixed-price estimate and delivery timescale. ## 1. USER INTERFACE AND DESIGN The application must retain a clean, minimalist presentation centred on a prominent, attractive, sunlit football stadium. The intended interface includes: - A stadium that remains clearly visible and is not obscured by excessive interface elements. - A discreet, single horizontal row of match controls. - A small white **PRE-MATCH PREVIEW & PREDICTION** box. - A larger white **LIVE TACTICAL INSIGHTS** notebook beneath it. - Black text on white backgrounds within both boxes. - Permanent titles integrated into the top of each box. - Voice and typed input for both boxes, with each input routed to the correct destination. - Live tactical observations displayed chronologically, oldest first and newest at the bottom, with clear match-minute timestamps. The interface must be practical and ergonomic, with no unnecessary dashboard cards, duplicate input boxes, decorative panels or redundant controls. Detailed visual references will be shared with the shortlisted or selected developer after appropriate contractual and confidentiality arrangements have been agreed. ## 2. MICROPHONE AND CONTINUOUS SPEECH-TO-TEXT — CRITICAL REQUIREMENT Reliable continuous speech-to-text is a core requirement of Couch Coach. The developer must inspect the original Bolt build and assess its existing speech-recognition implementation before proposing any replacement. Requirements: - Continuous voice input suitable for natural speech, spontaneous thoughts and extended streams of football observations. - Users must not need to reactivate the microphone for every sentence or short phrase. - Recognised text must appear promptly in the correct box. - Previously captured text must not silently disappear when recognition stops, encounters an error or reconnects. - Recognition must handle natural pauses and recover gracefully from browser recognition interruptions and transient errors wherever possible. - Microphone permission must be requested when necessary, with clear instructions if permission is blocked or denied. - Clear microphone controls and an understandable listening status. - Clear error messages and a Retry mechanism where appropriate. - Voice input must work independently in both the pre-match box and the live tactical notebook. The developer must identify the proposed speech-recognition API or library and explain the technical approach before replacing the existing mechanism. If the original build uses the browser''s Web Speech API, including SpeechRecognition or webkitSpeechRecognition, its suitability for retention and improvement should be assessed before introducing another service. The developer should assess practical ways to improve recognition of football terminology, player names and team names, including the possible use of pre-match notes as contextual vocabulary. Perfect recognition is not assumed, but realistic football vocabulary must be tested. Live observations must be timestamped according to when the observation began, rather than simply when a delayed transcription is committed. ## 3. MATCH CONTROLS AND KICKOFF SYNCHRONISATION The controls must appear in one compact horizontal row without obstructing the stadium or notebook. Required controls: - First Half — START / STOP. - Second Half — START / STOP. - PAUSE / RESUME. Kickoff synchronisation is essential. The match clock must reflect actual elapsed match time relative to the agreed kickoff reference, rather than simply starting from zero when the user clicks START. The implementation must preserve elapsed time through pause and resume and support the transition between the first and second halves. If starting or synchronising fails, the user must receive a clear error message and a Retry option. The developer must explain how kickoff synchronisation is implemented and how its accuracy will be tested. ## 4. NEW MATCH, DATA RETENTION AND RECOVERY Starting a New Match must produce a completely clean match interface. All match-specific information from the previous match must be cleared from the active interface, including pre-match notes, predictions, live observations and timestamps. No previous-match content may remain visible or contaminate the new match. The application must also handle refreshes and temporary Wi-Fi interruptions without losing previously captured observations or their timestamps. Where speech recognition is interrupted, the application should recover gracefully while preserving all text and observations already captured. The developer must explain how notes and timestamps are stored and recovered reliably. ## 5. M1 ACCEPTANCE TESTS All six acceptance tests must be demonstrated before M1 is accepted. **Test 1 — Start Match / Sync Kickoff** The clock starts and synchronises correctly on the first attempt, reflects the appropriate elapsed match time, and provides a clear error and Retry option if synchronisation fails. **Test 2 — New Match** A new match starts cleanly, with no pre-match notes, predictions, observations or timestamps carried over from the previous match. **Test 3 — Voice and Typed Observations** Both input methods work reliably. Live observations are routed correctly, timestamped appropriately and displayed in chronological order. **Test 4 — Microphone Permissions** Using a clean Chrome profile with no previously granted microphone permission, verify the permission request and the instructions provided if access is blocked. **Test 5 — Refresh and Wi-Fi Interruption** Previously captured notes and timestamps survive a page refresh and temporary connectivity interruption. Speech recognition recovers as far as the browser and implementation permit, without discarding captured observations. **Test 6 — Visual Acceptance** The prominent stadium, minimalist layout, compact control row and two clearly differentiated white notebook boxes are implemented as agreed, without unnecessary cards or controls. Testing must include realistic extended speech input, natural pauses, football terminology and player names, as well as error and recovery scenarios. ## 6. TECHNICAL APPROACH AND HANDOVER Before implementation, the developer must assess the original Bolt.new build in my GitHub account and explain: - Which existing components can be retained or improved. - The proposed speech-recognition API or library and its limitations. - How continuous recognition, interruptions and recovery will be handled. - How notes and timestamps will be stored and recovered. - How kickoff synchronisation will work. - How the application will be tested and deployed. Deliverables must include: - A working, tested and responsive application. - Clean, maintainable source code in a repository under my control. - Deployment and setup instructions. - A clear explanation of the implemented functionality and any remaining limitations. The developer must not assume that code from a previous development engagement is available or required. ## 7. SCOPE, COST AND DELIVERY This engagement covers **M1 stabilisation, implementation of the agreed interface and functionality, testing, and handover**. Wider M2 development is excluded and will be considered separately after M1 has been completed and accepted. M2 features include fixture selection for European football competitions, user accounts, Fan League functionality, leaderboards, expanded prediction features and multi-sport support. Before work begins, please provide: 1. Your proposed technical approach. 2. A fixed-price estimate and realistic delivery timescale. 3. A list of deliverables and confirmation of how each acceptance test will be demonstrated. 4. Any significant technical risks or limitations identified in the original code. 5. Confirmation that the work will build on the existing GitHub code wherever practical, avoiding an unnecessary rebuild. I am looking for a developer who can assess the existing assets objectively, communicate clearly, implement the requirements reliably and deliver maintainable work without unnecessary complexity or scope expansion. Please address the specific requirements above in your response and explain your proposed approach.', 1, 'FIXED', 5166000.00, 5166000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('aeb3fadc-7367-5bd2-93d1-18c1c4cb97c6', '8c4968e2-37a1-5aa0-9341-111864bd14b7', 'Full-Stack Developer – Custom Booking System with Instant M-Pesa Agent Payouts (Kenya)', 'Job Description I need an experienced full-stack developer to design and build a web application that integrates with M-Pesa for payments, using React on the front end, Node.js on the back end, and PostgreSQL as the database. Project overview The system should let users initiate and complete M-Pesa payments (STK Push / C2B), record transaction status in real time via callbacks, and manage related data (users, transactions, and core records) through a clean React interface and a well-structured Node.js API. Exact feature scope will be refined in the first week once we align on priorities. The foundation needs to be solid, secure, and maintainable. Technical requirements • React (modern functional components and hooks) • Node.js with a structured API (Express or equivalent) • PostgreSQL (schema design, migrations, and queries) • M-Pesa Daraja API integration (authentication, STK Push, callbacks, and transaction status handling) • Proper error handling, logging, and basic security practices • Environment-based configuration (dev / staging / production) What I’m looking for • Proven experience with the stack above, especially real M-Pesa integrations • Ability to work independently on an hourly basis with clear weekly progress updates • Willingness to discuss architecture choices and document key decisions • Clean, readable code and a practical approach to deployment Timeline and availability Estimated 3–6 months on an hourly basis. Medium skill level is appropriate; reliability and clear communication matter more than the lowest rate. This is a multi-month engagement. Please review your calendar carefully and disclose in your proposal any holidays or planned periods of limited availability in the next 3–6 months. Short, advance-communicated breaks are acceptable; I will hold you to the availability you state. Please also include: • 1–2 examples of previous M-Pesa or similar payment-gateway work • A short note on how you would structure the initial API and database schema • Your typical weekly availability I’m ready to start soon and will provide more detailed requirements once we connect.', 1, 'HOURLY', 387000.00, 904000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('04f22977-ce42-526f-81fd-ec2a5612cb11', '507a814c-eb53-50af-8f32-077ede2d50aa', 'Tuyển lập trình viên xây dựng và quản trị hệ thống mã giảm giá (Voucher/Promotion)', 'Tôi đang cần tìm một Freelancer có kinh nghiệm để xây dựng/tối ưu hóa tính năng quản lý chương trình khuyến mãi cho hệ thống của mình. Mục tiêu là giúp việc tạo, theo dõi và áp dụng các mã giảm giá...', 1, 'FIXED', 500000.00, 5000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('6e3b8383-888b-5232-b30a-5e86a3e218b9', '0cd1457c-ab56-57e3-bde1-c8532bd7c822', 'Cần tuyển Freelancer/Team chuyển đổi hệ thống website từ ASP.NET WebForms (.aspx) sang kiến trúc hiện đại sử dụng .NET Core + React NextJS.', 'Cần tuyển Freelancer/Team chuyển đổi hệ thống website từ ASP.NET WebForms (.aspx) sang kiến trúc hiện đại sử dụng .NET Core + React NextJS. Thông tin dự án: * Lĩnh vực: Website thuê xe du lịch * Hiện trạng: * Đã có source code hệ thống cũ * Database hiện tại gồm khoảng 16 tables * Hệ thống đang hoạt động ổn định và cần đảm bảo giữ nguyên dữ liệu hiện có Yêu cầu thực hiện: 1. Chuyển đổi Backend: * Refactor hệ thống backend từ ASP.NET WebForms sang .NET Core (C#) * Xây dựng kiến trúc API (RESTful API) * Tối ưu hiệu năng, bảo mật và khả năng mở rộng hệ thống * Giữ nguyên cấu trúc dữ liệu và logic nghiệp vụ hiện tại nếu phù hợp 2. Chuyển đổi Frontend: * Xây dựng lại frontend bằng ReactJS / NextJS * Tối ưu SEO, tốc độ tải trang và trải nghiệm người dùng * Responsive trên desktop/mobile/tablet 3. UI/UX: * Thiết kế lại giao diện hiện đại, chuyên nghiệp và thân thiện người dùng * Cải thiện trải nghiệm đặt xe, xem thông tin và thao tác quản trị 4. Chức năng: * Giữ nguyên dữ liệu hiện tại, URL/link cũ và các nội dung đang hoạt động để hạn chế ảnh hưởng SEO * Bổ sung thêm một số module/chức năng nhỏ trong quá trình triển khai * Bao gồm: * Trang chủ hiển thị thông tin dịch vụ * Trang quản trị (Admin) quản lý bài viết/nội dung Yêu cầu ứng viên: * Có kinh nghiệm với .NET Core, ReactJS/NextJS * Có khả năng migrate hệ thống cũ sang kiến trúc mới * Ưu tiên từng làm các dự án CMS, booking hoặc website dịch vụ * Có tư duy tối ưu SEO và performance Vui lòng gửi: * Portfolio hoặc dự án đã thực hiện * Công nghệ/kiến trúc đề xuất * Timeline dự kiến * Chi phí triển khai', 1, 'FIXED', 1000000.00, 5000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('df58f172-8938-51fe-8067-cbe536d80132', 'b24dda54-88ab-5d81-8431-9c2f3868bf51', 'The Steel Arc — Ghost Theme & Subscription Setup', 'The Steel Arc — Ghost Theme & Subscription Setup What you have: Frontend design live at steelarc.vercel.app. Needs converting to a working Ghost CMS with subscriptions, email newsletter, paywall and steel calculators. What I need built: Milestone 1 — $150 Convert existing Vercel/React design into a Ghost theme (exact match: Bricolage Grotesque + Nunito Sans fonts, blue #1D4ED8, white background, card shadows) Ghost installed and configured (self-hosted VPS ~$5/mo or Ghost Pro — your recommendation) Stripe connected: Free and Premium tiers Email newsletter working end to end Publishing workflow live so I can write and publish without touching code Milestone 2 — $150, due first week of November 2026 3-article metered paywall (custom JS counter, subscribe prompt after article 3) Steel calculators embedded as custom pages (I will provide formulas and inputs) Tech: Ghost CMS, Handlebars theme, Stripe, Mailgun or Ghost Pro email, JavaScript for paywall and calculators. You have: Full access to the existing design files and React code. I have my own domain and will set up Stripe account before start. Questions to answer before we start: Ghost Pro vs self-hosted VPS — your recommendation and why Confirm Milestone 1 deliverables match your understanding What do you need from me on day one to start Budget: $300 fixed, split across two milestones as above.', 1, 'FIXED', 7750000.00, 7750000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('432e5d13-1153-59b8-a075-47e1b823705f', 'a7978c31-b82a-5ba0-a5a0-7835a9c9b528', 'Senior Software Engineer - US-Focused (4~8 hrs/week)', 'A part-time consulting role for a senior engineer who''s great with people. Your primary job is client communication - joining discovery calls, clarifying requirements, explaining technical trade-offs, and keeping projects aligned. You won''t be the one writing code day-to-day. This is ideal if you''re a former CTO, solutions engineer, or technical lead who enjoys the client-facing side of the job and wants a lightweight long-term engagement alongside other work. What you''ll do - Join discovery calls, technical interviews, and project follow-ups with US-based clients - Translate business goals into clear technical direction for developers - Explain trade-offs, timelines, and risks in plain language - Write concise meeting summaries and next steps - Serve as the trusted technical voice clients come back to What we''re looking for - 5+ years of software engineering or technical consulting experience - Comfortable leading calls with US-based founders and operators - Native or near-native English - you need to hold your own in fast moving technical conversations - Strong understanding of web apps, APIs, cloud, and mobile (you don''t need to build them right now, but you need to talk about them credibly) - US timezone availability for client meetings (EST/PST overlap) Especially relevant backgrounds: solutions engineering, pre-sales, technical consulting, customer success, DevRel, or engineering leadership at a startup Compensation & commitment - $150–$250/hr depending on experience and client facing track record - 4–8 hours per week to start, with room to grow - Long-term engagement - we''re not looking for a one-project contractor - Flexible scheduling outside of client call windows Why this works for the right person You get the intellectual stimulation of complex technical work without the execution grind. You work directly with decision-makers - no layers of PM or process. If you''ve been in pure dev roles and miss the client-facing energy, or you''re consulting and want a steady anchor engagement, this fits.', 1, 'HOURLY', 1550000.00, 2067000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('233b0b91-8f47-543f-9989-d6fe5ee634d9', 'd3c39fb1-e3a0-5a09-bded-d00bd7d7352b', 'Build Job Costing and Workflow System', 'I need someone to start from scratch and build a complete system to monitor job costing, employee workflow, cost of goods, and productivity. The goal is to create a solution that makes it easier to bid jobs and improve profitability. This will be a challenge since nothing is currently set up, so I’m looking for someone who can design, develop, and implement a practical system tailored to our business needs. Also would like a dashboard where I could watch the day to day growth and sales Right now I use two different time management apps. Clock Shark, and Tymelix, I also use quickbooks for payments and job costing. I would like an app built that employees could use to add information also (time, pieces, time on equipment)', 1, 'HOURLY', 387000.00, 1214000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('c10d2556-ee74-557c-bf11-87c946da7727', '02eb28bd-7cfa-566a-88ae-9086b8f4ee71', 'Magento 2 FPC/Varnish Fix Needed ASAP', 'Need a developer to fix a Magento 2 site where FPC/Varnish is not working properly. The host has been unable to resolve the issue and is recommending outside help. This is an urgent problem that needs to be addressed quickly. Please share your experience with similar Magento performance issues and your availability to start right away. Site is Smokeday.com. Apply to job if you think you can fix it ASAP. Im offering a flat rate if it is fixed and working properly. The host is nexcess. Some tips from host: Thank you for being patient with us. Please be informed that we have checked the issue in detail, and on review of the file: vendor/magento/framework/View/Layout.php, we found the following code in it:(code is in attachment) Another tip. Hello Team, Thank you for your patience while we investigate this issue. As part of our investigation, we have completed several checks on the production environment and would like to share our findings so far. Checks performed: Reviewed the Magento configuration and identified that the Varnish configuration required correction. We updated the configured Varnish host and port. Verified that Magento Full Page Cache (FPC) is enabled and configured to use Varnish. Cleaned the Magento cache and tested the Varnish PURGE request, which returned a successful 200 Purged response. Checked the response headers for the homepage and a product page across multiple requests to review their cache behavior. Since the Magento-side checks and cache purge have not resolved the issue, we have escalated the case to our backend team. We have requested further verification of the production domain''s Varnish attachment and request routing, the configured Varnish endpoint, and the relevant cache and session handling. The root cause has not yet been confirmed. We will provide an update once the backend team completes its investigation. Thank you for your patience and cooperation.', 1, 'FIXED', 3875000.00, 3875000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('13ab34b5-7a64-5dfe-9c0c-2025a8df7e53', '7997d355-7caa-5ca3-947f-829600f7c71e', 'Fine-Tuning Open Source LLMs', 'We need a freelancer to fine-tune open-source large and small language models for a specific use case. The work includes adapting the models to our requirements, improving performance, and delivering a reliable solution. You should be able to explain the process, recommend the best approach, and help ensure the final model meets our goals. Experience with model customization and practical implementation is important for this project.', 1, 'FIXED', 12916000.00, 12916000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('11a4f877-2958-5606-aa4d-8392eb949fab', 'e1477860-683b-5e79-b66f-5a97a83a0fd5', 'Part-Time Virtual Personal Assistant | Website Updates & Light Administrative Support', '# Part-Time Virtual Personal Assistant | Website Updates & Light Administrative Support **Pay:** $10 per hour **Hours:** 3 hours per week **Location:** Remote **Position Type:** Ongoing, Part-Time Freelance **Start Date:** As soon as possible ### Job Description I am a busy professional seeking a reliable, organized, and tech-savvy virtual personal assistant to help with occasional website updates and light administrative tasks. I am looking for someone who is proactive, detail-oriented, and able to complete assignments independently. This is a small, ongoing position with the potential for additional hours as needed. ### Responsibilities **Website Management** - Update and maintain my personal/professional website. - Upload photos, professional accomplishments, and biographical information. - Make minor website edits and ensure information stays current. - Check website links and formatting. **Personal & Administrative Support** - Organize digital files and documents. - Conduct occasional online research. - Assist with travel research, reservations, and appointment scheduling. - Help maintain my professional biography, resume, and other materials. - Create or update simple documents and spreadsheets. - Assist with occasional personal projects and other small tasks. ### Qualifications - Experience updating websites using WordPress, Wix, Squarespace, or similar platforms. - Proficiency in Google Docs, Google Drive, and Microsoft Office. - Excellent English communication skills. - Strong organizational skills and attention to detail. - Ability to work independently and meet deadlines. - Dependable, professional, and respectful of confidentiality. ### Work Schedule Approximately 3 hours per week, with a flexible schedule. I will provide weekly priorities and expect a brief update on completed tasks. ### Compensation $10 per hour, with an initial 30-day paid trial period. This is intended to be a long-term working relationship for the right person. ### How to Apply Please include the following in your application: 1. A brief introduction about yourself and your experience. 2. Examples of websites you have updated or maintained. 3. Your experience providing virtual administrative assistance. 4. Your availability for approximately 3 hours per week. 5. The website platforms you are familiar with. Please begin your proposal with the words **"Personal Assistant"** so I know you have read the full description. I look forward to finding someone dependable who can help me stay organized and keep my professional website updated.', 1, 'HOURLY', 258000.00, 387000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('05be5cef-a921-5c3e-9ec7-b223eec667d4', 'f65deff5-0a90-528a-959d-08baf47afe9c', 'PHP Developer', 'We are looking for a skilled PHP developer to join our team. The ideal candidate should have experience in developing web applications using PHP. The main responsibilities will include developing and maintaining PHP code, troubleshooting and fixing bugs, and ensuring the smooth operation of our web applications. Strong understanding of PHP syntax, object-oriented programming, and database management is required. Additionally, the candidate should be familiar with popular PHP frameworks such as Laravel and Symfony. Attention to detail and the ability to work collaboratively with other team members is a must. This is a great opportunity for a talented PHP developer to contribute to our growing team and work on exciting projects. Skills: - PHP - Object-oriented programming - Database management - Laravel - Symfony', 1, 'HOURLY', 387000.00, 904000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('86cf4a50-80fe-5bfe-9fd6-00910f0d2a54', '7cacd114-89cb-511b-9f7e-a06878bb113b', 'Fix Dark Shadows in Three.js / React Three Fiber Scene', 'I have a React Three Fiber scene with a GLTF model, but the lighting looks flat and the shadows are too dark/pixelated. I am using DirectionalLight, but I can''t get it to look realistic. I need a Three.js expert to adjust the light intensity and add an Environment preset to make the model look professional. Deliverable: Updated lighting configuration code.', 1, 'FIXED', 258000.00, 258000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00');

