    updated_at = EXCLUDED.updated_at; the Architect designs security into the architecture, and Senior Engineers build to your standards and fix findings in their components. This is an individual contributor role: building controls, tooling, and tests, and reviewing code and designs. You also share security knowledge within the team and with other Client''s teams, so safe practices spread beyond the people who build the controls. You follow emerging agent and AI threats, test new attack classes in bounded experiments, and bring proven defences into production. Once they are live, you own them: monitoring, detection, and response in an enterprise environment. We assemble our setup from open protocols, open-source components, and our own services, so you build what is missing and maintain what you run. There is no formal on-call rotation yet, but one may be introduced. Key Responsibilities: 1. Threat Modelling & Secure Design • Agentic Threat Modelling: Threat model agents, tools, MCP servers, and multi-agent workflows using the OWASP Top 10 for LLM Applications, OWASP Agentic AI threats, and MITRE ATLAS, and run a lightweight pre-launch review gate. • Secure-by-Default Reviews: Review agentic code and designs, publish secure defaults, and make risk trade-offs explicit and owned. • Security Knowledge Sharing: Teach secure agent practices within the team and to other Brahma teams through guides, threat-model walkthroughs, demos and office hours. 2. Identity, Isolation & Guardrails • Agent & Tool Identity: Design authentication and authorisation for agents and tools with OAuth 2.0/OIDC, token exchange, and scoped, short-lived credentials, with per-tool least privilege, fail-closed MCP authorisation, and secrets kept out of agent runtimes. • Sandboxed Execution: Harden the containers and sandboxes where coding agents and tool calls run, with filesystem isolation, egress control, and human approval for irreversible actions. • Guardrails & Policy Enforcement: Build gateway defences against direct and indirect prompt injection, tool abuse, excessive agency, and data exfiltration: input and output filtering, PII/DLP , and policy-as-code, tuned so they do not stall developers. 3. Adversarial Testing & Supply Chain • AI Red-Teaming: Build an automated adversarial test suite (injection, tool misuse, exfiltration, goal drift) that runs in CI and on a schedule, so we can show controls work, not only that they exist. • Supply-Chain Security: Govern which MCP servers, skills, plugins, models, and dependencies we adopt, through review, allow-listing, signing, SBOMs, and scanning. 4. Detection, Response & Compliance • Audit Logging & Detection: Make every model, tool, and agent call traceable to a person and an agent, and feed guardrail events and anomalies into security monitoring and alerting. • Production Security Ownership: Own the security controls once they are live: monitor their effectiveness, tune guardrails from production data, and keep them patched and current as models, tools and standards change. • Incident Response & Compliance: Own the playbook for agent-related incidents and lead the technical response. Map controls to ISO 27001, ISO/IEC 42001, SOC 2, GDPR, and TPN, and keep evidence audit-ready. Job Requirements / Must Haves • Security Engineering Background: 5+ years in security engineering with a strong application or product security component, and fluent Python. • Build, Not Only Audit: Track record of shipping security tooling, controls, and automated tests as production code. • LLM & Agent Security: Hands-on experience securing LLM applications or agents against prompt injection and unsafe tool use. • Identity & Authorisation: Deep knowledge of OAuth 2.0, OIDC, token exchange, workload identity, and least-privilege design. • Threat Modelling: Experience leading structured threat modelling and turning findings into prioritised engineering work. • Secure SDLC & DevSecOps: Experience embedding security scanning and checks into CI/CD, and securing containerised workloads. • Risk Communication: Ability to explain risk and trade-offs clearly to engineers and leadership, and to document decisions. • Knowledge Sharing: Track record of teaching and documenting security practices for colleagues and other teams. Nice to Have: • AI Red-Teaming Tools: Experience with garak, PyRIT, promptfoo, or similar. • Policy Engines: Practical use of OPA/Rego, Cedar, or similar. • Sandboxing Technology: Familiarity with gVisor, Firecracker, seccomp, or Landlock. • Agent Infrastructure: Experience building or securing MCP servers, LLM gateways, or guardrail services. • GCP: Working knowledge of IAM, Workload Identity, Secret Manager, and Cloud Logging. • AI Governance & Media Security: Exposure to ISO/IEC 42001, NIST AI RMF, or MPA/TPN content security. • Certifications: OSCP , GIAC, CSSLP , or equivalent.', 1, 'HOURLY', 1033000.00, 1808000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('5efe8ec7-270f-5c47-89b1-d23d024e45d1', 'bd107529-bd44-5ed1-b840-65122ad16c90', 'AI Engineer / Full Stack Developer: Build a RAG-Powered AI Support Assistant', 'We run a B2B SaaS product used by property management companies, with roughly 400 paying accounts. The platform is built on Next.js, Node.js and PostgreSQL, and it is stable. Our challenge is support volume: about 70% of incoming tickets are repeat questions that our help documentation already answers, and our two-person support team spends most of its day on them. We want to add an AI assistant inside the product that answers customer questions using our documentation and, where appropriate, the customer''s own account data such as invoices, plan details and recent activity. When the assistant is not confident, it should hand the conversation to a human with full context attached. Scope of Work • RAG pipeline: ingest and chunk about 150 help articles and several PDFs, generate embeddings, and store them in a vector database (pgvector preferred, Pinecone also acceptable). • Retrieval quality: implement hybrid search (semantic plus keyword), reranking and metadata filtering so answers are accurate and grounded in our content. • Source-cited answers: every response should reference the article it came from, with a clear fallback when no reliable source exists. • AI agent with tool calling: allow the assistant to securely look up account data from PostgreSQL (invoices, plan status, usage) with strict, per-customer permission checks. • Human handoff: confidence-based escalation to our support team via email or Slack, including the full conversation transcript. • Chat widget: a streaming-response chat interface integrated into our existing Next.js application. • Guardrails and safety: prompt-injection protection, PII handling, topic boundaries and hallucination controls. • Evaluation and observability: an evaluation set to measure answer quality, plus logging and tracing (for example LangSmith or Langfuse) so we can see what customers ask and where the assistant fails. • Model strategy and cost control: recommend the right model(s) across OpenAI, Claude or Gemini, and apply caching, prompt optimization and model routing to keep API costs predictable. Additional Work (Preferred) • Fix intermittent Stripe billing issues where failed payments do not always update the plan status (webhook handling and reconciliation). • Improve dashboard load time for larger accounts through query optimization, indexing and caching. Current Technology Stack Next.js, React, Node.js, TypeScript, PostgreSQL, Stripe, AWS, Docker, GitHub Actions CI/CD Requirements • Proven experience shipping LLM or AI features to production, not only prototypes or demos. • Hands-on experience with RAG, embeddings, vector databases and prompt engineering. • Familiarity with OpenAI, Claude and/or Gemini APIs, and with frameworks such as LangChain or LlamaIndex. • Strong full stack skills (Next.js, Node.js, TypeScript) and comfort working in an existing codebase. • Solid understanding of API security, authentication and data privacy. • Clear communication: a short kickoff call and brief weekly progress updates. • Clean, well-documented code, as our in-house developer will maintain it after delivery. Nice to Have • Experience with agentic workflows, function calling or MCP (Model Context Protocol) integrations. • Experience with LLM evaluation frameworks and automated regression testing of AI responses. • Background in customer support automation or SaaS products. How to Apply Please include the following in your proposal: 1 One example of an AI or LLM feature you have built and shipped to production (with a link or short description). 2 Your approach to preventing incorrect or fabricated answers from the assistant. 3 Your proposed architecture and estimated timeline.', 1, 'HOURLY', 491000.00, 1033000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('702e917c-34a5-5241-a262-feeaf2fc2a7d', 'f0782286-9729-5b76-96a4-838f62c9f5e0', 'Senior AI Enginee-Skin Analysis, Personalized Analytics, RAG & LLM Integration', 'We''re developing an AI-powered skin health and wellness application and are looking for an experienced AI engineer to help design and implement the more complex AI components. The project already has a React Native mobile application, Supabase backend, and an early-stage Next.js dashboard. An existing development team is responsible for the core backend and application development. We''re looking for someone who can focus specifically on AI architecture, implementation, integration, and evaluation while collaborating with our existing developers and technical leads. Key Responsibilities 1. AI Skin Analysis Integrate a licensed third-party skin analysis/vision API. Implement image quality checks and confidence handling. Support historical scan comparisons and progress tracking. Handle uncertain results, failed scans, and provider limitations. 2. Personalized Pattern Engine Analyze historical skin observations alongside lifestyle, sleep, stress, skincare routines, and treatment data. Develop deterministic algorithms for personal baselines, longitudinal comparisons, and pattern identification. Account for incomplete data, time windows, and confounding factors. Generate explainable insights without unsupported medical or causal claims. 3. RAG Pipeline Build a retrieval-augmented generation system using approved educational and scientific content. Implement document processing, chunking, embeddings, vector search, and source citations. Support content versioning, retrieval evaluation, and evidence-grounded responses. Ensure unverified user-generated content is not treated as authoritative evidence. 4. AI Assistant and LLM Integration Combine authorized user history, scan results, pattern-engine outputs, and retrieved knowledge. Implement structured LLM responses, safety guardrails, and fallback handling. Support personalized educational guidance and user-confirmed actions. Prevent unsupported medical diagnoses and recommendations. 5. AI Architecture, Integration & Testing Review the existing architecture and recommend practical improvements. Collaborate with the current backend and application developers. Define AI service interfaces, API contracts, and data requirements. Implement AI-specific monitoring, logging, performance optimization, and evaluation. Support production readiness and technical documentation. Existing Technology Stack React Native Next.js Supabase / PostgreSQL Python / FastAPI or Node.js OpenAI, Anthropic, or similar LLM providers RAG, embeddings, and vector databases Third-party computer vision APIs We''re open to your recommendations for the AI-specific architecture and tools. Project Status The application is already under development. This is not a complete rebuild. The existing team will continue handling the core application, frontend, and general backend development. Your primary focus will be the AI components and their integration. The exact state of existing AI functionality will be confirmed during an initial architecture review. What We''re Looking For Strong production experience with LLMs, RAG, and AI backend architecture. Experience building personalized analytics or longitudinal data-processing systems. Experience integrating computer vision or image-analysis APIs. Strong Python/FastAPI or Node.js backend development skills. Familiarity with privacy-sensitive applications and secure data handling. Ability to work independently while collaborating with an existing engineering team. Experience with healthcare or wellness applications is a plus. Initial Deliverables We''d like to begin with an architecture and requirements review, followed by a detailed implementation estimate. Please provide: Your relevant AI engineering experience and examples of similar production systems. Your recommended technical approach for the four main AI components. Your hourly rate and availability. We''re looking for someone who can build reliable, maintainable AI systems, not just connect an LLM API.', 1, 'HOURLY', 387000.00, 1033000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('17a434fd-0bc7-5f00-8fad-b5512c30ac52', '7de0f5ad-5f8c-547a-8b0e-e3ac7f21227e', 'AI Automation Engineer for Support, Knowledge Base and Workflow Automation', 'Summary About Us We are an online brand selling technical products that customers can configure in many ways. This creates a lot of detailed questions for our team, so we want to bring in an AI Automation Engineer to help us organise and automate our main workflows. What We Want to Achieve - Support: Cut down the time our team spends on emails and help them answer detailed product questions faster. We use a helpdesk tool today, but we are open to changing the setup if there is a better option. - Knowledge base and training: Collect our product knowledge and company policies in one AI-powered knowledge base, and use it to create training material for new virtual assistants. - Ongoing improvements: Later on, automate other slow areas of the business, such as inventory planning, and improve our website so fewer customers need to contact support. Requirements - Experience building and launching AI agents, RAG knowledge bases and workflow automations for real businesses. - Able to review how we work today and suggest a simple, reliable setup that our team can use every day without much upkeep. - Hands-on experience with LLM APIs such as OpenAI and Claude, and with connecting AI to business tools and CRMs.', 1, 'HOURLY', 775000.00, 1550000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('e6e97a60-c034-546b-be41-e74080420601', '6b82d9ed-f8a5-5781-966d-d0c67bf27596', 'Lập trình AI Agent', 'Lập trình AI Agent theo yêu cầu. Tìm kiếm lập trình viên/nhóm kỹ thuật có kinh nghiệm xây dựng AI Agent nhằm tự động hóa các tác vụ xử lý dữ liệu, hỗ trợ vận hành và quản lý thông tin trong cảng container Liên hệ để trao đổi chi tiết.', 1, 'FIXED', 3000000.00, 5000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('b922f218-b483-56e6-8af7-5217638af32a', '6b82d9ed-f8a5-5781-966d-d0c67bf27596', 'Tích hợp AI , AI agents xử lý dữ liệu', 'Chúng tôi đang cần 1 team dev ứng dụng về AI, tích hợp AI agents,.... để lấy dữ liệu và xuất dữ liệu. Chúng tôi cần team dev thành thạo Mobile developer Flutter hoặc React Native. Backend developer,Python / Node,API, database,AI engineer,OpenAI / LLM,Recommendation system, logic code hiểu được tầm nhìn của công ty, Rành về AI hiện tại', 1, 'FIXED', 100000000.00, 200000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('334b895d-b536-5407-9e5b-a0c5e06d416a', '6b82d9ed-f8a5-5781-966d-d0c67bf27596', 'TUYỂN DỤNG – AI PRODUCT ENGINEER (LLM / AI ASSISTANT)', 'Mô tả công việc • Tham gia xây dựng và phát triển các tính năng AI ứng dụng trên sản phẩm thực tế. • Thiết kế luồng tương tác AI và tối ưu trải nghiệm người dùng. • Tích hợp LLM vào hệ thống web/app. • Xây dựng cơ chế xử lý ngữ cảnh, bộ nhớ, cá nhân hóa và đề xuất thông minh. • Tối ưu prompt, đánh giá chất lượng đầu ra và cải thiện hiệu suất AI. • Thiết kế pipeline xử lý dữ liệu phục vụ AI. • Phối hợp cùng Product, Backend, Frontend để triển khai tính năng. ________________________________________ Yêu cầu Bắt buộc • Có kinh nghiệm với LLM: OpenAI, Anthropic, Gemini hoặc tương đương. • Thành thạo Prompt Engineering. • Có kinh nghiệm tích hợp API AI thực tế. • Biết Python / NodeJS. • Hiểu REST API, database. • Có kinh nghiệm xây chatbot / assistant / recommendation / AI workflow là lợi thế. Ưu tiên • Đã làm RAG. • Hiểu embeddings, vector search. • Có kinh nghiệm LangChain / LangGraph / LlamaIndex. • Hiểu memory system, context management. • Đã làm personalization / recommendation engine. • Biết logging, evaluation, analytics cho AI. • Từng làm AI trên sản phẩm có user thật. ________________________________________ Điểm cộng lớn • Tư duy sản phẩm tốt. • Chủ động đề xuất giải pháp. • Thích nghiên cứu công nghệ mới. • Quan tâm AI ứng dụng thực chiến thay vì chỉ demo. ________________________________________ Công nghệ dự kiến • OpenAI / Gemini / Claude • Python / NodeJS • Vector DB • Embedding / RAG • REST API • PostgreSQL • Realtime / Analytics ________________________________________ Quyền lợi • Tham gia xây AI từ giai đoạn đầu. • Được đề xuất kiến trúc và công nghệ. • Môi trường startup tốc độ cao. • Có cơ hội phát triển thành AI Lead', 1, 'FIXED', 5000000.00, 50000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('8be3c6b9-aa06-512b-9363-dfa928a4918c', '76a0903b-5a4d-5363-aca6-d4640beaa0c8', 'Thiết kế website có công cụ tính phí, tracking và chatbot AI', 'Mình cần thiết kế 1 website bằng wordpress có công cụ tính giá đơn giản (đã có công thức), công cụ tracking lô hàng có database xây dựng bằng google sheet và chatbot tư vấn báo giá (sử dụng database...', 1, 'FIXED', 500000.00, 3000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('2c035447-a8c5-5431-80e3-aa88ff3a2c82', '2f27a9e1-e1df-5f34-af53-6186c18031eb', 'AI Engineer: Optimize Cost & Latency of a Multi-Stage Agentic Pipeline (Medical SaaS / Clinical RAG)', 'We’re looking for an experienced AI Engineer to analyze and optimize our core agentic pipeline for a medical SaaS platform. Our system assists healthcare providers with medical diagnosis decisions, structures clinical notes, and streamlines patient management workflows. Because this is a clinical decision-support tool, the main goal is to drastically reduce response time (latency) and operating costs while strictly maintaining or improving the precision, safety, and quality of the AI''s outputs. The system is a multi-stage agentic pipeline that processes complex patient data, electronic health records (EHR), and queries external medical knowledge bases (PubMed, clinical guidelines). It is used daily by doctors and medical staff to find relevant research, summarize patient histories, and cross-reference diagnostic criteria. What we’ve already done: The pipeline is in production, and we’ve already implemented several baseline optimizations: • Medical Guardrails: Implemented strict clinical guardrails for input/output validation to eliminate hallucinations and flag unsafe outputs. • Rigorous Evals: Set up structured clinical evaluation filters to verify medical accuracy. • Model Routing: Introduced dynamic routing (directing simpler synthesis tasks to smaller models, and complex diagnostic reasoning to frontier models). Now we need a specialist to take it to the next level with a systematic, data-driven optimization focused on speed and cost reduction without sacrificing clinical safety. What you’ll do • Audit the current pipeline architecture, agent orchestration, and stage-by-stage token usage and latency. • Find bottlenecks, redundant LLM calls, and cost drivers in our clinical RAG workflows. • Propose and implement optimizations (e.g., advanced caching, prompt compression, state management). • Document your findings, performance benchmarks, and recommendations for the engineering team. Requirements • Proven experience building and optimizing production LLM agents or multi-stage agentic pipelines. • Strong Python skills and hands-on experience with LangChain and LangGraph. • Solid understanding of Advanced RAG: medical text embeddings, vector search, semantic chunking, and specialized reranking strategies. • Experience with OpenAI and Anthropic APIs, including token economics, prompt caching, and strict structured outputs (JSON mode / Pydantic). • Experience with LLM evaluation and observability tools (e.g., LangSmith, Phoenix, or Arize). • Ability to explain trade-offs between cost, speed, and clinical safety clearly. Nice to have • Experience handling sensitive healthcare data (PHII) and working within HIPAA / GDPR / SOC2 compliance frameworks. • Experience with Hugging Face models (fine-tuning small medical classifiers, open-source embeddings, or local rerankers). • Slack API / Slack bot integrations • Experience integrating AI pipelines with EHR/EMR systems (via HL7, FHIR APIs). To apply, please include: 1. A short description of an agentic or RAG system you’ve optimized, including the results you achieved (specifically cost, latency, or accuracy numbers). 2. Your experience (if any) handling medical, healthcare, or highly regulated data. 3. Your availability and hourly rate.', 1, 'HOURLY', 775000.00, 1550000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('b029800d-17ba-5248-a3ad-12ea9444c283', '7fface8d-032b-56b2-8164-9a0e35d26759', 'Tạo ứng dung App (android/Ios) tích hợp AI , API, AI Agent....', 'Mục đích dự án: tổng hợp dữ liệu, xử lý dữ liệu bàng AI cho ra phướng án tốt cho khách hàng và đúng với giá trị cốt lõi của khách ,tích hợp các tiện ích, và tạo các box cho khách quản lý dịch vụ. Cần các team thành thạo và đã tạo ra nhiều App AI , và thông thạo Phát triển ứng dụng mobile (Flutter/React Native) Tích hợp API AI (OpenAI / recommendation system) Tối ưu UI/UX Có kinh nghiệm phát triển app mobile Hiểu về REST API AI / Machine Learning / Data,Python / Node,API, database. OpenAI / LLM,Vector database', 1, 'FIXED', 100000000.00, 200000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('f359b866-8053-53b3-a4a6-1f20823ed0f6', 'e6b4a4e6-6386-5795-9655-b5d38c07cdaa', 'Cần thuê Dev viết app auto chụp ảnh + đọc text từ hình (OCR)', 'Mình cần thuê người làm 1 app Windows tương tự tool auto quét stash/inventory game. Chức năng cần có: 1. Cài đặt & lưu cấu hình Set tọa độ nút mở stash/tab Set vùng grid item (điểm đầu / điểm cuối) Hỗ trợ nhiều stash/tab khác nhau Lưu / load config riêng 2. Auto scan item Tự động mở từng stash Di chuột lần lượt từng ô item theo hàng/cột Hotkey start / stop / pause 3. Capture ảnh Chụp full màn hình hoặc chỉ vùng tooltip Tự đặt tên file theo stash / row / col / thời gian Chọn folder lưu ảnh Có chế độ scan không lưu ảnh 4. OCR đọc text Đọc full text từ ảnh tooltip OCR tiếng Anh là chính Gom text nhiều ảnh thành database 5. UI quản lý Giao diện đơn giản dễ dùng Có log trạng thái chạy Hiển thị progress scan Test OCR trực tiếp từ ảnh mẫu Ai làm được ib trực tiếp giúp mình. Cảm ơn! Video làm thủ công: https://streamable . com/o00x5h', 1, 'FIXED', 1000000.00, 2000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('6bae43a4-7371-5c07-b9cb-19cb820253be', 'cca79aae-c24a-52c7-8e04-0639f2fbb683', 'Vapi AI Developer Needed: Legal Document Generation, Prompt Improvements & Document Storage Workflow', 'Project Overview We are seeking an experienced developer to improve and expand our existing Vapi AI legal assistant workflow. Our AI assistant helps callers research legal matters and create legal documents through phone conversations. We currently use Vapi, Make.com, Airtable, and Google Docs. We need a developer to improve our existing document-generation prompt and implement a secure document storage, retrieval, and editing system. Callers must be able to return during a future call, access their own previously saved documents, and continue working without repeating the entire process. The goal is to enhance our existing system, not unnecessarily rebuild it. The developer must review our current prompts, integrations, and automation scenarios before making changes. Scope of Work 1. Improve the Legal Document Generation Prompt — High Priority The existing prompt must be revised to ensure the assistant gathers and confirms the caller''s information before drafting any legal document. The assistant must follow these requirements: -Understand the caller''s request: Allow the caller to explain their situation and the type of document they need without prematurely interrupting or beginning to draft. - Collect all relevant information: Ask focused follow-up questions, one at a time, to gather missing facts, dates, names, case details, court information, requested arguments, supporting facts, and other information relevant to the requested document. - Identify missing information: Determine what additional details are reasonably necessary. Do not repeatedly ask questions the caller has already answered. - Confirm completeness: Before drafting, summarize the information collected and ask the caller whether there is anything else they want included or corrected. - Obtain explicit authorization: The assistant must not draft, generate, or finalize a legal document until the caller explicitly confirms that they want it drafted. For example, the caller might say, "Yes, draft the document now." - Handle corrections: If the caller provides additional information or requests changes before authorizing the draft, incorporate that information and confirm completeness again as appropriate. - Prevent premature drafting: Discussing a legal issue, requesting legal research, describing a situation, or asking questions about a document does not constitute authorization to draft it. - Research and accuracy: Use CourtListener and other configured research tools to identify relevant case law and citations when appropriate. Never invent facts, cases, quotations, citations, or procedural requirements. - Respect caller instructions: Include the information and arguments the caller wants addressed, while clarifying inconsistencies and explaining when additional information is needed. The explicit authorization requirement must be enforced in the prompt and the underlying workflow, not merely treated as a conversational preference. 2. Individual Customer Document Accounts and Secure Storage Each caller must have an individual, private document storage account or logically isolated document library associated with their verified customer ID. Requirements: - Individual document libraries: Every customer must have a separate, logically isolated collection of legal documents. Documents must never be exposed through a shared collection that allows customers to access one another''s files. - Secure identification: Use our existing customer ID and PIN verification process before retrieving, viewing, editing, or modifying stored documents. - Personal document library: Each caller must be able to retrieve their own previously created documents, including unfinished drafts, completed documents, and revised versions. - Automatic organization: Associate each document with its customer ID, unique document ID, document type, creation date, last modified date, version, and current status. - Persistent access: Documents must remain available across separate phone calls so callers can resume their work without starting over. - Privacy and access controls: A caller must never be able to view, retrieve, or modify another customer''s documents, even if they know that person''s name or document details. - Secure storage integration: Use Google Drive, Google Docs, or another agreed-upon secure storage solution that integrates with our existing Vapi, and Make.com. - Document ownership and version history: Preserve earlier versions when documents are updated and ensure all changes are saved to the correct customer''s library. - Account testing: Demonstrate that two separate test customers can save, retrieve, and edit their own documents independently without cross-account access. A separate Google account for every caller is not necessarily required. A secure, individually partitioned document library within our existing infrastructure is acceptable, provided customer-level access controls are properly enforced. 3. Document Retrieval During Future Calls The assistant must be able to retrieve documents created during previous calls. Requirements: - Verify the caller through the existing customer ID and PIN process. - Search the cloud storage for document records associated with the verified customer. - Retrieve the correct document from the customer''s individual document library. - Allow callers with multiple saved documents to select which document they want to work on. - Identify the document and confirm that it is the correct one before continuing. - Retrieve the latest saved version, including relevant progress notes and unfinished sections. - Handle missing records and retrieval failures without falsely claiming that a document was found. Example: A caller returns and says, "I was working on a motion to dismiss during my last call. Can we continue?" The assistant should verify the caller, locate the saved document, confirm the correct document with the caller, retrieve its latest version, and continue the conversation based on the existing work. 4. Resume and Edit Existing Documents The assistant must support continued document preparation across multiple calls. Requirements: - Retrieve the latest saved version of an existing document. - Allow callers to add information, correct facts, revise sections, and request other changes. - Ask clarifying questions when necessary before making substantive revisions. - Preserve existing content and maintain document version history. - Save revisions without accidentally losing previously saved information. - Associate every revision with the correct customer''s account. - Distinguish between discussing a legal issue, researching an issue, requesting a specific edit, and authorizing a new draft or redraft. For substantive redrafting, the assistant must confirm the requested changes and obtain explicit authorization before generating the revised document. Routine saving of already authorized edits may occur automatically if it follows the agreed workflow and does not bypass the caller''s authorization requirements. 5. Make.com, Vapi, Airtable and Google Docs Integration The developer must integrate these features with our existing system. Requirements: - Review the current Vapi assistant prompts and Make.com scenarios. - Configure the necessary webhooks, API requests, data mapping, and tool responses. - Connect the improved prompt to the existing legal document generation workflow. - Integrate document storage and retrieval with Airtable customer records. - Enable Vapi to retrieve document content and pass it to the appropriate editing or generation process. - Implement an authorization checkpoint in the workflow to prevent unauthorized document generation. - Add error handling for missing documents, incomplete information, failed storage requests, and API errors. - Ensure that any changes preserve existing customer verification and legal research functionality. - Avoid unnecessary duplication of existing workflows or services. 6. Testing and Quality Assurance The developer must demonstrate the following scenarios: 1. A caller describes a legal matter but does not request a document. No document is drafted. 2. A caller requests a document but has not provided sufficient relevant information. The assistant asks follow-up questions. 3. The assistant summarizes the information collected and asks whether anything else should be included. 4. The caller adds more information. The assistant incorporates it before seeking final authorization. 5. The caller has not explicitly authorized drafting. No draft is generated. 6. The caller explicitly authorizes drafting. The assistant generates the requested document using the confirmed information. 7. A caller returns during a subsequent call and retrieves a previously saved document. 8. A caller resumes an unfinished document and continues from the latest saved version. 9. A caller requests revisions and the assistant preserves the existing content and saves the updated version. 10. Two test customers have separate document libraries and cannot access one another''s documents. 11. An unverified caller attempts to retrieve a document. Access is denied. 12. A storage or API request fails. The assistant handles the error without falsely claiming that the document was saved or retrieved. Required Skills - Vapi AI voice assistant development and prompt engineering - Make.com automation and webhook configuration - Airtable API and database design - Google Drive and Google Docs API integration - REST APIs, JSON, and HTTP requests - AI document generation and editing workflows - Conversational information gathering and authorization logic - Secure handling of confidential legal documents - Customer-level access controls and data isolation - End-to-end workflow testing and troubleshooting Deliverables 1. A revised and tested legal document-generation prompt. 2. A structured information-gathering and completeness-confirmation process. 3. Explicit caller authorization before initial drafting and substantive redrafting. 4. Individual customer document libraries with appropriate access controls. 5. A working document storage and retrieval workflow. 6. The ability to resume and edit previously saved legal documents across separate phone calls. 7. Integration with our existing Vapi, Make.com, Airtable, and Google Docs configuration. 8. End-to-end testing of authorization, retrieval, editing, and customer data isolation. 9. Documentation explaining the workflow, configuration, and maintenance requirements. 10. A demonstration of successful end-to-end functionality before project completion. What to Include in Your Proposal Please answer the following questions: 1. What experience do you have with Vapi, Make.com, Airtable, and Google Docs integrations? 2. Have you built AI workflows that retrieve and update documents across separate conversations or phone calls? 3. How would you prevent document generation before explicit caller authorization? 4. How would you securely separate each customer''s documents and prevent cross-account access? 5. How would you preserve document versions and allow callers to continue unfinished work? 6. Can you improve our existing workflow without rebuilding the entire system? 7. What is your proposed estimated completion timeline? Please include relevant examples of previous work and explain how you would approach this project before proposing a solution. Budget and Project Expectations We are looking for an experienced developer who can make targeted improvements, communicate clearly, and deliver a reliable, tested solution. Important: Successful completion will be based on working functionality, including the explicit authorization checkpoint, individual customer document libraries, secure retrieval, and continuation of previously saved documents. Delivery of a revised prompt or proposed design alone will not be sufficient. The developer must not remove or break existing functionality, including customer verification, legal research integrations, and document generation. All changes must be tested before deployment.', 1, 'FIXED', 3875000.00, 3875000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('05b272ee-d0c7-5967-91a2-8fc9f070d2f3', '3706495a-eb37-51b3-8c0b-6d396ff31359', 'Custom Model Training for Niche Tasks', 'I need help taking open-source models and fine-tuning them for a specific niche. The goal is to complete models quickly if the work meets my expectations for speed and cost efficiency. I plan to publish 2–3 models per week. This is not about general skills—it’s about adapting existing models to perform specific tasks. Please apply only if you have prior experience with custom model development and can share examples of public work that demonstrate your ability to deliver practical, task-focused results.', 1, 'HOURLY', 129000.00, 465000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('41d1caa3-869d-5269-a10d-f6b5fddbeee1', '3c0e546c-a021-5283-8088-3ea52ac4a3be', 'Python API Specialist for Model Testing', 'I am looking for a practical Python/API operator to run a small, prepared model tests and data extraction and return clean, well-organized results. It will use an LLM''s API (probably OpenAI''s). This is at the level of a careful junior Python developer with real API experience. This is a tightly defined role directed by me and my AI agent (ChatGPT DOT). The agent prepares instructions, answers technical questions and reviews outputs; you execute the API steps he cannot currently run directly. I approve scope and spending. This role is needed because the ChatGPT agent cannot execute the APIs itself. Skills you need • Comfortable running and lightly adapting Python scripts, using a virtual environment and basic Git. • Hands-on REST API or Python SDK experience, including authentication, JSON, rate limits and timeouts. • Basic batch data handling: CSV/JSONL files, clear logs, row counts, checkpoints and avoiding duplicates. • Careful credential handling and the judgment to stop and ask when a paid call or a requirement is uncertain. You do not need machine learning, model training or cloud deployment.', 1, 'HOURLY', 387000.00, 646000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('6e88d794-a5e0-5a04-a5ae-73beda9461c1', '52bed77f-4a95-5738-bdb8-7b17512b20f5', 'AI Model Training and Evaluation Specialist', 'We need a freelancer to train, evaluate, and fine-tune AI models and chatbots for our projects. The work includes improving model performance, testing responses, and refining outputs to meet project goals. You should be comfortable working with AI systems, analyzing results, and making adjustments to improve accuracy and effectiveness. This is a part-time role for someone who can support ongoing AI development and help ensure models deliver reliable, high-quality results.', 1, 'HOURLY', 1550000.00, 2583000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('34f4fd0e-6e9f-5776-983f-e8b5d14a788d', '8bdd323a-3df9-5a6e-a58b-6efcc38cf77e', 'Computer Vision Engineer (Contract)', 'We are seeking an experienced Computer Vision Engineer to build an end-to-end crack detection and mensuration pipeline. The objective is to produce a model that can identify, segment, and quantitatively measure crack dimensions across the following structural surfaces: concrete, brickwork, mortar joints, and varied masonry. Expected job functions are: 1. Scrape publicly available datasets containing cracks representative of what is seen on masonry structures 2. Combine publicly available datasets with proprietary datasets from aRoboticsCompany 3. Label and segment relevant cracks in those datasets (relevance to be informed by aRoboticsCompany team) 4. Select an appropriate pre-trained model to conduct transfer training on 5. Conduct transfer training, applying labeled crack dataset to that model Model expected functions: 1. Generate a semantically segmented mask over cracks in an image 2. Generate estimated length and width for cracks in mask 3. Generate JSON’s or XML’s that list each crack location and metrics in each image Dataset curation (expected 30 hours of work) Identify, scrape, and clean publicly available datasets containing masonry/brick/mortar cracks (e.g., open academic datasets, structural inspection archives, web sources) while ensuring quality control and licensing compliance. Merge curated public data with our internal proprietary crack datasets. Establish standardized annotation formats (COCO-stuff , binary masks, or polygon GeoJSON). Implement tiling/slicing workfl ows (e.g., SAHI / patch-based inference) to preserve micro-crack details in high-resolution images, along with robust data augmentation (lighting shifts, mortar texture noise, weathered brick surfaces). Data labeling requirements (expected 200 hours of work) Label cracks in dataset in accordance with aRoboticsCompany requirements. Labels must consist of manually generated shading or masks over cracks in the training images with pixel level accuracy. Model training (expect 20 hours of work) Train, validate, and benchmark high-resolution segmentation models specialized in thin, elongated topologies (e.g., SegFormer, HRNet, UNet with attention/transformers, or YOLOv8/v11-seg). Ensure the model generalizes across surface variations: differentiating actual structural cracks from natural mortar lines, surface spalling, shadows, effl orescence, and vegetative growth. Implement post-processing algorithms (e.g., medial-axis skeletonization, Distance Transform, Voronoi/graph-based centerline extraction) to calculate: Crack Length: Continuous path tracking along the crack skeleton. Crack Width (Aperture): Local orthogonal width profi les along the skeleton (mean, median, and maximum width). Model backtesting and documentation (expect 24 hours of work) Provide clean, well-documented training and data-scraping codebase (PyTorch preferred) Provide backtesting data quantifying model accuracy Final Deliverables: Standalone inference pipeline accepting an input image and returning: High-resolution semantic crack mask. Overlay visualization highlighting detected cracks. Structured output (JSON) reporting crack instance ID, coordinates, estimated length, and estimated width profi le for each named image. Brief technical report summarizing validation metrics (mIoU, F1/Dice score, width/length error margins against reference test sets).', 1, 'HOURLY', 1292000.00, 2067000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('4f61a5fd-e983-5356-847a-241114996308', '8e235632-8e7d-58c9-a1d2-eb5ad7dfe33b', 'Senior AI Developer Needed — Build Custom Script-to-Video Ad Generator with Conversational AI Editor', 'We''re an established, high-volume DTC e-commerce company looking for an exceptional AI developer to build a custom, automated video ad production platform. Our goal is simple: We paste a completed 1–5 minute advertising script into a tool, select a video style, click Generate, and receive a fully produced, professional-quality video ad ready to run on Meta. Think high-performing V-Shred or Dr. Gundry-style direct-response video ads. We don''t want basic AI slideshows or generic AI-generated videos. We want highly engaging, professionally edited ads with rapid visual changes, animated text, sound effects, music, and compelling visuals. Ideally, the entire process is automated, with minimal human intervention. 1. Multiple Video Formats We want the ability to select from several video production styles, including: Direct-Response VSLs: Fast-paced editing, B-roll, animated captions, kinetic typography, visual pattern interrupts, and frequent scene changes. AI Talking Heads: Realistic AI presenters, doctors, experts, or spokespersons. AI UGC: Realistic AI-generated creators delivering natural, authentic-looking content. AI Animation: Animated characters, scenes, and educational explanations. AI Song Ads: Original AI-generated songs with synchronized visuals, lyrics, and editing. AI Drama Ads: Narrative-driven ads with realistic AI actors, dialogue, and multiple scenes. Comic Book Animation: Illustrated storytelling with animated panels and transitions. Vector Animation: Clean 2D motion graphics and animated illustrations. Claymation: Stop-motion-style animated characters and environments. We also want the ability to combine different styles within a single video. 2. Fully Automated Production The system should automatically: Analyze the script and break it into scenes. Determine appropriate visuals for each section. Generate or source video footage and images. Generate natural-sounding voiceovers. Create realistic AI characters and maintain visual consistency. Add animated captions, text overlays, and kinetic typography. Incorporate music, sound effects, and transitions. Synchronize visuals with the voiceover. Assemble and render the complete video. Export finished videos optimized for Meta advertising. The output should be a finished video ad, not raw clips that require manual editing. 3. Conversational AI Editing (Extremely Important) After generating the video, we want to make changes simply by chatting with an AI assistant. For example: "Make the first 10 seconds more engaging with faster cuts and more aggressive text animations." "Replace the footage at 1:20 with a 3D animation explaining the ingredient." "Change the spokesperson to a middle-aged female veterinarian." "Make this section look like a comic book animation." "Add more visual pattern interrupts throughout the video." The AI should understand these instructions and automatically modify the relevant portions of the video. Ideally, individual scenes can be edited without regenerating the entire video. 4. Technical Experience We''re looking for a developer with experience in several of the following: Generative AI video models (Veo, Kling, Runway, etc.). ComfyUI and custom generative AI workflows. LLM agents and natural-language interfaces. Python and API integrations. Remotion, FFmpeg, or programmatic video editing. AI voice generation and lip synchronization. AI image generation and character consistency. Automated video production pipelines. Full-stack application development. We''re flexible on the technology stack. We care about the quality of the final product, not which tools are used. 5. Who We''re Looking For We''re specifically looking for someone who has already built AI video generation or automated video editing systems. We are NOT looking for: Traditional video editors. People who manually create AI videos. Basic n8n automation specialists without video generation experience. Developers who have never worked with generative video. We want a strong technical developer who can architect and build a sophisticated AI-powered creative production system. Experience with direct-response marketing, Meta advertising, or DTC e-commerce is a significant advantage. 6. Budget & Engagement We''re flexible on budget for the right person. We''re open to starting with a paid proof of concept and expanding into a larger development project. This could become a long-term engagement as we continue building additional AI creative production capabilities. 7. How to Apply Please answer the following questions: 1. Have you personally built an automated script-to-video generation system? If yes, please share a working demo or video walkthrough. 2. Have you built systems that automatically combine AI-generated footage, voiceovers, animated captions, music, and transitions into finished videos? 3. Have you implemented conversational AI editing, where a user can request changes to an existing video through natural language? 4. What technology stack would you recommend for building this system? 5. Roughly how long would it take you to build a working proof of concept that converts a 1–3 minute script into a polished direct-response video ad? IMPORTANT: Please begin your proposal with the words "AI VIDEO BUILDER" so we know you''ve read the requirements. We''re looking to hire someone exceptional and move quickly.', 1, 'HOURLY', 775000.00, 1550000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('ecd1fa50-8538-5021-b361-8b01a3c5d1c2', '9b73f324-80da-56a2-8911-903d02b9cbc1', 'Flutter / FlutterFlow Prototype Developer – Manchester Based', 'Hello, We are looking for a Flutter/FlutterFlow developer to help turn our existing Figma designs into a fully interactive mobile app prototype for iOS and Android. This is a very complex social and messaging app with features including chats, profiles, social content, stories, calls, AI features and more. This role requires the developer to be able to work with us in person in Manchester, for a period of 3-4 weeks. Please only apply if you are based in Manchester or can regularly travel to Manchester. The first phase will focus on: - Recreating Figma screens accurately in FlutterFlow - Building responsive layouts for iOS and Android - Creating reusable components - Implementing navigation and interactions - Using mock/local data for prototype functionality - Building chat and custom list flows - Structuring the project so it can later develop into the production app We are looking for experience in: Flutter / FlutterFlow Figma-to-app development Mobile UI/UX implementation Responsive layouts State management and navigation Reusable component architecture Experience with social or messaging apps, Firebase/Supabase, notifications or real-time messaging is a bonus. The developer must be willing to sign an NDA and IP agreement. All source code, components and project work must belong to our company. Please include examples of Flutter/FlutterFlow apps you have built and confirm your availability to work in person in Manchester. For the right person there will be an opportunity to join our startup full time once we secure funding.', 1, 'FIXED', 23249000.00, 23249000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('978a21af-de84-5594-8a49-a7d3ed6263a6', 'bbb596cb-ce8e-56d1-80a1-f4b4cb37aef2', 'Tuyển bạn lập trình web đăng tin rao vặt tương tự chotot', 'Muốn làm web mua bán rao vặt tương tự các thông tin tương tự chợ tốt. Mong muốn thêm: - Được tư vấn kiến trúc hệ thống ngay từ đầu - Có roadmap phát triển mở rộng trong tương lai (mobile app, AI gợi ý tin đăng, quảng cáo nội bộ…) Yêu cầu ứng viên: - Có kinh nghiệm phát triển website marketplace / rao vặt / thương mại điện tử - Thành thạo PHP / Laravel / NodeJS / hoặc framework phù hợp - Có tư duy UX/UI cho nền tảng nhiều người dùng', 1, 'FIXED', 1000000.00, 10000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('eed42b85-f571-5408-af36-86e5708dee72', '84fa8c16-aa32-561b-b803-b22a5f5697cb', 'Build a Square space website with payment functionality.', 'I am looking for someone to create a square space website for my Beef jerky company, Reload Jerky. I already have a basic framework on chat gpt made so this should be a relatively straightforward assignment. The website also needs payment functionality. I wanted this website up several months ago but all the designers have fallen through. I''m looking for someone who can get this done quickly and efficiently, and who also will be communicative throughout the process. If we are happy with the final outcome there could be future contract work for website maintenance and any changes.', 1, 'HOURLY', 775000.00, 1033000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('291f95e2-f8c3-5e8b-9d41-8cfa7595b480', 'bfd0833d-c0a6-5ec2-84cc-8a08491aeda8', 'Senior Python/AsyncIO Engineer: Fix "Thundering Herd" & Non-Blocking Architecture', 'We have an existing Python automation script (using nodriver and asyncio) that interacts with a high-traffic web portal. During peak traffic hours (a classic "Thundering Herd" scenario), the target server becomes unresponsive. Our current fetch request hangs for 15+ seconds, causing a cascade of TypeError: Failed to fetch errors. Your Mission (Fixed Price: $300 - $400): 1. Thundering Herd Mitigation: Implement a strictly non-blocking architecture. You must use asyncio.wait_for (or equivalent JS AbortController inside the browser) with a strict timeout and an immediate retry loop. The bot must never hang, even if the server drops the connection. 2. Form Automation: Automate a multi-step form (dynamic fields, file upload, final click) using nodriver. I already have the exact HTML source code of this form. Requirements: Expert in Python, AsyncIO, and nodriver. Experience with high-frequency, low-latency systems (trading, real-time data aggregation).', 1, 'FIXED', 10333000.00, 10333000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('fae4682a-0fb4-56f4-a2e2-e053282212fb', '857354cd-bfcf-5945-a004-cd342c7ee943', 'Xây dựng các ứng dụng mobile cho các dự án', 'MÔ TẢ CÔNG VIỆC Phát triển và duy trì ứng dụng mobile đa nền tảng (iOS / Android) sử dụng Flutter hoặc React Native. Xây dựng và tối ưu UI/UX, hiệu năng và trải nghiệm người dùng. Tích hợp và làm việc với RESTful API, WebSocket và hệ thống backend. Phối hợp với Backend Developer, UI/UX Designer và Product Manager để phát triển tính năng mới. Tối ưu hiệu năng ứng dụng, giảm crash và cải thiện tốc độ tải. Thực hiện code review, refactor và cải tiến chất lượng code. Tham gia build, test và publish ứng dụng lên App Store và Google Play. Ứng dụng AI tools vào công việc hàng ngày để tăng năng suất phát triển phần mềm. YÊU CẦU KỸ THUẬT Bắt buộc Có tối thiểu 2 năm kinh nghiệm phát triển Mobile App. Thành thạo Flutter hoặc React Native. Hiểu rõ về: RESTful API JSON HTTP / HTTPS Authentication (JWT / OAuth) Có kinh nghiệm làm việc với: Git API integration Debugging và performance optimization Có khả năng xây dựng: Responsive UI Component reusable State management Yêu cầu về AI Ứng viên bắt buộc có khả năng sử dụng AI hỗ trợ công việc, ví dụ: Sử dụng AI để: Viết và refactor code Debug lỗi Tối ưu logic Viết documentation Tăng tốc độ phát triển sản phẩm Thành thạo sử dụng các công cụ như: ChatGPT / GPT-based tools GitHub Copilot hoặc AI coding assistants AI hỗ trợ viết code / phân tích lỗi Có tư duy AI-first development (sử dụng AI để tăng hiệu suất làm việc). Ưu tiên Có kinh nghiệm với: Firebase Push Notification Payment integration Realtime data Maps / Location services Hiểu biết về: Clean Architecture MVVM / Bloc / Redux / Provider CI/CD cho mobile Có app đã publish trên: App Store Google Play', 1, 'FIXED', 10000000.00, 30000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('29dd3f73-5f57-5a4d-9051-4af1c73f150e', 'b4ae10d0-75f6-5dc8-9e5b-4de7ec965c25', 'AI ChatGPT Search Website Developer', 'We need a developer to build a website that uses AI and ChatGPT to power a search experience. The site should be easy to use, responsive, and designed for a smooth user experience. You will be responsible for setting up the core search functionality, integrating the AI features, and ensuring the site works well across devices. Please share relevant examples of similar projects and your approach to building a clean, functional search-focused website.', 1, 'HOURLY', 387000.00, 904000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('67aa14db-b88c-50c5-af74-2b7f1820ceba', 'b20fb79b-a458-5de9-a392-5b5968001cbc', 'Senior Web Designer for a Dark, Editorial Homepage and Site Theme (Figma)', 'NO AGENCIES!! INDEPENDENT DESIGNERS ONLY. I’m the founder of Identient, an AI governance consultancy for FINRA member firms. Our buyers are CEOs, CISOs and compliance leaders. I have a defined concept called “Midnight Ledger”: deep ink grounds, hairline rules, licensed serif headlines, evidence set like entries in a financial record, and one warm accent. The information architecture, homepage copy, a working comp and a design brief are done. I need a designer to take it from a solid concept to a refined, distinctive final design. Deliverables (in Figma): Final site theme: color tokens, type scale, spacing, and a component library in dark and light variants Final homepage design for desktop and mobile (390 px) Hover and focus states for key components Developer-ready files, since my developer will build it You’re a fit if you have: A portfolio of editorial, financial-services or premium B2B sites that don’t look template-made Real typographic skill, including experience with licensed type (we’re evaluating GT Sectra and GT America) Clean Figma craft and experience handing off to developers Timeline: ASAP To apply: send two or three site designs you’re proudest of, and answer in one sentence: how would you make a dark-themed site feel trustworthy rather than ominous? I’ll share the brief, IA doc and current comp with shortlisted designers.', 1, 'HOURLY', 646000.00, 1292000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('31ff699a-49ca-569c-b0fb-c3225d96308b', 'b202cb34-6ed0-5c55-b5f0-8500ce26c050', 'Web Designer for Part-Time Projects', 'Caut un designer web pentru proiecte part-time care să ajute la realizarea unor site-uri simple. Am deja o idee clară despre ce doresc, iar proiectul va fi completat rapid. Experienţa este importantă, dar nu trebuie să fie foarte avansată. Dacă ai abilităţi bune de lucru cu HTML, HTML5, Adobe Photoshop sau alte instrumente similare, sunt deschis la colaborare. Vreau să lucrez cu cineva responsabil, creativ şi care să respecte termenele.', 1, 'HOURLY', 387000.00, 904000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('a751f8f2-163b-572f-a836-c7e45446fb98', '7f4cf06c-df06-5b48-ac3d-3e4cff3cfeb5', 'Looking for Flutter app developer', 'Flutter App Developer Needed for MVP ($250 Budget) Hi! I''m looking for a friendly and reliable Flutter developer to help me build an MVP (minimum viable product) for my app. I''m looking for someone who uses AI tools to speed up development, generate UI designs, and write code. The goal is to keep development simple and efficient, with additional coding where needed, while staying within a limited budget. Project requirements: - Build the app using Flutter for iOS, Android, and the web. - Develop both the frontend and backend. - Create the main pages, including chat, user profiles, and contacts. - Integrate e-commerce features into the app. - Connect the app to my existing WordPress website and WooCommerce store using APIs. - Deploy the app for iOS, Android, and web. This is an MVP project, so the focus is on getting the core features working rather than building a complex, fully featured product. Budget: $250 for the complete project, including development and deployment. I''ll explain the project in more detail and share the full requirements with the selected developer. I''m looking for someone who is comfortable using AI tools, can work efficiently, and is willing to work within this budget. If you''re interested, please share a few examples of your previous Flutter projects and let me know which AI coding tools you use. Looking forward to working together!', 1, 'FIXED', 6458000.00, 6458000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('d91cdc46-b3b1-533e-abe1-52ae707f03f7', '0622badc-5009-52b9-aeee-beeeec316415', 'Unity3D pair programming tutor with python and C# experience + good English', 'I have an existing Unity prototype and want to build it myself with guidance. I’m looking for daily project-based sessions covering C#, debugging, architecture, Git. I want to understand the code and do much of the implementation myself. Please share your Unity experience, an example of teaching or mentoring, your hourly rate, and whether you’re comfortable reviewing an AI-assisted codebase. We’ll start with one paid trial session. I''m a slow learner with programming and have tried many times in the past. I have a target game I want to build now I need someone to help me learn to reach it.', 1, 'HOURLY', 387000.00, 775000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('96de2451-d142-5f8c-b0d9-9e6b0c425c86', 'c072aab0-9038-5c64-8a8d-cc88e67cb476', 'C#/.NET Developer for Blazor and EF Core', 'We need a developer to build and maintain a Blazor application using EF Core with Azure SQL. Experience with Azure hosting and Entra ID is more important than any specific front-end library. You should be comfortable working on a small team with AI assisted workflows, supporting ongoing development, and helping improve application reliability and performance.', 1, 'HOURLY', 1292000.00, 2067000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('4e23f64d-db8b-5620-a1ca-c5138138c82e', 'babda95f-c51d-5cc3-a335-81f1f91ad86f', 'Quick, cheap website build', 'I just need a basic website for a dog care service. I know I could use AI myself, but I just find the process too depressing. It''s worth $50 for me to avoid it.', 1, 'FIXED', 1292000.00, 1292000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('6aadbd6f-2ad2-50f8-ad8c-50df8fca80cb', 'e0c1f32e-2eb3-5c6f-92e5-13e9ff460026', 'Need React JS Node JS Developer to fix bugs very fast', 'Need to fix bugs very fast , start proposal with READ that I can understand that the proposal was not wirtten by AI the qualifications: React JS, Node JS, Taiwland CSS, Next JS, Mongo DB', 1, 'FIXED', 1292000.00, 1292000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('9ac2fdaf-7b0f-5177-b2e9-43336ed7d9e3', '36495202-b91c-54f0-8549-f4eb18ca9ea1', 'Core PHP Developer', 'We are looking for an experienced Core PHP Backend Developer with strong hands-on experience in production environments. The candidate must be capable of diagnosing, troubleshooting, and fixing live production issues, optimizing database performance, and maintaining existing web applications. Key Responsibilities Develop, maintain, and optimize web applications using Core PHP. Diagnose and resolve live production issues, backend errors, and application failures. Troubleshoot issues using application logs, Apache logs, error logs, and server diagnostics. Identify root causes of production problems and implement permanent fixes. Optimize MySQL queries, database indexes, and overall database performance. Improve website speed, server response time, and application reliability. Debug existing codebases and resolve complex backend issues. Handle URL routing, redirects, HTTP status codes, dynamic sitemaps, and SEO-related technical issues. Implement secure coding practices and protect applications against common vulnerabilities. Work with Linux/Ubuntu servers and Apache web server configurations. Integrate REST APIs and third-party services. Collaborate with team members to deliver stable, scalable backend solutions. Required Skills Strong expertise in Core PHP and object-oriented programming (OOP). Hands-on experience with MySQL and database optimization. Proven experience diagnosing and fixing production issues in live applications. Ability to investigate root causes rather than relying only on temporary fixes. Knowledge of Apache, Linux/Ubuntu, server logs, and basic networking. Experience with REST APIs, AJAX, HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. Understanding of website performance optimization, caching, and debugging. Knowledge of Git and version control. Understanding of HTTP status codes, redirects, 404 errors, soft 404s, canonical URLs, and XML sitemaps. Experience Requirements Minimum 5+ years of professional Core PHP backend development experience. Mandatory hands-on production experience, including diagnosing, troubleshooting, and fixing live website issues. Experience maintaining existing applications and resolving critical backend and database problems. Ability to independently investigate technical issues and implement reliable fixes. Preferred Qualifications Experience with Laravel or other PHP frameworks. Experience with production server troubleshooting and performance monitoring. Experience handling high-load websites and improving application scalability.', 1, 'FIXED', 1292000.00, 1292000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('2f321d73-5c2a-5cea-ab00-5f95d553c8b9', '35cade3a-6bfd-5bc4-8293-66620407be7c', 'Senior Software Engineer', 'About WWCorporate WWCorporate is a software studio that builds web, mobile, and AI products for startups and established companies across Europe, the Middle East, and now the US. For more than 10 years, we''ve helped companies turn complex ideas into practical, scalable software products. We value clear communication, pragmatic engineering decisions, and long-term client relationships over unnecessary process or complexity. The Role We''re looking for a senior engineer who can operate confidently in both technical and client-facing environments. This role sits between our clients and our engineering team. You''ll lead technical conversations, clarify requirements, identify risks early, and translate business goals into clear execution plans for developers. This is not a pure coding role. It''s ideal for someone who enjoys architecture discussions, product thinking, and solving real business problems - while staying close to engineering without wanting another full-time development position. What You''ll Own - Lead client discovery calls, technical discussions, and project follow-ups - Translate client needs into clear technical direction and actionable development tasks - Help clients understand trade-offs, timelines, technical risks, and implementation realities - Keep projects aligned across stakeholders, developers, and decision-makers - Identify blockers early and proactively drive resolution - Write concise meeting summaries, technical notes, and next steps - Build trusted relationships with long-term clients and stakeholders - Support account growth by identifying additional opportunities when appropriate What We''re Looking For - 5+ years of experience in software engineering or technical consulting - Strong understanding of modern software systems including web applications, APIs, cloud infrastructure, and mobile products - Excellent spoken and written English with confidence leading calls with US-based clients - Ability to translate between business objectives and technical execution - Strong organizational and follow-through skills in a remote environment - Comfortable making decisions in ambiguous or fast-moving situations - Familiarity with US communication style, expectations, and working hours Nice to Have - Experience working directly with US clients or distributed international teams - Background in solutions engineering, pre-sales, technical consulting, or customer success - Experience with AI products, FinTech platforms, or eCommerce systems - Exposure to product strategy or technical architecture discussions Why This Role Is Different You''ll work directly with founders, operators, and decision-makers - not through layers of process. The work is practical, fast-moving, and communication-heavy. Success in this role comes from judgment, clarity, and the ability to align people around good technical decisions. Compensation Part-time contractor role with long-term collaboration potential. Compensation depends on experience, availability, and client-facing experience level.', 1, 'HOURLY', 1292000.00, 3100000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('d257b94f-ec8c-5a0e-b8a8-2f14f4056185', '2dafce05-ed92-5a0d-adf9-ed61ad31f52d', 'App Engineering and Design Lead', 'We need a leader to oversee app engineering and design for a project using Claude Code. You will guide development, shape the user experience, and help ensure the product is polished and functional. This role is ideal for someone who can take ownership of the technical direction, collaborate with the team, and deliver a high-quality app experience. If you have experience leading app projects and can help turn ideas into a strong final product, we’d love to hear from you.', 1, 'HOURLY', 387000.00, 904000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('5d4f2a3e-48c6-572a-b9f0-4ea6f9a5a434', 'c254009e-3448-57d2-9431-9b13f655ebc0', 'Senior engineer: replacement builds for multi-location businesses, plus paid on-call maintenance', 'I scope and sell software builds that replace the industry software multi-location businesses rent. I''m looking for a couple of senior engineers to build them in fixed-scope phases and then stay on, paid, for maintenance and on-call. You should have shipped production software that real users depended on before AI coding tools existed, and use Claude Code, Codex or Cursor daily now. First step is a 20 minute call. No work, code or design before we agree on a paid scope.', 1, 'HOURLY', 1292000.00, 3229000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('7ed74880-65f2-5931-9a5e-0183840817a2', '057bd816-cceb-56d9-9a87-9322c9c4bba8', 'Flutter Developer | AI App Developer', 'We are looking for an experienced Flutter Developer and AI App Developer for a technical consultation regarding an existing mobile application built with Flutter and Dart. The application is already developed and available for Android and iOS. We would like to discuss one existing user-facing feature and get professional recommendations regarding its current implementation and possible improvements. During the consultation, we would like to review several areas, including Flutter and Dart development, Mobile App Development, state handling, input validation, Firebase, API Integration, and Software Debugging. The application also includes AI-related functionality, so we would like to discuss the current approach from an AI App Developer perspective, how the AI functionality should interact with the mobile application and backend, and whether the existing technical approach is appropriate. We are also interested in recommendations from an experienced Flutter Developer and AI App Developer regarding Android and iOS Development, cross-platform implementation, Firebase structure, API integrations, potential technical risks, and the best way to improve the feature without making unnecessary changes to the existing application architecture. This is a consultation-only project. No development or code changes are required as part of this contract. The goal of the consultation is to review our current approach, answer technical questions, identify potential issues, and provide clear recommendations for our development team.', 1, 'FIXED', 3616000.00, 3616000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('e4468c76-2f2c-5014-b3f0-d2f65d3cbf38', 'a7de0da1-9cc8-5455-9f34-b790c2841993', 'AI & Automation Developer | Long-Term Technical Partner (US Time Zone)', 'We''re a growing agency looking for an experienced AI & Automation Developer who can become a trusted, long-term technical partner on our team. We''re not just looking for someone who can write code. We want someone who genuinely enjoys collaborating, communicates openly, takes ownership of their work, and cares about building strong relationships with both our team and our clients. What We''re Looking For: Strong experience with AI development, AI agents, API integrations, and workflow automation. Hands-on experience with Python, n8n, Make, Zapier, OpenAI APIs, and related technologies. Ability to work and communicate during US business hours (Eastern and Pacific Time). Excellent English communication skills, both written and spoken. Someone who is honest, reliable, proactive, and comfortable discussing technical challenges directly. Ability to work independently while collaborating closely with our team. Interest in building a genuine, long-term working relationship. How to Apply: Please include the following in your application: A short Loom video introducing yourself, explaining your experience, and sharing why you''d be a good fit for our team. Relevant project experience, especially AI and automation projects you''ve personally developed. Your availability during US business hours. One Last Thing I want to emphasize this: Communication and technical skills are equally important to us. We''re looking for someone we can trust, collaborate with comfortably, and grow alongside over time. You don''t need to know every technology, but you should be honest about what you know, willing to learn, and genuinely committed to doing great work. If that sounds like you, I''d love to hear from you and hopefully build something great together.', 1, 'HOURLY', 775000.00, 1550000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('322fbe79-7795-5cfe-af61-7a3903449481', '27f23ef7-b81d-5791-98d5-88d6a51ff374', 'Looking for a someone with great communication skill', 'We’re looking for someone with a technical background and strong English communication skills. You’d be a good fit if you: - Speak fluent, natural English - Have a software development or technical background - Can confidently discuss common software engineering topics - Know how to use AI tools to help prepare for technical discussions - Are dependable, honest, and available for a long-term partnership We’re looking for someone we can build a good working relationship with over the long term. If you have a technical background, communicate well, and are comfortable talking with clients and engineering teams, we’d be happy to hear from you. When applying, please send us a quick introduction about your technical background, client or interview experience, availability, and time zone.', 1, 'HOURLY', 775000.00, 1550000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('ef988437-6f82-5144-9074-e0d2cba9964b', '71a41dcf-4932-5ea0-a6ab-901480129dce', 'GHL Website builder (Can use AI)', 'Hi Team, Hope everything is well with you. I''m looking for a website builder with GHL Platform. We want someone who can build good-looking websites using AI. Make sure you include your portfolio examples 10+ of the build, ONLY for GHL platform. Thanks.', 1, 'FIXED', 775000.00, 775000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('0b666601-eb21-5815-82ec-d66d4a3d2634', 'f5572102-5730-5dc5-af90-c2296802821d', 'Votel.ai Website Development', 'I’m looking for someone familiar with votel.ai to help create a couple of websites I want to present to prospective clients. I’m also open to discussing the creation of some sub agencies. I don’t have much time to experiment, so I’m looking for someone who can move quickly and guide the process. If you can also help bring in clients, I’m open to working on a percentage of the profits.', 1, 'HOURLY', 387000.00, 775000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('e46b15c3-65e6-5433-8cfb-c96de14a99d0', '29a06ca8-6653-5169-b04a-ee8c0632144e', 'Implement Strapi 5 SEO generator plugin cho website hiện tại của công ty', 'AGENCY ONLY Điều kiện bắt buộc là có pháp nhân xuất được hoá đơn đỏ cho CTY Website CTY đc build trên Strapi5, đang có nhu cầu outsourcing việc implement SEO auto generate engine, có thể support cho AI auto generate cho SEO Plugin của Strapi work cho content được upload bởi Marketing team. Hiện tại website CTY được build trên Strapi5 bản community, deploy vào Netfily, CMS đặt tại AWS, nên Plugin này sẽ triển khai trên con CMS. - http://market.strapi.io/plugins/@strapi-community-plugin-seo Plugin phải hỗ trợ multiple languages, hiện tại đã có content cho en/vi/ja/ru Bên bạn có pháp nhân công ty và người để làm không thì liên hệ với tôi , CEO cần hoàn thành trong vòng 10 ngày.', 1, 'FIXED', 10000000.00, 30000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('19dfb427-0dd8-5a67-9d20-05ab50831f4a', '53e2eb36-7a0f-534c-a63a-b8b315f94b30', 'TRIỂN KHAI HỆ THỐNG WEB VỆ TINH & AI AUTOMATION ( 4 web )', 'Mình có gửi file đính kèm ạ. Mục tiêu dự án: Xây dựng hệ thống 10+ website vệ tinh (đợt 1 làm 4 web) cho ngách "Thảm đá nóng". Yêu cầu vận hành tự động, chuẩn SEO E-E-A-T và xóa hoàn toàn dấu vết hệ thống (Footprint). Thanks', 1, 'FIXED', 3000000.00, 5000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('cc9ca890-4f6e-54b2-afbc-b8b515262fae', '75eb839f-dceb-52b3-8305-1164e6c8c2da', 'TÌM DEVELOPER PYTHON / REACT (3+ NĂM KN) – FREELANCE', 'Bên mình là một software team mới, đang xây dựng network developer để triển khai các dự án web/app, automation và các hệ thống có sử dụng AI. Hiện chưa có dự án ngay, nhưng muốn kết nối trước với các bạn dev để có thể bắt đầu nhanh khi có project. Hình thức làm việc: 100% remote Giờ hành chính Làm việc theo từng project (freelance) ⏱️ Yêu cầu thời gian: Tối thiểu: ~20 giờ/tuần Hoặc full-time: 35–40 giờ/tuần (tuỳ theo project) Tech stack chính: Backend: Python (Django / FastAPI / Flask…) Frontend: React Database: PostgreSQL / MySQL / MongoDB CI/CD: GitHub Actions Cloud: GCP or AWS Deployment: Docker / server / cloud infra Yêu cầu: Có ít nhất 3 năm kinh nghiệm làm việc Có kinh nghiệm thực tế với Python + React (fullstack hoặc backend/frontend mạnh) Hiểu về API, database Có kinh nghiệm deploy (AWS / GCP hoặc tương đương) Sử dụng Git, GitHub workflow tốt Biết sử dụng AI tools trong coding, công việc (ChatGPT, Copilot, …) là lợi thế lớn Công việc: Xây dựng và phát triển hệ thống web/app Tích hợp API, xử lý dữ liệu Deploy và maintain hệ thống trên cloud Tối ưu performance và fix bug Quy trình: Review CV / GitHub / portfolio Call nhanh 15–20 phút Nếu phù hợp → add vào network dev Khi có project: Bên mình sẽ contact các bạn phù hợp Trao đổi nhanh scope và bắt đầu làm Có thể có check kỹ thuật ngắn theo từng project Mong muốn: Tìm dev có thể hợp tác lâu dài, làm nhiều dự án cùng nhau. Ứng tuyển gửi: CV GitHub / portfolio Tech stack rõ ràng Ưu tiên: Có kinh nghiệm trong lĩnh vực trading / forex, hệ thống tài chính Chủ động, phản hồi nhanh, đúng giờ Có kinh nghiệm deploy thực tế Có mindset dùng AI để tăng tốc công việc Nếu bạn quan tâm, gửi CV qua email: [được ẩn bởi vlance] nhé (bên mình không check comment/chat) Cảm ơn mọi người!', 1, 'FIXED', 20000000.00, 35000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('fb612f35-5083-5bb1-9f9e-70387cd393db', '1afa8f20-1b97-543a-9921-006917e9ae6e', 'Vertical OS điều phối chuỗi giá trị ngành sơn end to end', 'Mục tiêu: Auto điều phối các mắt xích toàn bộ chuỗi giá trị ngành. Mỗi điểm chạm = doanh thu ___ Bối cảnh hiện tại: Cty đang nằm ở node (Phân phối + Private Brand Lable + Thi công trọn gói). Khách B2B2C Doanh thu: Trực tiếp từ sản phẩm dịch vụ ___ Mục tiêu: - Điều phối toàn bộ chuỗi giá trị ngành - Doanh thu: + Mỗi điểm chạm điều phối đều sinh doanh thu ___ Yêu cầu: Kinh nghiệm thực tế ở dự án tương đương. Full stack, không nhận Job lẻ ___ Tổng cấu trúc “Vertical OS ngành sơn” 7 tầng chính: Internal (nội bộ) Operating (điều phối) Supply Layer (nguyên liệu) Factory Layer (sản xuất) Commerce Layer (phân phối) Execution Layer (thi công) Lifecycle Layer (bảo hành + tái chế) ___ Cấu trúc logic Vertical OS: Upstream: (1) Nguyên liệu → (2) Công thức Core production: (3) Nhà máy → (4) SKU Go-to-market: (5) Phân phối → (6) Bán hàng Execution: (7) Thi công → (8) Công trình ___ 1) Nguyên liệu Nguồn đầu vào vật chất: resin, pigment, dung môi, phụ gia → quyết định chi phí + chất lượng cơ bản 2) Công thức (R&D) Thiết kế “công nghệ sơn” → quyết định hiệu năng, phân khúc, lợi thế cạnh tranh 3) Nhà máy (Sản xuất) Biến công thức thành sản phẩm vật lý → kiểm soát chất lượng, chi phí, sản lượng 4) Sản phẩm / SKU Đơn vị thương mại hóa của sơn → danh mục, định vị, giá, vòng đời 5) Phân phối Dòng chảy sản phẩm ra thị trường → kho, vùng, đại lý, tồn kho 6) Bán hàng Tạo doanh thu trực tiếp → B2B dự án + B2C đại lý + pricing thực tế 7) Thi công Nơi “giá trị cuối cùng” được tạo ra → thợ, đội thi công, chất lượng công trình thực tế 8) Công trình (Demand / Use-case) Nơi tiêu thụ cuối cùng → nhà ở, công nghiệp, hạ tầng, dự án ___', 1, 'FIXED', 150000000.00, 200000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('4bddba8e-ed37-5ce8-a707-5e1ca0f41ac7', 'acdbb74a-402e-58c4-96a5-eb02cb96d7c6', 'Cần hợp tác phát triển phần mềm quản lý tài liệu điện tử', '- Cần bạn làm full hệ thống phần mềm quản lý tài liệu điện tử, số hóa, ứng dụng công nghệ mới và AI để phát triển', 1, 'FIXED', 50000000.00, 70000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('ad208107-7e9d-59b2-a7f7-331411099059', 'bd5359a6-ff59-5a13-83e1-eb59704fd942', 'Test chức năng của phần mềm cloud', 'Cần tuyển QA/Tester có kinh nghiệm kiểm thử nền tảng Cloud (IaaS/PaaS) hoặc Big Data/AI. Công việc bao gồm: thực hiện test chức năng, kiểm tra luồng triển khai, đo đạc latency breakdown, test AutoML, Vector Engine và cơ chế giới hạn ngân sách. Yêu cầu làm việc độc lập và viết báo cáo lỗi chi tiết. số lượng yêu cầu cần test ~ 800 chức năng, tính năng', 1, 'FIXED', 15000000.00, 16000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('5d11d948-404a-5520-8b7a-1e1f13a7cd29', 'cf5f4157-f97d-5c5d-9830-79a308252497', 'Tìm nhóm Senior phát triển App AI Sức khỏe Fresh Lens (Flutter/React Native)', 'Chào các bạn, mình là Quang, sáng lập dự án Fresh Lens. Mình hiện đang sinh sống tại nước ngoài và cần tìm một đội ngũ/Studio hoặc nhóm Freelancer Senior để lập trình phiên bản thương mại tinh gọn cho ứng dụng di động Fresh Lens trên cả hai nền tảng iOS và Android. Yêu cầu cốt lõi của dự án bao gồm: 1. Lập trình Module AI Camera chụp quét thực phẩm thô (thịt, rau, củ, quả, đồ khô, sữa) kết nối qua API Vision (OpenAI/Google Gemini). Cam kết tiêu chuẩn SLA: Thời gian phản hồi và trả kết quả hiển thị thông số Calo, Vitamin, Chất xơ dưới 03 giây. 2. Thiết lập cấu trúc dữ liệu và logic bộ lọc cá nhân hóa cho 05 nhóm hồ sơ sức khỏe/bệnh nền (Bình thường, Tiểu đường, Gút, Tim mạch, Suy dinh dưỡng) và hiện màn hình Tuyên bố miễn trừ trách nhiệm y tế song ngữ ngay khi mở app lần đầu. 3. AI tự động gợi ý công thức món ăn kết hợp khoa học từ nguyên liệu vừa quét và dự báo giới hạn thời gian sử dụng an toàn còn lại của thực phẩm. 4. Tích hợp hệ thống cổng thanh toán tự động hóa hoàn toàn (MoMo, VietQR) và cổng thanh toán quốc tế (In-App Purchase của Apple/Google Billing) cho các gói Premium , phối hợp mạng lưới quảng cáo Google AdMob. Yêu cầu đối với đối tác lập trình: - Có kinh nghiệm thực chiến về xử lý luồng truyền nhận hình ảnh qua API AI tốc độ cao. - Cam kết ký Thỏa thuận bảo mật thông tin (NDA) bằng văn bản trước khi nhận file Phụ lục tính năng chi tiết. - Thực hiện quy trình bàn giao và đồng bộ 100% mã nguồn (Source code) sạch lên tài khoản GitHub cá nhân của chủ đầu tư theo từng tuần (Weekly Deploy). Hình thức làm việc: Online 100% qua Zoom/Google Meet và quản lý tiến độ qua GitHub. Ngân sách dự kiến trọn gói cho phần lập trình: 160 triệu VNĐ (Sẽ thảo luận chi tiết dựa trên giải pháp kỹ thuật đề xuất).', 1, 'FIXED', 130000000.00, 160000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('9e9ac5f7-a59b-51e9-8f9a-6d4e6eedeaba', '61fcd83a-283a-5f9f-b0b1-91f95fbc97c4', 'iOS Developer for AI Assistant Integration', 'I have an iOS app built with SwiftUI and want to add an AI assistant to it. The main feature is a chat where users can ask questions and get answers based on their account data. The assistant will need to call a few backend functions, not just send messages to ChatGPT. I’m looking for someone who has built iOS apps and has hands-on experience with OpenAI APIs. The backend is still flexible, but I’m considering Supabase. To start, I’d like to build a working version of the chat with conversation history and two or three tool calls. If that goes well, there will be more work on the app. Please tell me about a similar feature you’ve built and how you’d approach this one. I’m interested in someone who can make technical decisions independently, not just implement a detailed spec.', 1, 'HOURLY', 387000.00, 775000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('40ed2afc-58c5-5173-b82e-bb277f03a797', '85792fd0-6e3b-5d8b-ad04-42b2d7f646f9', 'Automated Business Dashboard: React.js + Python + FASTAPI + n8n Workflow Integration', 'Summary We’re looking for an experienced AI Automation Engineer / Full-Stack Developer to build an automated business dashboard that connects internal business processes, APIs, databases, and third-party tools into one centralized platform. The project combines Next.js frontend development, Python/FastAPI backend services, and n8n workflow automation, with AI/LLM integrations where they provide practical business value. We need someone who can understand business requirements, recommend the right technical architecture, and deliver reliable, production-ready solutions—not just build a basic dashboard or chatbot prototype. Key Responsibilities Build a responsive business dashboard using Next.js and TypeScript. Develop backend services, REST APIs, and business logic using Python and FastAPI. Design and implement multi-step workflow automations using n8n. Integrate CRMs, databases, internal systems, and third-party SaaS platforms through APIs and webhooks. Develop AI-powered workflows and LLM integrations using OpenAI, Claude, Gemini, or similar providers where appropriate. Implement AI agents, structured tool calling, and human-in-the-loop approvals when required. Automate repetitive business processes and consolidate operational data into a centralized dashboard. Implement authentication, permissions, logging, retries, error handling, and monitoring. Optimize workflow reliability, performance, scalability, and API usage costs. Document the solution, integrations, and deployment process. Required Skills & Experience: Strong hands-on experience with Python and FastAPI. Experience building production-ready web applications using Next.js and TypeScript. Practical experience designing n8n workflows and business process automations. Strong understanding of REST APIs, webhooks, databases, and third-party integrations. Experience with AI/LLM integrations, prompt engineering, and AI agent workflows. Ability to translate business requirements into technical solutions. Understanding of authentication, data security, error handling, and production deployment. Nice to Have Experience with RAG, vector databases, and knowledge-based AI systems. Experience with CRM, HR, ERP, or other business management platforms. Familiarity with cloud deployment, CI/CD, and application monitoring. Experience implementing human approval steps in automated workflows. When Applying, Please Answer Share 2–3 relevant projects you have personally built involving business dashboards, n8n automation, or AI-powered workflows. Briefly explain how you would connect a Next.js dashboard, Python/FastAPI backend, and n8n automation workflows. Describe one challenging API integration or automation issue you solved and how you handled failures or retries. Which parts of this stack have you implemented in production, and what was your specific contribution? We value practical experience, sound technical judgment, clear communication, and maintainable solutions over buzzwords or tool lists.', 1, 'HOURLY', 387000.00, 646000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('c2a83c58-1136-50bc-982c-045b1b29aeee', 'f988c058-5dc9-5c23-97a3-85cd22bc15a1', 'Frontend Developer Needed for Crypto Market Dashboard', 'Frontend Developer Needed — Cryptocurrency Market Analytics Dashboard We are looking for an experienced frontend developer to build a modern, responsive cryptocurrency market analytics dashboard. Project Scope The dashboard will focus exclusively on cryptocurrency market data and analytics. It will not handle user funds or require access to private wallets. Key Features - Real-time cryptocurrency prices using public market data APIs. - Interactive charts showing historical price movements. - Percentage changes across different time periods. - A searchable list of cryptocurrencies with key market statistics. - Individual asset pages with price history and market information. - Responsive layouts for desktop and mobile devices. Technical Requirements - Experience with React, Next.js, or similar frontend frameworks. - Strong knowledge of JavaScript or TypeScript, HTML, and CSS. - Experience integrating REST APIs. - Familiarity with charting libraries and data visualization. - A portfolio demonstrating relevant projects. Deliverables - A fully functional, responsive web application. - Clean, maintainable source code. - Setup and deployment documentation. - A brief handover explaining how to configure the application. Budget and Timeline Please include your proposed price, estimated delivery time, and relevant portfolio examples in your proposal. We are looking for a reliable developer and are open to discussing long-term collaboration. To apply, please send us a message with your experience, portfolio, proposed approach, and estimated cost.', 1, 'FIXED', 25832000.00, 25832000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('95a9a922-cb05-5bc1-8123-e9daa0130009', '1baaad51-286d-5b95-abc8-476973d28895', 'Data Analyst – Business Intelligence & Data Reporting Specialist', 'We are currently looking for a Entry-Level Data Analyst – Business Intelligence & Data Reporting Specialist responsible for collecting, analyzing, and interpreting data to support business decision-making. This role involves creating reports, dashboards, and visualizations that transform raw data into clear, actionable insights. The analyst works with tools such as Excel, SQL, and data visualization platforms to identify trends, monitor key performance indicators (KPIs), and improve operational efficiency. This position also collaborates with cross-functional teams to ensure data accuracy and provide data-driven recommendations that support organizational goals. Key Responsibilities Collect, clean, and organize data from multiple sources to ensure accuracy and consistency Analyze datasets to identify trends, patterns, and actionable insights Develop and maintain reports, dashboards, and visualizations using tools such as Excel, Power BI, or Tableau Support business teams by providing data-driven recommendations Monitor key performance indicators (KPIs) and generate regular performance reports Assist in automating reporting processes to improve efficiency Collaborate with cross-functional teams including operations, finance, and management Ensure data integrity and compliance with company standards Required Skills & Qualifications High school / Bachelor’s degree in Data Analytics, Business, Statistics, Computer Science, or a related field (or equivalent experience) Strong analytical and problem-solving skills Proficiency in Microsoft Excel (formulas, pivot tables, data analysis) Basic knowledge of SQL for data querying Familiarity with data visualization tools (Power BI, Tableau, or similar) Strong attention to detail and accuracy Excellent written and verbal communication skills Preferred Qualifications Basic knowledge of Python or R for data analysis Experience with databases or data management systems Understanding of business intelligence concepts and reporting tools Internship or project experience in data analysis (a plus, not required)', 1, 'HOURLY', 517000.00, 1162000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00');

