    ('7827a8be-d3cc-5e84-8b84-3e7e36bde152', '615a4c9c-3391-5b1e-87d3-e7a6cee14c6d', 'AI/ML/DL and Website Development Expert', 'We are seeking a skilled professional to support AI, machine learning, and deep learning projects while also contributing to website development and data science tasks. The ideal candidate should be able to handle both technical and creative aspects of the work, including building and improving websites, analyzing data, and supporting AI-driven solutions. If you have experience working across these areas and can help deliver high-quality results, we would love to hear from you.', 1, 'HOURLY', 465000.00, 1162000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('1e8ef05b-8ebb-5065-bc17-26af6d156505', 'bcc79d28-24d9-59ab-808a-eaed80c67f8f', 'Test a Free Online Brain Test: First-Impression Feedback (about 30 minutes)', 'Thanks for taking a look. We’re about to launch a brain-training app, and its front door is a free Brain Fitness Test. We need 8 fresh eyes to take the test exactly as a new visitor would and tell us honestly how it went. What you’ll do, in one sitting of about 30 minutes: Open the link we send you, as if you found it on your own Take the Brain Fitness Test from start to finish Note your start and finish time Enter your email, read your results, and create an account Open your first cognitive exercise and play one round Write a short report: what was clear, what was confusing, anything that broke (with screenshots), and whether you would come back What we’re looking for: A mix of devices: Android phones, iPhones, and laptops (tell us yours) US based, 18 or older Honest, specific feedback. What didn’t work matters more to us than what did. Someone who has never seen Nutropx before Details: Fixed price, $25 You will never be charged anything, and we’ll give you any access code you need Please keep screenshots and details private until launch To apply, please answer: What device and browser will you use? Have you ever used a brain-training app? Which one? Can you do the test within 48 hours of getting the link? We’re starting soon, so we’ll pick testers in the next few days. Thank you!', 1, 'FIXED', 646000.00, 646000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('56707544-aac9-5ba1-8a54-0db7b7f52d6e', '95a09333-2fba-5f0a-bcf8-8ef4dd815407', 'Learn to Use Lovable Website', 'I need help learning how to use https://lovable so I can navigate the site and understand its main features. I’m looking for someone who can guide me through the process, answer questions about how things work, and help me get comfortable using the platform. Please share your experience with similar websites and how you would approach teaching someone new.', 1, 'HOURLY', 387000.00, 775000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('5cadfc57-0284-5a80-a596-54004d36c3f0', '094e210e-5eee-5e84-8c98-34162b890fab', 'macOS Workflow/Automations demos', 'Strict requirement: -Must use macOS. -Can come up with data related workflows. Nice to have: Experience with AI data training projects.] Looking for someone to suggest practical workflow ideas and provide demos showing the steps. We’ll start with a one-week trial and continue if the work produces meaningful results. Send your relevant experience', 1, 'HOURLY', 207000.00, 258000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('ed4999e4-47c2-57fe-8602-57485ce3b3e7', '167dbfd2-0632-5a0f-8418-c9f13080b4f4', 'Data Analyst + Claude AI Expert (Automated GoHighLevel Reports)', 'We have a lot of data in GoHighLevel and other tools. We need someone to build a fully automated reporting system: data pulled, cleaned, run through Claude, and delivered as reports on a schedule. No manual reports. You build it once and it runs on its own. What you will build - Automatic data pull from GoHighLevel through its API into a database - Scheduled pipelines that run with no one touching them - Claude (Claude API, Claude Code) processing that tags, summarizes and spots trends automatically - Dashboards and weekly reports that update and get delivered on their own - Automatic checks that dedupe, fix missing fields and alert us when tracking breaks Must have - Strong SQL and Python - Hands-on Claude experience (Claude API, Claude Code, prompts for data work) - GoHighLevel API or other CRM API experience - Built automated reporting systems before, not manual spreadsheets - Experience with large datasets - Clear written English Ongoing remote work. Starts with a small paid test project. To apply, answer: 1. Describe an automated pipeline you built from a CRM into a database. 2. Give one example of Claude you used on real business data. 3. Share an automated report or dashboard you built, and tell us how it updates. Start your proposal with the word "PIPELINE".', 1, 'HOURLY', 129000.00, 387000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('12717e64-e784-5733-85e3-bb1211542ede', '229b238f-2dda-59a0-b1c7-9e89f5bf6922', 'AI Voice Receptionist Developer – Experienced Professionals Only', 'We are looking for an experienced AI developer to build a production-ready AI Voice Receptionist that can handle inbound calls, engage in natural human-like conversations, answer customer questions, schedule appointments, transfer calls, and integrate with CRM systems. Key Requirements: Experience with Retell AI, Vapi, Twilio, OpenAI, or similar technologies. Natural, low-latency AI voice conversations. Appointment scheduling and calendar integration. Call routing, lead qualification, and CRM integration. Call transcription, summaries, and analytics. Scalable, multi-client architecture (SaaS-ready). IMPORTANT – PLEASE READ BEFORE APPLYING Do NOT apply if you have not implemented a working AI Voice Receptionist before. You MUST provide a live demo of a similar solution you have already developed. Screenshots, mockups, and theoretical knowledge are not sufficient. Please include your previous project experience, live demo link or demo availability, technology stack, estimated timeline, and fixed-price quote. We are looking for someone who has already built this successfully, not someone learning on our project.', 1, 'HOURLY', 129000.00, 310000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('be88f894-a8c5-55c9-90f6-0aafbca47f03', '44ff8de2-dd26-5c5f-8a07-c38bf9feacc9', 'Design UI for Ai product', 'I am an Ai engineer. who need help design an Ai product including chat for event palnning. I want to start with a mockups and continue if it fit.', 1, 'HOURLY', 387000.00, 1162000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('6fe91b15-0075-5f85-8509-30eca8e4ddc8', '91cecf18-4adc-5a7b-a4cc-048ef3a08a1c', 'AI Assistant Development with Echo7', 'We need a developer to build AI assistants using the Echo7 AI system that supports RAG, integrations, and workflows. The project includes setting up the assistant, connecting it to relevant tools, and creating efficient workflows for day-to-day use. You should be comfortable working with AI systems and delivering a reliable, functional assistant that can be used in practical business scenarios.', 1, 'HOURLY', 491000.00, 1033000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('f30c6078-d77d-5c6f-8a42-82175c603216', '7dbcc13e-c633-529e-8c4a-979de18211a9', 'Design Engineer to AI-Tutor', '# ProITBridge | Job Opening: AI Mentor – Design Engineering Background Company:ProITBridge Engagement Type:Freelance / Part-Time Time Commitment:Approximately 5 hours per week Work Mode:Remote ## About ProITBridge ProITBridge helps learners develop practical skills and prepare for careers in Artificial Intelligence, Generative AI, and Agentic AI through structured learning and mentorship. ## About the Role ProITBridge is looking for experienced Design Engineers who have successfully transitioned into Artificial Intelligence (AI), Generative AI, or Agentic AI, or who have integrated AI technologies into their design engineering domain. This opportunity is ideal for professionals who can share their career transition journey, provide practical AI guidance, and help learners understand how to apply AI skills to their existing engineering knowledge and career goals. The role focuses on 1:1 AI mentorship, technical guidance, and career transition support for premium learners. ## Key Responsibilities - Conduct one-to-one mentorship sessions with learners exploring AI career opportunities from a Design Engineering background. - Share practical insights from your transition into AI or your experience integrating AI into Design Engineering. - Clarify technical doubts related to AI, Machine Learning, Generative AI, and relevant AI tools. - Guide learners in identifying suitable AI technologies and applications for their engineering domain. - Provide direction on AI project selection, implementation approaches, architecture, and technology choices when required. - Review learners’ AI projects, proof of concepts (POCs), GitHub repositories, and portfolios, and provide constructive feedback. - Support learners with AI career planning, resume positioning, portfolio development, and interview preparation. - Help learners identify skill gaps and develop a practical roadmap for transitioning into AI-related roles. ## Required Qualifications - Previous professional experience as a Design Engineer or in a closely related engineering design role. - A demonstrated transition into AI, Generative AI, or Agentic AI, or practical experience integrating AI into Design Engineering workflows. - Working knowledge of relevant AI technologies, tools, and applications. - Practical understanding of AI use cases, project development, and implementation approaches relevant to your experience. - Strong communication skills and the ability to explain technical concepts clearly. - A genuine interest in mentoring and supporting professionals transitioning into AI. ## Preferred Technical Skills Engineering Design & Product Development, CAD / Design Tools, Engineering Drawings & Specifications, Design Analysis & Optimization, Simulation / Modelling, Technical Analysis, Python for AI, Machine Learning & Deep Learning Fundamentals, Computer Vision, Anomaly Detection, AI-Based Design Optimization, Embeddings & Vector Databases, RAG, AI Tool / Function Calling, AI Agents & Agentic AI, LangChain / LangGraph or equivalent frameworks, Generative AI & LLMs, AI APIs & Application Integration or domain-specific AI applications would be valuable. Candidates with practical examples of how they have applied AI to design processes, engineering workflows, simulation, optimization, or related use cases are particularly encouraged to apply. ## Time Commitment This is a flexible, part-time mentorship opportunity requiring approximately 5 hours per week. The schedule can be arranged in either of the following ways: - Monday to Friday:1 hour per day. - Saturday and Sunday:2.5 hours per day. ## Why Join ProITBridge? - Share your professional journey and help others transition into AI. - Guide learners in applying AI to real-world engineering problems. - Contribute to practical AI learning, project development, and career readiness. - Help build a community of engineers exploring AI-driven innovation.', 1, 'HOURLY', 407000.00, 679000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('62b311b5-7a83-563f-8e1e-bcfaf65722b6', '6de210b1-fdb0-5bd6-812a-ebbf2295291c', 'Cloud engineer to AI-Tutor', '# ProITBridge | Job Opening: AI Tutor – Cloud Engineering Background Company: ProITBridge Engagement Type:Freelance / Part-Time Time Commitment:Approximately 5 hours per week Work Mode: Remote ## About ProITBridge ProITBridge helps learners develop practical skills and prepare for careers in Artificial Intelligence, Generative AI, and Agentic AI through structured learning and personalized mentorship. ## About the Role ProITBridge is looking for experienced Cloud Engineers who have successfully transitioned into Artificial Intelligence (AI), Generative AI, or Agentic AI, or who have integrated AI technologies into cloud engineering and infrastructure workflows. The ideal candidate combines professional cloud engineering experience with practical AI knowledge and can guide learners in applying their existing cloud skills to AI-driven careers and solutions. This role focuses on one-to-one AI mentorship, technical doubt clarification, career transition guidance, and project direction for premium learners. It does not involve building applications on behalf of learners or conducting regular classroom teaching. ## Key Responsibilities - Conduct one-to-one mentorship sessions with learners transitioning from Cloud Engineering into AI. - Share practical insights from your journey into AI or your experience integrating AI with cloud technologies. - Clarify technical doubts related to cloud computing, Machine Learning, Generative AI, LLMs, and Agentic AI. - Help learners understand how cloud infrastructure, services, and DevOps practices support AI applications. - Guide learners in selecting suitable AI tools, cloud services, project ideas, and implementation approaches. - Provide guidance on AI architecture, model deployment, cloud integration, and MLOps practices. - Review learners'' AI projects, proof of concepts (POCs), GitHub repositories, and portfolios, providing constructive feedback. - Support learners with career transition planning, resume positioning, portfolio development, and interview preparation. - Identify learners'' skill gaps and recommend practical learning paths aligned with their career goals. ## Cloud Engineering Skills Candidates should have a strong foundation in: - Cloud Computing: AWS, Microsoft Azure, or Google Cloud Platform (GCP) - Cloud Infrastructure and Architecture - Compute, Storage, and Database Services - Networking Fundamentals - Identity and Access Management (IAM) - Docker and Kubernetes - CI/CD Pipelines - Infrastructure Automation - Monitoring and Logging - Linux - Git and GitHub - DevOps Practices ### Artificial Intelligence Skills Candidates should have practical knowledge of: - Python for AI - Machine Learning and Deep Learning Fundamentals - Generative AI and Large Language Models (LLMs) - Prompt Engineering - Embeddings and Vector Databases - Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) - AI Tool Calling and Function Calling - AI Agents and Agentic AI - LangChain, LangGraph, or Equivalent Frameworks - AI APIs and Application Integration - Cloud AI/ML Services - AI Model Deployment - MLOps, AI Monitoring, and Model Evaluation ### Professional Requirements - Previous professional experience in a Cloud Engineering, Cloud Infrastructure, DevOps, or closely related role. - A demonstrated transition into AI, Generative AI, or Agentic AI, or practical experience integrating AI into cloud engineering workflows. - The ability to explain technical concepts clearly and simplify complex topics for learners. - Strong communication, problem-solving, and mentoring skills. - A genuine interest in guiding professionals who want to transition into AI. ## Preferred Experience Candidates who have implemented AI solutions using cloud platforms, deployed ML models, integrated LLM applications with cloud services, or worked with AI infrastructure and MLOps workflows are particularly encouraged to apply. ## Time Commitment This is a flexible, part-time mentorship opportunity requiring approximately 5 hours per week. Candidates can choose either schedule: - Monday to Friday: 1 hour per day. - Saturday and Sunday: 2.5 hours per day. ## Why Join ProITBridge? - Share your career transition journey and help other professionals move into AI. - Guide learners in applying cloud engineering expertise to real-world AI solutions. - Contribute to practical AI learning, project development, and career readiness. - Help professionals understand how cloud computing and AI can work together to build scalable, intelligent systems.', 1, 'HOURLY', 407000.00, 679000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('a78dd207-0066-5373-935c-41278f0bc499', '3d7324c2-0726-550e-8b7c-674758e670dc', 'Generalist Product Engineer: AI Coding Agents (Claude Code / Codex), Food & Beverage AI Platform', 'About us : We’re running an AI innovation platform for food and beverage brands. It researches a brand and its market, spots trends, generates new product concepts with packshots and validates them with a range of testing methods to find the winners. Everything runs on a visual, durable AI workflow builder that agents can operate end to end. Who we''re looking for : A generalist who builds with AI coding agents and always starts from the client''s needs. You don''t have to be a deep specialist. You do need to understand the product, the user and the tech well enough to plan a feature, ship it on your own and suggest what we should build next. What you''ll do * Plan and ship features end to end, mostly by directing coding agents * Put yourself in the client''s shoes and turn their needs into clear features and good UX * Quickly learn the food & beverage and consumer goods domain * Bring new ideas for where the product should go next Must-haves * Excellent hands-on experience with coding agents like Claude Code and Codex. Tell us how you work with them. * A client-first mindset: you think about the user before the code * A generalist profile: you''re comfortable with product, UX and tech * You learn fast, solve problems creatively and work independently * Excellent English. German is a strong plus. Our stack (familiarity helps, depth not required) : Next.js 16, React 19, TypeScript, Tailwind v4, shadcn/ui, React Flow · Vercel AI SDK and AI Gateway (OpenAI, Anthropic, Google) · MCP servers · Vercel Workflow DevKit · Vercel (Blob, Sandbox) · Neon Postgres with Drizzle · Better Auth · pnpm, Biome, Vitest, Playwright', 1, 'HOURLY', 387000.00, 904000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('2f19d56e-a34d-5526-977b-5f0e9dbb5c66', '4390a3b2-5308-5124-8d38-95cb8d812cc8', 'Paid Q&A for AI/ML Engineers & Data Scientists ($30, ~30 min)', 'We''re paying AI/ML practitioners to answer 3 short questions about how they got into the field, with or without an AI degree. Your answers will inform educational articles on AI careers and degree programs. No writing skills needed. Who we''re looking for: - Current or recent ML engineer, data scientist, AI researcher, applied scientist, or similar hands-on role - Or a grad student in AI/ML or a related field - Any degree background (or none) is fine. Hiring experience is a big plus. How it works: - Pick 3 questions below and answer each in 150-300 words, typed or as a voice memo - Use specific examples from your own experience - No AI-drafted answers; they''ll be rejected - $30 per set of 3. Ongoing work for strong contributors. Questions: 1. How did you get into AI/ML, and what role did your degree (or lack of one) play? 2. Is an AI degree worth it, or is CS, math, or stats a better foundation? 3. When hiring, how much does a degree matter compared to projects and experience? 4. What did you have to learn on the job that school didn''t teach? 5. Which parts of your education mattered most and least in your AI/ML work? 6. Who should get a master''s in AI, and who should skip it? 7. Can you land an AI/ML job without a related degree? What does that path look like? 8. Which AI/ML roles need a grad degree or PhD, and which don''t? 9. How has generative AI changed what employers want in new hires? Are degree programs keeping up? 10. What''s the biggest mistake people make trying to break into AI? 11. Starting over today, would you get an AI degree? Why or why not? To apply, include: 1. The name of Shopify''s CEO at the top (this helps us sort through automated submissions) 2. A few sentences on your AI/ML background 3. Your degrees or credentials 4. The question number you''d most want to answer', 1, 'FIXED', 775000.00, 775000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('b02fbbdb-33e4-5ffc-aab5-4895fb65c6b4', '5e18af0c-e17f-5fe2-8af7-a381cb517a17', 'AI Engineer', 'Required Skills AWS, Anthropic, TypeScript, Docker, Terraform, Python, C#, OpenAI, PostgreSQL About Role The role is a full‑stack AI software engineer responsible for designing, shipping, and operating customer‑facing AI systems across the entire product lifecycle—from discovery and prototyping through deployment and monitoring—working directly with customers, product managers, and engineering teams with high autonomy and impact. Responsibilities Design, build, and operate systems in customer‑facing production environments Translate ambiguous business and customer problems into prototypes and technical specifications Track emerging AI capabilities and apply them where they create clear leverage Own the full application lifecycle including discovery, experimentation, evaluation, deployment, and monitoring Make system design decisions, manage trade‑offs, and ensure long‑term scaling and maintainability Write legible codebases for agents and developers and drive tooling improvements across the organization Partner with product managers to enhance product vision with AI‑native solutions Requirements 2+ years of experience in software engineering or applied AI Strong applied AI and software engineering fundamentals Experience working with AI development tools in full‑stack applications Experience designing AI‑based solutions for real workflows Working knowledge of cloud platforms and frontier AI platforms such as Anthropic or OpenAI Ability to span technology, product, and design thinking with high autonomy Bias for shipping, iterating, and incorporating customer feedback over polish Curiosity to continuously improve systems, products, and personal craft Degree in Computer Science, Engineering, Data Science, or related field (preferred) Experience operating AI systems in production with attention to evaluation, cost, and performance trade‑offs (preferred) Background in high‑ambiguity environments close to customers (e.g., early‑stage startups, forward‑deployed engineering, internal product teams) (preferred) Experience with large‑scale Python, C#, and TypeScript codebases (preferred) Experience integrating AI solutions into existing, established products (preferred)', 1, 'HOURLY', 465000.00, 1033000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('131c10dd-848b-55d6-9ac1-7e46d0b0d1a4', '0031eb91-0197-53a5-9973-5b90082552f0', 'Senior Program Test Lead (Brussels, Belgium Onsite)', 'Senior Program Test Lead – French or Dutch Speaker (Brussels, Belgium) Summary Location: Brussels, Belgium Work Mode: On-site Employment Type: Full-time Experience: 8+ Years in testing, including large-scale test program leadership Education: Bachelor’s Degree Language: Native or fluent French or Dutch (mandatory) and professional English About the Opportunity The successful candidate will orchestrate testing across multiple workstreams of a large transformation program in Brussels, own the program test plan, and coordinate internal teams and suppliers. This role requires strong, hands-on test program leadership and governance expertise, and fluent French or Dutch. Key Responsibilities -Develop the overall program test plan and break it down into integrated operational plans. -Orchestrate testing activities carried out by multiple workstreams, internal teams and suppliers. -Build and maintain a consolidated schedule of test campaigns, dependencies, environments, datasets and resources. -Coordinate the sequencing of System Testing, SIT, End-to-End, UAT, regression and non-functional tests. -Anticipate capacity conflicts, critical dependencies and cross-domain impacts, and propose the necessary trade-offs. -Produce consolidated dashboards on coverage, results, risks and quality of evidence for governance decisions. -Apply risk-based testing and maintain a traceability framework from requirements to test evidence. -Report to senior stakeholders and governance bodies, providing clear end-to-end visibility of quality, coverage and risk. Mandatory Requirements -Minimum 8 years of experience in testing. -Proven experience leading large-scale, multi-workstream testing programs. -Strong knowledge of System, SIT, E2E, UAT and regression testing methodologies. -Ability to build and maintain comprehensive test plans and schedules. -Experience with test governance, risk-based testing, traceability, and reporting to senior stakeholders. -Excellent communication and stakeholder coordination skills, including supplier management. -Bachelor’s degree. -Native or fluent French or Dutch, spoken and written, plus professional English. Nice to Have Experience coordinating testing with third-party platform vendors and their delivery processes. Experience with migration validation and cut-over planning. Experience with non-functional testing coordination (performance, security, resilience). Background in large transformation programs. Location Requirement: This is an on-site role in Brussels, Belgium; candidates must be able to work on-site with a French- or Dutch-speaking team. Important: Strong practical experience leading large-scale test programs and fluent French or Dutch are essential. Candidates must meet both requirements to be considered. 📩 Interested? Apply with your updated CV in English (no contact information), highlighting your test program leadership and governance experience, your language levels (French, Dutch, English), current location, and availability or notice period.', 1, 'HOURLY', 904000.00, 1292000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('631a540d-3b0b-5bc1-9791-fc6df2b3c45d', 'a15884d4-02d1-5eb4-964b-18e86be64c9b', 'Senior AI Automation & Systems Architect — Make, Airtable, ClickUp, APIs', 'Initial focus: Internal operating architecture, followed by marketplace automation About ZEAL ZEAL is building an AI-powered digital travel advisor and curated marketplace that connects travelers with authentic local experiences, trusted accommodations, and meaningful communities. We''re preparing to scale our operations and are looking for an experienced Automation & Systems Architect to design, implement, and maintain the internal systems that will power our business. This is not a basic Zapier or Make automation role. We''re looking for someone who can design an interconnected operating system, implement the technical infrastructure, anticipate dependencies, and create scalable, well-documented workflows. You''ll work directly with the founder and collaborate with our technical and operational teams. Our Technology Stack ClickUp — Project management and asynchronous execution Make.com — Workflow orchestration and integrations Airtable — Operational databases and marketplace intelligence Pipedrive — CRM and partnership management OpenAI API — AI-powered workflow intelligence BigQuery — Data warehousing Sigma and Amplitude — Analytics and reporting Google Workspace and Slack — Documentation and communication Milestone 1: Internal Operating System Architecture Our first priority is establishing a connected, reliable internal operating system. Responsibilities include: Audit existing tools, workflows, and architecture documentation. Design and configure ClickUp for cross-functional team execution, including task structures, custom fields, automations, dependencies, and escalation workflows. Architect Make.com integrations between ClickUp, Airtable, Pipedrive, Google Workspace, and Slack. Establish consistent data models, record identifiers, and source-of-truth rules. Automate operational handoffs between business functions. Implement error handling, monitoring, logging, and recovery processes. Create scalable foundations for AI-powered knowledge retrieval and operational intelligence. Document system architecture, automation scenarios, SOPs, and maintenance procedures. Expected outcome: A functional, integrated operating infrastructure that minimizes manual coordination and supports a growing remote-first team. Milestone 2: AI-Powered Marketplace Sourcing & Outreach Following the internal systems implementation, you''ll help build the automation infrastructure supporting ZEAL''s marketplace. This includes: Creator and local ambassador discovery, enrichment, and scoring. Tour operator and experience vendor sourcing. Accommodation partner discovery and qualification. AI-assisted research and review intelligence. Airtable data pipelines, deduplication, and quality assurance. Automated qualification and outreach preparation. Personalized messaging workflows and CRM synchronization. Performance tracking and optimization. We have already developed detailed workflows, data structures, AI agent specifications, scoring frameworks, and implementation blueprints for these systems. Your responsibility will be to validate the architecture, identify improvements, and implement production-ready workflows. Required Qualifications Advanced Make.com experience, including routers, webhooks, APIs, data transformation, and error handling. Advanced Airtable experience, including relational database architecture. Strong ClickUp implementation experience. Experience integrating multiple business applications into one operational ecosystem. OpenAI API and structured AI workflow experience. Understanding of data integrity, idempotency, monitoring, and system reliability. Ability to write clear technical documentation. Strong asynchronous communication and independent problem-solving. Preferred Qualifications Experience with Pipedrive or similar CRMs. BigQuery, SQL, and business intelligence integrations. AI agents, RAG, and knowledge retrieval systems. Marketplace, travel-tech, SaaS, or platform business experience. Experience supporting remote-first startups. What Success Looks Like We want someone who can simplify complexity rather than add to it. The right candidate will be able to explain why a system should be designed a certain way, identify potential failures before they occur, and create infrastructure that another developer can maintain. We value architectural judgment, execution quality, and ownership more than certifications alone. Engagement Structure We anticipate beginning with a paid architecture assessment, followed by milestone-based implementation. The initial engagement will focus on internal operations, with additional phases covering marketplace automation and ongoing optimization. How to Apply Please include: A description of the most complex multi-platform operating system you''ve personally architected and implemented. A Loom video (3–5 minutes preferred) walking through a real system you''ve built, including its architecture and integrations. Your experience with Make, Airtable, ClickUp, APIs, and OpenAI. An example of how you''ve handled automation failures, duplicate records, or data synchronization issues. Your hourly rate, availability, and preferred engagement structure. Applications consisting only of generic AI-generated proposals or lists of tools will not be prioritized. We are seeking an experienced systems architect who can also execute—not someone learning these platforms on the job.', 1, 'HOURLY', 775000.00, 2583000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('dffb921e-eb95-5080-b7d4-cd0fed7034ee', '24f753b6-7f22-5cab-8a1d-5550bdff3ae3', 'Coletores de dados para IA: grave seu trabalho em ofícios e comércios', 'Procuramos pessoas em países selecionados para gravar vídeos de si mesmas enquanto realizam o seu trabalho. Você vai usar o celular em um suporte de cabeça e gravar do seu próprio ponto de vista enquanto realiza tarefas reais. Os vídeos serão usados para treinar sistemas de inteligência artificial e de robótica. Não é necessária experiência com gravação. Procuramos pessoas que saibam seguir instruções e estejam dispostas a se gravar fazendo o trabalho de verdade. Escopo e pagamento Este é um contrato de preço fixo para 25 horas aprovadas de vídeo. O pagamento é dividido em 5 etapas de 5 horas cada, e cada etapa é liberada depois que os seus vídeos passarem pela revisão. Os colaboradores que fizerem um bom trabalho poderão receber mais horas quando este contrato terminar. Suporte de cabeça Você vai precisar de um suporte de cabeça para o seu celular. Antes de comprar, envie para nós o link do produto para que possamos aprová-lo, e guarde o seu comprovante de compra. Vamos reembolsar o valor total do suporte quando você completar 20 horas aprovadas. O reembolso será pago como bônus antes do encerramento do contrato. Quem procuramos Procuramos pessoas que possam realizar algumas destas tarefas no seu trabalho: - Espaços de eventos: montagem e desmontagem de palcos, organização de cabos, equipamentos de som - Lojas e supermercados: reposição de prateleiras, etiquetagem de preços, recolhimento de carrinhos, recebimento de mercadorias - Obras de construção: drywall, pintura, alvenaria, assentamento de azulejos, telhados, limpeza - Fazendas, jardins e estufas: colheita, plantio, coleta de ovos, alimentação de animais, irrigação - Salões de beleza e spas: cabelo, unhas, banho e tosa de animais - Hidráulica, ar condicionado e elétrica: instalação de torneiras e vasos sanitários, manutenção de aparelhos de ar condicionado, montagem de tubulações, instalação de tomadas e luminárias - Hotéis: limpeza de quartos, limpeza pesada de banheiros, lavanderia, transporte de bagagens - Oficinas mecânicas e lava-rápidos: troca de óleo, serviços de pneus, estética automotiva, conserto de motos - Marcenarias e oficinas de madeira: montagem de móveis, lixamento, acabamento, instalação de ferragens - Restaurantes e cozinhas industriais: preparo de alimentos, cozinha de linha, lavagem de louça, panificação, decoração de bolos - Limpeza comercial: banheiros, pisos, janelas, carpetes, lavanderia industrial - Fábricas de alimentos, armazéns e indústrias: embalagem, separação de pedidos, carregamento de paletes, operação de máquinas, solda Conhece alguém que possa se qualificar? Vamos conversar! Requisitos Você precisa ter um destes celulares: - iPhone 12 ou mais recente (o iPhone 16e e o 17e não são aceitos) - Google Pixel 6, 7, 8 ou 9 (incluindo os modelos Pro) - Samsung Galaxy S21, S22, S23 ou S24 (qualquer modelo) Nenhum outro celular é aceito. O seu celular deve ficar em um suporte de cabeça na altura da testa ou dos olhos, inclinado para baixo, para que as suas mãos e dedos apareçam o tempo todo. A sua área de trabalho deve estar bem iluminada. O que esperamos - O trabalho deve ser real e ter um propósito. Varra um piso que esteja realmente sujo. Não limpe uma bancada que já está limpa nem repita tarefas só para a câmera. - Cada vídeo deve ser gravado do seu próprio ponto de vista. Vídeos de outras pessoas, gravações de uma tela ou material reutilizado serão rejeitados e não serão pagos. - Varie as suas tarefas, os objetos com que você trabalha e os seus locais de uma sessão para outra. - Selecione a etiqueta de tarefa correta antes de começar cada gravação. -----------------------------------(English)-------------------------------------------------------------------- Summary We are hiring people in selected countries to record videos of themselves doing their job. You will wear your smartphone on a head mount and record from your own point of view while you complete real tasks. The videos will be used to train AI and robotics systems. No filming experience is needed. We want people who can follow instructions and are willing to record themselves doing the work for real. Scope and Pay This is a fixed price contract for 25 approved hours of video. Payment is split into 5 milestones of 5 hours each, and each milestone is released after your videos pass review. Contributors who do good work may be offered more hours after this contract ends. Head Mount You will need a head mount for your phone. Before you buy one, please send us the product link so we can approve it, and keep your receipt. We will reimburse the full cost of the mount after you complete 20 approved hours. The reimbursement will be paid as a bonus before the contract closes. Who We Are Looking For We want people who can complete some of these tasks at their work: - Event venues: stage setup and teardown, cable management, sound equipment - Retail and grocery stores: restocking shelves, price tagging, collecting carts, receiving stock - Construction sites: drywall, painting, masonry, tiling, roofing, cleanup - Farms, gardens, and greenhouses: picking, planting, collecting eggs, feeding animals, irrigation - Salons and spas: hair, nails, pet grooming - Plumbing, air conditioning, and electrical work: installing faucets and toilets, servicing AC units, fitting pipes, wiring outlets and lights - Hotels: cleaning rooms, deep cleaning bathrooms, laundry, moving luggage - Auto shops and car washes: oil changes, tire service, detailing, motorcycle repair - Carpentry and woodworking shops: furniture assembly, sanding, finishing, installing hardware - Restaurants and commercial kitchens: food prep, line cooking, dishwashing, baking, cake decorating - Commercial cleaning: restrooms, floors, windows, carpets, industrial laundry - Food factories, warehouses, and manufacturing plants: packing, order picking, loading pallets, running machines, welding Do you know someone who may qualify? Let''s talk! Requirements You must have one of these phones: - iPhone 12 or newer (the iPhone 16e and 17e are not accepted) - Google Pixel 6, 7, 8, or 9 (including Pro models) - Samsung Galaxy S21, S22, S23, or S24 (any model) No other phones are accepted. Your phone must be worn on a head mount at forehead or eye level and tilted down so your hands and fingers are always in view. Your work area must be well lit. What We Expect - The work must be real and have a purpose. Sweep a floor that is actually dirty. Do not wipe a counter that is already clean or repeat tasks just for the camera. - Every video must be recorded from your own point of view. Videos of other people, recordings of a screen, or reused footage will be rejected and will not be paid. - Please vary your tasks, the objects you work with, and your locations from one session to the next. - Select the correct task label before you start each recording.', 1, 'FIXED', 2893000.00, 2893000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('33ae0bf1-170a-5cb2-8abc-223f2eca4b36', 'b5257d4e-8316-5bd4-a47e-126f8b8a3aaf', 'Senior AI Engineer', 'PokerDen is hiring an AI engineer to design, build and ship the game''s first AI features, and to run them reliably in production. PokerDen is a social Texas Hold''em game: players create an account, take a seat and play with friends in real time. It uses play chips only, with no real-money betting. The working MVP has a full Hold''em engine, real-time tables over Socket.io, and player accounts with chip balances saved in MongoDB. It has no AI features yet. You''ll be the person who decides how AI fits into the game and gets it into players'' hands - What you’ll do You''ll own PokerDen''s AI work from prototype to production. In your first months, that means: 1. Build AI opponents. Create poker bots at several skill levels so players always find a game, even at quiet tables. Bots are always clearly labelled as bots, and they see only what a human player in their seat would see. 2. Protect fair play. Detect collusion, chip dumping, multi-accounting and players using bots or outside help, using game history and behaviour signals. Flag cases for review instead of banning automatically. 3. Moderate chat. Filter abuse, spam and personal information in lobby and table chat, with low enough delay that conversation still feels live. 4. Add a hand review assistant. After a hand ends, players can ask an LLM to explain what happened and what they might have done differently. It never gives advice during a live hand. 5. Make it production-ready. Each feature ships with evaluation sets, monitoring, cost and latency budgets, fallbacks for when a model or provider fails, and a way to roll changes back You''ll work with the full-stack engineer, who owns the game server, and directly with the project owner on what to build next. What you bring - 4+ years in software engineering, with 2+ years shipping machine learning or LLM features that real users rely on - Strong Python, and enough TypeScript or JavaScript to work on our Node.js game server - Hands-on experience building with LLM APIs: prompt design, tool use, structured outputs, and evaluating model quality - Experience taking AI features to production: serving, monitoring, cost control, and handling model failures safely - Solid machine learning basics: classification, anomaly detection, and choosing the right metrics for imbalanced data - A habit of measuring: you build test sets before you tune, and you can show whether a change made things better - Good judgement about player trust and privacy: what data to use, what to log, and when a person should make the final call - Clear written English for async work', 1, 'HOURLY', 1808000.00, 2583000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('63d22136-3c3b-522f-a385-2d5c4b978656', 'b9bc0a63-82c8-5de6-bcf1-c987ea4a8e3f', 'Senior Data Engineer', 'PokerDen is hiring a data engineer to build the game''s data foundation: recording every hand, tracking how players use the game, and supplying clean data to our AI work. PokerDen is a social Texas Hold''em game: players create an account, take a seat and play with friends in real time. It uses play chips only, with no real-money betting. The working MVP has a full Hold''em engine, real-time tables over Socket.io, and player accounts with chip balances saved in MongoDB. Hands are played out on the server, but their history is not saved yet, and there is no analytics or data pipeline. You''ll build that from the start. What you’ll do You''ll own PokerDen''s data from the moment it is created to the moment someone uses it. In your first months, that means: 1. Record every hand. Design and build hand history storage: every deal, action, pot and result, linked to the players and table, in a format that is easy to query and replay. 2. Track how the game is used. Set up event tracking for sign-ups, sessions, table joins, chip top-ups and churn, and build the dashboards the team uses to decide what to build next. 3. Watch the chip economy. Report how chips enter and leave the game, and alert the team when balances move in ways that suggest a bug or cheating. 4. Feed the AI work. Give the AI engineer reliable, well-documented datasets for training poker bots, detecting unfair play and evaluating models. 5. Make it production-ready. Pipelines ship with tests, data quality checks, monitoring, backups and clear ownership, and they don''t slow down live games. 6. Protect player data. Keep personal information separate and access-controlled, set retention rules, and support data export and deletion requests. You''ll work with the full-stack engineer, who owns the game server, the AI engineer, who uses the data, and directly with the project owner on priorities.', 1, 'HOURLY', 2067000.00, 2583000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('ddcfc287-1c90-533e-aa75-c83ae54131a4', '5dd8da37-44e0-54c7-9537-6b03cd3cf13e', 'Web Developer needed', 'Websites are already set up and functioning with the payment gateways I just need someone to attach the pdf document to each or 9 training courses for download, make sure payment gateways which is clover are working efficiently for all 5 websites most of them are already but just want to be sure. Some web links content pages on a few sites keep changing back to the sign up page for some reason this needs to be fixed. There are also some edits like correcting misspellings and replacing background photos on a few web pages. This project is 85% completed I just need someone to do a few fixes to finalize everything to go live', 1, 'FIXED', 3229000.00, 3229000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('5a8f09ef-d992-5dba-bf56-65a8af18507b', '72ad14ec-c250-57e0-8de0-0f0a05a9a849', 'Senior Software Engineer – AI & Data Platforms (Native English)', 'Senior Software Engineer – AI & Data Platforms Location: Remote Experience Level: Senior (6+ years) Project Type: Part-time Contract Language Requirement: Native-level English About the Role We’re seeking an experienced Senior Software Engineer specializing in AI platforms, data engineering, and machine learning infrastructure. You’ll architect and build enterprise-scale systems that power intelligent applications, focusing on production-grade AI solutions and cloud-native data platforms. Key Responsibilities Design and implement enterprise AI platforms supporting LLM integration, RAG architectures, and generative AI applications Architect scalable data platforms for ingesting, processing, and serving large volumes of data (millions of records/month) Build production ML platforms including model training pipelines, deployment automation, monitoring, and governance Develop secure REST APIs and microservices using Python, Java, or TypeScript Implement CI/CD automation, containerization, and infrastructure-as-code solutions Optimize distributed data processing pipelines and improve system performance Collaborate with data scientists, product managers, and cross-functional teams to deliver production-grade solutions Required Skills & Experience Core Technologies: Languages: Python, Java, or TypeScript/JavaScript AI/ML: Generative AI, LLMs, RAG, prompt engineering, model deployment Data Engineering: Spark, Kafka, ETL/ELT pipelines, SQL Cloud Platforms: AWS or Azure (or both) DevOps & Infrastructure: Docker, Kubernetes, Terraform, CI/CD pipelines Databases: PostgreSQL, MongoDB, Snowflake, Databricks, or similar Communication & Experience: Fluent, native-level English (verbal and written) – ability to communicate clearly in meetings, documentation, and code reviews 9+ years of software engineering experience Proven track record shipping production AI/ML systems Strong understanding of system design and scalability Experience building cloud-native applications Ability to work independently and communicate effectively in a remote setting Nice-to-Have: Experience with LLM platforms (OpenAI, Azure OpenAI, Llama, LangChain, LlamaIndex) Vector databases and semantic search implementations MLOps and ML platform development Healthcare, fintech, or enterprise software experience Kubernetes orchestration at scale Microservices and distributed systems architecture What We’re Looking For Excellent communication and collaboration skills Problem-solving mindset with attention to detail Proactive in asking clarifying questions and providing updates Ability to mentor junior engineers Experience working in agile/fast-paced teams Deliverables Well-architected, production-ready code Automated testing and CI/CD pipelines Documentation and knowledge sharing Regular progress updates and collaboration', 1, 'HOURLY', 775000.00, 1550000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('29bf91dc-5220-521e-9fed-c6034ce3d091', 'acaea9f7-6582-5f57-952d-6cdb0bce2bd2', 'تطوير منظومة إدارة وتشغيل ذكية متعددة الوكلاء (Multi-Agent AI System) مع لوحة تحكم ويب احترافية', 'وصف المشروع نبحث عن مهندس برمجيات متخصص في AI Agents وMulti-Agent Orchestration لتنفيذ مشروع WAZEFNI AI OPERATIONS، وهو نظام برمجي جديد بالكامل لإدارة وتشغيل فريق من وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي تحت إشراف مدير عام ذكي، مع لوحة تحكم ويب عربية احترافية. المطلوب ليس إنشاء Chatbots مستقلة أو لوحة تحكم شكلية، بل منظومة تشغيل حقيقية تستطيع توزيع المهام وتنفيذها ومراجعتها ونقل المخرجات بين الوكلاء تلقائياً، مع حفظ المحادثات والقرارات واستمرارية العمل بعد الانقطاع. يبدأ المشروع بفريق محدود لاختبار المحرك، مع بنية قابلة للتوسع إلى أكثر من 20 وكيلاً، وإمكانية إدارة الوكلاء والأقسام والمهارات والصلاحيات ومسارات العمل بالكامل من لوحة التحكم دون تعديل الكود البرمجي. أولاً — المتطلبات الأساسية 1. محرك الوكلاء والإدارة العامة مدير عام AI يستقبل الأهداف ويحوّلها إلى خطط ومهام. توزيع المهام تلقائياً على الوكلاء المتخصصين. دعم التنفيذ المتسلسل والمتوازي والاعتماديات. انتقال المخرجات والنتائج بين الوكلاء دون تدخل يدوي. مراجعة الجودة وإعادة الأعمال غير المطابقة للتصحيح. تشغيل مستمر 24/7 عند وجود مهام. إمكانية إضافة وإيقاف وإعادة تفعيل الوكلاء من لوحة التحكم. 2. المحادثات الدائمة والمراقبة المباشرة محادثة مستقلة ودائمة لكل وكيل. حفظ كامل للرسائل والتوجيهات والقرارات والمخرجات. مشاهدة خطوات التنفيذ واستدعاءات الأدوات لحظياً. إمكانية إرسال توجيه أثناء تنفيذ المهمة والتأثير على الخطوات التالية. إيقاف المهام واستئنافها وإبلاغ المدير العام بالتغييرات. استعادة المحادثات وسياق العمل بعد إعادة تشغيل النظام. 3. لوحة تحكم ويب عربية لوحة تحكم احترافية باستخدام React أو Next.js أو تقنية مناسبة، تدعم العربية واتجاه RTL. تشمل إدارة الوكلاء والأقسام والمحادثات والمهام والاعتمادات والملفات والتكاملات والإعلانات والتقارير والإشعارات والتكاليف والمستخدمين والصلاحيات. شرط أساسي: يستطيع المستخدم إنشاء الوكلاء وتعديل أسمائهم وتعليماتهم ومهاراتهم ومعرفتهم وصلاحياتهم وإيقافهم وأرشفتهم من الواجهة، دون الرجوع للمبرمج. 4. محرر سير العمل المرئي (Visual Workflow Builder) إنشاء وتعديل مسارات العمل بالسحب والإفلات دون برمجة. تحديد الوكلاء والأدوات والاعتماديات وشروط الانتقال. دعم التفرعات والتنفيذ المتوازي والموافقات وإعادة المحاولة. إمكانية طلب إنشاء Workflow من المدير العام عبر المحادثة. اختبار المسارات وحفظ إصداراتها قبل التفعيل. تنفيذ المسارات فعلياً بواسطة المحرك، وليس عرضها بصرياً فقط. 5. الذاكرة والاستمرارية قاعدة بيانات دائمة لحفظ المهام والمحادثات والقرارات والأحداث. ذاكرة مشتركة للمشروع ومعرفة متخصصة لكل وكيل. Checkpoints واستئناف التنفيذ بعد الأعطال. Task Queue وإدارة إعادة المحاولة. منع تكرار العمليات الحساسة عند انقطاع الاتصال. سجل تدقيق كامل للعمليات والتغييرات. نسخ احتياطية وآلية استعادة موثوقة. 6. التكاملات والأدوات إنشاء طبقة تكاملات قابلة للتوسع، تشمل دراسة وربط الوظائف المتاحة رسمياً في: Google Drive وSheets وDocs. Figma. ElevenLabs. Higgsfield. Gemini / Veo. HeyGen. أدوات التحليل مثل vidIQ وYouTube Analytics. منصات الإعلانات Meta وGoogle وYouTube وTikTok وSnapchat وLinkedIn. يجب تقديم مصفوفة توضّح لكل خدمة الوظائف الممكنة فعلياً، والصلاحيات والقيود والتكاليف، مع تحديد التكاملات التي ستُنفذ وتُختبر ضمن السعر. Google Drive هو المرجع الرسمي لأصول الإنتاج. يستخدم الوكلاء الملفات المعتمدة، ولا تُضاف أصول جديدة إلى المكتبة الرسمية أو تُنقل أو تُحذف دون موافقة. 7. إدارة الحملات الإعلانية إنشاء خطط ومسودات الحملات. إدارة الأهداف والجمهور والميزانيات. متابعة النتائج وتحليل الأداء. اقتراح وتنفيذ التحسينات ضمن الحدود المعتمدة. تقارير الحملات عبر المنصات المدعومة. منع إطلاق الحملات أو تجاوز سقف الإنفاق دون موافقة صريحة. 8. الأمان والصلاحيات صلاحيات مستقلة لكل وكيل وموظف. إدارة المستخدمين والأدوار من لوحة التحكم. حفظ مفاتيح API بصورة آمنة. بوابات اعتماد للعمليات الحساسة. مراقبة الاستهلاك والتكاليف وحدود الإنفاق. سجل تدقيق وإيقاف طارئ للعمليات. ثانياً — التقنيات المقترحة نرحب بالمعمارية المناسبة من المطور، مع تفضيل التقنيات التالية عند ملاءمتها: Claude API / Claude Agent SDK. LangGraph. Python / FastAPI أو Node.js / TypeScript. PostgreSQL. Redis مع Celery أو BullMQ. Next.js / React. WebSocket أو SSE. Docker. يمكن اقتراح بدائل تقنية بشرط توضيح أسباب الاختيار وضمان الاستقرار وقابلية التوسع. ثالثاً — مثال عملي مطلوب نفترض أننا طلبنا من المدير العام: «نريد زيادة تسجيل أصحاب العمل في نينوى خلال الشهر القادم». المطلوب أن يستطيع النظام تلقائياً: تحويل الهدف إلى خطة ومهام. تكليف وكيل الاستراتيجية بتحديد الجمهور والرسائل. تكليف كاتب المحتوى بإعداد النصوص. تكليف وكلاء الإنتاج بتجهيز المواد الإعلانية. مراجعة المخرجات وإعادتها للتعديل عند الحاجة. تجهيز الحملات الإعلانية ورفعها للاعتماد. تنفيذ الإجراءات المصرح بها ومتابعة النتائج. إعداد تقرير للإدارة عن الأداء والتوصيات. يجب أن تظهر هذه الأعمال داخل محادثات الوكلاء ولوحة التحكم، مع إمكانية التدخل أثناء التنفيذ، دون نقل المعلومات يدوياً بين الوكلاء. رابعاً — مراحل التنفيذ والتسليم المرحلة 1: التحليل والمعمارية دراسة المتطلبات، وتصميم قاعدة البيانات، ومحرك الوكلاء، والصلاحيات، وخريطة التكاملات وخطة التنفيذ. المرحلة 2: تأسيس المحرك تشغيل المدير العام ووكيلين متخصصين، مع تفويض المهام وعودة النتائج وحفظ الحالة والاستئناف. المرحلة 3: لوحة التحكم والمحادثات تنفيذ لوحة الويب والمحادثات الدائمة والمراقبة المباشرة والتوجيهات والاعتمادات. المرحلة 4: الإدارة دون برمجة إنشاء الوكلاء وإدارة المهارات والصلاحيات ومحرر Workflows من الواجهة. المرحلة 5: التكاملات والتشغيل ربط الخدمات ذات الأولوية وإدارة الأصول والحملات الإعلانية واختبارها. المرحلة 6: الاختبارات والإطلاق اختبارات الأمان والاستمرارية والأداء والتعافي من الأعطال، ثم النشر والتوثيق والتسليم. لا ننتقل إلى مرحلة جديدة إلا بعد اختبار المرحلة السابقة واعتمادها. خامساً — شروط التسليم تسليم الكود المصدري الكامل للواجهة والخادم ومحرك الوكلاء. التسليم على استضافة وحسابات نملكها. تسليم قاعدة البيانات والتوثيق ودليل التشغيل والصيانة. تقديم اختبارات فعلية لكل مرحلة، وليس مجرد فيديو أو واجهات تجريبية. تحديد مدة الضمان والدعم الفني المجاني بعد التسليم. توضيح التكاليف الشهرية المتوقعة للخوادم وClaude API والخدمات الأخرى. عدم وجود رسوم تطوير شهرية إلزامية بعد الاستلام. قابلية التوسع وإضافة الوكلاء دون إعادة بناء النظام. ستُرفق وثيقة تقنية تفصيلية بالمشروع، ويُطلب من المتقدم مراجعتها بالكامل قبل تقديم عرضه. سادساً — المطلوب من المتقدم نبحث عن مطور لديه خبرة فعلية في بناء أنظمة Multi-Agent، وليس مجرد معرفة نظرية بالأدوات. يرجى تقديم عرض مالي شامل، ومدة تنفيذ واقعية، وتقسيم واضح للمراحل والمخرجات، مع توضيح أي وظائف أو تكاملات لا يمكن تنفيذها وفق المتطلبات. نفضّل العروض التي تتضمن أدلة عملية على مشاريع مشابهة، مع الاستعداد لتقديم فيديو مسجل عبر مستقل يوضح النظام أثناء العمل. سابعاً — آلية الإشراف والاختبار والاستلام النهائي تنويه مهم لجميع المتقدمين: لدينا فريق برمجي متخصص سيتولى التواصل المباشر مع المطور، ومتابعة التنفيذ، ومراجعة الكود المصدري والبنية التقنية، والإشراف على استلام المشروع بالكامل. كما يتوفر فريق مستقل للاختبار وضمان الجودة (QA)، مسؤول عن فحص كل مرحلة واختبار وظائفها عملياً، والتحقق من مطابقتها للمتطلبات الفنية والتشغيلية. شروط الاعتماد والاستلام: تخضع كل مرحلة لاختبارات فنية وتشغيلية شاملة، ولا يُسمح بالانتقال إلى المرحلة التالية إلا بعد اجتياز الاختبارات والحصول على اعتماد رسمي. يلتزم المطور بمعالجة جميع الأخطاء والملاحظات المتعلقة بالمتطلبات المتفق عليها قبل اعتماد المرحلة. بعد اكتمال جميع المراحل، يُجرى اختبار نهائي شامل (Final Acceptance Testing) للمنظومة بالكامل، يشمل التكامل بين الوكلاء، والأمان، والأداء، والاستمرارية، والتعافي من الأعطال. لا يُعتبر المشروع مستلماً بصورة نهائية إلا بعد نجاح الاختبارات، واعتماد الفريق المختص، وتسليم الكود المصدري وجميع الملفات والتوثيقات والصلاحيات المتفق عليها. نؤكد أن معيار الاستلام هو نجاح التشغيل الفعلي ومطابقة جميع المتطلبات، وليس مجرد اكتمال البرمجة أو عرض واجهات النظام. لذلك نرجو تقديم عروض واقعية من مطورين قادرين على تنفيذ المشروع وفق هذه الآلية، والالتزام بالمراجعة والاختبار والتسليم الاحترافي. حدد السعر النهائي للمشروع بالكامل، والمدة الإجمالية، وتقسيم التكلفة والمدة على مراحل، والتكاملات المشمولة فعلياً، ومدة الضمان والدعم الفني المجاني. نرجو عدم تقديم سعر تجريبي منخفض للمرحلة الأولى فقط دون توضيح التكلفة الكاملة المتوقعة.', 1, 'FIXED', 19374000.00, 19374000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('5b8cbf0f-0f40-59ee-838a-55873590adb3', '487951e8-0be3-5ce8-93a0-d9bf5daf076d', 'Claude Code Expert - We Build Together Over Zoom', 'I''m looking for an expert with claude code to sit with me and build out: Automated content systems for my business Help me develop a new software Bring whatever I want to build to life You must be an absolute expert and know how to bring it all to life. Connect everything together and have it live. I''d also like to build a "Jarvis" type dashboard that is everything all in one that I can talk to. Ultimately what I envision is a massive automated content system that is connected to multiple different Instagram accounts and social media platforms that is creating content and selling various digital products in different niches on autopilot from the content that''s created. We sit and do it together over zoom, you tell me what to do it, help me trouble shoot, answer all my questions, help me learn and figure everything out along the way. We will sit down for several hours at a time, monday through Friday. Looking to build an awesome long term relationship with many projects available together. Please submit examples of your work in this space to be considered. Must be available from 9am to 5pm Central standard time, USA. Thank you!', 1, 'HOURLY', 387000.00, 1292000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('e76d53ac-f6e4-5f75-ad4c-3470e6744adc', 'ec1bbf70-830f-56f4-950a-745b87d8f060', 'AI Specialist and Web Builder', 'Looking for a full-time AI specialist with flawless English to rapidly build websites using AI tools and manage ongoing digital operations on a monthly retainer.', 1, 'HOURLY', 129000.00, 258000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('aec36afe-c897-5a2f-8efd-420db12a14c2', '8a49836e-cbd4-50de-bdb0-1dab3def95d5', 'I need help pushing code to github and connecting godaddy DNS to Netlify', 'I need this task done by this week. There will be more tasks to accomplish before my Art Basel meeting on December 6th', 1, 'HOURLY', 387000.00, 646000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('ec854b0c-21ca-557e-9eb0-8637304e015a', '79d9952c-6982-5c73-9008-6a99a812eb73', 'AI Prompt Engineer: Claude Code Operator (Hourly, 20+ hrs/wk)', 'PathFinder CRO is an AI RevOps platform that audits and builds inside companies’ HubSpot and Salesforce portals. We build with Claude Code every day, and we need a disciplined prompt engineer to run that work at volume and prove every result. What you’ll do Take scoped tasks from our ClickUp build list and run them in Claude Code against our codebase (React/TypeScript, Supabase) Write and refine prompts, steer the agent mid-run, and stop it when it drifts off-scope or invents an answer Verify every output against the task’s Definition of Done: run the tests, check the UI, and capture Playwright screenshots as evidence Open clean Draft PRs that say what changed, how you verified it, what’s still open, and which prompts you used Flag blockers early and clearly instead of guessing You’re a fit if you Have used Claude Code (or a similar agentic coding tool) on real projects, and can show us Can read TypeScript well enough to tell when the AI is confidently wrong Treat “done” as proven, not assumed Write short, clear status updates Can overlap at least 4 hours a day with US Eastern time Nice to have: HubSpot or Salesforce API/OAuth experience, Lovable, Make or n8n, RevOps exposure. How we work You work on a branch and open Draft PRs. Every PR is reviewed by our founder before it merges, and you never merge, deploy or publish. You never use production data or secrets. Engagement The role starts at 20 hrs/week, hourly, tracked through Upwork. We expect to scale to 30–40 hrs/week quickly for the right person, and we may add more operators. Shortlisted candidates complete a 3-hour paid trial on a real backlog ticket. You fix a bug in Claude Code, prove it works with screenshots and a test, and hand us a PR we can review in 10 minutes. To apply, start your proposal with the word “Pathfinder.” Then tell us about one time an AI coding tool got something wrong and how you caught it.', 1, 'HOURLY', 258000.00, 1550000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('05b07af4-70f0-57b8-9315-dbc4ba91eec8', '237a737a-135d-5636-b0cd-0074b56629e5', 'AI Football Player Tracking & Performance Analysis Model', 'Development of a computer-vision AI model for football match video analysis, focused on tracking a single selected player and extracting performance metrics. Scope of work: - Player detection model (YOLO) trained/fine-tuned on football broadcast footage - Multi-object tracking (ByteTrack) with single-player lock-on and ID-switch handling - Two-stage processing: fast preview for player selection, then full GPU analysis - Pitch calibration to convert video coordinates into real-world positions - Metrics extraction: distance covered, speed, sprints, activity levels (standing to sprinting), positional heatmap and zone occupancy - Structured JSON output ready to feed reporting and AI-generated analysis - GPU inference pipeline (serverless) with testing and accuracy tuning This contract covers the AI model and analysis pipeline only. The web platform, user interface and report design are not included.', 1, 'FIXED', 108494000.00, 108494000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('3b336ed1-e343-5a0b-b65e-f5aebbf72fdf', '307d011e-6f30-56cf-8c28-64b29bdadf0a', 'Paid Platform Testers Needed – Employment Screening System | Ethur.ai- 10 Min Job', 'Summary Ethur.ai is developing an innovative employment screening platform designed to make the screening process faster, more efficient, and user-friendly. We are looking for U.S.-based individuals to help us test our platform and ensure that our backend screening technology is functioning accurately and reliably. **What You''ll Be Doing** As a platform tester, you will complete a real-world screening workflow through Ethur.ai, just as an applicant would during an employment screening process. This will take about five minutes to complete. All information will be deleted after the platform is tested. All sensitive information must be entered only through Ethur.ai''s secure screening platform, never through Upwork messages or email. This involves: - Creating a test applicant profile on our platform. - Entering your real personal information, including your full name, U.S. residential address, Social Security Number (SSN), and other details required to complete the screening. - Completing the screening process so our team can evaluate the functionality, accuracy, and performance of our backend systems. - Reporting any technical issues, errors, or difficulties encountered during the process. - Providing brief feedback on your overall experience. **Important Information** - **No credit check will be performed**, and participation will not affect your credit score. - This is strictly a platform testing and quality assurance project, not an employment application. - Your information will be processed through our screening system for testing purposes. - You will be informed about the screening process and required personal information before participating. **Who We''re Looking For** - Individuals based in the United States with a valid SSN and U.S. residential address. - People comfortable completing an identity-based employment screening workflow. - Detail-oriented individuals who can provide clear, honest feedback. - No technical experience or specialized qualifications required. **Project Details** This is a straightforward, short-term testing opportunity. Our primary objective is to validate that the Ethur.ai screening platform and its backend integrations work correctly using real applicant information. Your participation will directly contribute to improving the reliability and user experience of our platform. **Interested?** Apply to participate in testing Ethur.ai and help us build a better employment screening experience.', 1, 'FIXED', 1292000.00, 1292000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('7e786280-ba8d-5434-903c-18ea800444dc', 'f778e002-0a99-5aac-8f8b-1a7468c64334', 'Learnworlds Platform Expert Needed', 'We need an expert to update our Learnworlds website and course content. The work includes improving the site structure, updating course pages, adding more dieas to make courses better and making sure the overall experience is clear and easy to navigate. You should be comfortable working with Learnworlds and able to handle both website and course updates efficiently. Please share relevant experience and examples of similar projects.', 1, 'HOURLY', 387000.00, 904000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('814fbff2-e7f0-5447-aa4d-d967866efe7e', 'f734a51b-76b1-5949-8bdf-19857248e407', 'AI based solution for MSP', 'like to get AI based solution development for MSP for internal/ External clients and to automate processes', 1, 'FIXED', 2583000.00, 2583000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('f929e6d1-7806-5478-9fad-d9ffcbd46c89', 'e547d064-2ad1-5874-98c6-cdeb0b2f9a86', 'Cải thiện độ chính xác, latency, tối ưu mô hình nhận dạng, xử lý, chuyển đổi giọng nói', '- Xây dựng, tối ưu model ASR (việt hóa) - Xây dựng PoC khai thác công nghệ text-to-speech dựa trên kịch bản tham khảo Yêu cầu ứng viên - Có kinh nghiệm thực tế xây dựng AI/ML/LLM PoC hoặc prototype - Hiểu rõ sự khác nhau giữa PoC – MVP – Product Ưu tiên ứng viên từng làm: AI cho doanh nghiệp - Finetune open source models, having mindset about commercialized product - Có kinh nghiệm làm các dự án AI thực tế tương tự cho doanh nghiệp (đi kèm kết quả, giải pháp)', 1, 'FIXED', 1000000.00, 3000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('9b6879f6-626f-5a0e-9433-64cda3b037e3', 'fd16c9fc-ee10-5458-84a6-f0e94ed82ce3', 'Viết Plugin cho phần mềm sketchup ngôn ngữ Ruby có thể dùng Ai đề code', 'Mình cần viết plugin cho sketchup dùng ngôn ngữ ruby có chức năng tạo mộng liên kết, khấu đối tượng, khấu ngàm âm dương, bo cong cạnh, làm mịn đường cong . *Có bảng cài đặt thiết lập thông số. Có login bằng key. Bạn Có thể kết hợp dùng Ai để xử lý. Yêu cầu ứng viên (quan trọng) - Có kinh nghiệm SketchUp Ruby API (bắt buộc). Vui lòng gửi plugin đã làm / repo / video demo. - Nắm vững xử lý geometry: edges, faces, groups/components, transformations, intersections. - Có kinh nghiệm làm các thao tác tương tự: boolean/cutting, tạo joint/mộng/ngàm, fillet/smoothing là lợi thế lớn. - Biết tổ chức code, dễ bảo trì; đặt tên rõ ràng; có log/handling lỗi. - Chủ động đề xuất giải pháp kỹ thuật + giới hạn của SketchUp (solid/non-solid).', 1, 'FIXED', 500000.00, 1500000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('50422504-f5df-55db-9e23-056f5a6977b3', '69c02d66-a39e-5db1-9788-6359fe2c9f92', 'Tìm nhà đầu tư cho dự án TDataWorks', 'Tìm và hợp tác với nhà đầu tư có mong muốn Đầu tư trực tiếp vào lĩnh vực TDataWorks - Dự án dữ liệu và xu hướng công nghệ ở Việt Nam. Nhằm phục vụ: - Phân tích xu hướng công nghệ tại thị trường Việt Nam - Hỗ trợ doanh nghiệp ra quyết định dựa trên dữ liệu (data-driven) - Xây dựng các sản phẩm/dịch vụ xoay quanh Data, AI, Automation, Business Intelligence - Dự án hướng tới việc phát triển hệ sinh thái dữ liệu, có khả năng mở rộng sang nhiều ngành: marketing, thương mại điện tử, tuyển dụng – nhân sự, tài chính, giáo dục và SaaS. Ưu tiên: - Nhà đầu tư cá nhân (Angel Investor), quỹ nhỏ, hoặc doanh nhân công nghệ - Có kinh nghiệm trong các lĩnh vực: Data / AI / SaaS / Martech / HR Tech Startup công nghệ hoặc doanh nghiệp số - Có network tại thị trường Việt Nam hoặc Đông Nam Á', 1, 'FIXED', 1000000.00, 250000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('aef27c28-cf79-59d6-bf13-ce3662f20d81', 'c67c02ea-615c-5876-a391-754d0d4a7e94', 'AEO / GEO Specialist (AI Search & ChatGPT Optimization)', 'Project xây dựng Website (website trên Webflow) Website cần có AEO/GEO (tối ưu search trong AI - cụ thể là ChatGPT) - Phân tích website, nội dung hiện có dưới góc nhìn AEO/GEO (tối ưu cho AI trả lời, featured answers, entity-based search…) - Nghiên cứu cách AI/LLM (Google AI Overview, ChatGPT, Claude…) hiển thị và trích dẫn nội dung Cần tìm freelancer: có exp SEO đang chuyển qua làm AEO hoặc có epx 1-2 project làm AEO/GEO Ưu tiên: - Đã làm việc với website content lớn - Có tư duy cập nhật xu hướng SEO mới, AI-first SEO', 1, 'FIXED', 200000.00, 5000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('2e87263e-55bf-59ce-86b9-38abc5bb83f9', 'e33fedeb-d15b-5bcb-a852-749dd321211f', 'Tìm nhà đầu tư cho dự án TDataWorks - Mong muốn hợp tác lâu dài', 'Tìm và hợp tác với nhà đầu tư có mong muốn Đầu tư trực tiếp vào lĩnh vực TDataWorks - Dự án dữ liệu và xu hướng công nghệ ở Việt Nam. Nhằm phục vụ: - Phân tích xu hướng công nghệ tại thị trường Việt Nam - Hỗ trợ doanh nghiệp ra quyết định dựa trên dữ liệu (data-driven) - Xây dựng các sản phẩm/dịch vụ xoay quanh Data, AI, Automation, Business Intelligence - Dự án hướng tới việc phát triển hệ sinh thái dữ liệu, có khả năng mở rộng sang nhiều ngành: marketing, thương mại điện tử, tuyển dụng – nhân sự, tài chính, giáo dục và SaaS. Ưu tiên: - Nhà đầu tư cá nhân (Angel Investor), quỹ nhỏ, hoặc doanh nhân công nghệ - Có kinh nghiệm trong các lĩnh vực: Data / AI / SaaS / Martech / HR Tech Startup công nghệ hoặc doanh nghiệp số - Có network tại thị trường Việt Nam hoặc Đông Nam Á, định hướng mở rộng thị trường toàn cầu', 1, 'FIXED', 1000000.00, 250000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('066aa050-6c00-5423-a9fc-48061c3f1fd4', 'a14f0e90-6e46-5889-b57c-45437258da99', 'PHÁT TRIỂN AI CHUYÊN XỬ LÝ ẢNH', '1: Thu thập "Nguyên liệu" (Dataset) Đây là bước quan trọng nhất mà chỉ bạn (người am hiểu thị trường Mỹ) mới làm tốt được. AI học từ ví dụ, vì vậy bạn cần: Ảnh đầu vào: Các bộ ảnh gốc (3-5 tấm phơi sáng khác nhau cho một góc chụp). Ảnh đầu ra (Kết quả mong muốn): Những tấm ảnh HDR đã được editor tay nghề cao chỉnh sửa hoàn thiện theo đúng chuẩn Mỹ (trong trẻo, thấy rõ cửa sổ). Số lượng: Càng nhiều càng tốt, tối thiểu nên có khoảng 500-1000 bộ để AI bắt đầu "hiểu" được phong cách. 2: Lựa chọn "Nền tảng" (No-code hoặc Thuê ngoài) Vì không biết lập trình, bạn có hai lựa chọn: Cách A (Tự làm với No-code): Sử dụng các nền tảng như Lobe.ai (của Microsoft), Google Teachable Machine hoặc JTheta.ai. Bạn chỉ cần tải ảnh lên, "dán nhãn" và nền tảng sẽ tự huấn luyện model. Tuy nhiên, cách này thường chỉ mạnh về phân loại ảnh hơn là chỉnh sửa chi tiết. Cách B (Thuê chuyên gia - Khuyên dùng): Bạn thuê một lập trình viên Python chuyên về Computer Vision (Thị giác máy tính). Bạn cung cấp dữ liệu ở Bước 1 và yêu cầu họ huấn luyện các mô hình như GANs (Generative Adversarial Networks) – loại AI chuyên "vẽ" lại ảnh theo phong cách được học. 3: Huấn luyện AI (Training) Đây là giai đoạn AI "học bài". Nếu bạn thuê người làm, họ sẽ chạy dữ liệu của bạn qua các máy chủ mạnh (GPU). AI sẽ cố gắng biến ảnh gốc của bạn thành ảnh đẹp như ảnh mẫu. Ban đầu nó sẽ làm rất xấu, nhưng qua hàng ngàn lần thử sai (epochs), nó sẽ dần nhận ra quy luật: "À, vùng cửa sổ này phải lấy chi tiết từ tấm ảnh thiếu sáng nhất". 4: Kiểm tra và Tinh chỉnh (Testing & Feedback) Khi AI cho ra kết quả đầu tiên, bạn sẽ phải làm giám khảo: Nếu ảnh bị ám màu: Yêu cầu lập trình viên điều chỉnh hàm mất mát (Loss Function) về màu sắc. Nếu cửa sổ vẫn bị cháy sáng: Cung cấp thêm nhiều ví dụ về "Window Pull" cho AI học lại vùng đó. Lưu ý: AI trong bất động sản rất hay lỗi ở các đường thẳng (vertical lines). Bạn cần nhấn mạnh việc giữ thẳng cột nhà với bên phát triển.', 1, 'FIXED', 210000000.00, 250000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('8def304d-a9df-54b2-8b77-ec0456263a76', '8df768f5-a8bc-5500-afa3-288f9af0467f', 'Tối ưu tính năng chuyển đổi, tách giọng nói cho PoC đánh giá chất lượng cuộc gọi', '- Sử dụng, ứng dụng AI cho việc tự động hóa QA (Quality Assurance) và hợp phức hóa mindset đánh giá trong trung tâm cuộc gọi chăm sóc khách hàng - Finetune, cải thiện độ chính xác mô hình chuyển đổi giọng nói - Tối ưu pipeline, model tách giọng chuẩn xác nhất có thể so với thực tế đi kèm với các phương pháp trong pre-processing và post-processing - Phát triển tính năng nhận dạng cảm xúc, intent khách hàng qua giọng nói và đưa gợi ý điều chỉnh tốc độ, phản hồi phù hợp cho người gọi - Trao đổi scope dự án và tiềm năng phát triển (nếu có)', 1, 'FIXED', 3000000.00, 5000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('a2e632b7-9511-550e-bbb6-b805dcccbdde', '5186bfe5-0dc5-5707-9780-f16bf385509e', 'Phát triển ứng dụng AI cho doanh nghiệp', 'Chúng tôi cần tuyển Dev lập trình ứng dụng AI cho doanh nghiệp. Chi tiết sẽ được chia sẻ sau khi sơ tuyển.', 1, 'FIXED', 10000000.00, 30000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('436049ee-6d66-596f-b3e0-213fcd93a875', '109fff90-398d-5c0a-beeb-b04f08b5c4cb', 'Tạo khóa học về HTML/CSS/JS', 'Hiểu rõ mục tiêu dự án và đề xuất giải pháp phù hợp. Thiết kế website: dựng layout, thiết kế UI/UX, lập trình chức năng cơ bản. Đảm bảo sản phẩm đúng yêu cầu, sửa đổi theo phản hồi từ bạn.', 1, 'FIXED', 300000.00, 600000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('cd1c20f4-900d-54fc-9bc5-b93f5b70aab6', 'e070ff5b-c54d-5d98-abe5-376a08ab72c9', 'Cần freelancer setup email cho domain mới + ReachInbox.AI (long-term)', 'Tôi cần 1-2 freelancer chuyên setup email cho các domain mới mà tôi đã mua. Công việc bao gồm: Tạo 5 email addresses trên mỗi domain (.com) Thêm 5 email accounts vào ReachInbox.AI Kết nối và cấu hình đúng cách trong ReachInbox.AI Lưu ý quan trọng: Warmup sẽ do ReachInbox.AI tự động xử lý, freelancer không cần làm warmup. Chỉ làm cho các domain mới (không chạm vào domain cũ). Thanh toán một lần khi hoàn thành setup cho mỗi domain. Yêu cầu: Có kinh nghiệm setup domain và ReachInbox.AI Setup nhanh, sạch sẽ và chuyên nghiệp Ai có kinh nghiệm thì inbox ngay cho tôi kèm ví dụ công việc đã làm trước đây. Cảm ơn!', 1, 'FIXED', 550000.00, 700000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('5c18c16b-dcc9-5bfd-a48d-6fb86c54e57d', 'afbbd65b-db29-5bff-b1d6-5c50196e4ea1', 'Tạo AI tự động đăng ảnh lên Google Maps địa điểm đã chỉ định', 'Tạo AI tự động đăng ảnh lên Google Maps địa điểm đã chỉ định khi ảnh mới được thêm vào telegram Ưu tiên giải pháp: Sử dụng API chính thức, automation tool (n8n, Make, Zapier…) hoặc custom code; Có hướng dẫn bàn giao + tài liệu sử dụng cơ bản *Hiểu về cách hoạt động của Google Maps / Google Business Profile *Có khả năng đề xuất giải pháp tối ưu, đảm bảo tính ổn định và hạn chế rủi ro tài khoản *Biết xử lý ảnh cơ bản (tối ưu dung lượng, định dạng…) là một lợi thế *Ưu tiên ứng viên đã từng làm các hệ thống tự động hóa liên quan đến social/platform', 1, 'FIXED', 200000.00, 1000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('386c3c9a-248d-5ec5-8abc-eb83cd8a197a', 'fc56d4c2-bf1d-511c-ac43-01527c68b829', 'Sử dụng Camera AI quét và nhận biết chênh lệch độ cao đế giày', 'Cần tìm Developer có kinh nghiệm AI / Computer Vision để code cho sản phẩm hệ thống sử dụng Camera AI quét trực tiếp sản phẩm giày, nhận diện và kẻ line phân biệt chênh lệch độ cao đế giày. Công việc cụ thể: Tích hợp code với Camera AI / Camera thông minh để quét hình ảnh realtime Xử lý hình ảnh đầu vào từ camera Detect viền đế giày, bề mặt tiếp xúc, độ nghiêng Kẻ line trực quan thể hiện phần cao thấp lệch nhau Tính toán sai số / độ chênh lệch theo pixel hoặc mm Tối ưu tốc độ xử lý để chạy ổn định realtime Bàn giao source code hoàn chỉnh Yêu cầu ứng viên: Thành thạo Python / C++ Có kinh nghiệm OpenCV, YOLO, TensorFlow, PyTorch hoặc thư viện AI tương đương Đã từng làm dự án camera công nghiệp / camera AI / vision inspection là lợi thế lớn Biết xử lý realtime stream RTSP / USB Camera Chủ động, làm việc đúng tiến độ Hình thức hợp tác: Online từ xa, hợp tác ngắn hạn cho đến khi xong dự án, linh hoạt thời gian Thỏa thuận theo năng lực và phạm vi công việc Ưu tiên: Có demo dự án AI Vision thực tế Từng làm hệ thống kiểm tra lỗi sản phẩm bằng camera Có thể hỗ trợ sau bàn giao', 1, 'FIXED', 2000000.00, 4000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('39a01d4c-345f-5045-817a-d5c69de2a8f1', '29b702e9-ccb4-55d7-87ae-661bd8604e94', 'Tìm lập trình viên senior / tech lead AI-first đồng hành xây GMS One – AI Business Operating System', 'Chúng tôi cần tìm một hoặc vài lập trình viên có kinh nghiệm để đồng hành lâu dài trong dự án GMS One / GM / HungIT AI Business Operating System. Đây không phải là một website đơn lẻ, mà là một nền tảng vận hành doanh nghiệp có nhiều module: quản lý khách hàng, máy móc, sửa chữa, báo giá, hóa đơn, kho, QR, nhân viên/KTV, dashboard, AI assistant, website restaurant/nail, AI Content Studio. Mục tiêu trước mắt là xây dựng GM Workshop Core: thay thế dần Access/Excel, giảm nhập tay, tăng tốc tạo báo giá/hóa đơn/phiếu sửa chữa, quản lý kho, quản lý nhân viên/KTV và đưa AI vào hỗ trợ vận hành. Công việc chính: • Audit hệ thống/quy trình hiện tại: Access, Excel, website restaurant/nail cũ nếu cần. • Đề xuất kiến trúc cho GMS One Core + GM Workshop + HungIT Platform. • Xây dựng backend/frontend theo hướng platform, không làm kiểu copy source cho từng khách. • Thiết kế database sạch, có phân quyền, tenant, QR, audit log, workflow. • Tạo module quản lý khách hàng, máy móc, phiếu sửa, báo giá, hóa đơn, kho, nhân viên/KTV. • Tích hợp AI để viết nháp nội dung, tóm tắt, gợi ý, cảnh báo, nhưng có người duyệt. • Viết tài liệu kỹ thuật, hướng dẫn deploy, bàn giao code rõ ràng. Yêu cầu bắt buộc: • Có kinh nghiệm xây hệ thống web/app thực tế, không chỉ làm landing page. • Hiểu tư duy SaaS / multi-tenant / platform, không hard-code cho một khách hàng. • Biết Git, repo công ty, staging/production, backup, deploy, rollback. • Có khả năng làm việc với AI tools như ChatGPT, Cursor, Copilot, Claude hoặc công cụ tương tự để tăng tốc, nhưng không phụ thuộc mù quáng. • Biết viết tài liệu, báo cáo tiến độ, estimate giờ, acceptance criteria. • Tôn trọng quyền sở hữu mã nguồn của công ty. Điều kiện làm việc: • Làm việc từ xa. • Có thể bắt đầu bằng task audit/thiết kế kiến trúc hoặc MVP nhỏ. • Ưu tiên cộng tác lâu dài. • Có thể tính theo giờ, theo task, theo giai đoạn hoặc thỏa thuận theo năng lực. • Trước khi làm lớn sẽ có task thử nghiệm có trả phí. Yêu cầu khi ứng tuyển: Vui lòng gửi: • Portfolio hoặc dự án đã làm. • Công nghệ mạnh nhất của bạn. • Kinh nghiệm về SaaS, multi-tenant, CRM, ERP, workflow, QR, invoice, inventory nếu có. • Bạn đang dùng AI như thế nào trong lập trình hằng ngày? • Mức phí theo giờ hoặc theo tháng. • Thời gian có thể làm mỗi tuần. • Một đoạn ngắn: nếu được giao dự án GMS One, bạn sẽ bắt đầu audit và thiết kế kiến trúc như thế nào? Liên hệ: Mobil/WhatsApp: +[được ẩn bởi vlance] [được ẩn bởi vlance]', 1, 'FIXED', 200000000.00, 250000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('2970e920-aed1-5745-8467-ff7e8a296b8c', 'dbc6e1c1-b6c3-5e3f-ada9-35572a2bdf3b', 'Tìm trợ lý trực tuyến AI-first hỗ trợ vận hành công ty GM / HungIT', 'Chúng tôi cần tìm một trợ lý trực tuyến/cộng tác viên vận hành làm việc từ xa để hỗ trợ công việc hằng ngày cho công ty tại Đức và hệ sinh thái HungIT / GM. Công việc không chỉ là nhập liệu, mà là hỗ trợ tổ chức thông tin, theo dõi việc, chuẩn bị tài liệu, ghi chú, tổng hợp, nhắc việc và dùng AI để tăng hiệu quả. Công việc chính: • Tổng hợp thông tin, tài liệu, ghi chú cuộc họp. • Sắp xếp task, deadline, danh sách việc cần làm. • Chuẩn bị nội dung email, WhatsApp, tin nhắn chăm sóc khách hàng theo mẫu. • Nhập liệu, cập nhật bảng tính, CRM, tài liệu nội bộ. • Hỗ trợ theo dõi ứng viên, freelancer, cộng tác viên. • Tóm tắt tài liệu dài bằng AI, sau đó kiểm tra lại thủ công. • Chuẩn bị báo cáo tuần: việc đã làm, việc đang làm, vướng mắc, kế hoạch tiếp theo. • Hỗ trợ anh/chị quản lý lịch, nhắc việc, phân loại việc quan trọng. Yêu cầu bắt buộc: • Thành thạo tin học văn phòng: Word/Google Docs, Excel/Google Sheets, PowerPoint/Canva cơ bản. • Biết dùng ChatGPT hoặc công cụ AI để tóm tắt, viết nháp, lập checklist, dịch, soạn email. • Cẩn thận, trung thực, biết hỏi khi chưa rõ. • Viết tiếng Việt rõ ràng, mạch lạc. • Biết tiếng Anh hoặc tiếng Đức là lợi thế. • Có thể làm việc theo quy trình, có báo cáo, có deadline. Điều kiện làm việc: • Làm việc từ xa. • Có thể bắt đầu part-time. • Ưu tiên người muốn hợp tác lâu dài. • Có task thử nghiệm nhỏ trước khi nhận việc chính thức. Yêu cầu khi ứng tuyển: Vui lòng gửi: • Kinh nghiệm làm trợ lý, nhập liệu, vận hành, admin hoặc chăm sóc khách hàng nếu có. • Các công cụ bạn dùng tốt: Excel, Google Sheets, Notion, Trello, ChatGPT, Canva, v.v. • Bạn dùng AI để làm việc nhanh hơn như thế nào? • Mức phí theo giờ/tháng. • Thời gian có thể làm mỗi tuần. • Làm thử một đoạn ngắn: hãy mô tả quy trình bạn sẽ dùng để quản lý task, nhắc việc và báo cáo tiến độ cho sếp.', 1, 'FIXED', 10000000.00, 30000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00');

