    ('b4de6917-2493-5bca-8e6d-10c39b4d0cba', '18610fdd-dc6e-5d77-a76d-fa0b02f7abdf', 'Tích hợp API Supership', 'Tích hợp API từ SuperShip cho luồng đơn giao sách 2 chiều (giao sách mới và đồng thời lấy sách cũ về trong cùng một đơn), bao gồm tạo đơn giao nhận, đồng bộ phí vận chuyển theo báo giá từ SuperShip, lưu mã vận đơn, xử lý webhook cập nhật trạng thái và mapping về hệ thống nội bộ, đảm bảo idempotency tránh tạo trùng đơn, tích hợp trực tiếp vào flow hiện tại của hệ thống từ bước tạo order, xác nhận điều phối, cập nhật trạng thái giao nhận đến hoàn tất giao dịch, đồng thời tích hợp API từ SuperAI cho luồng đơn trả sách 1 chiều từ khách về OpenBoox, tự động tạo đơn hoàn, ưu tiên chọn J&T Express và fallback sang VNPost nếu J&T không khả dụng, cập nhật trạng thái trả sách qua webhook và đồng bộ với flow return/queue của hệ thống, lưu phí dự kiến và phí thực tế để phục vụ đối soát, hiển thị đầy đủ thông tin vận chuyển trên dashboard admin, hỗ trợ retry khi tạo đơn lỗi và ghi log chi tiết để phục vụ kiểm tra, đối soát và debug.', 1, 'FIXED', 2000000.00, 2000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('69bf0aa7-2f95-568e-86dc-f9dd5e23bcdf', 'a407bfeb-c5f0-55cd-a3c5-72112aee00f4', 'Bilingual Shipping Company Website , Custom Development, CMS & API Integration', 'We are a shipping and delivery company based in Saudi Arabia, looking for an experienced developer or development team to design, develop, and launch our official corporate website. The website must provide a professional Arabic and English experience, reflect our brand identity, and connect visitors with our existing services and systems. The scope includes UI/UX design, frontend and backend development, a custom CMS, an admin dashboard, integrations, testing, deployment, and handover. This is a corporate website project. Building a new shipping management system is outside the scope. 1. Technical Requirements - Custom development without WordPress. - Deployment on a company-controlled dedicated server or isolated cloud environment. - Arabic and English support, including proper RTL and LTR layouts. - Responsive design for mobile, tablet, and desktop. - Fast-loading, SEO-friendly pages. - A secure CMS that our team can use without coding. - Restricted access to administrative functions. Please specify your proposed frontend, backend, database, and CMS technologies. Explain your choices, licensing requirements, and ongoing dependencies. 2. Website Pages - Home - About Us - Our Services - How We Work - Partners - Blog, including categories and article pages - Pricing & Packages - Careers / Submit Your CV - Shipment Tracking - Customer Testimonials - Contact Us - Terms & Conditions - Privacy Policy Pricing and packages are for display only, with a “Contact Sales” form. Online payments and checkout are not required. The Careers page will contain a general application form. Job listings, vacancy publishing, and job detail pages are not required. 3. UI/UX Design and Content - Create a professional design aligned with our brand guidelines. - Provide editable design files, preferably in Figma. - Submit the main page designs for approval before development. - Design both Arabic and English layouts. - Populate the website with approved initial content. We will provide our brand assets, company information, and service details. Please clearly confirm: - Whether you have dedicated Arabic and English copywriters. - Whether initial copywriting, translation, proofreading, and content entry are included in your price. - What materials you need from our team. - The number of design and content revision rounds included. Legal page content requires our approval before publication. 4. Forms and Integrations Customer Registration / Sales Inquiries - Capture customer and business information through website forms. - Propose integration with Asana or Google Sheets. - Explain the integration method, account requirements, limitations, and additional fees. - Include input validation, spam protection, submission confirmation, and staff notifications. Shipment Tracking Please evaluate and quote these options: A. Integrating with our existing shipment tracking API. B. Connecting visitors to our existing tracking page. Explain your recommendation and the documentation or access required. If embedding the existing page is proposed, confirm feasibility first. Careers / General Applications - Provide a general application form for candidates to submit their contact details, professional information, and CV. - Store applications and CVs securely. - Allow authorized staff to view applications and download CVs through the admin dashboard. - Send an email notification to designated staff when a new application is received, with a secure link to review it. - Display a submission confirmation to the applicant. - Include appropriate file type and size restrictions, upload protection, and a privacy notice. No vacancy publishing, job listings, applicant accounts, or recruitment workflow system is required. 5. Admin Dashboard and CMS Authorized staff should be able to manage: - Website pages and bilingual content. - Services, pricing, and packages. - Blog posts and categories. - Banners and announcements. - Partner logos and testimonials. - General career applications and uploaded CVs. - Customer registration submissions and sales inquiries. - Admin users, roles, and permissions. - Relevant SEO fields. - Activity logs and submission exports. Please explain how Arabic and English content will be managed. Any order-related functionality must be clearly defined and quoted separately. If proposed, it should retrieve agreed information from our existing system through an authorized integration. Admin / CMS Demo Please provide a working demo or recorded walkthrough of a comparable admin dashboard and CMS. We want to assess content editing, bilingual management, permissions, and submission handling before selecting a developer. 6. Security and Privacy The solution should include: - HTTPS and secure deployment configuration. - Secure admin authentication and role-based access. - Server-side validation and protection against common web vulnerabilities. - Rate limiting and spam protection for public forms. - Secure handling of CVs and customer information. - Server-side storage of API keys and credentials. - Restricted access to administrative endpoints, applications, and stored submissions. - Appropriate logging, backups, and documented restoration procedures. For Asana, Google Sheets, and tracking integrations, explain the data flow and access controls. Customer records must not be exposed through public sheets, unrestricted links, or unprotected endpoints. 7. Deliverables - Approved sitemap and user flows. - Editable UI/UX design files. - Fully developed Arabic and English website. - Functional CMS and admin dashboard. - Agreed forms and integrations. - Approved initial content uploaded in both languages. - Functional, responsive, and security testing. - Staging environment for review and acceptance. - Production deployment on our domain. - Complete source code in a company-owned Git repository. - Database structure, deployment instructions, and configuration documentation. - Admin training and a practical handover guide. - Transfer of project credentials and company-owned accounts. Please disclose any paid templates, libraries, subscriptions, or third-party services before using them. 8. Proposal Requirements Please include: - Your understanding of the scope. - The exact frontend, backend, database, and CMS stack you propose. - Relevant Arabic/English website examples and your role in each. - An admin dashboard/CMS demo or walkthrough. - Your team structure and who will handle design, development, content, and testing. - A delivery timeline with milestones and required inputs from us. - A fixed-price breakdown for design, development, content, integrations, testing, and deployment. - Hosting recommendations and estimated recurring costs. - Exclusions, optional features, and third-party fees. - Included post-launch warranty and support terms. - Optional maintenance pricing after the warranty period. We prefer a fixed-price project with payments linked to completed and approved milestones. Our target delivery period is 6–8 weeks after scope approval and receipt of the required materials and integration access. Please provide a realistic schedule. Please include at least 30 days of post-launch bug-fix support and explain what it covers. Company identity, domain, brand assets, and technical documentation will be shared privately with shortlisted candidates.', 1, 'FIXED', 51664000.00, 51664000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('c91f4ec4-7c4d-5d96-89ea-fd13dcee52ac', '7801d135-604b-5e28-b8f5-8d3baa179ba6', 'Shopify Expert for Logistics E-commerce Site', 'We are a growing cross-border logistics and moving company operating between the USA and Mexico. We are transitioning from a manual quoting process to a fully automated e-commerce model for standard parcel shipments. We need a top-tier Shopify Expert to build a fast, mobile-first, and highly optimized transactional website. Core requirements include creating 3 standard shipping products, configuring advanced flat-rate shipping zones based on origin and destination zip codes, and implementing strict conditional logic that redirects customers to a WhatsApp form for custom quotes when selecting Full House Move or Commercial Freight. The site should have a clean, modern, high-converting design focused on reducing friction so customers can get their price and pay in under 60 seconds.', 1, 'FIXED', 4650000.00, 4650000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('f3c9da18-38f2-5009-9c20-028bf544bcd8', '9a42f7b1-3ef0-5e1a-82f6-891876f6fb47', 'UI/UX Designer for Mobile B2B Logistics Prototype (Figma)', 'Overview: We are designing a disruptive, highly specialized B2B capacity-sharing mobile platform for the commercial trucking industry, launching with a pilot in the metro Philadelphia area. The app functions as an efficiency network that coordinates fleet schedules to eliminate empty return trips ("deadheads"). We require a talented UI/UX Designer to transform our structured product logic and text-based layouts into a high-fidelity, interactive, and clickable mobile prototype in Figma that we can use for live client demos and investor pitches. No coding is required for this phase. Please see attachment for more details.', 1, 'FIXED', 12916000.00, 12916000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('e775fcf6-f0a4-5a53-81b9-6a8e2d77f968', 'f19bf44a-9d53-58d6-961e-996f178ebe56', 'Cần lập trình app giao hàng', '1. Tính năng dành cho Khách hàng (User App) Đăng ký/Đăng nhập: Đơn giản qua số điện thoại, mạng xã hội. Tạo đơn & Tìm kiếm: Đặt hàng, nhập địa chỉ, ghi chú chi tiết, đặt trước. Theo dõi đơn hàng, trạng thái đơn (đang lấy, đang giao). Thanh toán đa dạng: Tiền mặt (COD), ví điện tử, thẻ tín dụng. Đánh giá & Xếp hạng: Đánh giá tài xế và chất lượng dịch vụ. Thông báo (Push Notifications): Cập nhật tình trạng đơn hàng ngay lập tức. Chat trong ứng dụng: Trò chuyện hoặc gọi điện trực tiếp với shipper. 2. Tính năng dành cho Tài xế (Shipper App) Nhận/Huỷ đơn: Tiếp nhận đơn hàng phù hợp vị trí. Bản đồ & Chỉ đường: Tích hợp Google Maps/Apple Maps để tìm đường tối ưu. Quản lý thu nhập: Xem chi tiết thu nhập theo ngày/tuần/tháng, ví tiền. Quản lý trạng thái: Cập nhật trạng thái "Đang bận" hoặc "Sẵn sàng nhận đơn". 3. Tính năng dành cho Quản trị viên (Admin Panel) Quản lý người dùng & Shipper: Quản lý thông tin, phê duyệt tài xế. Quản lý đơn hàng: Theo dõi tất cả đơn, xử lý sự cố. Báo cáo & Thống kê: Báo cáo doanh thu, hiệu suất hoạt động. Thiết lập chi phí: Cấu hình phí ship theo khoảng cách, thời gian. DT/Zalo : [được ẩn bởi vlance]', 1, 'FIXED', 20000000.00, 40000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('33191fc2-7eae-5098-8c23-17d8d4e861a8', 'f19bf44a-9d53-58d6-961e-996f178ebe56', 'Cần lập trình app giao hàng (ship) có app khách + app shipper khu vực huyện', 'Cần lập trình app giao hàng (ship) - Có app khách + app shipper - Có phân loại khu vực huyện *Có kinh nghiệm lập trình mobile app (Android / iOS hoặc cross-platform như Flutter, React Native...) *Có kinh nghiệm phát triển ứng dụng có hệ thống đặt đơn, định vị hoặc quản lý đơn hàng *Có khả năng thiết kế API backend và database cho hệ thống *Ưu tiên ứng viên đã từng phát triển app giao hàng, logistic hoặc đặt dịch vụ *Có khả năng trao đổi rõ ràng về giải pháp kỹ thuật và thời gian triển khai', 1, 'FIXED', 1000000.00, 10000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('cdf56ab5-9d87-53b7-a0cd-fc25285a2626', 'f19bf44a-9d53-58d6-961e-996f178ebe56', 'Rà soát fix lỗi hoàn thiện dự án app giao hàng đa dịch vụ có sẵn bộ code', 'Mình cần dev Flutter (ưu tiên VN) Hiện tại: - Đã có sẵn bộ app giao hàng (user, tài xế, shop…) - App đã lên CH Play, chạy ổn định Cần hỗ trợ: - Rà soát lại toàn bộ hệ thống - Hoàn thiện giao diện & trải nghiệm người dùng - Fix các lỗi nhỏ (nếu có) - Tối ưu hiệu năng - Chuẩn bị cho việc phát triển thêm tính năng Yêu cầu: - Có kinh nghiệm Flutter / app đa dịch vụ - Đã từng làm app giao hàng, gọi xe là lợi thế - Nhận code có sẵn và làm tiếp Làm việc: - Freelance hoặc lâu dài đều được - Có thể chia milestone rõ ràng Ngân sách: trao đổi (ưu tiên làm nhanh và có tâm) Inbox để mìn', 1, 'FIXED', 1000000.00, 10000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('348baed2-5de6-5ac4-8693-229884c5606d', '180078db-8cc0-5670-bc2a-d89a9e61ef79', 'Web đơn giản để quản lí yêu cầu app giao hàng phải có bản đồ', 'Yêu cầu cơ bản Viết app giao hàng đăng ký tên riêng Không sử dụng khuôn mẫu (ở đay) 3 app đặt hàng và tài xế quán ăn', 1, 'FIXED', 5000000.00, 10000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('20f66300-a508-51da-bbf9-eaed7b491856', '36037fbf-18aa-5c17-82ac-fb1167c9b8ac', 'Website Order and Stock Management', 'I need a reliable freelancer to manage website orders, handle email support, and oversee product stock management. The role includes processing customer inquiries, updating inventory levels, and ensuring smooth day-to-day operations for an e-commerce website. I’m looking for someone organized, responsive, and comfortable working independently while maintaining clear communication. This is a part-time opportunity for someone who can help keep the website running efficiently and support customer needs consistently.', 1, 'FIXED', 16791000.00, 16791000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('f8b90f8b-c348-5b57-a5c3-9c8e8794c968', '8a65e04a-d103-5d38-8782-e838d9c0d7cd', 'Warehouse Application Code Review', 'I’m looking for an experienced developer to review an existing warehouse management application built with Next.js. The application is currently used internally by approximately 15–20 users. We plan to expand its use to external users, with an expected total of around 100 users. Before expanding access, I want to ensure the application is secure, reliable, and ready to handle the increased usage. Scope of Work Review the application’s source code and overall architecture. Assess the application’s security, reliability, and maintainability. Identify potential bugs, security vulnerabilities, and performance bottlenecks. Evaluate whether the current architecture can support approximately 100 users. Identify potential scalability issues and recommend improvements. Provide actionable recommendations to address any issues found. Requirements Proven experience in web application development. Strong knowledge of Next.js and modern web technologies. Experience with application security, performance optimization, and scalability. Strong analytical and problem-solving skills. Expected Deliverable A code review report summarizing the findings, identified risks, and recommended improvements, prioritized by severity and urgency. The goal is to understand the application''s current condition and identify any issues that should be addressed before making it available to external users.', 1, 'FIXED', 1937000.00, 1937000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('b146602a-3ccc-5a27-a2a1-1a3588ea820b', '096ada90-adf9-5cfe-a39d-3f9141e40ac0', 'Senior SAP BI/BO Specialist – Data Warehouse & Business Intelligence (Brussels, Belgium)', 'Senior SAP BI/BO Specialist – Data Warehouse & Business Intelligence (Brussels, Belgium) Summary Location: Brussels, Belgium Work Mode: On-site Employment Type: Full-time Experience: 10–15 Years Education: University degree or equivalent Language: English or French at B2 level or higher (mandatory) About the Opportunity The successful candidate will design, develop, and maintain the eGrants Enterprise Data Warehouse (EDW), focusing on ETL/ELT development, enterprise data modelling, SAP BusinessObjects reporting and data integration using SAP Data Services. This role requires strong, hands-on expertise in both SAP BusinessObjects and SAP Data Services. Key Responsibilities Design and maintain enterprise data warehouses and data models. Develop and manage ETL/ELT pipelines using SAP Data Services. Build and maintain BI reports, dashboards and semantic models (Universes) using SAP BusinessObjects. Develop and optimise SQL and PL/SQL queries and database structures. Ensure data quality, performance and security across the data warehouse and reporting layers. Ensure GDPR compliance and maintain clear technical and functional documentation. Collaborate with business stakeholders and technical teams to deliver reporting and analytics solutions. Investigate data and reporting issues, identify root causes, and implement corrective actions. Mandatory Requirements Minimum 10 years of IT experience. 10+ years of hands-on SAP BusinessObjects experience. 8+ years of hands-on SAP Data Services experience. Strong expertise in data warehousing, ETL/ELT, dimensional modelling, SQL, and PL/SQL. Knowledge of SAP BusinessObjects Universe Design and Administration. Experience with relational databases such as Oracle or PostgreSQL. Strong analytical and problem-solving skills, and a team player. University degree or equivalent. English or French proficiency at B2 level or higher. Nice to Have Experience with AWS and data lakehouse architectures. Knowledge of Apache Iceberg, dbt, or Airflow. Experience with Qlik Sense or other BI tools. Familiarity with modern data governance tools. Location Requirement: This is an on-site role in Brussels; candidates must be based in Belgium or willing to relocate to Belgium. Important: Extensive practical experience with both SAP BusinessObjects and SAP Data Services is essential, and all mandatory requirements must be met. Candidates who do not meet them will not be considered. 📩 Interested? Apply with your updated CV (no contact information), highlighting your SAP BusinessObjects and SAP Data Services experience, English/French level, current location (or willingness to relocate), availability or notice period, and salary expectations.', 1, 'HOURLY', 387000.00, 646000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('14d65275-8eab-5432-8217-cdf2b3cdd7f8', 'ae36208e-6a50-51c2-b042-c3d2969f827e', 'Nghiên cứu bài toán định vị kho hàng (WLP: Warehouse Location Problem), nghiên cứu thuật toán cận tối ưu để giải bài toán WLP, đề xuất thuật toán giải bài toán', 'Nghiên cứu bài toán định vị kho hàng (WLP: Warehouse Location Problem), nghiên cứu thuật toán cận tối ưu để giải bài toán WLP, đề xuất thuật toán giải bài toán', 1, 'FIXED', 5000000.00, 10000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('47c67af0-c00c-53ed-b1f8-07320729900d', 'affeae32-9eea-500f-92c6-61421eb21e9e', 'Xây dựng hệ thống tracking khách hàng từ QR Zalo OA (Webhook + Google Sheet)', 'Chúng tôi cần tìm freelancer/dev để xây dựng MVP hệ thống tracking khách hàng từ Zalo OA với yêu cầu đơn giản, triển khai nhanh. Mục tiêu: Theo dõi khách hàng đến từ từng đại lý qua QR Zalo OA Ghi nhận dữ liệu tự động khi khách: Follow OA Nhắn tin lần đầu Yêu cầu chức năng: 1. Link tracking đại lý Tạo link dạng: https://zalo.me/{OA_ID}?ref=DL001 Mỗi đại lý 1 mã riêng (ref) 2. QR Code Generate QR từ link Đảm bảo mỗi QR tương ứng 1 đại lý 3. Webhook xử lý dữ liệu Nhận event từ Zalo OA: follow message (tin nhắn đầu tiên) Xử lý & lưu dữ liệu: user_id ref (mã đại lý) event_type timestamp 4. Lưu dữ liệu Lưu vào Google Sheet Dữ liệu rõ ràng, dễ filter theo đại lý 5. Chống trùng Không ghi trùng user nếu đã tồn tại Test Test với nhiều tài khoản khác nhau Đảm bảo: Ghi đúng ref Không lỗi webhook Không trùng data Deliverables Code backend (Node.js / Python đều OK) Webhook hoạt động ổn định Google Sheet lưu dữ liệu Hướng dẫn: Cấu hình Zalo OA Tạo link + QR Test hệ thống Kỹ năng yêu cầu freelancer phải có Kinh nghiệm làm việc với: API / Webhook Zalo OA API (hoặc tương tự) Backend: Node.js / Python (FastAPI, Express…) Làm việc với Google Sheet API Xử lý logic chống trùng dữ liệu Hiểu basic tracking / referral system Ưu tiên: Đã từng làm Zalo OA / chatbot / tracking Có tư duy làm MVP nhanh, gọn Loại hình làm việc Việc làm dự án Hình thức làm việc Làm online Yêu cầu khác Có thể trao đổi nhanh qua Zalo/Telegram tiến độ mỗi ngày hoặc theo milestone Code clean, dễ mở rộng', 1, 'FIXED', 200000.00, 200000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('e66f8a6e-b0d8-5b05-9daa-81c68262dd66', 'd016f6be-a8c9-5a12-9093-a4d2295c46fc', 'Larvel Developer - Markeplace website', 'We are looking for a Senior Laravel Expert to start immediately for quick API & backend tasks: Marketplace APIs: Review & optimize existing backend APIs. Payments: Review current gateway integrations, handle webhooks, and remove deprecated payment methods. SMS Workflows: Perform quick modifications to existing SMS scenarios/triggers. Tracking Integrations: Remove legacy Meta & Google integrations and implement new API-based integrations. Code Review: Audit, refactor, and work quickly with legacy code. Requirements: Advanced Laravel & RESTful APIs expertise. Strong experience with Payment Gateways, Meta APIs, Google APIs, and SMS integrations. Fast code reader with strong legacy code review skills. Must be available to start immediately.', 1, 'HOURLY', 258000.00, 517000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('78acee89-3275-5562-9eab-7e733c9c7730', '687da4ed-12f2-5295-9b81-f2858013c843', 'Mobility Platform Mobile App Developer', 'We are seeking a developer to build a mobile application for a mobility platform. The project involves creating a user-friendly app that supports key features such as ride booking, real-time tracking, and user account management. You will work closely with our team to deliver a reliable, scalable solution that meets user needs and business goals. Experience with mobile app development and a strong understanding of user experience are important for this role.', 1, 'FIXED', 12916000.00, 12916000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('c58238bd-fe3c-547e-8478-5a4c6996135d', '97d7d1e7-f6d2-58a9-ad5d-4c283722dae1', 'Real Jira Experts needed: Consultant to test Time Tracking App', 'We could collect feedback on our Jira time tracking app from just about anyone, but we''d much rather hear from a real Atlassian professional. If you''ve spent a few years working with Jira, you''ll spot things a casual tester never would, and that''s exactly what we''re after: your honest, hands-on impression of the app. Your background in Jira administration and in time tracking topics like worklogs, timesheets, billable hours and team capacity planning will make your input genuinely valuable to our product team. The whole test is short, so plan for around 30 minutes. One requirement before you apply: you''ll need admin access to a test Jira Cloud instance with a few projects and work items, plus at least 2–3 users so you can build a small team and see how the team features work. What the task looks like? Install this Jira Cloud app called "Timesheet Builder | Time Tracking & Worklog Reports for Jira": Atlassian Marketplace (https://marketplace.atlassian.com/apps/1227537/timesheet-builder-time-tracking-worklog-reports-for-jira?hosting=cloud&tab=overview) Shortly familiarize yourself with the app. In Jira Cloud, open a work item, add timer to current task and start the timer on a work item, stop it after a minute or two, and add a worklog manually. Go to Apps → Timesheet Builder → My Timesheets. Log some time: use drag-and-drop to move an item from the list to the calendar Look around: check your worklogs in the Calendar view (week and month), then open Worklog analysis to see your personal timesheet overview. Go to Teams → create a new team and add 2–3 members. Add Billable worklog attribute to the team. Create another worklog and assign it to your team. Open the Team Overview and check the team worklog analysis and the capacity calculation for the current week or month. Check the results. And provide us your feedback here: https://forms.cloud.microsoft/Pages/ResponsePage.aspx?id=Mcnn_sJCOkSD1eRjIiZ1O4vq70QXmchEgxo5XAwyuGpUMFRSSUxQRVA1MEI3TE01QlhQMzRWSllNOS4u And you''re done! To solve the use cases properly, please only apply for this job if you can use a testing Jira Cloud instance with test spaces, work items and several users available to add to a team. We can''t wait to hear your feedback. Many thanks for your time.', 1, 'FIXED', 646000.00, 646000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('b1badfce-4585-5b9f-9d8d-af70f0a2f68c', '808fe8c0-1c3c-5910-b74b-7fffbe5d9dbe', 'Cần mua trọn bộ code app xe tải dọn nhà giống Lalamove', 'Cần tìm đơn vị hoặc nhóm Freelancer có sẵn Source Code App vận chuyển hàng hóa, dọn nhà (mô hình tương tự Lalamove/Ahamove) để mua lại và tùy chỉnh giao diện. Hệ thống bắt buộc bao gồm đủ 3 phần: App cho Khách hàng, App cho Tài xế (chạy trên cả iOS và Android) và Trang Admin quản trị cho chủ app. Yêu cầu tính năng đặc thù: Luồng đặt đơn phải tích hợp thêm tính năng tùy chọn dịch vụ Bốc Xếp (khách có thể chọn số người phụ bốc xếp, số lầu, có thang máy hay không) và thuật toán tự động cộng tiền bốc xếp vào tổng hóa đơn. Phí bốc xếp này tài xế hưởng 100%, app chỉ thu chiết khấu trên giá cước xe tải. Yêu cầu đối tác bàn giao toàn bộ Source Code sạch, hỗ trợ đẩy app lên Store thành công và có chính sách bảo hành lỗi tối thiểu 6 tháng. Ngân sách trọn gói dự kiến khoảng 100 triệu VNĐ. Ưu tiên các bên có sẵn App Demo để test trực tiếp trước khi ký hợp đồng.', 1, 'FIXED', 60000000.00, 120000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('b42219df-df3a-5465-b92b-65b976d6d244', '3ba6f635-c8ab-56a2-8e54-d1ebc2a583cc', 'Marketing Budget Planning & Tracking Tool for Car Dealer (Excel / Google / Microsoft 365)', 'I''m working for a marketing department of a multi-brand automotive dealer group in northern Italy (22 brands, 19 locations). I need a structured tool to plan, allocate and track our marketing budget — replacing a set of disconnected Excel sheets that no one keeps up to date. What the tool needs to do: • Let marketing staff plan a yearly budget per brand/location/category, broken down by month • Provide a simple entry form (with dropdowns) to log each marketing activity: category, supplier, planned amount, dates, brand(s) and location(s) involved — activities can span multiple brands and multiple locations, each with its own % split • Let staff later record the actual invoiced amount against each activity (manual entry, invoice number/date) • Show, at any time, Planned / Allocated / Actual spend and the variance between them — filterable by location, brand, period, category and status • Provide a group-wide summary dashboard (totals + breakdown by brand and location) that is clear enough to show to management • Allow data export to Excel Platform: I want this built on Excel, or alternatively a Google Workspace solution (Sheets + Apps Script) or a Microsoft 365 solution (Excel/SharePoint/Power Automate/Power Apps) — not Airtable or a custom web app. Please tell me in your proposal which of these you''d recommend given the requirements below, and why. Scale: ~8-10 users (most need edit rights, a few view-only), a few hundred to a couple thousand activities per year, desktop use. A detailed technical requirements document (data structure, field-by-field logic, budget rules, dashboard requirements) is attached — please review it before quoting, as it reflects several weeks of internal requirements-gathering and is meant to save back-and-forth. I''m looking for someone who has built similar budget/planning tools before and can talk through the trade-offs of each platform option. Please include relevant past work in your application.', 1, 'HOURLY', 258000.00, 775000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('b44f7f17-cd60-54c4-a224-b1c333f7dd0e', '6973a117-6474-5292-b220-7d80853d107a', 'Sports athlete data tracking', 'I have a fully build website created by AI, which I want to turn into a full-stack normal website. It works, and is linked to google firebase. I want to turn it from something I use, to something I can see to clients. The final product should be well-structured, scalable, and ready for ongoing use. Please share relevant experience with similar web projects and Firebase integration.', 1, 'FIXED', 6458000.00, 6458000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('2590ab92-f737-5401-a0e6-fd733f6984ec', '07118a68-7411-5e75-baa4-ee08a3e3a375', 'Full-Stack AI Engineer for Invoice & Financial Document Processing SaaS', 'We are looking for an experienced Full-Stack AI Engineer based in Europe (or aligned European time zones) to build and integrate an advanced Agentic AI document processing module into our existing SaaS platform. Unlike traditional hardcoded extraction scripts that break on messy layouts, our system relies on Agentic workflows (utilizing frameworks like LangGraph or custom tool-use loops) to autonomously classify documents, handle multi-step extractions, cross-verify line items, self-correct low-confidence fields, and route exceptions intelligently. The platform processes commercial invoices, receipts, and structured financial forms under strict European data compliance standards (GDPR). We need a dedicated professional to take ownership of this fixed-scope feature milestone, ensuring secure API handling, high-performance asynchronous processing, and robust agentic orchestration.', 1, 'FIXED', 517000.00, 517000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('cbaab35f-e424-57ba-9bfc-93711da16250', 'b4033aef-ff27-585f-a2a6-51f1a705dc2c', 'Commission Automation & Reconciliation System — Power Automate + Python + SharePoint', 'We are an IT services company seeking to automate our twice-monthly sales commission process. We currently handle this manually using spreadsheets and QuickBooks Desktop. We have a detailed proposal from one vendor and want a second independent proposal to compare before deciding. **The Problem:** Each commission cycle, our controller reconciles sales to cost across multiple categories (hardware, consulting, hourly services, CSP/Azure cloud, managed services, monthly billing), calculates gross profit and commission, reviews exceptions, updates a Commission Master, and posts commission bills in QuickBooks. This takes significant manual effort and we need it automated with deterministic, auditable rules. **What We Need Built:** 1. Workflow orchestration (Power Automate) — trigger commission runs, collect readiness confirmations, route approvals, send Teams + email alerts for exceptions. 2. Commission calculation engine (Python, hosted as Azure Function) — ingest QuickBooks report exports + supporting SharePoint files, normalize/classify invoices, match invoices to cost sources (PO matching, project costs, hourly rates, cloud cost workbooks, P&L lookups), calculate profit/margin/commission per transaction using configurable rate rules, and detect anomalies. 3. Exception review workflow — SharePoint List + Excel Review Log. Clean items continue while exceptions are held. Resolved items trigger targeted reprocessing, then a final full-period validation before approval. 4. Outputs per run: commission workbook with audit trail, per-rep summaries, Commission Master update, QuickBooks Posting Sheet (approved totals by rep), payment status check, pre-payroll change-detection report. 5. QuickBooks boundary — data enters via file exports only (no direct SDK integration initially). The automation never modifies source accounting records. Our controller manually posts the final approved commission bills. 6. Validation — historical replay of prior periods + three consecutive live parallel runs matching manual results exactly. **Optional add-on (quote separately):** Direct QuickBooks Desktop SDK/Web Connector integration for automated data retrieval and approved bill creation. **What to Include in Your Proposal:** - Your understanding of scope + clarifying questions - Proposed architecture (confirm or suggest alternatives to Power Automate + Python + SharePoint) - Fixed-price quote for core implementation - Separate estimate for optional QuickBooks direct integration - Estimated hours and calendar timeline including parallel validation - Payment milestone structure - Relevant experience with commission/accounting automation - Post-launch support availability A detailed requirements document will be shared with shortlisted candidates.', 1, 'HOURLY', 387000.00, 646000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('d6dd46db-a3f3-57ca-8413-3a37bbd5e76a', '0398820d-3754-5561-b7f1-d1f0ee2f659a', 'Google Sheets Business Automation - Invoicing, CRM, Inventory & Cash Flow', 'I’m looking for an experienced Google Sheets / Apps Script developer to build a connected set of business tools for a small workwear manufacturing and trading company based in Riga, Latvia. Everything currently exists as basic Google Sheets or Excel files - the goal is to create what''s missing, connect them, automate the manual work, and make them actually useful day-to-day. Scope of work: 1. Product catalogue Structure the existing product list (raw materials, purchased goods, finished products) with SKU codes, categories, sizes, colors, pricing and VAT logic — ready to be referenced by the invoicing tool. 2. Client & supplier CRM Build a clean Google Sheets CRM covering client and supplier records: contact details, payment terms, VAT status (Latvia / EU / non-EU), linked Drive folders. 3. Automated invoicing Build a smart invoice form that pulls client data from the CRM, auto-determines document type (Latvian PPR or English Invoice), generates a sequential document number (PPR-2026-0001 / INV-2026-0001), exports a styled PDF, saves it to the client’s Drive folder, and creates an email draft. Every issued invoice logs line-item data into a sales analytics sheet. 4. Incoming invoice automation Set up an email-based automation that detects incoming supplier invoices (PDF attachments), extracts key data (supplier, amount, due date), and logs them into an incoming payables register. Each invoice PDF is automatically saved to a designated Google Drive folder. The system also auto-forwards the email to the accountant so she can book it into the accounting system without any manual steps from the company''s side. 5. 13-day rolling cash flow forecast A simple dashboard that pulls data from both the outgoing invoices (receivables) and incoming invoices (payables) registers to show a 13-day forward cash position - updated automatically. Tech stack: Google Sheets, Google Apps Script, Gmail and/or integration with other email. Preferably everything within Google Workspace, no external tools. Ideal candidate: - Solid Google Apps Script experience (beyond formulas) - Has built invoicing or financial automation in Sheets before - Familiarity with EU VAT rules is an advantage - Delivers clean, documented work Please share examples of similar projects. Fixed price or milestone-based preferred.', 1, 'FIXED', 20666000.00, 20666000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('bf14eb54-dcb8-5f5c-b658-ad229088901d', '358f684e-5fb4-5051-b559-2ee1383242ef', 'Haiti // Testing of Payment methods', 'We are a company specializing in regional testing. Our client asked us to find a way to test some payment methods on their website. A test takes about 10 minutes. Payment depends on your performance: $10 for performing testing within 24 hours. Conditions: - The tests must be recorded on video with JAM - send the results within 24 hours - provide us with additional info regarding the test if needed', 1, 'FIXED', 258000.00, 258000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('e0b541f4-2e41-52df-a1c6-39bb932c46d1', '55515b64-ffa1-5514-8713-c34028df6ef5', 'Laravel + React Developer to Upgrade Affiliate Platform (SSR, Stripe, Scheduled Promoted Ad Spots)', 'Title: Laravel + React Developer to Upgrade Affiliate Platform (SSR, Search, Product Pages, Promoter Accounts, UI/Admin Redesign) Description: We run an established affiliate marketing website and are looking for an experienced full-stack developer to upgrade the existing platform with server-side rendering, new features, a polished public UI, and a faster, redesigned admin interface. Current setup: - Backend: Laravel REST API - Admin panel: React app, built and deployed as static files - Public site: React app, built and deployed as static files (client-side rendered only, no SSR) - Hosting: DreamHost Scope of work: 1. Server-side rendering for the public site (required) - Convert the public React app to SSR (e.g., Next.js) for SEO and performance - Set up hosting and deployment for SSR (e.g., Node on a DreamHost VPS); recommendations welcome - Keep existing pages, routes, and URLs working, with no SEO loss from the migration - Proper meta tags, Open Graph data, structured data, sitemaps, and canonical URLs 2. Site search - Fast, relevant search across products and content - Filters, sorting, autocomplete, and SEO-friendly search result pages - Recommendations on search tooling (e.g., Laravel Scout with Meilisearch or Algolia) are welcome 3. Product detail pages (PDP) - SSR product pages with images, pricing, affiliate links, descriptions, and related products - Product schema markup for rich search results - Optimized for speed and Core Web Vitals 4. Private promoter accounts - Promoters can sign up, manage a profile, and submit or manage their own listings and deals - Admin approval workflow for promoters and their content - Promoted placements: promoters book featured spots for specific days and time windows, with an availability calendar, no double-booking, and automatic activation and expiry - Stripe payments for promoted spots (Checkout, webhooks, refunds, invoices, payment history) - Promoter dashboard with basic reporting: impressions and clicks 5. Public UI polish - Refine the design for a clean, modern, consistent look across desktop and mobile - Improve layout, typography, spacing, loading states, and accessibility 6. Admin interface redesign - Facelift focused on speed of everyday admin work - Bulk actions, quick edit, keyboard-friendly workflows, better tables, filters, and search - New screens to manage promoters, approvals, promoted slots, payments, and reports 7. Scheduling and background jobs (Laravel) - Laravel scheduler and queues for promoted spot activation and expiry, content publishing, data syncs, and cleanup - Cron setup on DreamHost, with logging and failure alerts Requirements: - Strong Laravel experience: Eloquent, API resources, Sanctum, scheduler, queues and jobs - Strong React experience, plus proven experience migrating a client-side React app to SSR (ideally Next.js) without hurting SEO - Experience building search for product or content sites - Experience with multi-role user systems (admin, promoter, public) - Hands-on Stripe integration experience, including Checkout and webhooks (Laravel Cashier is a plus) - Strong UI/UX sense and experience building admin dashboards - Experience deploying Node/Next.js apps on a VPS (DreamHost experience is a plus) - Comfortable with Git, pull requests, and writing tests - Clear communication in English How we work: - You''ll get access to a private repository and a local or staging setup with sample data. - Production and project details are shared only after hiring, and an NDA is required. - Work is split into milestones (e.g., SSR migration → search and product pages → promoter accounts and payments → UI polish → admin redesign), paid per milestone. - We start with a small paid task to confirm fit. To apply, please include: 1. React-to-SSR or Next.js migration projects you''ve completed 2. Examples of product sites, search features, or admin dashboards you''ve built 3. How you''d approach search and the promoter account system 4. How you''d host and deploy the SSR site, and what hosting changes you''d recommend 5. A rough estimate of time and cost per milestone, plus your availability and rate Proposals that don''t answer the questions above won''t be considered.', 1, 'FIXED', 7750000.00, 7750000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('6ef61fcf-7eb8-5436-b632-37413b431d22', 'fd7cfc57-2b08-5a52-899f-c3fc899a08c8', 'App Wallet for Remittances', 'We need a developer to build a mobile app wallet for remittances, with a focus on secure transactions, user-friendly design, and reliable performance. The project includes developing core wallet features, integrating payment systems, and ensuring a smooth experience across devices. We’re looking for someone who can help create a dependable solution for sending and receiving money, with attention to security, usability, and scalability.', 1, 'HOURLY', 387000.00, 775000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('443a9e9f-255e-5262-8a42-adea16d48241', '7162d31f-bff0-50ad-b547-8d1dbdbf959e', 'Lập trình app Android kết nối Loyverse POS ↔ Zeller Terminal (thanh toán tự động)', 'Cần tuyển freelancer/team lập trình app companion Android (React Native) để kết nối Loyverse POS với Zeller Terminal cho chuỗi 3 nhà hàng. BỐI CẢNH: Đang dùng Loyverse POS để bán hàng, và Zeller Terminal để nhận thanh toán thẻ. Hiện Zeller chưa tích hợp sẵn trong Loyverse, nên khi thu tiền nhân viên phải bấm số tiền thủ công trên máy Zeller. Cần xây 1 app đồng hành (companion app) để khi tạo đơn trên Loyverse với hình thức thanh toán "Zeller", máy Zeller Terminal tự động nhận đúng số tiền cần thu. YÊU CẦU KỸ THUẬT: - Bắt buộc dùng React Native (Zeller Terminal SDK chỉ hỗ trợ React, React Native, .NET tại thời điểm hiện tại — đã xác nhận qua tài liệu chính thức của Zeller Developer Suite) - Tích hợp Loyverse API (đọc đơn hàng mới, cập nhật trạng thái thanh toán) - Tích hợp Zeller Terminal SDK (React Native) để gửi lệnh thu tiền - Xử lý lỗi: giao dịch thất bại, mất mạng, chống thu trùng PHẠM VI: - Xây companion app hoàn chỉnh, test thật trên thiết bị Android + máy Zeller Terminal - Tài liệu vận hành cho nhân viên không rành kỹ thuật - Hỗ trợ sửa lỗi 2 tuần sau bàn giao Đã có sẵn: tài khoản Zeller merchant + Terminal thật, tài khoản Zeller Developer Suite, bộ tài liệu mô tả kỹ thuật chi tiết (đính kèm), bộ code skeleton React Native làm sẵn khung kiến trúc (đính kèm) — freelancer hoàn thiện phần tích hợp SDK thật và test. Ưu tiên người có kinh nghiệm thực tế tích hợp payment SDK (Stripe, Adyen, SumUp, Zeller...) trên React Native. Đây là hệ thống liên quan tiền thật, ưu tiên chất lượng hơn giá rẻ. Vui lòng báo giá kèm: kinh nghiệm liên quan, thời gian hoàn thành dự kiến, có sẵn sàng hỗ trợ bảo trì dài hạn không.', 1, 'FIXED', 15000000.00, 40000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('b1d34a8a-ce16-5f67-a537-deb548c1235a', '7a25cc3e-f95b-5164-b98c-fa852764b7ac', 'Senior Full Stack Product Engineer (Next.js/Tailwind/Similar) – High-End B2B Fintech Marketplace', 'We are building a stealth B2B marketplace platform in the financial and professional services space. We are looking for an elite Full Stack Product Engineer who doesn''t just write clean backend code, but has a rigorous eye for modern design, typography, and functional UI. Our design standard is uncompromising. The platform must feel like an institutional, Series-B tier fintech product from day one. If your design inspiration is Stripe, Ramp, Linear, and Mercury—and you know how to build data-dense, highly interactive interfaces without them feeling cluttered—you are exactly who we are looking for. The Current MVP Tech Stack: • Frontend: React / Next.js, Tailwind CSS, TypeScript • Backend / Database: Next.js API Routes, PostgreSQL (Neon) • Authentication: Clerk (custom split-screen integrations) • Hosting / Deployment: Vercel, Cloudflare • Storage: Google Cloud Storage What You Will Build: • A Multi-Sided Marketplace: Architect and build role-based portals for three distinct user types, ensuring secure data isolation and customized routing. • High-Craft UI/UX: Translate concepts into pixel-perfect frontend components. You will be implementing 1px blueprint grids, split-pane messaging interfaces, sticky 2-column workspaces, and custom mathematical calculator cards. • Complex Data Tables: Build responsive, filterable ledger tables for financial and deal-flow tracking. • System Integrations: Implement transactional emails, dynamic document uploads, and scheduling API integrations. Who We Are Looking For: • The "Design Engineer": You understand layout geometry, symmetric padding, monospace typography for financial data, and subtle state changes (hover, focus rings, loading states) without needing a designer to redline every single pixel for you. • The Architect: You know how to structure a scalable Next.js app, manage complex state, and write secure, efficient database queries. • The Communicator: You communicate proactively, push back if a feature can be built in a smarter way, and write maintainable, well-documented code. How to Apply (Please read carefully): Generic, copy-pasted proposals will be immediately archived. To be considered, please include the following in your cover letter: Start your proposal with the word "Blueprint" so we know you read this entire description. Provide 2-3 links to LIVE web apps you have built from scratch. We are specifically looking at your UI/UX execution and frontend polish. (Github repos are great, but we want to see the live user experience). Briefly confirm your experience with our specific stack (Next.js, Tailwind, Postgres, Clerk or similarly related stacks). We are looking to hire quickly and build a long-term relationship with the right engineer as this platform scales.', 1, 'HOURLY', 1808000.00, 2196000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('67856f85-eaa6-5963-845e-b252cc40cc9d', '68db97c6-d892-5b37-8635-3ee98e53ae85', 'Fintech Payments Application Development', 'Mojo Pay Engagement Brief Prepared 26 October 2026 Fintech Payments Application · Prepared for Mojo Pay In This Brief 01 About Mojo Pay 02 Application Overview 03 Product Scope 04 Timeline 05 AI Development Preference 01 About Mojo Pay Mojo Pay is based in Australia. The project is for a new fintech payments application for web and mobile. It''s a very simple app for business that want to use credit cards to pay for the bills, but the bill provider only accepts bank transfers. 02 Application Overview We need an agency to help bring our ChatGPT demo into a fintech payments application for web and mobile, secure and ready for production. 03 Product Scope Customer-facing front end for web and mobile Ideally, an administration console to action requirements Connect the completed app to the client''s payment processor Integrate the completed application with payment processor - API credentials will be provided to the successful candidate. The app will launch in Australia under a licensed provider. Mojo Pay has no current website. We will provide a reference example of our main competitor. 04 Timeline Ideally 4 weeks 05 AI Development Preference The agency should use ChatGPT or Claude and create a suitable harness to manage AI development, so the work can be handed over and continually managed. If there is a faster way using a replit or off-the-shelf app build that makes ongoing hosting, support and manageability easier, then we will consider these options. Payments app demo remit-business-login.salty-plume-9228.chatgpt.site Client-created ChatGPT prototype to guide the customer web/mobile experience and possible administration console. Competitor reference website Client identified an existing competitor as Mojo Pay''s main competitor and a useful product/category reference; it is not Mojo Pay''s website.', 1, 'FIXED', 129160000.00, 129160000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('b0634994-cca5-5466-adce-1645e17d43ad', '0e1daa3f-9691-56e8-89a1-151b94a732d8', 'Fintech QA Testers Needed- Deposits & Payouts (Multiple Countries)', 'We’re looking for local testers with manual QA experience to ensure a seamless user experience. Your role will involve manually test the app''s features and provide feedback on usability and functionality. You’ll need your own eligible bank account and must complete KYC in the app. $20 for both tasks and brief feedback, with pre-approved transaction costs covered separately. Countries: United States, Australia, Canada, Singapore, UAE, Saudi Arabia, Türkiye, Thailand, South Korea, Israel, Romania, Czechia, Poland, and euro-area EU countries.', 1, 'FIXED', 517000.00, 517000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('4f8a62a7-54f6-55f2-b8af-f98be67ead57', 'f0c4cfb8-e3d4-5287-acc2-0ab8588eaeab', 'Job Title: Wix Website Designer & Developer for Fintech / Global Payments Startup', 'Job Title: Wix Website Designer & Developer for Fintech / Global Payments Startup Project Type: Fixed-price project Budget: $300–$500 USD (open to proposals) Experience Level: Intermediate to Expert Timeline: 2–3 weeks Platform: Wix / Wix Studio (preferred) About the Company OneBorder is a Canadian-based fintech and business solutions startup helping businesses expand internationally, simplify cross-border payments, and enter new markets. Our services include: Market Entry Solutions: Helping businesses navigate new markets, particularly India, South Asia, and North America. Merchant of Record (MoR): Helping international businesses sell products and services in new markets. Cross-Border Payments: Facilitating international payment collection and settlement through appropriate partners. Global Collection Accounts: Supporting businesses with international payment collection solutions. Our vision is to remove the complexity of international expansion and make global commerce more accessible. Website: www.oneborder.ca What We''re Looking For We are seeking a talented website designer and developer to create a professional, modern, and visually appealing corporate website for OneBorder. The website should reflect the credibility and sophistication of an established global fintech company while maintaining a clean, simple, and intuitive user experience. We like the design aesthetics of companies such as Stripe, Airwallex, Wise, and Paddle. We are not looking for a complicated custom-coded website. We prefer someone who can leverage Wix or Wix Studio templates and customize them to create a premium-looking website that is easy for our team to maintain. Project Scope 1. Website Design & Development Build a fully responsive website with approximately 5–7 pages, including: Home: Strong headline, value proposition, services overview, and calls to action. About Us: Company mission, vision, and positioning. Our Solutions: Overview of OneBorder''s core services. Merchant of Record: Dedicated page explaining our MoR solution. Market Entry & Global Payments: Overview of our international business solutions. Industries We Serve: Target customer segments and use cases. Contact Us: Contact form and consultation inquiry. We are open to recommendations on the final website structure. 2. Design Requirements Modern, premium fintech aesthetic Clean layouts with strong typography Professional colours and consistent branding Subtle animations and interactive elements Mobile, tablet, and desktop optimization High-quality icons and visual elements Clear calls to action throughout the website We will provide the company logo, brand colours, business description, and initial content. 3. Technical Requirements Wix or Wix Studio development Basic on-page SEO optimization Contact form integration Domain connection to oneborder.ca Fast-loading and mobile-friendly design Basic analytics setup Easy-to-edit content and page structure 4. Content & User Experience We will provide initial content and messaging. However, we would appreciate someone who can recommend improvements to page layouts, content presentation, and user experience. Experience designing websites for fintech, SaaS, B2B technology, or financial services companies is highly preferred. Deliverables Fully functional website published on Wix Approximately 5–7 professionally designed pages Responsive mobile and desktop layouts Contact form and basic SEO setup Two rounds of revisions Full ownership and editing access Brief handover or walkthrough showing how to update content Ideal Candidate We are looking for someone who: Has a strong portfolio of modern B2B or fintech websites Is experienced with Wix or Wix Studio Has excellent design judgment and attention to detail Can work independently with minimal supervision Communicates clearly and delivers on time Understands how to build websites that convert visitors into business leads How to Apply Please include the following in your proposal: Links to 3 websites you have designed, ideally for fintech, SaaS, or B2B companies. Your recommended approach for building OneBorder''s website. Whether you recommend Wix or Wix Studio and why. Your estimated timeline and fixed project price. What you would need from us to get started. Important: Please start your proposal with the words "OneBorder Website" so we know you''ve read the full description. We are looking for someone who can deliver a polished, professional website efficiently and potentially support future website enhancements as our business grows.', 1, 'FIXED', 12916000.00, 12916000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('bc146617-c037-5c1c-81aa-5b1479a061ca', '92353250-0f19-511f-a5be-8d4f0cf36509', 'Tìm team/ developer xây dựng hệ thống web (Fintech / Trading Tool)', 'Mình đang tìm team hoặc developer có kinh nghiệm xây dựng web application để phát triển một hệ thống hỗ trợ quản lý giao dịch tài chính. Thông tin tổng quan dự án: - Web application cho trader - Có thiết kế UI/UX sẵn (Figma) - Có kết nối dữ liệu từ MT5 - Bao gồm các module chính như: - User login / onboarding - Thiết lập cấu hình hệ thống - Dashboard & quản lý giao dịch - Journal / lưu trữ dữ liệu giao dịch - Trang quản trị Yêu cầu: Có kinh nghiệm làm web app backend + frontend Ưu tiên đã từng làm fintech / trading / MT5 integration Bạn quan tâm vui lòng inbox để nhận thêm thông tin dự án (Figma + scope).', 1, 'FIXED', 40000000.00, 50000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('d66cb3d7-932d-56a4-bf8a-9bba33d1c78c', 'ac80a274-ac8b-50ef-a4ed-ce62c83d35ac', 'Cần tuyển core banking developer', 'Công ty phần mềm Odyssey cần tuyển developer làm Core Banking có nghiệp vụ banking, ưu tiên core/tích hợp core, ngôn ngữ C++ hoặc Java.', 1, 'FIXED', 20000000.00, 40000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('e6dcea29-3487-57bd-b06a-f392ed39d52d', 'ddea9324-d2ba-541a-98db-ea178c2bd7e2', 'FIX message handler', 'We are looking for someone to build a FIX 4.4 message handler in order to purchase stock borrows from a single source. It would be 1 connection, 1 spec to third party, and it would need to connect to a web service that we have via API.', 1, 'HOURLY', 387000.00, 775000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('1f83716a-729a-57ee-b62c-4cd42d15868e', '78c55bdc-56fd-5759-bc85-8c4c9eec0475', 'Chúng tôi cần tuyển Freelancer Python Developer hỗ trợ xây dựng giải pháp tổng hợp & hợp nhất báo cáo tài chính từ các file Excel do công ty con gửi lên OneDrive/SharePoint.', 'Công ty con dùng template Excel chuẩn (Trial Balance / Notes / IC…) và upload lên thư mục OneDrive theo cấu trúc chuẩn Python script sẽ tự động: đọc dữ liệu theo template validate dữ liệu (các rule kiểm tra) chuẩn hóa theo mapping COA tổng hợp hợp nhất theo cấu trúc báo cáo xuất báo cáo tổng hợp ra Excel hoặc lưu vào database', 1, 'FIXED', 5000000.00, 10000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('db77864b-cd34-51a6-ae8b-2414ee5687da', 'e02ab342-093e-5f0a-b3a3-9dae92f9f67e', 'AI Receptionist Website Development', 'I need help coding and publishing my AI receptionist website, including setting up the site, connecting it to Stripe, and ensuring everything works smoothly before launch. The project includes building the website, handling the payment integration, and preparing the site for live deployment. I’m looking for someone who can manage the full setup and make sure the final product is ready to go.', 1, 'FIXED', 2583000.00, 2583000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('e121b67e-877b-5d51-b576-fd49ab828005', '0b7408a7-132b-5c99-86fe-016e82decbec', 'AI System for Information Management', 'I need an expert to help me create a system for organizing and retrieving information from digital books and construction drawings. The goal is to build a centralized bank of information that makes it easy to search, access, and manage these documents. I already have accounts with ChatGPT, Claude, and Gemini, and I want the expert to recommend the best platform for this project. The right freelancer should be able to design the system, set it up, and ensure it is efficient and user-friendly.', 1, 'HOURLY', 387000.00, 646000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('31a7a55c-b863-5ee8-96c7-d77e84a566f1', '4772cad5-a83f-50a0-89e8-17290f83aeff', 'Mobile App Developer Needed for Finance API Integration', 'Looking for a Flutter or React Native developer to integrate a third-party financial API into an existing finance mobile app. The task includes fetching and displaying financial data, handling API authentication, and basic testing and bug fixes. Experience with REST APIs, JSON, and fintech application is preferred.', 1, 'FIXED', 2583000.00, 2583000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('76fe58f0-e9fa-53b5-adc1-cfbd0469715f', 'b570fc18-3417-5aca-b551-3635bbcfdc36', 'Futures Order Flow Platform for PC — Finish Rithmic (R|API) Integration & Live Execution', 'ABOUT THE PROJECT Centeno Flow is my own order-flow analysis platform for futures (ES, NQ and micros): footprint charts, volume profile / TPO, DOM ladder, tape, replay and paper trading. It runs as a Windows desktop app for PC (.NET WebView2 wrapper around a web app) and in the browser. The analysis side is FINISHED. I need a developer to build the live connectivity and execution layer. YOUR WORK (milestones, fixed price, in this order) 1. Stable live data from Rithmic via R|API: a local Python bridge (asyncio + websockets, async_rithmic library) feeding ticks, DOM depth and bars to the app, with auto-reconnect. 2. Live order execution: MKT / LMT / STP / STP-LMT, OCO brackets (stop + target), cancel, flatten, order state tracking. 3. Real account data in the app: balance, equity, open P/L, positions — no placeholders. 4. Safety first: daily loss limit, position limits and a kill switch. Everything is tested on paper trading before any live test. 5. Audit and repair a list of existing indicators (I provide the list at kickoff). Acceptance = before/after verified on real data. 6. All work in MY GitHub repository from day 1, with documentation (English or Spanish). STACK Python (asyncio, websockets, async_rithmic), JavaScript (single-file web app), C# / .NET 8 + WebView2 (desktop wrapper already built). HOW WE START — PAID TRIAL ($100, 3 days) Before the full contract: a small paid trial against the Rithmic simulator — send/cancel orders, an OCO bracket with cross-cancellation, visible order states, bridge reconnection — delivered in my repo with a short demo video. If the trial passes, we continue milestone by milestone with escrow. The full project is budgeted at $1,500–$4,500 depending on the trial and your rate. SCREENING QUESTION (answer it in your proposal) Connecting to Rithmic with correct credentials returns rp_code 13 "permission denied" at authentication. What does it mean, and who is the only party that can fix it?', 1, 'FIXED', 2583000.00, 2583000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('2ec6a374-e4df-5549-998e-875bbff525c3', '3bd3fb06-cf31-501c-be66-7606cd38c9b9', 'Cần viết website doanh nghiệp có chức năng đầu tư, gửi tiết kiệm online', 'Hiện tại bên mình cần viết 1 website doanh nghiệp, có chức năng sau: 1. Trang chủ 2. Giới thiệu doanh nghiệp 3. Sản phẩm - Dịch vụ 4. Liên hệ Member đăng ký/ đăng nhập/ KYC Member có các chức năng: Gửi tiết kiệm, mua sản phẩm đầu tư hưởng lãi suất, lịch sử tiền gửi. Nạp/rút tiền ( qua bank ) Và một số chức năng cơ bản cho quản lý xem và duyệt báo cáo có thể trao đổi thêm. Liên hệ với mình qua zola Kh.ông năm năm chí.n sá.u bả.y một hai bả.y nă.m để trao đổi chi tiết', 1, 'FIXED', 3000000.00, 8000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('6a48a6d4-5a9f-5388-bdd9-8f11f489143d', 'ea06e6d3-d57e-5075-84da-e96cfddc661c', 'Kiểm thử xâm nhập website', 'Phát hiện lỗ hổng: Phát hiện các lỗi trước khi trang web bị xâm phạm hoặc dữ liệu khách hàng bị đánh cắp. Đánh giá rủi ro: Xác định mức độ nguy hiểm mà mỗi lỗ hổng gây ra cho hệ thống. Tuân thủ: Nhiều ngân hàng và tổ chức yêu cầu báo cáo kiểm thử xâm nhập định kỳ để đảm bảo an ninh dữ liệu. Tìm lỗi hiển thị, test chức năng,...', 1, 'FIXED', 200000.00, 2500000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('f6356e66-e021-5ee2-9f3c-e2d9dc243de7', '986f6759-e303-512e-8f92-9894c8e28655', 'Flutter Developer | iOS & Android App Development | Bug Fixing', 'I am looking for an experienced Flutter developer to build and improve a mobile app for both iOS and Android (hybrid / cross-platform). What I need: - Build the app in Flutter and Dart (FlutterFlow experience is a plus) - User login and signup with Firebase or Supabase - RESTful API integration - Payment gateway integration with Stripe - In-app purchases - AI features using the OpenAI API, including a chatbot - Mobile app redesign: clean, modern and responsive UI - Convert our existing website into a mobile app (if applicable) - Bug fixing and performance improvements - Push notifications Requirements: - Strong experience with Flutter and Dart - Experience with Firebase, Supabase and REST APIs - Experience with Stripe and in-app purchases - Experience with OpenAI API / chatbot development - Good knowledge of state management (Provider, Bloc or Riverpod) - Clean, well-commented code and Git usage - Ability to publish the app to Google Play Store and Apple App Store Project details: - Size: Medium - Timeline: 1 to 3 months - Level: Intermediate - Budget: $15 - $30/hr To apply, please share: 1. Links or screenshots of similar Flutter apps you have built 2. Your experience with Stripe, Firebase/Supabase and OpenAI integration 3. Your estimated timeline and how you would approach this project I prefer regular progress updates and clear communication. Looking forward to your proposals.', 1, 'HOURLY', 258000.00, 517000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00');

