    ('c4e9c0af-076e-5d04-a1ec-0f0ee59c4b7b', '755e4520-79b7-543f-9f4c-cb012e25321a', 'Cybersecurity and Compliance Consultant', 'Need a consultant with experience helping small US-based software firms pass penetration testing and SOC2 Type 2 compliance. We develop Windows solutions installed in client environments and host websites using Azure App Service Plans with SQL Azure, with plans to expand to client data hosting. We also use Azure VMs for internal and client applications and have an on-premise network and server protected by a firewall, used only by developers. We need guidance on how to pass PEN testing and SOC2 Type 2 compliance based on similar software firm experiences.', 1, 'HOURLY', 517000.00, 1292000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('30613c88-1c84-51fd-b618-3ee13cf102b7', 'cfcaa3ad-b3a4-558c-8d16-9bdaa473d54b', 'Mobile Cybersecurity Specialist for Spyware Analysis and Remote Access Technology Training', 'Hi, I''m looking to work with an experienced mobile cybersecurity specialist to learn about Android and iOS security, mobile spyware, and remote-access technologies. I''m interested in understanding how image-based exploits work, how spyware infects mobile devices, how remote-access tools are developed, and how security professionals identify and prevent unauthorized access. I''m looking for someone who can provide hands-on training in a controlled testing environment using devices I own or have explicit permission to test. Could you please share your experience, the training you offer, the tools and technologies involved, and your estimated cost? Thank you.', 1, 'FIXED', 1550000.00, 1550000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('c560c0fd-b8c7-50bd-b453-7ba9392fbf61', 'ba7b1f3f-888a-5f85-b1f7-bde2338736a3', 'Pre-launch security review & pentest of Node.js web app (medical practice, German UI)', 'We are a small private medical practice in Germany. We have developed a self-built, web-based internal application that runs on a local server in our practice network and is used in the browser on our Macs and iPads. It is local only – it is not online and will not be accessible from the internet. It covers patient intake forms, patient records, cost estimates/contracts, cash book and staff tasks. Before we start using it in our daily practice, we want an experienced, independent security professional to review it thoroughly. The app will handle sensitive health data (GDPR Art. 9), so security must be verified first. About the app - Node.js server (no npm dependencies), plain HTML/JavaScript frontend, roughly 15 server files plus ~30 pages - Data stored as AES-256-GCM encrypted files (no database) - Runs in a Docker container on a Synology NAS inside the practice LAN only (no internet exposure, no cloud) - Staff log in with personal PINs; role-based permissions (reception, OR staff, practice manager, admin) - Used on Macs (staff) and iPads; iPads can switch into a restricted "patient mode" for intake forms with signatures - IMPORTANT: The user interface, code comments and documentation are in German. You do not need to speak German, but you must be comfortable working with German labels (browser translation is fine). Scope (white-box) - You receive the full source code plus synthetic test data and a start guide. You run the app locally on your own machine. - NO access to our network, servers or any real patient data – everything is tested on your local copy. - Source code review focused on security - Hands-on testing of the running app, including: - authentication, PIN brute-force protection, session handling, lockout - authorization: can a lower role access other roles'' data or functions (IDOR, privilege escalation)? - iPad patient mode: can a patient escape it or see other patients'' data? - attacks from inside the local network (e.g. another device in the practice Wi-Fi) - XSS, injection, CSRF, path traversal - file uploads (photos, Excel import) - encryption and key handling - deployment notes (Docker/NAS configuration – review of our written setup, no access) Deliverables 1. Written report in English: each finding with severity (CVSS), proof/steps to reproduce, and a concrete fix recommendation 2. Short executive summary for a non-technical owner 3. One retest after we have fixed the findings Requirements - Proven application security / penetration testing experience; OSCP, OSWE, CREST or', 1, 'HOURLY', 775000.00, 2067000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('29763857-c96a-58ab-8fb7-15ce2cbdf33c', '314ae80f-9a2b-5f72-abd7-9ebd1c4f2261', 'Làm app dịch vụ chăm sóc sức khỏe tại nhà', 'giao diện đơn giản dễ sử dụng khách đăng nhập, chọn dịch vụ, thời gian, địa điểm nhân viên xác nhận làm xong thanh toán tiền mặt hoặc quét mã QR thống kê thu nhập nhân viên', 1, 'FIXED', 1000000.00, 2000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('f9ebc6c3-78c5-5acb-8849-e6149a3840e5', 'f4375e08-59e8-5fc9-a385-b139fd641db1', 'Urgent Incident Response: Guest Phishing & Booking/Email Account Security', 'We manage vacation rentals, and some guests are receiving phishing messages impersonating our business or booking communications. We suspect a security incident, but the source and extent have not been confirmed. We need an experienced, hands-on incident-response specialist who can start promptly, trace the source, stop unauthorized access, and help fix confirmed security gaps. INITIAL PHASE: $500 FIXED PRICE This budget is for a focused initial investigation and agreed containment/hardening work. In your proposal, clearly state what you can complete within $500, the deliverables, and the expected timeline. Any broader remediation or testing must be quoted and approved separately before proceeding. SCOPE - Review supplied phishing-message samples, headers where available, timestamps, and relevant account, messaging, and integration logs; preserve useful evidence. - Determine whether the evidence points to account takeover, sender impersonation, exposed guest data, a compromised integration, or another cause. Separate confirmed findings from hypotheses. - Review relevant authorized business-email, booking-platform/PMS, and connected messaging accounts. Assess suspicious sessions, staff access, third-party app permissions, API tokens, MFA/recovery settings, forwarding rules, and delegated access as applicable. - Perform agreed containment and targeted fixes while coordinating production changes to avoid disrupting legitimate guest communications. - Verify the implemented changes and explain what was tested and what remains unresolved. DELIVERABLES 1. Plain-English findings with supporting evidence and an incident timeline where available. 2. Systems/accounts and guest data potentially affected, with confidence and limitations clearly stated. 3. A record of containment and fixes actually implemented, plus verification results. 4. A prioritized list of remaining risks and a separate estimate for any additional work. EXPERIENCE Please demonstrate experience investigating real account compromises and SaaS/email incidents. Experience with Google Workspace, booking platforms, OwnerRez, and messaging integrations is useful. Certifications are welcome, but practical incident-response experience and clear communication matter most. ACCESS AND CONFIDENTIALITY Work is limited to systems we own or explicitly authorize. Start with supplied evidence/read-only access where practical, use temporary access as needed, protect guest information, and preserve evidence. Coordinate disruptive changes in advance. No destructive testing or testing of third-party platforms without authorization. PLEASE INCLUDE - Earliest start time, timezone, and availability for an initial call through Upwork. - One or two comparable incidents you handled, without revealing client information. - Your first investigation steps and the specific work/deliverables included in the $500 phase. - A redacted sample report, if available. Please keep proposals and communications on Upwork. We will share sensitive evidence privately with the selected specialist.', 1, 'FIXED', 12916000.00, 12916000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('45d57dc7-ace4-5a6a-a176-8745a3efe25b', 'b0b9e637-ddfc-5c96-a403-5c5ca29db39b', 'Independent Security & Architecture Review – Deno / Supabase AI Application', 'I''m seeking an experienced, independent application-security specialist or senior software engineer to review the security foundations of an AI support application being developed for a private online community. **THIS IS A SECURITY AND ARCHITECTURE REVIEW ONLY — NOT A SOFTWARE DEVELOPMENT JOB.** **Project** - Backend: JavaScript/TypeScript, Deno, Supabase/PostgreSQL - AI integration: Anthropic models - Estimated effort: approximately 8–12 hours - Fixed-price budget: $530 - Worldwide applicants welcome - Review can begin within one week of hiring **Review priorities** 1. Authentication: one-time login codes, sessions, token security, expiration and revocation. 2. Authorization: role enforcement, cross-user data isolation and administrator access. 3. Database security: PostgreSQL privileges, row-level security, security-definer functions and migrations. 4. Protected emergency records: resistance to unauthorized modification or deletion. 5. Retention and deletion controls. 6. Emergency shutdown mechanisms and failure behavior. 7. AI model and tool-execution boundaries, including prompt injection and data leakage. 8. Safety-detection and response logic, including fail-safe behavior. This is a focused, risk-based assessment, not a comprehensive penetration test or security certification. Prioritize consequential weaknesses and identify any areas not tested. **What you receive** After signing a nondisclosure agreement, you will receive a sanitized, version-controlled ZIP containing relevant source code, database migrations, tests, technical documentation and selected evidence. You will NOT receive: - GitHub repository access - Production or development system access - API keys, passwords or credentials - Real community-member data You may inspect and test the code in an isolated local environment, including temporary modifications to your local copy necessary to reproduce security findings. You may not modify our working systems or repositories. **Required deliverables** **1. Professional written security-review report**, including: - Executive summary: are the foundations suitable for continued development? - Findings ranked Critical, High, Medium or Low - File and line references where applicable - Evidence, consequences and specific recommended corrections - Important controls found sound - Tests performed and areas not assessed **2. Live video walkthrough**, lasting 30–45 minutes, explaining findings, answering questions and identifying corrective priorities. The meeting will be recorded with all participants'' consent. Both deliverables are included in the fixed price. **Timeline** - Written report due within **7 calendar days** of receiving the review package. - Final video walkthrough within **3 business days** after delivery of the report. - I will respond to review-blocking questions within **1 business day**. - Documented delays caused by my failure to provide necessary information will extend the affected deadline by the corresponding delay. - Any other requested extension requires my written agreement. Missed deadlines without timely notice may result in contract termination subject to Upwork''s procedures. **Mandatory conditions** - Upwork identity-verified profile before confidential materials are provided - Signed NDA before disclosure of confidential information - No unauthorized subcontracting or sharing - No AI tools of any kind, including locally hosted AI, may process confidential project materials without my prior written authorization - No unauthorized uploads to third-party services - Confidential treatment of code, findings and report - Written confirmation of deletion of review materials after completion, as specified in the NDA - Live video interview before selection - Clear, fluent spoken and written English - Ability to explain technical issues to a business owner who is not a professional programmer The completed report may be shared with my designated technical advisers, including AI advisers, for internal evaluation and correction planning. **Qualifications** Strong experience in application security, independent code review, PostgreSQL permissions and JavaScript/TypeScript is essential. Experience with Deno, Supabase, and AI application security is desirable. A strong Upwork work history and a sanitized example of a previous security-review report are preferred. **Screening questions** 1. Describe a real security review you performed. What significant weakness did you discover, and how did you verify it? 2. How would you test whether one user can access another user''s records in PostgreSQL/Supabase? 3. How would you verify that a protected emergency-record table cannot be updated or deleted by an application role? 4. Can you provide a sanitized example of your reporting format? 5. Are you willing to sign the NDA, avoid AI tools without written authorization, and participate in both video meetings? 6. What is your time zone and availability for calls during U.S. Eastern business hours? 7. Can you deliver the written report within 7 calendar days of receiving the materials and complete the video walkthrough within the following 3 business days? I am looking for an independent professional who will challenge assumptions, examine evidence, and clearly report what is secure, what is vulnerable, and what remains unverified. Generic proposals will not be considered.', 1, 'FIXED', 13691000.00, 13691000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('902c9aa2-a997-5eb5-be57-60033ec7e14c', '74ef89fc-2522-587b-92a8-125d716a4b14', 'Cần Senior Flutter Developer Audit Kiến trúc & Bảo mật App Flutter + Supabase', 'Chúng tôi cần tìm một Senior Flutter Developer có kinh nghiệm thực tế để audit toàn bộ kiến trúc của một ứng dụng Flutter trước khi đưa lên production. Lưu ý: Không yêu cầu phát triển tính năng mới hoặc viết lại code. Công việc bao gồm: Review toàn bộ source code Flutter Đánh giá kiến trúc và cách tổ chức project Kiểm tra bảo mật (Authentication, Authorization, Supabase, RLS...) Đánh giá việc lưu trữ dữ liệu local, ảnh, file, voice Đánh giá offline-first và đồng bộ dữ liệu Đánh giá khả năng mở rộng và maintain của hệ thống Chỉ ra các rủi ro trước khi đưa ứng dụng lên production Đề xuất phương án cải thiện Deliverables mong muốn: Báo cáo Audit kiến trúc Báo cáo Audit bảo mật Production Readiness Checklist Danh sách rủi ro và mức độ ưu tiên Khuyến nghị cải thiện hệ thống Thời gian dự kiến: 5–7 ngày Có thể trao đổi online 1–2 buổi để làm rõ yêu cầu.', 1, 'FIXED', 15000000.00, 30000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('3c4683d6-2fe9-5bc7-9082-343e172b1883', '108b508e-628c-504c-8f9d-129eede9f2ed', 'Get my X account back', 'My X account was hacked, and I need someone to help me retrieve my account back', 1, 'FIXED', 1292000.00, 1292000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('8e0ba620-d3a4-5b6b-aabf-75c70d098ae5', '7cb4c6ee-f7d5-5daf-9e72-67841e65548a', 'SIH26265 – AICTE Security Deposit/FDR Management Portal (Smart Automation)', 'I''m developing a software solution for Smart India Hackathon (SIH) problem statement SIH26265: "Streamline of Security Deposit/FDR Portal," issued by AICTE under the Smart Automation theme. Objective Build a professional, functional web application that streamlines the lifecycle of security deposits and Fixed Deposit Receipts (FDRs), reducing manual paperwork, missed maturity dates, delays in approvals and difficulty tracking deposit status. Core features required 1. Dashboard - Display total deposits/FDRs, total value, active deposits, upcoming maturities, pending approvals and released deposits. - Provide search, filters and status indicators. 2. FDR/deposit management - Create, view, update and search deposit records. - Store FDR/reference number, institution/vendor, issuing bank, deposit amount, creation date, maturity date, interest rate (where applicable), purpose, attached documents and current status. - Validate required fields and dates. 3. Lifecycle and approval workflow - Support submission, review, approval/rejection, renewal and release workflows. - Track the responsible user, timestamps, comments and status changes. - Include a clear record of every important action. 4. Automated reminders - Highlight upcoming maturity dates and overdue actions. - Provide configurable maturity warnings and dashboard alerts. - If email notifications cannot be integrated within the deadline, implement functional in-app notifications and demonstrate them using realistic sample data. 5. Document management - Allow users to upload and view supporting documents where feasible. - Associate documents with the relevant deposit record. - Validate file types and handle errors safely. 6. Reports and audit trail - Provide a filterable deposit register and summary reports. - Record important changes, approvals, renewals and releases in an audit log. - Include CSV export if feasible. 7. Authentication and roles - Provide a working login/demo experience. - Include administrator and reviewer/user permissions where feasible. - Prevent unauthorized users from performing approval actions. Technical requirements My expected stack is React for the frontend, FastAPI and Python for the backend, SQLAlchemy for database access, and a suitable database such as SQLite for a quick local MVP or PostgreSQL if already configured. Please inspect my existing codebase before deciding whether to reuse or modify the architecture. The frontend, backend and database must be integrated. I need actual working CRUD operations, persisted data, functional navigation, realistic sample records and a reliable demo—not merely static screens or a Figma design. One standout feature Please prioritize an intelligent maturity-management feature that identifies FDRs approaching maturity, highlights overdue actions and recommends the next action (renew, release or review) based on the record''s status and configured rules. Clearly label rule-based recommendations; do not present them as financial or legal advice. Delivery requirements by October 27, 2026 - Complete source code and project files. - Working frontend, backend and database integration. - Setup instructions and environment-variable example. - Database schema and sample/demo data. - A working local run or deployed demo. - Testing of the main user journeys. - README with architecture, features, setup and known limitations. - A short demo walkthrough suitable for an SIH evaluation. Timeline and budget My total budget is ₹5,000. Please confirm the exact scope you can realistically deliver within this budget and the deadline before starting. Prioritize a reliable, complete core workflow over unnecessary features. I can provide the official problem statement, existing codebase/repository and additional requirements. Please confirm your availability for immediate work and whether you can collaborate live so I can understand and maintain the solution. This is an SIH submission, so I need to ensure all development assistance complies with the applicable competition and institutional rules. Please do not use fabricated integrations, misleading AI claims or nonfunctional demo buttons.', 1, 'FIXED', 1292000.00, 1292000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('f587bb9d-8d50-5db8-be36-46c5bb78300c', '888267f7-fa6c-5a1d-aad8-c1e5135c7791', 'Hide the maindomain also from subdomain subdomain is not separate domain', 'I am working on a university-provided Cybersecurity Final Year Project. The university has provided access to a domain and its Cloudflare DNS settings. A subdomain has already been created and is available for the project. I need an experienced email deliverability and DNS configuration specialist who understands Brevo, Cloudflare, SPF, DKIM, DMARC, and email authentication headers. My Requirements: 1. Configure Brevo with the existing university-provided domain and subdomain. 2. Review the current DNS records and identify the technically feasible options for configuring the email setup. 3. My primary requirement is to ensure that the main domain is not displayed even not in the subdomain in the email''s visible sender details or relevant authentication headers, particularly the **From, Signed-by, and Mailed-by** fields, wherever technically possible. 4. The main domain appearing in the original email source is acceptable. However, I want to understand whether the visible sender information and authentication-related fields can be configured to use the subdomain instead. 5. Recommend the best technically feasible solution using the existing domain, Cloudflare DNS, and Brevo, without purchasing another domain if possible. 6. Explain any limitations imposed by Brevo, DNS configuration, or email authentication standards. **Important Notes:** - This is an academic Cybersecurity Final Year Project using university-provided infrastructure. - I already have access to the domain and Cloudflare. - A subdomain is already available; I do not need to purchase a separate domain. - I am looking for a practical, technically sound solution rather than a general explanation. - Please clearly explain what can and cannot be achieved before making any configuration changes. **Required Expertise:** Brevo, Cloudflare DNS, email deliverability, SPF, DKIM, DMARC, SMTP, and email header analysis. Please apply only technically supported configurations and explain the expected results and limitations before proceeding.', 1, 'FIXED', 387000.00, 387000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('751d5856-2fd5-5b37-b57e-d15cf00787e7', 'bff0709c-873b-5a1e-802e-6767ae9d8b0e', 'Senior developer needed: 1-hour paid review of an AI code review tool', 'I’m the founder of AuditBench AI, a tool that reviews pull requests and full codebases for security vulnerabilities, exposed secrets and logic bugs, and gives a clear ship or don’t-ship verdict. I’m looking for experienced developers to test it and give honest, detailed feedback. This is a short, paid evaluation task. There’s no sales pitch, and you don’t need to buy anything. WHAT YOU’LL DO (about 1 hour): Run AuditBench AI on a personal or test repository. Please don’t use code belonging to your employer or clients. Review the findings and judge whether they were accurate, useful or noisy. Answer the 6 feedback questions below in writing. Optional ($15 bonus): record a 3–5 minute screen recording of your first impressions. FEEDBACK QUESTIONS: What type of project did you test, and in which language or framework? Which findings were genuinely useful? Which were wrong or unnecessary? Did it miss anything important a senior reviewer would catch? How clear were the explanations and suggested fixes? How does it compare to other tools you have used, such as CodeRabbit, GitHub Copilot review or SonarQube? Would you or your team use it? What would need to change first? REQUIREMENTS: 5+ years of professional development experience Comfortable reviewing Node.js, Python or a similar stack Experience with pull requests on GitHub or GitLab Clear written English DELIVERABLES: Written answers to the 6 questions Optional screen recording Budget: $30 fixed, plus a $15 bonus for the recording. Honest criticism is more valuable to me than praise. I’d rather hear what’s broken than what’s nice.', 1, 'HOURLY', 517000.00, 1033000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('3b926a28-52c2-5e28-a294-96696e3b5fcc', '0b3e2236-8106-5072-97c6-0944dbe2a5cd', 'Senior VoIP Engineer – VICIdial, ViciBox & VOS3000', 'We are looking for an experienced VoIP Engineer for a long-term, monthly Upwork contract to install, configure, manage, and troubleshoot our VoIP infrastructure. Key Responsibilities: Install and configure ViciBox, VICIdial, Asterisk, and VOS3000. Configure inbound and outbound calling infrastructure. Set up SIP trunks, carriers, DIDs, and call routing. Integrate VICIdial with VOS3000 and external SIP providers. Troubleshoot SIP, RTP, call quality, and connectivity issues. Optimize infrastructure for high-volume concurrent calls. Provide ongoing server maintenance, monitoring, and technical support. Requirements: 5+ years of hands-on VoIP experience. Strong expertise in VICIdial, ViciBox, VOS3000, and Asterisk. Experience with Linux server administration and SIP protocols. Proven experience deploying production VoIP systems. Contract Type: Monthly / Long-Term To Apply: Please share your relevant experience, previous VoIP deployments, monthly rate, and availability. Important: We need a hands-on engineer who can independently install, configure, and maintain the complete infrastructure, not just provide consultation.', 1, 'FIXED', 30998000.00, 30998000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('1f226a0a-cd1b-5269-a9c5-e34819ffb8f0', 'b3f5090c-bd06-57ed-96c4-f977347a9954', 'Security Operations Center Analyst I - Weekend Shift/Floater', 'We are seeking a Security Operations Center Analyst to triage security alerts generated from our SIEM (Sentinel). Triage alerts as false positives or react to true positives by resetting user passwords or isolating computer accounts in Microsoft Defender for Endpoint. Escalate incidents to customers using our Service Desk Software. The technologies that the person will be working with include Microsoft Sentinel, the entire suite of Microsoft 365 Defender products, and potentially Microsoft Defender for Cloud. Candidates for this role should be familiar with attack vectors, cyberthreats, incident management, and Kusto Query Language (KQL). Must Have: Prior experience working in a Security Operating Center Above Average English Language - Verbal and Written A laptop with a fast and stable Internet Connection Nice to Have: Security Certifications: SC-200, AZ-500 We are hiring for the following (Weekend) shifts, as well as the opportunity for a floating analyst: 1st Shift (12 AM PST to 8 AM PST)', 1, 'HOURLY', 387000.00, 1033000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('3b1bb313-e31f-5348-b510-a8c56cb0fbce', '6c172bbe-8cec-5499-9342-7f0819b550ed', 'PHP Website and Server Security', 'We have a PHP website used for internal document control hosted on a cloud-based Apache server. We use MySQL for database functions. We need help with the following: * Resolving bugs with the existing PHP code as they are found * Adding new functionality, using PHP and MySQL * Patching PHP and fixing deprecated functions * Optimizing firewall settings * Implementing recommended security updates * Securing FTP access and settings Key skill is ensuring everything works smoothly after any changes are made. Anticipate needing 10 hours/week for 2-3 months but this will flex up and down depending on the needs of the team.', 1, 'HOURLY', 1292000.00, 1550000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('4bf1ce3e-e6cd-56e6-97c1-433bc81be83d', 'df5e17eb-9d5b-5e58-91ee-3f5aedc16183', 'Paid trial: senior Linux/PHP reviewer for security verification reports', 'Oakshield (oakshield.co) verifies whether small businesses'' PHP and WordPress servers are actually patched for recent critical PHP vulnerabilities, and whether there are signs of compromise. Oakshield is a business of Luven Technologies LLC, a new US firm. Our tools collect read-only evidence and a rule engine decides pass/fail. A named person approves every report. We need a senior engineer as an independent reviewer. The work: you review evidence bundles (process lists, package versions and changelogs, PHP-FPM and php.ini settings, file hashes, cron and user lists). You confirm or challenge our draft findings, and approve or escalate. No access to client systems, ever. About 1–2 hours per job, booked in advance with an agreed response time. To start: our first 10 jobs per service, plus any job with a possible sign of compromise or an online store. You have: - 5+ years running production PHP (PHP-FPM, Apache/mod_php, nginx) on Linux - Real familiarity with distro and vendor backports (Debian/Ubuntu, RHEL/Alma, cPanel, CloudLinux, Plesk) - WordPress/WooCommerce experience - Incident-response judgment ("stop, preserve evidence, escalate") - Clear writing Terms: hourly (tell us your rate), no minimum, per booked job. Paid trial first: 2–3 hours reviewing three test servers. Before you see any real client data, we require a short NDA and contractor terms (confidentiality, IP, data handling) and a background check. Professional liability (E&O) insurance is required within 30 days. US-based preferred. Individuals only, no agencies. To apply, answer: 1. Which weekday and evening hours (time zone) could you cover? 2. In 3–6 sentences: how do you confirm a PHP fix is actually running on a Debian or RHEL server whose package keeps an old version number? 3. Does any current employment or contract restrict outside work or claim IP you create?', 1, 'HOURLY', 2067000.00, 3616000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('d11f191c-6953-5efe-8e11-1d09ba068b7a', '5b1de9a5-748e-51d0-9337-6c2ac39aa981', 'Tạo api kết nối với phần mềm để show dữ liệu', 'Cty có nền tảng azure, có source code web, tìm người tạo vm trên azure, deloy code web lên đó và tạo api để kết nối với api ở database phần mềm ở dưới local server. Mục đính show dữ liệu lên website Yêu cầu ứng viên - Có kinh nghiệm thực tế với Microsoft Azure, đặc biệt: *Azure Virtual Machine *Network / Security Group / Firewall - Có kinh nghiệm deploy web (ASP.NET, NodeJS, PHP hoặc nền tảng phù hợp với source code hiện có) - Hiểu rõ cách xây dựng & tích hợp REST API - Có kinh nghiệm kết nối hệ thống cloud ↔ local server - Nắm được các vấn đề bảo mật cơ bản (API key, token, HTTPS) - Ưu tiên ứng viên: *Đã từng triển khai hệ thống hybrid (Cloud + On-premise) *Có thể tư vấn thêm phương án tối ưu, ổn định hệ thống', 1, 'FIXED', 3000000.00, 3000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('1ece4b08-a950-5cb3-94d5-958699ccfdd4', '745b55b3-e160-5179-9eba-6cdb35cf4b76', 'Fix flutter webview', 'Tôi cần 3 nút này hoạt động trên flutter webview. Yêu cầu: Bảo mật dự án. thời gian fix: 1 ngày xong bug này sẽ có nhiều task khác để làm', 1, 'FIXED', 200000.00, 200000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('69787fc4-0d36-5aea-9b71-b7d3ea187635', '87fb963e-b7d3-5d58-a6ee-df81a981dd4f', 'Native Windows desktop GPT agent app', 'Ngôn ngữ lập trình: Thành thạo C# (.NET 8+) hoặc C++ và TypeScript/Node.js Kiến thức hệ thống (Critical) Kỹ thuật Evasion Network Security', 1, 'FIXED', 30000000.00, 50000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('2339436f-f056-518a-ba5b-13f7458b7f93', 'a06c0ad6-8085-5def-a5e4-4c00a4eab6b0', 'Senior B2B SaaS Website Designer | Conversion-Focused UX & Figma Design System', 'Senior B2B SaaS Website Designer | Conversion-Focused UX & Figma Design System We''re looking for an experienced B2B SaaS website designer to improve the visual quality, user experience, and conversion potential of an existing SaaS marketing website. The product operates in the SEO and digital marketing technology industry, with AI-powered capabilities and workflow automation. Our website is already live and functional. We''re looking to elevate its design quality, improve how we communicate product value, and create a consistent, reusable design system. This is a website design project, not an application dashboard redesign or development project. WHAT WE NEED 1. Website UX and Visual Improvements Review the existing website and identify opportunities to improve: - Overall visual quality and professional appearance - Information hierarchy and content presentation - User experience and navigation - Conversion-focused layouts and CTA placement - Product feature presentation and visualization - Typography, spacing, and visual consistency - Desktop and mobile usability We prefer improving the existing website rather than redesigning everything unnecessarily. 2. Core Marketing Page Designs We''ll need designs for several important B2B SaaS marketing pages, including: - Homepage - Main product page - Pricing page - Customer-specific solution pages - Product comparison pages The exact page list and requirements will be shared with shortlisted candidates before requesting a final quote. 3. Reusable Figma Design System This is a key requirement. We want a design system that our development team can reuse to build future pages while maintaining a consistent visual identity. It should include: - Colors, typography, spacing, and layout foundations - Buttons, forms, navigation, cards, and other UI elements - Reusable hero sections and feature layouts - Product screenshot and demonstration components - Pricing and comparison components - Testimonials, FAQs, and CTA sections - Responsive components and layouts - Figma Auto Layout, component variants, and reusable styles/variables We expect a functional, well-organized component library, not just a static style guide. 4. Product Visualization Our SaaS product has multiple features, workflows, and AI capabilities. We want a designer who can present complex software functionality through clear, attractive, and easy-to-understand visuals. Experience designing websites for AI SaaS, SEO software, marketing technology, or workflow automation products is a plus. COPYWRITING AND DEVELOPMENT We''re working with a professional B2B SaaS copywriter who is developing our positioning, messaging, and website copy. The designer will work with the approved copy and help translate it into effective visual layouts. Our development team will handle implementation. We''re looking for Figma design deliverables only, including responsive layouts and developer handoff. WHO WE''RE LOOKING FOR - Proven experience designing high-quality B2B SaaS marketing websites - Strong understanding of conversion-focused website UX - Excellent visual design skills and attention to detail - Advanced Figma skills and experience building reusable design systems - Ability to design effective product and feature presentations - Experience with responsive website design - Ability to collaborate with copywriters and developers We prefer designers with experience working on established SaaS products rather than only designing startup landing page templates. HOW TO APPLY Please include: 1. Three live B2B SaaS websites you''ve designed, ideally with links to the live sites. 2. Your specific role and contribution to those projects. 3. An example of a reusable Figma design system or component library you''ve created. 4. A brief explanation of how you approach improving an existing SaaS website''s design and conversion experience. 5. Your typical pricing range for a multi-page SaaS website design project that includes a reusable design system. 6. Your availability and estimated project duration. We''re particularly interested in designers who can demonstrate both strong visual design and thoughtful conversion-focused UX. SELECTION PROCESS We''ll review portfolios and shortlist candidates based on relevant experience and design quality. Shortlisted designers will receive the website URL, detailed page requirements, and project scope so they can provide an accurate fixed-price proposal. We''d prefer to start with a paid website audit and design direction before proceeding with the full project. We''re looking for someone who can help establish a professional, scalable visual foundation for our SaaS website.', 1, 'FIXED', 38748000.00, 38748000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('91e79c58-78b6-5c0e-8b60-4ea675121077', '8a8d0acb-fd99-52b1-864b-8bb06f7994e8', 'Website Design and Migration', 'We’re redesigning the website for a client and need an experienced Webflow developer to build it. You’ll work alongside our design lead (UX/UI and approvals) and an outside marketing agency (content and SEO strategy). Your role covers development, CMS setup, blog migration, QA, and launch. The most important part of this project is migrating our existing blog without losing its organic search value. We know rankings can’t be guaranteed, but we expect a careful, documented process that follows SEO best practices. What you’ll do: Build and customize the site from an existing Webflow template, implementing approved designs responsively across all devices Audit and migrate existing blog posts into Webflow CMS, keeping content, dates, authors, categories, and metadata intact Preserve existing URLs wherever possible and set up 301 redirects where they must change Carry over titles, meta descriptions, canonicals, headings, alt text, and internal links; verify sitemaps and indexing Test URLs and redirects for broken links, redirect chains, and missing metadata Create reusable CMS templates for service pages, services/fleet/vehicle pages, and the blog Structure the site and CTAs to support a separate booking system we’ll add later (the booking system itself is out of scope) Handle QA, launch support, and a short CMS walkthrough or documentation Required: Strong hands-on Webflow experience, including CMS collections and dynamic templates Proven experience migrating blogs or content-heavy sites into Webflow while preserving SEO Solid understanding of migration SEO: redirects, metadata, canonicals, sitemaps, indexing Clear communication and comfort working with designers and an outside SEO agency Nice to have: Experience with large established sites, transportation or service businesses, Google Search Console/Analytics, or booking platform integrations. In your proposal, please include: 2–3 live Webflow sites you’ve built or migrated A blog migration you’ve done and how you handled URLs, redirects, metadata, and validation A brief outline of how you’d approach this migration and launch Your timeline and availability Your pricing (fixed or hourly) and any scope assumptions Please focus on your SEO-sensitive migration experience, not just general Webflow work.', 1, 'HOURLY', 387000.00, 775000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('243b039d-18ca-5124-a76d-83aa190d8447', '9e353a11-2954-5ab6-bab8-ba465653dbd1', 'Website Designer for Homepage Edits', 'I need a Wordpress website designer to update my existing homepage and here is example https://www.lcclconstruction.co.uk of the homepage I want you to use as example', 1, 'HOURLY', 387000.00, 517000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('6b9cb994-1939-5e4b-8cab-fd2d6ba4079d', '6d734d28-75b9-53b2-a75c-37b2d4d69f53', 'Job Title: UI/UX Website Designer – Premium Financial Services Website (Figma)', 'Budget: $60 Fixed Price We''re looking for a talented UI/UX web designer to refine and polish the existing website designs for Real Path Financial, a financial services company. We''re aiming for a premium, institutional appearance inspired by companies like Morgan Stanley, Goldman Sachs, and Northwestern Mutual. What We Already Have: Company logo and established forest green, gold, and cream branding Existing homepage hero image and layout Financial Products page design featuring six product cards Initial design direction for our Join Real Path recruiting page Established website structure and content direction What We Need: Refine our existing homepage to look more polished and professional Improve the Financial Products page layout Design a clean Financial Education page Create a simple, elegant Contact Us page Refine the Join Real Path recruiting page Ensure consistent typography, spacing, colors, and visual styling throughout Deliverables: Figma designs for desktop and mobile Organized, editable design files ready for developer handoff Important: We already have a developer handling implementation. This project is strictly for UI/UX design. We''re not starting from scratch. We have existing designs and references to share. Please send your portfolio, preferably featuring premium corporate or financial services websites.', 1, 'FIXED', 2067000.00, 2067000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('2e237240-dfc2-5fe8-82e9-1c33c55f5d05', '9d004240-3f96-52c7-8d14-1613c3f4de03', 'Default Website Design Template for Pizzerias', 'We need a default website design template tailored for pizzerias that is clean, easy to customize, and ready for use. The template should support key pages such as home, menu, about, and contact, with a layout that feels welcoming and professional. We’re looking for someone who can create a polished, responsive design that can be adapted across different pizzeria brands. Please share relevant examples of similar templates or restaurant-focused designs.', 1, 'HOURLY', 517000.00, 775000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('92d38c56-392d-525a-a69c-09d1e5d79e34', '25643bde-1b6b-59ea-8e98-4af5ea98fb40', 'Website Design and Build for Woodworking and Carpentry Company', 'We are looking for a web designer/developer to create a professional website for a woodworking, carpentry, and construction company. The website should showcase our services, completed projects, craftsmanship, and service area while making it easy for potential customers to request an estimate. Project scope: - Design and build a modern, professional website - Create pages for our main services - Add a project gallery with before-and-after photos - Include an About page and contact information - Create a simple estimate-request form - Add click-to-call buttons for mobile visitors - Ensure the website works well on desktop, tablet, and mobile - Complete basic on-page and local SEO setup - Connect the website to our domain - Provide access and basic instructions for future updates We are looking for someone who has experience building websites for contractors, construction companies, or other local service businesses. Please include relevant examples, your recommended platform, estimated timeline, and total project cost.', 1, 'FIXED', 129000.00, 129000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('c17bb2d0-ec6e-5c0a-a784-604755cf13f0', '9227c381-c650-581f-a13b-e0988981d2cd', 'Figma Designer Needed to Refine Existing Website Design', 'We have an existing website design and are looking for an experienced Figma designer to refine it and prepare it for development. The overall design direction and content are already established. We need someone who can turn the existing design into a polished, responsive, and production-ready Figma file. Scope: * Recreate/refine the existing website design in Figma * Set up responsive layouts for desktop, tablet, and mobile * Use Auto Layout, Components, and Variables properly * Improve spacing, alignment, and visual consistency where needed * Add animations and transitions to selected elements/pages * Organize layers, components, styles, and assets cleanly * Prepare the file for developer handoff and Dev Mode Requirements: * Strong Figma skills * Experience with responsive web design * Experience with Auto Layout, Components, and Variables * Experience with UI animation/prototyping * Understanding of how designs translate into web development * Strong attention to detail and clean file organization Nice to have: * Familiarity with HTML/CSS or front-end development * Experience handing Figma files off to developers Please share relevant Figma/web design examples, especially responsive and animation work, along with your availability and estimated timeline.', 1, 'FIXED', 3358000.00, 3358000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('fd547f9b-f5af-5400-af08-1d2eef039daa', 'a213804d-ebc1-5e50-86c2-2a319faea827', 'Professional Website Designer Needed for Keynote Speaker & Author (4–5 Page Website)', 'Project Overview I''m looking for a talented website designer to build a modern, professional website for my growing keynote speaking and author brand. I don''t need an overly complicated or expensive website. I''m looking for something clean, polished, visually impressive, and easy to navigate that will help establish credibility and generate speaking inquiries. The website should look professional enough to appeal to corporate event planners, conference organizers, associations, and other organizations looking to hire keynote speakers. I''m open to using an existing premium website template as the foundation, provided the finished product looks customized and professional. About Me I''m a Colorado-based entrepreneur, keynote speaker, and soon-to-be-published author. After suffering a life-changing injury as a teenager, I''ve spent more than two decades navigating approximately 50 surgeries, limb loss, and chronic pain while building a successful career in commercial real estate, starting businesses, and raising a family. I''m currently working on a book with Forefront Books and building a professional speaking career focused on resilience, overcoming adversity, perspective, and creating a meaningful life despite life''s challenges. I want my website to reflect both my personal story and my professional accomplishments. It should be inspiring without feeling overly dramatic or cliché. Website Scope — Approximately 4–5 Pages 1. Homepage Strong headline and professional photography Brief introduction and overview of my speaking message Clear "Book Me to Speak" call to action Space to add a speaking video in the future 2. About Me Personal background and story Professional accomplishments Journey into keynote speaking 3. Speaking Keynote topics and descriptions Types of audiences and organizations I speak to Space for future testimonials and speaking videos Clear booking inquiry button 4. Book & Media Information about my upcoming book Space for podcast appearances, interviews, and media coverage Social media links 5. Contact / Booking Professional contact form Speaking inquiry form Email contact information Design & Functionality Requirements Clean, modern, premium-looking design Fully mobile-responsive Professional typography and strong use of photography Fast loading Basic SEO optimization Contact form connected to my email Social media integration Easy for me to make future updates Domain connection and website launch assistance Full ownership and administrative access upon completion I''m open to Squarespace, Webflow, or WordPress. I would appreciate your recommendation based on ease of use, ongoing costs, and maintenance. Content & Branding I can provide personal photos, background information, my biography, and details about my speaking topics. I would prefer someone who can help organize and refine the website content so it communicates my message effectively to potential speaking clients. I am not looking for extensive branding services or custom software development. Budget & Timeline I''m open to competitive fixed-price proposals based on your experience and the quality of your work. Please provide your best all-inclusive quote for the project. I value quality and professionalism, but I''m also looking for someone who can accomplish this efficiently without unnecessary complexity or costs. Ideally, I''d like the website completed within 3–5 weeks. To Apply Please answer the following: Can you share 3 examples of professional websites you''ve personally designed, preferably for speakers, authors, entrepreneurs, or personal brands? What platform would you recommend for this project and why? What is your total fixed-price quote? How long would the project take? Does your quote include assistance with organizing and refining website copy? Will I have full ownership and the ability to make updates myself after launch? Important: Please start your proposal with the words "Speaker Website" so I know you''ve read the project description. I''m looking for someone who is creative, responsive, detail-oriented, and capable of delivering a polished professional website without overcomplicating the process. There may be opportunities for additional work as my speaking business and book launch develop.', 1, 'HOURLY', 517000.00, 1550000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('34c454e5-a901-5353-a7b0-7788759696aa', '8393ae36-c49e-50d2-befe-f178e6801c86', 'Looking for a professional website designer', 'I am looking to build a professional website for my business using WordPress. I am seeking professionals with strong expertise in HTML, WordPress development, and plugin integration, capable of managing everything seamlessly within the platform.', 1, 'FIXED', 2067000.00, 2067000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('1ade0a3e-ef33-561a-8f3f-ddc33be2c7c9', '4b5783c8-c6d3-590f-9e07-cda1c577e2cd', 'Website Designer Needed – Visual Redesign of 5 Existing Pages for a Feminine, Celestial Brand', '# Website Designer Needed – Visual Redesign of 5 Existing Pages for a Feminine, Celestial Brand ## Project Overview I''m looking for a talented website designer to transform the visual appearance of five existing pages on my website, **Earth Goddess AU**, into a beautiful, cohesive and premium brand experience. The pages are already built, and **all forms and functionality are working correctly**. I do not need a website built from scratch or the forms recreated. The focus of this project is purely on improving the aesthetics, layout, styling and overall visual presentation. I have created visual mockups for all five pages to demonstrate exactly the look and feel I''m aiming for. These will be provided as the primary design references. ## Pages to Redesign 1. Find Your Path – Overview of our four customer and business pathways 2. VIP Shopper – Customer loyalty and rewards program 3. Affiliate Business Builder – Affiliate opportunity and application 4. Earth Goddess Ambassador – Brand ambassador program and application 5. Wholesale Partner – Wholesale program and application The existing pages can be viewed here: - https://earthgoddess.com.au/find-your-path - https://earthgoddess.com.au/vip-shopper - https://earthgoddess.com.au/affiliate-business-builder-application - https://earthgoddess.com.au/ambassador-application - https://earthgoddess.com.au/wholesale-partner-application ## The Aesthetic I''m Looking For Earth Goddess AU is a nature-inspired, feminine and slightly mystical brand. Our aesthetic combines modern luxury with botanical beauty, celestial symbolism and a warm, welcoming community feel. The design direction includes: - A sophisticated colour palette of dusty rose, plum, burgundy, terracotta, warm ivory and muted botanical greens. - Elegant serif headings paired with beautiful script accents and clean, readable body typography. - Botanical foliage, moon phases, stars, crystals and subtle magical details. - Premium lifestyle imagery featuring nature, candles, crystals, flowers and feminine, empowering themes. - Beautifully designed application forms, benefit sections, icons, buttons and calls to action. - Consistent branding and styling across all five pages. The overall result should feel luxurious, cohesive, inviting and distinctly Earth Goddess — not like a generic business template. **I want the website to look like the supplied mockups as closely as practical.** I''m happy for you to make professional design recommendations, but the existing mockups should guide the visual direction. ## Scope of Work The successful freelancer will: - Redesign the visual styling and layout of all five existing pages. - Improve typography, spacing, alignment, colours, backgrounds, borders and decorative elements. - Incorporate suitable imagery and design details inspired by the supplied mockups. - Make the pages visually consistent while giving each pathway its own personality. - Style existing forms so they blend seamlessly into the overall design. - Improve the visual hierarchy so visitors can easily understand the benefits of each program and find the relevant call to action. - Ensure the pages look beautiful and remain easy to navigate on desktop, tablet and mobile. - Implement the approved designs on the existing website. ## Important: What I Do NOT Need - No new website build. - No new forms or form integrations. - No changes to existing form functionality, submission processes or integrations. - No unnecessary rewriting of the existing website copy. - No major changes to the website structure or other pages. The existing functionality must remain intact. Please focus your time and expertise on the visual design and implementation. ## What I''ll Provide - Links to all five existing pages. - Five visual mockups showing the intended design direction. - Existing branding and website assets. - Feedback and design approvals throughout the project. ## Ideal Freelancer I''m looking for someone who has a strong eye for detail and experience creating beautiful, polished websites. You''ll ideally have experience with: - Website UI design and visual redesigns. - Implementing designs on existing websites and working within an established platform. - Feminine, botanical, lifestyle, wellness, beauty or luxury brands. - Responsive design and consistent styling across multiple pages. - Styling existing forms without breaking their functionality. Please share examples of websites you''ve designed that demonstrate your aesthetic ability, particularly projects where you''ve transformed an existing website rather than built one from scratch. ## Deliverables 1. A cohesive visual redesign of all five pages. 2. Implementation of the approved designs on the existing website. 3. Responsive styling for desktop, tablet and mobile. 4. Functional testing to confirm existing forms and buttons continue to work. 5. A reasonable revision stage to refine the design based on feedback. ## When Applying, Please Answer These Questions 1. Have you worked on visual redesigns of existing websites where the functionality was already complete? 2. What platform and design tools would you use for this project? 3. Can you implement the designs directly on the existing website while preserving the current forms and integrations? 4. How would you approach matching the supplied mockups while ensuring the pages remain responsive? 5. Please provide two or three relevant examples from your portfolio. 6. What is your proposed fixed price and estimated turnaround time for all five pages? ## Budget and Timeline Please provide a fixed-price quote for the complete project, along with your estimated timeline. I''m looking for quality design work, clear communication and attention to detail. There may be opportunities for additional website design work in the future if this project is a good fit. I''m excited to find someone who can help bring the Earth Goddess vision to life and turn these existing pages into a beautiful, cohesive experience for our community. **Please note: This is primarily an aesthetics and visual styling project, not a functional website rebuild.**', 1, 'FIXED', 5166000.00, 5166000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('73f69856-330e-56d5-9a1e-80928d50e6c4', '8e40f2db-047e-597c-9b4a-947109fcef8f', 'Thiết kế website bằng ngôn ngữ ReactJs Flutter', 'Các giao diện website bán hàng mobile app Thanh Toán quản lý đơn hàng địa chỉ. - Thiết kế giao diện website bán hàng (desktop & mobile responsive) - Thiết kế giao diện mobile app bán hàng - Thiết kế các màn hình và luồng chức năng - Xây dựng user flow, wireframe, mockup và prototype - Đảm bảo giao diện nhất quán với brand guideline Bắt buộc có kinh nghiệm thiết kế UI/UX cho website hoặc mobile app Ưu tiên đã từng tham gia dự án thương mại điện tử, biết làm prototype tương tác để mô phỏng trải nghiệm người dùng.', 1, 'FIXED', 5000000.00, 20000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('17a11ac2-4ebd-510b-908c-3fe9a38b9c48', 'd844f068-32b7-56d9-834f-b9e94f5e5220', 'Thiết kế Website TMĐT ngành Điện Mặt Trời - Style Tối giản hiện đại.', '1. Mô tả chung Dự án: Website bán hàng nexsolar.vn Ngành hàng: Điện năng lượng mặt trời, Đèn Solar. Nền tảng bắt buộc: WordPress + WooCommerce. Theme bắt buộc: woocommerce bán hàng, tham khảo như flatsomw, hoặc tương tự trang dmtsolar.vn Phong cách thiết kế: Tối giản (Minimalist), sạch sẽ, nhiều khoảng trắng, tinh tế giống trang tham khảo: https://dmtsolar.vn/. 2. Yêu cầu chi tiết về Giao diện (UI/UX) Màu sắc: Chủ đạo Xanh lá cây, vàng + Điểm Nhấn Cam (#ff9900). Nền trắng sạch. Header: Thiết kế gọn gàng. Có Sticky Header (dính khi cuộn). Bao gồm: Logo, Thanh tìm kiếm Ajax (Live Search), Hotline, Giỏ hàng. Footer: 4 cột (Thông tin Cty, Link nhanh, Chính sách, Mạng xã hội). Có vị trí chờ để gắn logo Bộ Công Thương. Mobile: Tối ưu 100% cho di động. Bắt buộc có Bottom Navigation Bar (Thanh menu dính dưới đáy màn hình) gồm: Trang chủ, Danh mục, Giỏ hàng, Tài khoản. Trang chủ: Slider banner lớn có hiệu ứng text động. Khối USP (Cam kết): Icon + Text. Khối sản phẩm hiển thị dạng Tab (Ajax): Bán chạy, Mới, Khuyến mãi. Khối Dự án tiêu biểu (Carousel). 3. Yêu cầu về Tính năng (Function) Bộ lọc sản phẩm (Filter): Lọc được theo Giá, Thương hiệu, Công suất, Loại pin ở Sidebar trang danh mục. Tính năng đặc biệt (Bắt buộc): Tích hợp công cụ Tính toán điện mặt trời (Solar Calculator). Khách nhập số tiền điện -> Web tính ra cấu hình hệ thống dự kiến (Logic tính toán sẽ được cung cấp khi nhận việc). Yêu cầu khách điền SĐT/Email để xem kết quả chi tiết. Thanh toán: Tối ưu trang Checkout (Bỏ các trường thừa như Mã bưu điện). Tích hợp chọn Tỉnh/Thành phố Việt Nam tự động. Nút "Mua ngay" (Quick Buy) bên cạnh nút "Thêm vào giỏ". Tương tác: Tích hợp Zalo Button, Call Button, Messenger Chat. 4. Yêu cầu về Kỹ thuật & Bàn giao Tốc độ: Tối ưu điểm Google PageSpeed Insights > 80 (Mobile) và > 90 (Desktop). Cài đặt Cache, nén ảnh WebP. Bảo mật: Cài đặt SSL, bảo mật trang Admin, chống Spam form. Bàn giao: Source code đầy đủ. Video hướng dẫn quản trị cơ bản (Thay banner, sửa text). Hỗ trợ bảo hành lỗi kỹ thuật trong 3 tháng đầu. chi tiết sẽ nêu trong hợp đồng Trao đổi thêm : 0901.911.242', 1, 'FIXED', 4000000.00, 5000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('a7bf5255-e513-5356-8346-38c98f79ff33', '81cfde60-17d6-5944-93d3-ef7c7e87d8d3', 'Thiết kế website bán hàng, quản lý nhân viên', 'Thiết kế một trang web bán hàng hoặc quản lý với đầy đủ các yêu cầu từ cấu trúc website, dễ quản lý, dễ bảo trì.', 1, 'FIXED', 1000000.00, 100000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('130ac0cc-3f8b-5793-ae22-32bd4aa9ec09', 'cf4e82cc-4ca3-5684-9604-5b46946272bf', 'Tuyển lập trình viên thiết kế website', 'TUYỂN FREELANCER THIẾT KẾ WEBSITE KTX Bên mình hiện cần thiết kế website cho Kí túc xá Thiên Đàng với mục đích: - Hỗ trợ sinh viên mới hội nhập - Đăng thông báo chung - Lưu giữ hình ảnh và...', 1, 'FIXED', 3000000.00, 7000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('ecf57534-1fdc-5e8a-8b98-ce5a0dc71999', 'b2b8d008-a145-5a98-9a08-8b525aaa10ab', 'Thiết kế website Hệ thống Dưỡng sinh', 'Tôi cần tìm Freelancer lập trình WordPress và WooCommerce triển khai website dựa trên bộ thiết kế giao diện có sẵn gồm hơn 10 trang chi tiết. Bạn có thể dùng AI convert ảnh sang HTML hoặc CSS để làm nhanh phần thô. Các nhiệm vụ chính: Giao diện: Code theme chuẩn responsive di động, tối ưu tốc độ và On-page SEO. Bán hàng: Cấu hình WooCommerce nâng cao. Khi hết hàng tự động khóa nút mua và hiển thị trạng thái chờ hàng. Đơn hàng thành công tự động sinh mã và chạy thanh tiến trình theo dõi. Thư viện bảo mật: Phân cấp danh mục tài liệu. Các file nội bộ bắt buộc nhập đúng mã số đối tác mới cho xem hoặc tải. Trang quản trị đối tác: Dashboard cá nhân hóa gồm biểu đồ doanh số, thẻ thống kê hoa hồng, điểm thưởng. Tự động tạo mã QR và link tiếp thị liên kết định danh cho từng đối tác. Tích hợp: Nhúng cổng Trợ lý ảo AI và cụm nút chat nổi ở góc màn hình (đã có sẵn mã kết nối). Yêu cầu: Cam kết bảo mật thông tin dự án. Code sạch, không dùng theme rác dính mã độc. Thời gian thực hiện từ 7 đến 10 ngày. Ngân sách trọn gói. Vui lòng báo giá và đính kèm sản phẩm tương tự bạn đã từng làm.', 1, 'FIXED', 5000000.00, 7000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('03b8b62b-8dfb-5d7b-8883-f9435ed22a64', '1b552964-bd62-575a-b6c7-6577aae8cae1', 'Thiết kế website đọc truyên', 'Mình đang cần tìm người có kinh nghiệm thiết kế và lập trình website đọc truyện, tham khảo giao diện và tính năng từ website: https://bunaudio.com/ Yêu cầu dự kiến: Thiết kế giao diện đẹp, hiện đại, dễ sử dụng, tối ưu trên cả điện thoại và máy tính. Có trang chủ, danh sách truyện, danh mục thể loại, tìm kiếm truyện. Trang chi tiết truyện, danh sách chương và giao diện đọc truyện. Có hệ thống quản trị để đăng truyện, chỉnh sửa nội dung và quản lý danh mục. Tốc độ tải trang nhanh, tối ưu SEO và dễ nâng cấp thêm tính năng. Nếu có thể, hỗ trợ thêm chức năng nghe truyện audio, tài khoản người dùng và đánh dấu truyện yêu thích. Mình mong muốn: Đã có kinh nghiệm làm website đọc truyện, truyện chữ hoặc truyện audio. Có sản phẩm thực tế để tham khảo. Báo giá rõ ràng, thời gian hoàn thành cụ thể. Có hỗ trợ bảo hành và xử lý lỗi sau khi bàn giao. Ngân sách: Thỏa thuận theo tính năng và chất lượng sản phẩm. Bạn nào nhận làm hoặc biết người phù hợp vui lòng inbox, gửi portfolio, báo giá và thời gian dự kiến hoàn thành. Cảm ơn mọi người!', 1, 'FIXED', 5000000.00, 10000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('6f6ff53f-6633-54b2-8235-2dcdec0fbc43', '6a71cfd2-5fdc-5f22-960e-b3b497bee4f7', 'Framer designer to build a 5-8 page website from a finished wireframe and copy', 'We''re building the website for Rise New Zealand, a membership organisation for the next generation of families connected to New Zealand. The site will be built in Framer. The structure is done. We need a designer to make it look good. What you''ll get from us - A wireframe for every page (5-8 pages) - Page layouts and section order - All copy, written and approved - Brand assets: logo, colours, fonts - A Framer workspace with editor access - Fast decisions. One point of contact, same-day feedback on NZ or US Pacific hours. What you''ll do - Translate the wireframes into a polished, responsive Framer site (desktop, tablet, mobile) - Set up the typography, spacing and component system so we can add pages later without you - Build it clean: native Framer components, CMS where it makes sense, no hacks that break on the next update - Light motion where it helps, none where it doesn''t - Hand over a site we can edit ourselves What you won''t do - Information architecture, copywriting, or strategy. That''s handled. Timeline and budget - Two weeks from kick-off to handover - Fixed price, US$1,500, paid in two milestones: homepage approved, then full site handed over Who we''re looking for - Independent freelancer, not an agency - Three or more live Framer sites you designed yourself (send links, not screenshots) - Strong eye for type and whitespace. Restrained over flashy. - Available for a 30-minute kick-off call this week To apply, send links to your Framer work and one sentence on how you''d approach a wireframe-to-design brief. Short proposals win.', 1, 'FIXED', 38748000.00, 38748000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('aa597ca7-7b7e-59d8-8020-2b71f7176a98', '90a0ff22-d647-5165-8abb-4e5f5b75ec96', 'Frontend Developer Needed – Modern Animated Website (Next.js, GSAP, Framer Motion)', 'Looking for a creative frontend developer to build a modern, responsive gym website with smooth animations and a clean, professional design. The goal is to create a visually appealing website with engaging interactions and a great user experience across desktop and mobile devices. Tech Stack: * Next.js / React * Tailwind CSS * Framer Motion (Motion) * GSAP for scroll-based animations What I Need: * Modern, responsive website design * Smooth scrolling and subtle animations * Interactive sections and hover effects * Clean, maintainable frontend code * Mobile optimization and good performance To Apply: Please share 1–2 examples of animated websites you''ve built, briefly explain your approach, and mention your estimated timeline. I''m particularly interested in developers who understand both visual design and frontend performance.', 1, 'FIXED', 9041000.00, 9041000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('971d8713-5f44-5f10-a56d-d6a38a9fe54d', '3d35d0fd-72b8-5818-aa32-986c540ec769', 'UX Portfolio Update with Framer', '# Framer Designer Needed — UX/Product Design Portfolio Redesign **Budget:** $500–$1,000 fixed price **Target timeline:** 2–3 weeks **Platform:** Framer I''m a Senior UX/Product Designer with approximately six years of UX experience, including enterprise product work at Chubb and Home Depot. I''m looking for a talented visual/web designer with strong Framer experience to refine and elevate my existing portfolio. **This is not a from-scratch project.** I already have a website, case-study narratives, work experience, and an established direction. ### Project scope - Redesign my homepage with a sophisticated, modern, human-centered aesthetic. - Improve visual hierarchy, typography, layouts, and overall design consistency. - Create one reusable case-study template. - Apply that template to two priority case studies. - Help present research findings, processes, and product outcomes visually. - Ensure excellent desktop, tablet, and mobile experiences. - Implement and hand off everything in my existing Framer account. - Include two rounds of revisions. ### Desired style Professional, sophisticated, memorable, accessible, and warm. The design should appeal to hiring managers and design leaders evaluating senior and lead-level UX candidates. Strong storytelling is more important than decorative animations. ### Ideal candidate - Demonstrated Framer development skills - Strong visual and editorial design - Experience designing portfolio or case-study websites - Excellent typography and responsive design skills - Ability to work with existing content and provide thoughtful creative direction ### When applying, please provide 1. Two or three relevant websites you personally designed and built. 2. Your proposed fixed price and what it includes. 3. Your estimated delivery timeline. 4. Whether you can work in my existing Framer project. 5. What you believe matters most when designing a senior UX designer''s portfolio. I will provide the existing website, case-study content, visual references, and design direction.', 1, 'FIXED', 25832000.00, 25832000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('ee67f3dc-a798-5c85-b7e9-fdc7254e622a', 'b2a4d631-e644-5c75-86a4-c1175963075b', 'Content Designer for Framer Website', 'We’re migrating our website from Webflow to Framer. You already have page structure built in SketchUp, so the main job is turning that into a finished site — layout, visuals, and copy that speaks to clients looking for construction work. You’d own the look and the wording end to end, from homepage through project pages and contact.', 1, 'FIXED', 2583000.00, 2583000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('235d7fce-0d06-5b4b-a36a-c1e0eca9b08a', '720a0a4b-0654-56aa-a3a4-ec1ee3ac52b0', 'Fix lỗi Framer', 'Mình hiện tại đang làm giao diện website bằng Framer, và gặp phải lỗi này, mình cần chỗ trợ fix nhanh ạ', 1, 'FIXED', 200000.00, 250000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('2c5337fa-91a6-5dd6-b6bb-3976a5f61823', '59eccfb3-58e7-53f8-a74a-fd6f579f1008', '**[TUYỂN FREELANCER THIẾT KẾ LANDING PAGE / MINI GAME EVENT]*', '**[TUYỂN FREELANCER THIẾT KẾ LANDING PAGE / MINI GAME EVENT]** Bên mình đang cần tìm **freelancer thiết kế và phát triển landing page** cho một chương trình **game/event online**, có tích hợp theo...', 1, 'FIXED', 3000000.00, 10000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('c78cf32a-7ddb-5d84-93f9-efc184127e68', '48ec993e-7bbb-5916-a99a-a56761f9aa32', 'Frontend Developer Needed to Design a Landing Page for a Jewellery Brand', 'We’re looking for a frontend developer to design and build a modern, responsive landing page for a jewellery brand. The page should present the brand’s products and story in a visually appealing way while ensuring a smooth user experience across devices. You’ll work closely with our team to translate concepts into a polished final design and implement the page with clean, maintainable code. Experience creating engaging, conversion-focused web experiences is important, and we’re seeking someone who can deliver a high-quality result on time.', 1, 'FIXED', 1292000.00, 1292000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('44549524-4779-58e2-8842-521a837c38c8', '48ec993e-7bbb-5916-a99a-a56761f9aa32', 'Website and Landing Page Designer', 'We’re looking for a designer to create a polished website and landing pages with a strong focus on UI/UX. The work includes designing layouts, improving user flow, and delivering clean, modern visuals that support conversion goals. You should be able to translate business needs into intuitive experiences and collaborate closely with our team to refine the final designs. Experience creating engaging web experiences and delivering high-quality design assets is important for this role.', 1, 'FIXED', 12916000.00, 12916000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('0141bee4-cf21-5a1b-9431-a2aab57d98cf', '2135949f-f887-5656-86c4-84332ced38d6', 'Create an attractive landing page', 'Hi! I need to create an attractive landing page in my website that shows our brand new shop. We just created a google business listing and need to create a landing page so that people can actually find it in google more easily.', 1, 'FIXED', 1292000.00, 1292000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('22c57b4a-9e90-50c3-87d6-a92a22bb58c7', 'bc4b9c0b-f33b-51f5-894f-4b77055ab9bb', 'Landing Page Designer Needed – $10 Fixed Budget', '**We are looking for a creative and skilled freelancer to design a modern, professional, and responsive landing page for our business.** The landing page should be visually attractive, user-friendly, and designed to encourage visitors to explore our products or services. **Project Requirements:** - Clean, modern, and professional design - Fully responsive for desktop and mobile devices - Attractive hero section with a clear call-to-action button - Business introduction section - Product or service showcase - Contact section with WhatsApp button - Smooth navigation and fast-loading design - Professional colours, typography, and layout **What We Expect:** - A complete, functional landing page - High-quality design with attention to detail - Source files and final deliverables - Minor revisions if required **Budget:** $10 USD (Fixed Price) **Experience Level:** Entry Level We are looking for someone who can deliver quality work within our budget. This could lead to future projects if we are satisfied with the results. Please share examples of your previous landing page designs when applying. Thank you!', 1, 'FIXED', 258000.00, 258000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('79920c11-7a8a-5376-bc43-880249da0437', 'fefb2d51-ae57-548d-b042-c45519adfc58', 'Build Business Landing Page with AI Chat Assistant and Client-Editable Admin Panel', 'JoyHomes Trading needs a freelancer to build a professional landing page with an integrated AI chatbot and an admin panel that lets our team update the site without coding. Scope of Work 1. Landing Page Hero, About Us, Products/Services (4-6 categories), Why Choose Us, Contact, Footer Quote request form that sends to my email WhatsApp button and click-to-call on mobile Fully responsive, fast loading, basic SEO, Google Maps embed 2. AI Chatbot Chat widget on the landing page Answers customer questions about our products, prices, and contact details Trained on our company information (FAQ and product list I provide) Collects visitor name, phone, and email, and forwards the lead to my email or WhatsApp Fallback message: “Please contact our team” when it doesn’t know the answer Powered by OpenAI/Claude API or a plugin (Tidio, WP-Chatbot, etc.). I will pay the API cost. 3. Admin Panel (client-editable) Secure login for admin users Edit page text, images, and contact details Add, edit, and delete products and categories Post news and updates (announcements, new arrivals, offers) View quote requests and chatbot leads Simple enough for a non-technical person to use 4. Design Clean, modern look using our logo and brand colors (I will provide) Free stock images if I don’t have photos What I Will Provide Logo, brand colors, company text, product list, and FAQ for the chatbot Domain, hosting, and API key (or ask me to set them up) Deliverables Live, working site with chatbot and admin panel Admin login and source files or WordPress access Short video walkthrough showing how to update content One round of revisions and 7 days of bug-fix support Not Included Domain, hosting, and AI API fees Online store with payments Ongoing maintenance Budget and Timeline Budget: $100 fixed (open to milestone payments). Change this number to what you can pay. Delivery: 7-10 days Experience Level: Intermediate Required Skills WordPress/Elementor, or React/Next.js with a simple backend Chatbot integration (OpenAI/Claude API, Tidio, or similar) Admin panel or CMS setup Responsive design and basic SEO To Apply, Please Include 2-3 links to websites you built, ideally with a chatbot or admin panel The tools you will use (WordPress plugin or custom code) Your delivery time and final price Which parts, if any, you cannot do within the bud', 1, 'FIXED', 646000.00, 646000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00');

