    ('cc819932-94a5-5896-a8b5-36699887e041', '4292eda0-8ccf-535e-a605-1439f0e437ff', 'Squarespace Website Builder', 'I need help building out my existing Squarespace website to better showcase my services and prior work. The goal is to improve the overall presentation and make it easier for visitors to understand what I offer. I also need a contact form set up so leads can be collected in one place and filtered through my email. I’m looking for someone who can improve the site’s structure, layout, and functionality while keeping everything organized and easy to manage.', 1, 'FIXED', 12916000.00, 12916000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('bf4d228f-b570-5cf8-8c90-49b1fbd29b8e', '4292eda0-8ccf-535e-a605-1439f0e437ff', 'Squarespace Mobile Responsiveness Fix', 'I need a Squarespace designer to help fix a few mobile layout issues on my website. The desktop version looks good, but one section of my homepage doesn''t display as neatly on smaller mobile screens. I''m not looking for a complete redesign. I simply need someone who understands Squarespace''s responsive design tools and can improve the appearance of the affected section while keeping the existing design consistent. Scope of Work Review one problematic section on my homepage. Adjust spacing and alignment for mobile devices. Fix any overlapping text or elements within that section. Adjust text sizing where necessary. Check that the section''s main button is visible and functional. Confirm the desktop version remains unchanged. Expected Deliverables One homepage section optimized for mobile display. Improved spacing, alignment, and readability. Before-and-after screenshots showing the adjustments. Freelancer Requirements Experience with Squarespace 7.1 Fluid Engine. Knowledge of responsive website design. Ability to troubleshoot basic layout issues. Attention to visual consistency. How to Apply Please share one example of a Squarespace website you''ve improved for mobile responsiveness and briefly explain how you would approach this task.', 1, 'FIXED', 129000.00, 129000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('5b0f04eb-fc4f-5c99-8824-0d7bc8570983', '4292eda0-8ccf-535e-a605-1439f0e437ff', 'Squarespace Designer Needed to Redesign My Small Business Website', 'I run a small business and my current Squarespace website feels outdated and isn''t bringing in enough leads. I''m looking for an experienced Squarespace designer to give it a fresh, professional look and make it easier for visitors to find what they need. What I''d like done: Redesign the homepage and main pages using Squarespace 7.1 (Fluid Engine), keeping my existing branding Clean up the navigation and layout so the site is simple to use Make sure everything looks good on mobile, tablet, and desktop Basic on-page SEO: page titles, meta descriptions, headings, and image alt text Improve page speed by optimizing images and heavy sections Add a booking or contact form and connect it to Mailchimp Some light custom CSS to fine-tune fonts, spacing, and buttons What I''m looking for: A web designer or developer with solid Squarespace experience and a portfolio of live sites Good eye for clean, modern design and conversion-focused layouts Clear communication and reliable turnaround If the project goes well, I have ongoing website updates and maintenance work to hand over.', 1, 'FIXED', 258000.00, 258000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('082f950e-faba-55a7-8d07-3319e980d88d', 'e4ad90c6-d7d3-50ca-9607-1bd68fab8928', 'Squarespace Designer + Landing Page/Quiz Funnel + Content Creator', 'Squarespace Designer + Landing Page/Quiz Funnel + Content Creator We are an Australian functional health and naturopathy clinic looking for an experienced Squarespace designer/developer and digital content creator to work with us on an initial landing page and interactive health quiz, with the potential for ongoing work across our website, campaigns and social media content. We are looking for someone who understands both the creative and technical side of digital marketing and, importantly, has previous experience working with Australian naturopaths, functional medicine practitioners, integrative health clinics or similar health professionals. This is not just a graphic design role. ## INITIAL PROJECT — LANDING PAGE + INTERACTIVE QUIZ The first project will involve working closely with me to create a new high-converting landing page within our existing Squarespace website. A major component will be an interactive health assessment/quiz designed to generate qualified leads and direct potential clients towards the most appropriate next step. The landing page will need: • Custom design within our existing Squarespace website • Strong, conversion-focused page structure • Clear calls to action • Mobile and desktop optimisation • Interactive health assessment/quiz • Conditional/branching logic based on answers • Different results or recommendations based on quiz responses • Lead capture, including name and email • Integration with our email marketing/CRM system • Automated quiz results and/or follow-up emails • Integration with our existing booking system • Meta Pixel and Google Analytics/conversion tracking where required • Basic SEO and page optimisation • Full testing before launch QUIZ + FUNNEL EXPERIENCE The quiz needs to feel like a personalised health assessment , not simply a contact form. For example, someone may select hormones, skin, gut health or another health concern and then receive different questions and recommendations depending on their answers. You should be able to help us determine the best structure and technology for this rather than simply waiting for us to provide every technical decision. You will need to be comfortable with: • Conditional quiz logic • Multiple quiz outcomes • Lead segmentation/tagging • Email automation • CRM integration • Booking integrations • Conversion tracking • Tracking quiz starts, completions, leads and bookings Experience with platforms such as Typeform, ScoreApp, Interact, Outgrow or similar is highly regarded. We are open to your recommendations regarding the best platform, but you need to be able to **recommend, build, integrate and test the solution.** SQUARESPACE EXPERIENCE IS ESSENTIAL You must be highly experienced with Squarespace and comfortable working within an existing website and brand. This includes: • Building and editing landing pages • Creating layouts beyond basic Squarespace templates • Mobile optimisation • Forms and third-party integrations • Embedding external tools • Basic custom CSS/code where required • SEO settings • Analytics and tracking integrations • Troubleshooting website issues • Maintaining a consistent existing brand aesthetic Please provide examples of Squarespace websites and landing pages you have personally built.** 2. CONTENT CREATION + VIDEO EDITING For the right person, there will also be ongoing content creation work We create regular educational content across Instagram and other digital platforms and need someone who can take our ideas, copy, raw footage and existing brand assets and turn them into polished content. You should be confident with: • Editing Instagram Reels and short-form video • Taking raw footage and turning it into polished content • Cutting footage to improve pace and retention • Adding subtitles/captions • Adding hooks and on-screen text • Basic audio and music editing • Creating Reel covers • Creating Instagram carousels • Creating static posts • Working from existing Canva templates • Repurposing existing content into additional assets • Resizing/adapting content for different platforms • Basic image editing • Maintaining consistent fonts, colours and branding Strong Canva and video editing skills are essential. We want someone who understands current social media content without making everything look generic, overly trendy or like a standard Canva template. AUSTRALIAN NATUROPATHY / HEALTH EXPERIENCE — ESSENTIAL You must have previous experience working with naturopaths, functional medicine practitioners, integrative health clinics or similar health professionals in Australia. Ideally, you already understand the Australian naturopathy and wellness space, including how practitioners communicate online and the importance of maintaining a professional, credible and evidence-led brand. You should also understand that health-related marketing requires more care around wording and claims than general lifestyle content. Please provide specific examples of Australian naturopaths, functional health practitioners or integrative health businesses you have worked with previously. Applicants without relevant Australian health/wellness industry experience may not be considered. OUR BRAND STYLE Our aesthetic is: Premium Minimal Modern Clinical Clean Elevated Warm We are evidence-led and professional but still want our content to feel approachable and patient-friendly. We do **not** want generic wellness branding, templated content or overly corporate design. Attention to detail is extremely important. You need to be able to look at our existing brand and maintain that identity consistently across the **website, landing pages, quizzes, Reels and social content.** ## WHAT WE NEED FROM YOU You must be able to demonstrate experience with: • Squarespace • Landing page design and development • Interactive quizzes/assessment funnels • Conditional logic • Email/CRM integrations • Booking integrations • Conversion tracking and analytics • Mobile optimisation • Canva • Short-form video/Reel editing • Instagram content creation • Maintaining established brand guidelines • Australian health/wellness businesses • Ideally Australian naturopaths or functional health practitioners We also value someone who can bring ideas to us If you see a better way to structure a landing page, improve a funnel, present a Reel or increase conversions, we want you to make those recommendations rather than simply execute instructions. WHEN APPLYING Please include: 1. **2–3 Squarespace websites or landing pages you have personally worked on 2. At least one interactive quiz, assessment or lead-generation funnel** you have built 3. 2–3 examples of Reels/short-form videos you have edited 4. Examples of **Instagram carousels/static content you have created 5. Examples of Australian naturopaths, functional medicine practitioners or health clinics you have worked with 6. Which quiz platform you would recommend integrating with Squarespace and why 7. How you would connect quiz responses to email automation and our booking system 8. How you would track quiz starts, completions, leads and bookings 9. Which design and video editing programs you use 10. Your estimated timeframe for completing the initial landing page + quiz 13. Your general weekly availability for ongoing work Please start your application with the words **“SQUARESPACE + NATUROPATHY”** so we know you have read the entire brief. Please do not apply if your Squarespace experience is limited to editing basic templates or if you cannot provide examples of relevant previous work. For the right person, there is potential for **ongoing work across our Squarespace website, landing pages, lead-generation funnels, campaigns, Reels and social media content.', 1, 'HOURLY', 465000.00, 1033000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('6e34c70b-908b-51cb-9d8f-84d31691b84f', '0ad90b4b-d65d-5f1a-96a6-37bc7dd726e9', 'Webflow designer needed: Mobile Fixes & Final Website Polish', 'I am looking for an experienced Webflow designer/developer to troubleshoot and professionally polish my existing website for Van Allen Integrative Health & Wellness, a private virtual healthcare practice serving Connecticut. Website: https://vanallenintegrative.com The website has already been built. The branding, color palette, fonts, written content, service pages, and overall design direction are established. I need a skilled professional to correct existing issues and refine the site so it feels cohesive, sophisticated, and professionally finished. This is a website refinement project, NOT a redesign or a build from scratch. Scope of Work 1. Fix Mobile Navigation and Responsiveness • Fix the mobile navigation menu, where the hamburger/menu icon currently overlaps the “Services” link. • Restore and correctly display all intended navigation links, including About, Pricing, FAQ, and other existing links. • Diagnose why the published mobile website looks different from the Webflow Designer preview. • Correct mobile layout issues, including image sizing, alignment, spacing, and excessive whitespace. • Review responsive layouts on desktop, tablet, and mobile. • Test the actual published website on mobile devices or appropriate browser testing tools, not just the Webflow Designer preview. 2. Repair the FAQ Page • Restore a clean, professional FAQ accordion layout. • Display each question clearly with a “+” control that expands to reveal the answer. • Ensure answers open and close correctly and the layout works properly on desktop and mobile. • Preserve every existing question and answer exactly as written. 3. Refine the Website’s Visual Design Give the existing website a polished, cohesive, high-quality finish while preserving the established brand. This includes: • Refining alignment, spacing, margins, and padding. • Improving visual consistency across page sections. • Ensuring typography, heading hierarchy, and body text are presented consistently and remain readable on mobile. • Styling CTA buttons with moderately rounded corners rather than square edges. • Reviewing the header, footer, service sections, images, and landing pages for consistency. • Adding subtle design refinements where appropriate to make the site feel intentional and professionally designed rather than generic or AI-generated. The desired aesthetic is sophisticated, warm, understated, private, and medically credible. 4. Review Every Existing Page Please review all existing pages, not just the homepage, including: • Homepage • Psychiatry & Medication Management • Medical Weight Management • Men’s Sexual Health • Women’s Hormone Health • About • Pricing • FAQ • Contact and other existing pages or landing pages Correct responsive layout issues and obvious visual inconsistencies throughout the existing website. 5. Photography and Brand Details • I am open to replacing photographs to improve the overall presentation or resolve issues with existing imagery (the photos were placeholders). • Replacement images must complement the existing brand, colors, and aesthetic. • Use appropriately licensed images. Do not use recognizable luxury-brand logos or copyrighted imagery without permission. • Add the existing brand favicon. • Review the footer, social media links, and other existing brand details. • Remove the “Made in Webflow” badge if my current Webflow plan permits it. Please do not purchase an upgrade or incur additional costs without my approval. 6. Check All Links and Website Functionality Verify that all existing: • Navigation links • CTA buttons • Service-page links • Booking and scheduling links • Patient portal links • Contact forms • Footer links • Social media links work correctly and direct visitors to the intended destinations. Do not replace or modify booking destinations without my approval. 7. Basic Accessibility, SEO, and Final Quality Check As part of the finishing work: • Check basic image alt text where appropriate. • Review heading structure and text readability. • Check for obvious contrast or accessibility issues. • Review page titles and basic existing SEO settings. • Check for obvious broken links or display issues. • Test the website after changes and verify the approved updates on the published site. This is a basic quality check, not a full SEO overhaul. Important Requirements: Please Read Carefully DO NOT CHANGE THE WRITTEN CONTENT. All existing wording must remain exactly as written across every page, including: •Headlines and body copy •Service descriptions •FAQ questions and answers •Pricing and membership information •Calls to action •Other existing website text Do not rewrite, shorten, rephrase, remove, or add marketing copy without my explicit approval. Please preserve the existing color palette, typography direction, branding, page structure, and overall aesthetic. Do not rebuild the site or make major structural changes unnecessarily. Before making substantial changes, establish a practical backup or restoration plan. If you discover an issue that requires additional work beyond the agreed scope, explain the issue and obtain my approval before proceeding. No additional charges or paid upgrades without my approval. Deliverables 1. Corrected mobile navigation and responsive layouts. 2. Repaired FAQ accordion. 3. Consistent, polished design throughout the existing website. 4. Favicon and approved image replacements, if needed. 5. Verified navigation, CTA buttons, booking links, forms, and footer links. 6. Basic accessibility and SEO checks. 7. Final testing of all existing pages on desktop and mobile. 8. Publication of approved changes and confirmation that the live site works correctly. 9. A brief summary of completed work and any remaining issues. Budget and Timeline My target budget is $250 fixed price for the defined scope. Please review the live website and confirm which items you can complete within this budget before work begins. If you believe additional work is necessary, please explain why and provide a revised quote for approval before starting. I would prefer completion within approximately one week, if feasible. To Apply Please include: •Two or three examples of Webflow websites you have personally designed, refined, or troubleshot. •Confirmation of your experience fixing mobile navigation, responsive layouts, and FAQ accordions in Webflow. •Your proposed fixed price and estimated turnaround time. •A brief explanation of how you would approach diagnosing the current mobile navigation and layout issues. I am looking for a detail-oriented Webflow professional who can finish the existing website efficiently, preserve all established content and branding, and help me confidently launch a polished, professional online presence.', 1, 'FIXED', 6458000.00, 6458000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('70c9071a-576b-5797-97d1-cf0a5a053f5c', '0ad90b4b-d65d-5f1a-96a6-37bc7dd726e9', 'Webflow Expert Needed: Update Existing Site', 'Job description We’re looking for an experienced Webflow designer/developer to update an existing website with new copy and a few new pages. This is not a redesign. The site has an established design system, and the goal is to reuse its existing components, classes and styling so everything feels consistent. The new copy is final and approved. It comes in a detailed build spec that shows every word, where it goes and which existing component it uses. Project scope (Phase 1) - Copy updates on 6 existing pages plus nav, footer, form messages and a new 404 page - Small layout changes only: hide one pricing card, add a founder note using an existing block, and expand the FAQ from 14 to 22 questions - US/Canada price swap: a lightweight script that reads the visitor’s country by IP and swaps 10 price tokens on the same URL, with a footer toggle saved in a cookie - ROI calculator update: new fields and separate US and Canadian formulas (all formulas supplied) - 3 new pages: a Scorecard tool (ready-made HTML embed supplied), a terms page and a Careers page with two small CMS collections - Technical SEO: meta and social tags for 12 pages, share images, redirects, canonical tags, JSON-LD schema, sitemap submission to Google and Bing - Click tracking on all calls to action and Microsoft Clarity install - QA across desktop, tablet and mobile, in both US and Canada views What we’ll provide - The complete build spec with final copy and build notes - Ready-made code for the scorecard tool and the schema - All calculator formulas, price values and metadata - Access to Webflow, domain settings Ideal candidate - Strong Webflow Designer and CMS experience: collections, template pages, conditional visibility, empty states - Comfortable writing custom JavaScript in Webflow embeds (geo-based content, calculators, schema) - Experienced updating existing Webflow sites without breaking the design system or creating class clutter - Solid technical SEO basics: redirects, canonicals, schema testing, Search Console - Clear communication and collaboration to complete project on time - Experience with B2B service, staffing or SaaS sites is a plus. Deliverables - All pages built to match the spec word for word on desktop, tablet and mobile - Canadian visitors see CAD prices and the Canadian calculator; everyone else, including search engines, sees USD - Calculator results match the worked examples in the spec - Schema passes Google’s Rich Results Test, redirects work, sitemap submitted To apply, please include - Two or three Webflow sites you’ve built or updated with custom code or CMS (calculators, dynamic pricing, job boards). Tell us what you did on each. - How you would build the IP-based price swap so search engines still see the default prices. - Your start date and weekly availability. - What post-launch support you include (for example, 30 days of bug fixes).', 1, 'FIXED', 38748000.00, 38748000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('6dbf0ce9-44d1-5771-9c88-ac00886694f7', 'e80f9f5d-9046-54d4-a697-c4bdcad8ce23', 'Webflow developer who uses AI tools, for ongoing website work', 'We are looking for a Webflow developer who uses AI in their daily workflow to build faster and with fewer mistakes, to join our delivery team on an ongoing basis. WHAT YOU WILL DO - Build and update Webflow sites from designs, briefs and change requests - Handle tasks of all sizes, from quick fixes to full builds - Handle configuring, embedding, and integrating 3rd Party applications on websites - Use AI tools to speed up development, QA and documentation, and tell us where they help and where they do not - Communicate clearly with our team on scope, timing and questions WHAT WE ARE LOOKING FOR - Strong Webflow experience, with a portfolio you can show us - Fluent English, written and spoken - A track record on Upwork: completed jobs and reviews that mention communication, quality and problem solving - Dependable and detail-oriented. (the word is "Capybara") You tell us early when something is off. - Comfortable using AI tools (for example ChatGPT, Claude, Codex or similar), and honest about their limits - Based in North America, South America or Europe preferred - Bonus: experience with other platforms, such as WordPress, Shopify or Squarespace WHAT WE OFFER - Steady work from a team that has completed almost 2,000 website tasks - Clear briefs, and a founder who answers questions TO APPLY Please read this far. To show you did, start your proposal with the keyword. Then include: 1. Two or three Webflow projects you built, with links 2. A short example of how you use AI in your work 3. Your availability (hours per week) and your time zone', 1, 'HOURLY', 387000.00, 904000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('6c4c8f13-0155-58c1-9feb-ca856c323f2e', '1b0b3dc7-8d62-5325-b61d-ff45fdea45fa', 'Wix Website Redesign Expert | Custom Features & New Pages Addition', 'I have an existing business website built on Wix that needs a professional redesign and a few additional pages. I want to improve the overall appearance, make the website easier to navigate, and add custom features that better support my business needs. Issues I’m experiencing: - The current website design looks outdated and needs a fresh, modern appearance. - Some pages have inconsistent layouts, spacing, and typography. - The website needs additional pages to showcase my services and business information. - I need custom features that improve functionality and user experience. - The website should look professional and work smoothly across desktop, tablet, and mobile devices. What I need: - Redesign the existing Wix website while maintaining my brand identity. - Improve the homepage layout, navigation, and visual consistency. - Create and add new pages based on my business requirements. - Implement custom features using Wix tools or Wix Velo where necessary. - Ensure all pages are responsive and easy to use across devices. - Test the updated website before completion. What I’ll provide: - The existing website link for an initial review. - Access to the Wix website after the offer is accepted. - Details about the new pages and custom features required. - Reference websites or design examples to guide the redesign. What I’m looking for: - Proven experience with Wix website redesign and development. - Knowledge of Wix Studio, Wix Editor, and Wix Velo. - Experience creating professional business websites and custom functionality. - Strong attention to detail and responsive design. - Clear communication and reliable delivery. To apply, please share an example of a Wix website you’ve redesigned or developed, and briefly explain how you would approach improving the existing design, adding new pages, and implementing custom features.', 1, 'FIXED', 517000.00, 517000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('e52be58b-a6ae-5cae-a63e-cec13a6c466d', '1b0b3dc7-8d62-5325-b61d-ff45fdea45fa', 'Updating WIX Website with new brand package', 'I''m looking for an experienced Wix website designer to update my existing e-commerce website. I''ve recently completed a full brand refresh with a professional designer and have the new branding assets ready to go, including logos, typography, colors, and brand guidelines. I''m looking for someone who can implement this new branding throughout my existing Wix website while also refining the overall design to create a more polished, elevated, and cohesive shopping experience. **Scope of work:** - Implement new brand colors, fonts, logos, and visual elements throughout the website. - Refresh the homepage layout and overall website aesthetic to align with the new branding. - Update navigation, headers, footers, buttons, and other design elements. - Refine product pages and collection pages for a clean, elevated shopping experience. - Ensure the website looks beautiful and functions properly on both desktop and mobile. - Maintain all existing e-commerce functionality, products, customer information, and integrations. - Make recommendations for improvements to the overall user experience and visual presentation. **What I''m looking for:** Someone with strong design experience, particularly in luxury home furnishings, interiors, lifestyle, or boutique e-commerce brands. I''m drawn to clean, editorial, sophisticated website designs that feel high-end without being overly minimal or generic. This is primarily a branding implementation and website refresh, not a complete rebuild. I would like to work with someone who has a strong eye for design and can thoughtfully translate my new brand identity into my existing website. Please share examples of previous Wix websites you''ve designed, particularly for luxury or design-focused brands, along with your estimated timeline and pricing. Thank you!', 1, 'HOURLY', 387000.00, 775000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('45730352-a6eb-522d-9793-9e665a7a2ee8', '7bcd4507-de13-5caf-ae7a-b3fb1cdb764e', 'Wix Website Development for Wine Classes', 'I need help building a professional website for my wine classes and events company on Wix. The site is already in development, but I want it to feel polished, on brand, and visually engaging. I’m looking for someone who can refine the design, improve the user experience, and add subtle animations where appropriate. The goal is to create a clean, modern site that reflects my business and makes it easy for visitors to explore classes, events, and other offerings.', 1, 'HOURLY', 387000.00, 775000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('ccf9e1e9-cacb-5621-a2c9-45e5a535217e', 'ab20b033-64b3-5f5f-93e8-ea1f26e7d956', 'Looking for a Wix Expert to Fix Small Website Design Issues', 'I am looking for a Wix expert to help fix a few minor design issues on my website. The website is already built, but some elements need small adjustments to make the overall appearance cleaner, more consistent, and professional. For this $5 task, I need someone who can identify and fix a few specific design issues without redesigning the entire website. Task May Include: - Fix minor spacing and alignment issues - Adjust text sizes and font styles - Improve image positioning and sizing - Correct button styling inconsistencies - Make small layout adjustments - Check the affected section on desktop and mobile Requirements: - Experience with Wix or Wix Studio - Good eye for website design and detail - Understanding of responsive layouts - Ability to work with an existing website design - Good communication skills Goal: Fix the selected design issues and make the affected areas look polished, consistent, and user-friendly while preserving the existing website style.', 1, 'FIXED', 129000.00, 129000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('03172a1d-415a-5fdb-b3b7-69108fa53e9d', 'ab20b033-64b3-5f5f-93e8-ea1f26e7d956', 'I want to Fix Mobile Responsiveness for my Existing Wix Website', 'I’m looking for an experienced Wix website designer to improve the mobile responsiveness of one page on my existing Wix website. The goal is to make the page look clean, professional, and easy to navigate on smartphones while maintaining the website’s existing design, branding, and desktop layout. Scope of Work: - Adjust the layout of one existing Wix website page for mobile devices. - Fix text alignment, image sizing, spacing, and element positioning. - Ensure buttons, headings, and other page elements display correctly on smaller screens. - Improve readability and the overall mobile user experience. - Check the updated page using Wix’s mobile preview to ensure everything looks correct. Project Budget: $20 fixed price. Estimated Delivery: 1 day. Requirements: - Proven experience with Wix website design and mobile optimization. - Good understanding of responsive layouts, typography, and spacing. - Ability to identify and fix mobile display issues. - Attention to detail and clear communication. This project focuses on improving the mobile responsiveness of one existing page. It does not involve a complete website redesign. Please apply if you can complete the task within the stated budget and timeframe. I look forward to working with a reliable Wix website designer.', 1, 'FIXED', 517000.00, 517000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('aedba9c9-09bf-5473-99a3-eb7f244c3de2', 'ab20b033-64b3-5f5f-93e8-ea1f26e7d956', 'Wix Website Cleanup and SEO Setup', 'I need help cleaning up an existing Wix website and preparing it for better search visibility. The work includes improving site structure, fixing broken links, optimizing page content, and setting up basic SEO elements. I’m looking for someone who can make the site cleaner, more organized, and easier to navigate while improving its overall performance for search engines.', 1, 'HOURLY', 258000.00, 775000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('60af956b-3172-5850-b016-a75f7d8a43c1', 'a8efa9fc-b250-5ff3-a76c-35680b44a46f', 'Wix Website Designer Needed for a Small Website Improvement', 'I’m looking for a Wix website designer to improve a small section of my existing website. The website is already built. I need someone who can make a few design improvements, improve the layout, and ensure the section looks good on desktop and mobile. Tasks: * Improve one existing Wix website section. * Fix spacing, alignment, and layout issues. * Check the mobile version. * Keep the existing website style and branding. Requirements: * Experience with Wix Website Design and Wix Website Redesign. * Good eye for layout and responsive design. * Ability to follow instructions and communicate clearly. Budget: $10 fixed price for this small task. Wix Website Designer Needed for a Small Website Improvement Please share one relevant Wix website you have worked on and briefly explain how you would approach this task.', 1, 'FIXED', 258000.00, 258000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('e89d34ec-da72-5616-b021-30d0e61b1c49', 'a8efa9fc-b250-5ff3-a76c-35680b44a46f', 'Wix Designer to Improve a Landing Page Section and Call to Action', 'I’m looking for a Wix expert to improve one section of an existing landing page. The main goal is to make the section clearer, more professional, and easier for visitors to use. I want the call-to-action button to be visible and the layout to work well on mobile devices. **Tasks:** - Improve the layout of one landing-page section. - Adjust the heading, spacing, and content placement as instructed. - Check the call-to-action button and its link. - Optimize the section for mobile screens. **Requirements:** - Experience with Wix landing page design. - Understanding of user experience and conversion-focused layouts. - Good communication and attention to detail. **Budget:** $10 fixed price for this small improvement. When applying, please include a relevant example of a Wix landing page you have designed or improved.', 1, 'FIXED', 258000.00, 258000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('c0ad49a2-cd66-58d3-b8f6-fa6bbb7117c7', 'da7fa75b-c7cf-5e66-aad2-915e3309026b', 'Wix Form Creation for Website', 'I need a freelancer with experience working with Wix websites to make tweaks to a few pages and corrections to a form created in HTML . The scope of work should complete is mins/hours vs days.', 1, 'FIXED', 904000.00, 904000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('360bcd30-c236-5ccd-b69c-674efb97b9af', 'c5f83ee2-166a-5892-bfa4-f6459e1ce22e', 'Update Wix Architect Portfolio Website', 'I need help updating my Wix-based architect portfolio website. The work includes adding new pages for recently finished projects, updating existing pages with different format of image gallery, and improving the overall presentation using current brand design and aesthetics. The goal is to refresh the site and make it more polished but maintaining the overall design and aesthetic.', 1, 'HOURLY', 387000.00, 775000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('139a4270-da81-550f-a9d3-3bcb3cc67ce6', '7bdd153b-4bb6-5a63-8af1-edfcb04c0dae', 'Wix Website Design Consultation & Design Improvement Advice', 'I''m looking for a Wix website expert to review my existing website and provide some professional advice on how to improve it. My website is already live, but the layout feels a bit messy, especially on mobile, and I''m not sure what changes would make the biggest difference. What I need: A quick review of my existing Wix website Suggestions for improving the layout and overall design Basic advice on mobile responsiveness and user experience Recommendations on what to fix first I''m not looking for a complete Wix website redesign right now, just a short consultation with someone experienced in Wix website design who can point me in the right direction. I''d appreciate someone who can explain things clearly and offer practical suggestions.', 1, 'HOURLY', 465000.00, 1033000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('e583ca59-d3cd-5f8a-9c3b-aa2aab72dcd0', '675c7e92-2223-563f-bd65-b9ca202761a2', 'Wix Studio Responsive Layout Expert', 'Need a Wix Studio expert to improve mobile and tablet responsiveness across an existing site. Phase 1 is an immediate audit and cleanup of page alignments, sizing, padding, margins, and docking settings so text and containers stay clean and usable on smaller screens. Phase 2 is a follow-up to refine a dynamic real estate product page, making photo and video galleries responsive without harming page speed. You should be comfortable adjusting breakpoints, custom docking, and fluid layout controls, and have a portfolio showing responsive Wix or Wix Studio work.', 1, 'HOURLY', 387000.00, 646000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('b14d94e1-51e6-5f54-b865-e5668752cb7b', '536b1fe3-671f-5bc9-aacf-24e788f4eae7', 'Wix Website Designer For Publishing Company', 'I already have a website which I am mostly happy with, but I need someone to provide better quality images, to generally improve the design and layout, and any other suggestions on improvement. Thank you!', 1, 'FIXED', 697000.00, 697000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('d3be9b4e-efd3-5b98-bf6a-22500ca421a5', '9b50d16c-5e1c-59df-bdb3-7a6469998a76', 'Wix Expert Needed to Fix Contact Form on Existing Website', 'Hi, I''m looking for a Wix website designer who can help me fix and test the contact form on my existing website. The website is already built, but I want to make sure visitors can submit enquiries without any issues. I also need the form fields checked and the submission process tested. This is a small task. I don''t need a complete website redesign. Scope of Work - Check one existing Wix contact form. - Fix a form layout or configuration issue, if needed. - Check that the required fields work correctly. - Test the form submission process. - Confirm that submissions are configured to reach the intended destination, where access and settings allow. Requirements - Experience with Wix Website Design. - Familiarity with Wix Forms and form settings. - Ability to troubleshoot simple website issues. - Good communication and attention to detail. Budget and Timeline Budget: $10 fixed price. Timeline: 1–2 days. Scope: One existing contact form. To Apply Please share an example of a Wix website you''ve worked on and briefly explain how you would check and troubleshoot a contact form. I''m looking for someone reliable who can complete this small task carefully.', 1, 'FIXED', 258000.00, 258000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('d407f837-f44f-5229-a19b-e8dad75eb61d', '9b50d16c-5e1c-59df-bdb3-7a6469998a76', 'Wix Studio Contact Form Fix', 'I need a Wix website designer to fix an existing contact form on my Wix Studio site. The form is not working properly, and I want someone who can identify the issue, make the necessary updates, and ensure the form submits correctly. Please share relevant experience with Wix Studio and similar fixes. This is a small, focused project for someone who can work efficiently and communicate clearly throughout the process.', 1, 'FIXED', 129000.00, 129000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('d76509f7-bb92-5695-96a8-4fe49b74f95e', 'cfe69e91-7a0d-5ea4-a492-c07006bd7ce6', '1 Product Store and B2B Bidding Platform WordPress', 'We need a developer to build both our 1 product store and our B2B auction platform using WordPress plugins. You will be using WooCommerce and Ultimate Auction Pro to build the website and we will provide the access to the plugins. You will also be expected to work on all other website updates and changes using Elementor. All communication is to happen on Upwork any emails will be reported to Upwork as against their terms of service. All work done on the website will be done on a live video call using Upwork''s video call feature. You will be given supervised access to a Shop Manager account in WordPress to work with our team. You will not be allowed to work when not on an Upwork video call and all work done must be supervised and approved. ID checks are REQUIRED for all applicants before being hired. You will be expected to show your face and ID using Upwork''s video call feature. Any agencies looking to violate Upwork''s policies and hide behind fake profiles to gain new clients will be automatically reported for ID fraud to Upwork and fired immediately.', 1, 'HOURLY', 775000.00, 775000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('8d531099-976a-59e1-bb24-ba8935e1ef86', '2825af0b-9d70-5238-939e-27a580c3565c', 'WordPress Developer for B2B Directory', 'We need a WordPress developer to build a B2B import and export directory website. The project includes setting up the site, creating vendor and product listings, and improving the overall user experience. You should be comfortable working with directory-style websites and helping deliver a clean, functional platform for buyers and sellers. Please share relevant examples of similar projects and your approach to building a scalable directory site.', 1, 'FIXED', 10333000.00, 10333000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('246b4e6b-2260-5b45-9c72-e353083028cf', 'cc4bf5b8-e881-5d7c-bcfd-4779839f46f3', 'Tìm sinh viên / Freelancer thiết kế website WordPress B2B (Sẵn domain)', 'Mình cần tìm một bạn sinh viên hoặc freelancer trẻ thiết kế một website thương mại B2B về phụ tùng công nghiệp (Sẵn domain) Yêu cầu kỹ thuật: • Nền tảng: WordPress + Elementor (để bên mình tự đăng bài sau này). • Cấu trúc gồm 4 trang cốt lõi: Trang chủ (Industrial look), Trang danh mục sản phẩm (tối ưu để chứa danh sách mã sản phẩm chạy SEO), Trang form yêu cầu báo giá (RFQ) nhận file XLSX/PDF/JPG/DOC. Trang Giới thiệu/Liên hệ. • Cấu hình trỏ tên miền về Hosting quốc tế (Chọn máy chủ đặt tại Đức/Hà Lan). • Tích hợp bảo mật SSL và 2 Email tên miền doanh nghiệp. • Hỗ trợ khắc phục lỗi kỹ thuật (nếu có) và hỗ trợ tinh chỉnh nhẹ giao diện (font chữ, màu sắc, bố cục, form liên hệ) tối đa 3 lần trong vòng 1 tháng sau khi bàn giao để hoàn thiện website chuẩn chỉnh nhất. • Cung cấp một tài liệu/video ngắn hướng dẫn cách tự đăng bài sau khi nghiệm thu công việc. Ngân sách: Vui lòng báo giá chưa kèm tiền hosting, vì hosting bên mình sẽ tự thanh toán. Vui lòng gửi báo giá kèm theo 2 link sản phẩm website/portfolio các bạn đã từng làm. Ưu tiên các bạn nhiệt tình, có trách nhiệm. Xin cảm ơn!', 1, 'FIXED', 1500000.00, 2500000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('b75f8a89-2406-59a7-b3b6-2c25718f7082', 'dc8f7869-7d14-56fd-aec0-bc7173cca6c8', 'WordPress Author Website for Debut Nonfiction Book – Fixed Price', 'I am an author based in Mumbai, India, launching a nonfiction book on the ocean and marine pollution in January 2027, aimed mainly at readers in the US, UK, Europe and Australia. I need a small, clean, simple, elegant author website built on WordPress, using a ready-made theme, with my content inserted and a few key features set up. I will supply ALL text, photos, book cover and logo, plus a written brief with page-by-page content. I am not looking for custom coding or original branding, just a well-chosen theme, set up properly and filled in neatly. PLATFORM AND DOMAIN - The site must be built on WordPress.com, on my own account and paid plan (already registered in my name). No other platform, please. - Please recommend a suitable free theme in your proposal. Do not buy any paid theme or plugin without my written approval. - I must be able to edit the site myself afterwards (add an article, change a link, swap a photo and so forth) without coding. DESIGN APPROVAL (before any building starts) Before building the site, please submit the following for my approval: - The free theme you propose to use - A wireframe (layout sketch) of the Home page and The Book page - A colour palette - Typography (fonts for headings and body text) Building begins only after I have approved all four. PAGES (7 approximately) 1. Home – hero image with one headline and a button, book feature with cover and short excerpt, short author bio with photo, newsletter signup, space for reader praise, latest articles, footer 2. The Book – cover, description, excerpt, and buy buttons (see below) 3. Other Books – my earlier books plus "coming soon" titles 4. About – longer author biography with photos 5. Writing / Journal – a blog-style page for my essays and articles 6. Media – downloadable press kit (bio, author photos, book cover) 7. Contact – simple contact form This is only a rough structure and we will discuss and finalize actual structure before finalising the contract. Actual structure can be marginally different than above. Some pages can be built and kept hidden for now. FEATURES REQUIRED - Newsletter pop-up connected to Substack or MailerLite (or similar, to be agreed). - Signup form that delivers a free lead magnet by email automatically. - Buy buttons on The Book page linking to the book''s pages on online retailers (Amazon.com, Amazon.co.uk, Kindle, and others such as Ingram Spark or Lulu or Bookshop.org or any other). Build them now, hidden or marked "Coming soon". I must be able to add, remove or change retailer buttons myself without coding. - Fully mobile-friendly. - Fast loading, no heavy animations. - Basic SEO: page titles, meta descriptions, image alt text, and Google Search Console set up. - Short privacy note on the signup form. DELIVERABLES - Theme, wireframe, colour palette and typography for approval - Complete, working website with all my content in place - Up to 2 rounds of revisions - Around 60 minute video call showing me how to edit pages, add an article, change the buy buttons and edit the pop-up - All admin access returned to me, and any access you were given removed at handover MILESTONES (fixed price, USD 150) - Milestone 1 (USD 50): theme, wireframe, colour palette and typography approved - Milestone 2 (USD 100): full site completed, revisions done, handover call held POSSIBLE FUTURE WORK (not part of this job) I may later want to sell books directly from the site through a print-on-demand platform such as Lulu, using an integration or API. If you have experience with this, please mention it in your proposal. It would be a separate, separately priced project. TO APPLY, PLEASE INCLUDE 1. Links to 2–3 WordPress websites you have built, ideally for authors, writers or small creative businesses 2. Your experience with WordPress.com specifically (not only self-hosted WordPress) 3. The theme you would suggest for this site 4. Confirmation that you can meet the 30 November deadline 5. Please start your proposal with the word "OCEAN" so I know you have read this brief Proposals without portfolio links will not be considered.', 1, 'FIXED', 3875000.00, 3875000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('b28eb0fd-ad63-545e-bba2-a5f08417c686', 'f11d8a60-711b-5fd2-bf58-4bfcb2e65b8b', 'WordPress Developer Needed – Build 2026 Midterm Elections Hub Page', 'I need an experienced WordPress developer to build a dedicated 2026 Midterm Elections hub page on my news site. The site runs on the Foxiz theme with Elementor. The page must match the existing site design (clean, modern news layout, light theme, bold headlines, category badges, grid/sidebar style) and feel native to the rest of the site. Project Requirements • Create a new page titled (will give you title) • Match the current site design and Foxiz styling as closely as possible. • Include these sections: • Strong headline + Politics category badge • Prominent Live Election Results section that embeds the official elections results dashboard via iframe • Key races cards/sections (will provide) • Make the page mobile-responsive and fast. • Optimize for SEO (proper headings, meta title/description, clean URL). • Add the page to the main menu under Politics (or as discussed). Need completed no later than October 31, 2026.', 1, 'FIXED', 5166000.00, 5166000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('549c1161-b601-5cb9-aed1-3ac1523efabe', 'a47e2a4e-cb63-5032-b49d-c14fed50a5e7', 'WordPress Site Setup and Template Upload', 'Starting a media website and need help setting up the website and uploading the template for now. Not well-versed in Wordpress so need help with initial setup, and possible project work later.', 1, 'HOURLY', 387000.00, 775000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('ad2dfedd-b363-51ab-9019-11662bc22fe8', 'ec5c1367-c8f2-5c50-ad4c-6bc800d279f9', 'Malware Cleanup of WordPress Sites Hosted by HostGator', 'Seeking malware removal from five Wordpress sites hosted by Hostgator: One primary domain and four subdomains. Beside that, eight unused sites need be deleted. (I tried deleting the directories myself, but a persistent malware script or backdoor on the hosting account keeps regenerating and replacing these folders the next day.) Please trace the root source of this infection, delete these unused directories, and ensure they cannot self-replicate. I am a non-tech person and am not completely sure whether all five sites are built on WordPress, or if they all use the Divi theme. Because of this, the malware may have corrupted other unknown themes on the server. I do have a clean, zipped version of the Divi theme ready to share if it helps for the sites that use it. Please audit the themes on the other sites and let me know what you find. Note: A couple of the domains deal with intimacy coaching and relationship topics. The titles contain words that some conservative environments might flag. Will this pose any firewall issues or personal discomfort for you while working in the cPanel/databases? Budget is set to $150 as a starting point, but I am willing to go higher for a top-tier security specialist who can offer a 30-day warranty against re-infection.', 1, 'FIXED', 3875000.00, 3875000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('acca6acc-18ab-5b62-b05a-343c0b5a7082', '3e09af55-5e63-5f93-b62b-c36788a72bf0', 'WordPress Developer Needed to Customize Website', 'I am looking for an experienced WordPress and WooCommerce developer to improve my existing website and prepare it for an e-commerce launch. **Project Requirements:** - Review the existing WordPress website and its current configuration. - Improve the website layout, structure, and overall user experience. - Set up and customize WooCommerce. - Configure product pages, categories, pricing, and product images. - Integrate a suitable payment gateway for customers in the UAE. - Ensure full compatibility with mobile, tablet, and desktop devices. - Optimize website speed, security, and performance. - Ensure all existing functionality and settings are preserved. - Test the website thoroughly before completion. **Important Conditions:** - The website and domain are already set up. - The Coming Soon page has already been completed and does not need to be recreated. - This is an existing website, not a new website built from scratch. - Please review the current setup before proposing additional work or plugins. - Provide a fixed-price quote and estimated delivery time before starting. **To Apply:** Please share examples of similar WooCommerce websites you have developed, your proposed approach, total cost, and estimated completion time.', 1, 'FIXED', 1808000.00, 1808000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('07620a48-6d31-552b-a83a-1c04abacb5b4', '5092e200-d79e-5909-bd1d-0d620d8849e3', 'WordPress Front-End Developer – Codebase Remediation & Layout Stabilization (No Agencies)', 'We are seeking a precise, mechanical WordPress front-end developer to execute a clearly defined codebase remediation and content integration project for our storefront platform, Fort Hunt Sentinel. Every element of this project has been meticulously finalized down to the individual character block. You are being hired strictly as a mechanical code-deployment utility. There is ZERO creative authority allowed on this project. You will be provided with a locked, character-exact Statement of Work (SOW) PDF and a complete, downloaded WordPress site backup archive (encrypted zip file). Your job is to stand up an offline sandbox environment, unpack the assets, and implement the precise front-end layout parameters character-for-character. Key Technical Requirements: 1. Sandbox Replication: Local, offline replication of our existing site assets into an isolated sandbox environment for structural audit and layer validation. 2. Hyperlink Underline Elimination Mandate: Globally strip all default, permanent text underlines from links across the entire architecture (including the FAQs and AN UPGRADE pages). Hyperlinks must display natively as bold text only, with underlines manifesting strictly during active user cursor hover events. 3. Single-Click Unmuted Video Playback: Configure the [ See Video ] action trigger to pass the unmuted volume parameter (muted="false") instantly upon a user click event. Completely eliminate the secondary, redundant "unmute" toggle asset layout underneath the player window. 4. Authoritative Column Overwrites: Implement our structural updates character-for-character, including a specific 3-column "We Deliver" homepage layout. 5. SEO Matrix Optimization: Inject a precise 14-item foundational keyword index strictly within hidden backend metadata fields to protect the clean visual theme of the front-facing canvas. Hiring Constraints & Rules: • Fixed-Price Milestones: Payment is strictly bound to a 4-tier milestone structure managed through platform escrow. Release of funds is gated by explicit technical validation criteria and a mandatory User Acceptance Testing (UAT) review. • No Code Fluff: We do not authorize changing text parameters or adding generic agency fluff. Shifting, rewriting, or omitting any wording will result in a failed milestone acceptance review. • Browser & Viewport Validation: Code will be verified on physical mobile viewports for text scaling stability and script latency before milestone sign-off. Application Instruction (Crucial Filter): You must begin your proposal with the exact phrase "Utility-Grade Integration Ready" at the very top of your text block. All proposals that omit this exact verification hook will be hidden and rejected instantly without review.', 1, 'HOURLY', 1679000.00, 2067000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('e8812529-fa26-5b0a-adc6-8a141aa25394', '41481090-ea7d-5a4f-9779-18ed4030accd', 'Experienced WordPress backend developer to rebuild a document plugin', 'Looking for a careful, experienced WordPress backend developer for a scoped project, with the goal of working together long term, part time or full time. We care about quality and speed. You ship it tested, with unit tests. We run acceptance on a staging copy against the spec before sign-off. The job: rebuild an old custom plugin on a WooCommerce Subscriptions site that generates PDF documents for members, such as agreements and notices. The new plugin stores templates with versions, records when a member accepts a document, generates the PDFs, keeps an archive per member, sends documents by email, shows a documents page, and migrates the old files and records. The spec is written. You get the specs, the old code and a data sample, and you own the technical decisions. We answer business questions quickly. We use AI coding tools and automated review, and you are welcome to as well. You are responsible for the whole plugin: design, code, tests, QA, migration, and that it works in production. - Budget is negotiable. - You must attach your github profile URL and/or portfolio of wordpress plugins to be considered. - Overlap with Eastern Time Zone is preferred.', 1, 'FIXED', 10333000.00, 10333000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('1d8191b4-b89e-5900-9783-c7e93d61c311', '6c3079c2-5baf-5150-8ac4-3b09ae972796', 'WordPress Developer for Website Build', 'We need a developer to build a new website from scratch using WordPress. The project includes creating a custom homepage, setting up key internal pages, and implementing a clean, responsive design. You will also handle basic site configuration, page layout, and ensure the site is easy to navigate. Experience with WordPress development and attention to detail are important for this role.', 1, 'HOURLY', 387000.00, 904000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('4648bb75-da65-598a-9e9e-632b4a65d327', '6c3079c2-5baf-5150-8ac4-3b09ae972796', 'WordPress Website from Figma', 'I have a complete Figma design for a guest house website, including desktop, tablet, and mobile versions. I need an experienced WordPress developer to recreate the design using Elementor and deliver a fully functional, responsive website ready for use. All sections, text, images, menus, and buttons must be editable and working correctly. I already have a domain and hosting. Fixed budget: €50.', 1, 'FIXED', 1292000.00, 1292000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('7921bb92-7329-5882-a9ad-42d0201ecd37', 'bdc4b5a2-a442-5f81-b9a6-a1a059ebda05', 'update the hero section and contact page of an existing website using Elementor', 'Improve the hero section design. Redesign the contact page. Ensure mobile responsiveness. Maintain the existing website style and functionality. Requirements: Experience with WordPress and Elementor. Good eye for modern UI/UX design. Attention to detail.', 1, 'HOURLY', 258000.00, 258000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('6f2a7cca-667b-58cd-a84a-6db780019a51', '34571191-cc01-5673-b8ef-56e8ff62f807', 'Skilled Full-Stack WordPress Developer for Long-Term', 'A full-stack WordPress – PHP customized developer is required for long-term – for finalizing development, support & maintenance of a big-data, dynamic & complexed System: • Rating System is a Global complex System for relative quality rating & for comparing prices of products & services, in which comprehensive data from over 484K websites included in over 4,300 different activity fields (“AFs”), including over 1,000 AI tools, each AF is in a different Excel DB, each AF is characterized by average of 250 parameters of the AF & set of complexed algorithms calculate the Ratings & compares. • The System includes the WordPress website that has been developed in the last few years, the System is near to being completed, then a long-term maintenance will be given by the freelancer. • The API & a set of 8 supporting xls2json Python software are already completed. Mandatory requirements (If you are not top graded in A-H, no use participating): A. Ability to integrate into an existing very complex System & code. B. Ability to quickly understand written tasks. C. Fast and independent in work. D. Particularly, thorough, systematic & meticulous work ability. E. Keen eyes for details. F. Striving for perfectionism. G. Experience with Excel & spreadsheets. H. High level of English. • This is not a casual statement of capabilities - it will be included in the contract and will be continuously reviewed in the overall conduct, exaggerated reporting on these points, will be quickly discovered and without compromises cause the work to be terminated at once. • Being a complex System & entering into the middle of development, the process of entering'' the System before hiring includes 6 steps, in which detailed written guides & flowcharts will be delivered one by one. • What''s next: 1). Pls. refer to your capabilities, separately to each of the job requirements A-H (format: ni/10 [n is your level /out of 10]). 2). For supporting your A-G capabilities - add links to relevant jobs of yours. 3). Confirm understanding & agree for a long process of learning the System before starting to develop. 4). Confirm agree to react quickly to the steps until completed. 5). Confirm availability to work at least 30-40 hrs. /week, @ up to $12 /hr. • Then, proceeding will be 5 steps of getting deeper into the job & full compatibility for the job, until hiring. Thx.', 1, 'HOURLY', 310000.00, 387000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00');

