    ('2d572ea3-ccf4-52ea-baa2-6aef39202c1d', '407aa9b9-2c1b-5a21-9205-0a0f7bd1513e', 'WordPress Menu Website Fix', 'Need a developer to fix and improve a menu website. The work includes reviewing the current site, identifying issues, and making updates to improve functionality and user experience. You should be able to troubleshoot problems, implement fixes, and ensure the site works smoothly across devices. Please share relevant experience with similar website fixes and your approach to resolving issues quickly and effectively.', 1, 'FIXED', 517000.00, 517000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('24f9edaf-bd0b-58fb-a886-d31bf110c985', 'e80a0d31-810c-5f5d-b811-74dd11201d46', 'Independent security review of two custom WordPress plugins (one handles payroll)', 'Independent security review of two custom WordPress plugins, one of which handles payroll and bank payment files. You must not have written or worked on this code. Requirements: – 5+ years of WordPress plugin development, with PHP and MySQL/MariaDB. – Previous security or code-review work. Name one example in your proposal. What you will receive, after accepting a short confidentiality term: the two plugin zips and their checksums, the source, the specification, our test scripts and their output, and the list of known issues and fixes. Test data only. There is no access to a live site and no real staff data. Deliverables: Run the test scripts on your own computer and confirm whether your results match ours. Read the code that handles money and bank details, and try to break it. A short written report covering what you checked, what you found (with severity), and a plain go or no-go. Deadline: report delivered by 6 November 2026. Please open your proposal with a specific question about the work, not a generic pitch.', 1, 'FIXED', 10333000.00, 10333000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('19dbd0cb-b3ee-53d5-b376-f18e763ffd64', 'b277d8b7-fd8c-5966-84ce-5f78e1c1ea30', 'Build Informational Website on Square Space', 'We are seeking a freelance web designer and developer to create a professional informational website for Kingdom Convergence. The site should explain our mission and areas of work, build credibility, and make it easy for prospective customers and partners to contact Darius Carter. Kingdom Convergence focuses on connecting Christian faith with business, work, and community. Our vision includes equipping churches, believers, and business owners through teaching, relationships, and practical tools grounded in biblical principles. The website should speak to Christian entrepreneurs, church and ministry leaders, and people seeking to apply their faith at work.', 1, 'HOURLY', 387000.00, 775000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('cd3ca399-7dbe-592a-8063-c0d801d15177', '51f07dcd-20a8-50c9-ab66-7b7cc89b04cc', 'Xây dựng lại 1 trang trong web WP', 'Liên hệ để nhận yêu cầu cụ thể và gửi mình các dự án WP của "CHÍNH BẠN"', 1, 'FIXED', 200000.00, 800000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('3c49246a-23dd-5948-abab-07920358c634', '147c1bc9-8968-5a38-a96f-2c56d469ddde', 'Cần xây dựng và hoàn thiện website theo mẫu sau', 'Mình cần xây dựng 1 website WP theo mẫu sau: noithatmanhhe.vn . ĐIều chỉnh lại giao diện cho phù hợp với tone màu thương hiệu, và chỉnh bổ sung thêm các box bổ sung dạng infomation tĩnh. Ngoài ra sẽ upload các công trình của bên mình lên trên website này luôn nhé và biên tập lại nội dung website , banner 1 thể luôn để có thể sử dụng được luôn, bạn nào nhận cho m xem các dự án trước đây đã từng làm nhé.', 1, 'FIXED', 2000000.00, 3000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('bec433e2-3dcc-5d2e-b772-6275be26cd7d', 'bff544df-5beb-5960-b206-47f61d899718', 'Thiểt kế giao diện website cá nhân cho học sinh nộp du học', 'Thiết kế giao diện website bằng figma các trang như Home, Leadership, Activties,... Theo yêu cầu và style khách chọn', 1, 'FIXED', 1000000.00, 1500000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('13b67606-f8fd-556d-877b-132bc7eae26b', '91303087-c4ba-53df-83c7-7f7decb9bc23', 'Thiết kế trang rao vặt về thời trang', 'Thiết kế trang rao vặt chuyên về thời trang có các điểm chính sau: - Quản lý thành viên (Profile, nâng cấp, VIP,...), bài đăng - Các tính năng liên quan đến tin đăng: up, ghim, sửa, xoá tin đăng, duyệt tin (tự động và thủ công) - Cho phép bình luận, đánh giá tin đăng - Có ghi nhận lượt thích, đánh giá, theo dõi - Tìm kiếm quanh đây theo tiêu chí khoảng cách - Có bộ lọc sản phẩm nhiều tiêu chí - Đăng ký và đăng nhập qua Gmail, Facebook,... - Có biện pháp chặn spam - Các hiệu ứng liên quan đến hình ảnh: zoom, đổi hình tự động, quy định kích cỡ upload và video,... Và các chi tiết nhỏ khác cần thiết Ghi chú: - không tích hợp thanh toán, quản lý giỏ hàng - cần thiết kế figma hoàn chỉnh trước khi code', 1, 'FIXED', 20000000.00, 30000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('6ea2d4e6-bf24-5a4d-89b4-29b82012e7aa', '4d4b244f-40dc-5f48-b12d-ab9ecf08aeb0', 'UX/UI designer for a mobile app', 'Read fully before apply We are redesigning the onboarding of our mobile app (Android + iOS) and need a UX/UI designer. The job: - 5–6 screens, from sign-up to the user''s first alert being set up - Figma, with our existing design system - About 20–25 hours over 2 weeks - $30/h What we would love to see: - Mobile onboarding flows you''ve designed - How you''d make a first-time setup feel quick and simple A small note on timing: Before posting, I checked upworkxray.com (A free upwork analysis tool) and two things surprised me. Almost half of UX/UI jobs from US clients go up between 11pm and 7am India time. And 27% of UX/UI jobs already had invites sent a few minutes after posting. Hope my time zone and way works for me, Wish me luck!', 1, 'HOURLY', 646000.00, 904000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('5e071dc0-5ee5-58e0-a76d-959e0d190303', '727a2b7b-1691-532e-a0b5-2a12334fa109', 'Ui design', 'I’m looking for an experienced UI/UX designer to improve the design and user experience of my web platform. I want a distinctive visual identity, clear navigation, strong typography, and layouts that work smoothly on mobile and desktop. Thoughtful animations and microinteractions should make the experience feel polished and easy to use. The work includes reviewing the current website, improving key user flows, and designing the agreed pages in Figma. Deliverables should include responsive layouts, a clickable prototype, reusable components, and organized files with developer handoff notes. Please cover loading, empty, error, and success states where relevant. We’ll start with one key page to agree on the design direction before moving to the remaining screens. I’ll provide access to the current website, explain the product, share references, and give feedback at agreed milestones. Please send two or three relevant projects, explain your role in each, and include your availability, estimated timeline, and pricing. Outline what your quote includes and how you handle revisions. This role covers design and handoff. If you also offer frontend implementation, please quote that separately.', 1, 'HOURLY', 646000.00, 1214000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('4b2d7a32-036c-5f05-8dc6-8694b1cb148f', '962a1a65-ae86-5f71-8770-cf472e920167', 'Website Maintenance and Link Fixes', 'Need a freelancer to maintain and update a website, including fixing broken links for the contact email address and restoring access to certain functions. The work should ensure the site remains functional and user-friendly after updates. Please share relevant experience with similar website maintenance tasks and your availability for ongoing support.', 1, 'HOURLY', 387000.00, 775000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('6a322307-7436-5815-b407-0a4e6dcb80a6', '9df8ae26-ae03-5964-b3c0-91d28f461566', 'Flutter Developer for Accessible Hair Styling App', 'I’m looking for an experienced Flutter developer to build the MVP of an accessible hair styling assistant app. The app helps people with limited mobility, dexterity challenges, sensory sensitivities, and neurological conditions style their hair with less fatigue, fewer repetitive motions, and reduced sensory overload. This is not a standard consumer beauty app. Accessibility, calm design, and adaptive interaction are core requirements—not nice-to-haves. What You’ll Build A cross-platform mobile app (iOS + Android) that includes: • Personalized onboarding and profile system (mobility, dexterity, sensory triggers, energy levels, hair characteristics) • Adaptive style library with effort, noise, reach, and one-handed filters • Guided routine player with large controls, pause/repeat/skip, adjustable pacing, mid-session fatigue check-ins, optional voice, and haptic feedback • Global Calm Mode (reduced motion, muted palette, no non-essential sound) • Technique library, session logging, and simple recommendations • Full offline support for core content • Strong accessibility implementation (screen readers, large touch targets, switch/keyboard support, high contrast, reduced motion) I have a complete product blueprint that details every feature, user flow, technical specification, data model, acceptance criteria, and estimated effort. This will be shared with the selected freelancer. Technical Requirements • Flutter (Dart) for the frontend • Firebase (Auth, Firestore, Cloud Storage) for backend and optional sync • Offline-first approach for core guides • WCAG 2.2 Level AA target • Clean, maintainable code with reasonable documentation Deliverables • Working MVP builds for iOS and Android • Full source code • Basic documentation and content structure • App store submission support (or guidance) Ideal Freelancer • Proven Flutter experience shipping production apps • Strong accessibility knowledge (VoiceOver, TalkBack, touch target sizing, reduced motion, contrast) • Experience with Firebase and offline patterns • Clear communicator who asks good questions early • Comfortable working from a detailed specification Timeline MVP target is approximately 9–14 weeks depending on availability and pace. I’m open to a phased approach. To Apply, Please Include: 1. Examples of Flutter apps you’ve shipped (links preferred) 2. Any accessibility-related work or relevant experience 3. Your estimated timeline and high-level approach for this project 4. Your availability (hours per week) 5. Any questions you have after reading this description I’m looking for someone who treats accessibility as a first-class requirement and can execute carefully against a detailed blueprint. Serious proposals only.', 1, 'HOURLY', 336000.00, 568000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00');

