    updated_at = EXCLUDED.updated_at; we need you to review it and standardize it. Safe over-the-air updates. A/B system updates with automatic rollback triggered by our health endpoint, signed artifacts, and separate app-only updates. We expect Mender, but we''re open to RAUC or SWUpdate with a reasoned recommendation. Handling the HailoRT kernel driver. A strategy for updating the kernel and OS without breaking the HailoRT kernel module. Device hardening. No default credentials, non-root services, a firewall, an SSH policy, a read-only or overlay root filesystem where practical, a hardware watchdog, and protection against power loss and SD card wear. Provisioning and identity. Unique per-device credentials or certificates, plus a first-boot setup flow for device name, site and network. CI pipeline. Automated ARM64 builds, versioned releases and artifact signing. GitHub Actions or GitLab CI is preferred. Documentation. A runbook covering how to build, release, provision a new device, roll out an update, and recover a failed device. Milestones (fixed price per milestone): M1: A reproducible image that boots and runs our application, built from a script in our repo. M2: Working OTA updates, including a live demo where a deliberately broken update rolls back automatically. M3: Hardening, provisioning and per-device identity complete. M4: CI pipeline and runbook delivered and handed off. Required experience: Shipping embedded Linux products to the field, not only servers or cloud Raspberry Pi or other ARM single-board computer image builds (pi-gen, rpi-image-gen, Yocto or Buildroot) OTA systems with A/B partitions and rollback (Mender, RAUC, SWUpdate) systemd, Debian packaging, kernel modules / DKMS Linux security hardening for unattended devices Nice to have: Hailo, NVIDIA Jetson, or other edge AI accelerators Camera and GStreamer pipelines on embedded Linux Fleet management platforms (Mender, balena) Not in scope: Application logic, inference models, the API, or dashboards. Those stay with our team. To apply, please answer: How would you make updates fail-safe on a device mounted on a ceiling with no physical access? How do you handle kernel updates when a vendor kernel driver (like HailoRT) depends on a specific kernel version? How would you give each device unique credentials during provisioning? Describe an embedded device fleet you shipped: hardware, update system, and number of devices. An NDA and IP assignment agreement will be required before you get access to the repository.', 1, 'HOURLY', 77000.00, 2583000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('55e8da61-108e-5824-9992-592c756fd045', '6bbc0494-a0a9-547e-8b42-23e75853bb79', 'Productionize Raspberry Pi Edge AI Device', 'We need a freelancer to help productionize a Raspberry Pi-based edge AI device for a commercial product. The work includes refining the current prototype, improving reliability and performance, and preparing the system for scalable manufacturing. You will support hardware and software integration, troubleshoot issues, and help create documentation for production and deployment. Experience with embedded systems and edge AI workflows is important. This is a part-time project with potential for ongoing collaboration.', 1, 'HOURLY', 491000.00, 1033000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('c9aff518-dab3-5f78-947d-60a0d06bf7d5', '6e9e1be5-47aa-593f-8f20-689e82816e0d', 'Kỹ sư phần cứng / firmware phát triển module 100 nút bấm', '1. Module có 100 nút bấm, khi nhấn nút sẽ gửi tín hiệu tọa độ X, Y qua cổng UART (RS232) cho nhà cung cấp màn hình cảm ứng. 2. Không kết nối trực tiếp với PC, chỉ gửi tín hiệu cho nhà cung cấp màn hình cảm ứng, sau đó nhà cung cấp sẽ chuyển tiếp cho PC. 3. Cần có phần mềm cài đặt trên máy tính để tôi có thể đặt tọa độ X, Y cho từng nút bấm. 4. Sau khi cài đặt xong, tọa độ sẽ lưu vào module không mất khi mất điện. 5. Không cần giả lập chuột, không cần driver phức tạp. Nếu có thể làm vui lòng báo giá tổng thể và thời gian hoàn thành. Cảm ơn.', 1, 'FIXED', 20000000.00, 40000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('d3f6545f-ac2b-55e1-bdd6-3fb859fe80a9', '80c0ec02-42fa-5901-8fb7-20a61b32b1e8', 'Cần tuyển người làm hệ thống MCP cho các phần mềm thiết kế chip bán dẫn', '*Yêu cầu ứng viên: - Có kinh nghiệm lập trình backend (Python, C/C++, hoặc ngôn ngữ tương đương) - Hiểu biết về kiến trúc hệ thống, API, và xử lý dữ liệu - Ưu tiên ứng viên đã từng làm việc với các hệ thống tích hợp, middleware hoặc giao thức kết nối tương tự MCP - Có kiến thức hoặc từng tiếp cận lĩnh vực thiết kế vi mạch / bán dẫn / EDA là một lợi thế lớn', 1, 'FIXED', 10000000.00, 30000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('98dd489d-73a0-5a2a-9cb7-18abcde3ea1b', 'abdf56d6-cc24-542c-92e0-c6aa4d339b73', 'Cần làm app sheet quản lý sim Iot , gói cước đang sử dụng,', 'Cần làm app sheet quản lý sim Iot , gói cước, khách hàng đang sử dụng, Mình đã phác thảo sẵn giao diện, chạy thử trên Gemini canvas, cần chỉnh sửa và hoàn thiện, thêm dashboard theo dõi, chạy online.', 1, 'FIXED', 2000000.00, 5000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('6ab6174e-68ea-5ef7-933e-944f03f627bb', 'aef7f4ea-eeea-5c8e-a3f2-e179609614d3', 'Emergency Broadcast Alerts', 'PROJECT: Emergency Broadcast Alert System for Mobile Phones & IoT Gadgets We need a developer to build a real-time emergency broadcast system that can alert all connected phones and gadgets instantly. GOAL: Create an app similar to NDRRMC / Emergency SOS alerts. When an admin sends a broadcast (e.g., Earthquake, Flood, Fire), ALL subscribed phones must receive a critical alert that will: - Ring a loud siren even if phone is on silent/DND - Show full-screen alert notification - Vibrate in SOS pattern - Flash the flashlight - Work even when app is closed or in background FEATURES REQUIRED: 1. Mobile App (Android - Priority, iOS optional): - Firebase Cloud Messaging (FCM) integration - Subscribe to topics (e.g., emergency_broadcast, city-specific alerts) - Background service & full-screen intent notification - Siren sound with loop, vibration, torch strobe - "I Am Safe / Stop Alarm" button - Last alert history 2. Admin / Broadcaster Panel: - Web dashboard or simple Node.js script to send broadcast - Fields: Title, Message, Type (Earthquake/Flood/Fire), Location - Send to ALL or to specific topic/city - High priority delivery 3. Optional IoT Integration (Bonus): - ESP32 / relay to trigger physical barangay siren or smart lights via MQTT/HTTP when broadcast is received. TECH STACK PREFERRED: Flutter + Firebase (FCM, Firestore) for app, Node.js or Firebase Console for admin. Open to native Android (Kotlin) if more reliable for critical alerts. DELIVERABLES: - Full source code (Flutter or Android Studio project) - APK file ready to test - Admin panel / sender script - Setup guide for Firebase - Documentation on how to trigger alerts BUDGET & TIMELINE: Please provide your estimate and timeline. This is an initial version (MVP) but will lead to a long-term project with more features like maps, evacuation routes, and chat. REQUIREMENTS: - Proven experience with FCM, background services, and critical notifications - Experience with loud alarm / emergency apps is a plus - Can work with Firebase Please start your proposal with "EMERGENCY READY" and share examples of similar alert/notification apps you''ve built.', 1, 'HOURLY', 387000.00, 775000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('24754b67-4d0e-565e-bbd2-693d90941c33', 'fe1864af-c130-5f39-bc14-ee9dc3d765ee', 'Technical content developer', 'Looking for an embedded systems engineer to help develop new content (How-Tos) using RaspberryPi, NVIDIA Jetson like, SBCs using our no-code build tool called eLBaaS. The person having prior experience with Robotics (ROS2), EdgeAI or any embedded Linux based product development will be given priority. Having experience working with various features like, OTA integration, ensuring device security/encryption etc. is great to have. Must posses a SBC to conduct the tests and prepare the contents. Please apply with your expected rate. The indented task is milestone basis and payment is based on milestone. Expected range: $50-$100 for each content.', 1, 'FIXED', 1292000.00, 1292000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('1e8a552f-8e2e-5b27-bc40-9884e63227b1', '8f19e8a2-eeb4-52c9-ae12-217d6d95198e', 'Bên mình cần tìm đối tác triển khai hệ thống Backend cho phần mềm quản lí xe', 'Bên mình đang triển khai nền tảng xe cũ tích hợp AI + Fintech + IoT, cần tìm agency/công ty công nghệ đồng hành ngay từ giai đoạn đầu. Scope công việc gồm 4 phần: - AI định giá xe tự động (Scraping + ML Model) - Sàn đấu giá real-time cho 1.000+ Salon (WebSocket + Kafka) - Hệ thống IoT giám sát & khóa xe từ xa (GPS + Geofencing) - Mobile App (iOS/Android) + Web Admin Chi tiết trao đổi cụ thể hơn', 1, 'FIXED', 100000000.00, 200000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('49a2bb91-a37a-5386-8e23-19785e954d2a', 'f6d347db-738f-5efe-a794-09332997e328', 'Bên mình cần tìm đối tác triển khai hệ thống Backend cho phần mềm quản lí xe ở Hà Nội', 'Bên mình đang triển khai nền tảng xe cũ tích hợp AI + Fintech + IoT, cần tìm agency/công ty công nghệ có kinh nghiệm đồng hành ngay từ giai đoạn đầu. Gửi mình portfolio cụ thể Scope công việc gồm 4 phần: - AI định giá xe tự động (Scraping + ML Model) - Sàn đấu giá real-time cho 1.000+ Salon (WebSocket + Kafka) - Hệ thống IoT giám sát & khóa xe từ xa (GPS + Geofencing) - Mobile App (iOS/Android) + Web Admin Chi tiết trao đổi cụ thể hơn', 1, 'FIXED', 100000000.00, 200000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('2177366d-d668-5aea-9b3c-18e5dee5f026', '869cb006-3290-5054-a9d0-be174d23cb3d', 'Flutter Build MVP for location (Using multiple techs to get accuracy indoors)', 'Summary Hello my name is Simon from IGC Loyalty Flutter Developer (Indoor Navigation / Sensor Fusion / Mapbox) Pilot Project (No Source Code Required) Overview We would require APK and also git access for code check We are looking for an experienced Flutter developer or small development team to build a proof-of-concept APK demonstrating highly accurate indoor positioning. This is not a full application rebuild. The goal is to prove technical capability before a larger commercial engagement. If the pilot is successful, we intend to purchase the code, expand the scope, and engage the successful developer for long-term development. Objective Create a simple Android APK demonstrating accurate navigation through: Hotel (multiple floors) Shopping mall (multiple floors) The application does not require: Login Database Admin dashboard Marketplace Payment systems Accuracy is far more important than appearance. Required Technology The preferred technology stack includes: Flutter Mapbox Geolocator Sensor Fusion Accelerometer Gyroscope Compass Step Counter Barometer (where available) Indoor Navigation Engine Google ML Kit OCR (for recognising floor signs) GPS and Geofencing NO BEACONs Developers may suggest alternative technologies if they improve positioning accuracy. Pilot Features The APK should demonstrate: Outdoor navigation to building Transition indoors Floor detection Lift/elevator detection Escalator detection Vertical transport recognition Correct level identification Indoor navigation Navigation guidance arrow Turn-by-turn guidance Destination photo popup Example: "Please go here to collect" with a photo of the destination. Navigation should then continue to that exact location. Accuracy Requirements The system should correctly identify: Building Floor Direction Shop or room User movement Arrival at destination Example locations: Hotel Lobby Level 2 Level 11 Room Shopping Mall Level 1 Level 3 Correct retailer Deliverables We require: Flutter source code for the pilot Working APK Git repository Installation instructions Technical documentation Explanation of positioning approach Important This project is independent and does not require access to our existing source code. We are evaluating technical capability only.', 1, 'FIXED', 200000.00, 600000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('346613c4-a7aa-5211-9b59-d8165500afc0', 'ae3c9770-a8fe-58ed-b435-8e4b206e4bb7', 'Xây dựng trang webgis', 'Xây dựng trang webgis với các yêu cầu: - Giao diện giống OSM - Tìm kiếm trong các lớp dữ liệu - Xem thông tin khi chọn trên bản đồ - Bật/tắt lớp dữ liệu - Thay đổi basemap', 1, 'FIXED', 3000000.00, 5000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('d82dc12a-60bd-5f86-a438-1f08b2360d98', 'a34df32c-f734-58b9-a807-8aeb4fe97013', 'TUYỂN DEV GIS — XÂY DỰNG BẢN ĐỒ NỘI BỘ', 'Từ file CAD as-built, xây dựng bản đồ số nội bộ dạng GIS và routing engine cho khu vực có nhiều kho hàng. Công việc cụ thể: - Xử lý CAD (DXF) → GIS: kiểm tra hệ tọa độ, làm sạch layer, polygonize khu kho/block, tạo road network topology - Thiết kế schema PostgreSQL/PostGIS: đường, block/kho, cổng, gắn attribute (một chiều/hai chiều, giới hạn tải trọng/chiều cao) - Build serving layer: GeoServer/pg_tileserv xuất vector tile, MapLibre GL JS hiển thị bản đồ - Build routing engine trên mạng đường nội bộ (không phải public road): pgRouting hoặc self-hosted OSRM/Valhalla, có turn-by-turn Yêu cầu: 1. Có kinh nghiệm thực tế làm dự án GIS 2. Có kinh nghiệm build routing engine 3. Biết xử lý CAD → GIS', 1, 'FIXED', 10000000.00, 30000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('ddba6d38-d91c-5abe-8ff8-5a2be5493daa', '461f3aa0-6973-5865-95ea-c1e7a91b2249', 'Senior ArcGIS Developer: Python, Field Maps and API Integration', 'We need an experienced ArcGIS developer to help a client automate and improve an existing, largely manual workflow that already runs on ArcGIS Pro and ArcGIS Online. The work combines configuration with development: Python tools in ArcGIS Pro, offline data capture in ArcGIS Field Maps, automated PDF outputs, and integration with third-party back-office systems through REST APIs. This is hands-on development work to an agreed design, from data model through to deployment. The contract runs for one to three months from mid-November 2026, subject to contract award, with possible ongoing support after completion. The workload is heaviest at the start and then reduces to part-time. The work runs on Irish time (GMT), so we prefer freelancers based in the EU or the UK. Tasks - You will work on these tasks: • Build ArcGIS Pro Python toolboxes (arcpy) for office users. • Design geodatabase models with domains, attribute rules and relationship classes. • Configure ArcGIS Online layers, web maps and Field Maps forms with Arcade and offline map areas. • Automate the generation of PDF map packs and pre-filled forms. • Build and schedule integrations that sync records between ArcGIS and third-party back-office systems through REST APIs. Skills required ArcGIS Pro • Python toolboxes (.pyt) and script tools built with arcpy. • Layouts, map series and report templates. • Geodatabase design: domains, subtypes, attribute rules (Arcade), relationship classes and feature templates. • Publishing hosted feature layers and web maps to ArcGIS Online. • Repeatable data loads with Python geoprocessing or ModelBuilder. ArcGIS Online • Hosted feature layers, views, groups, sharing and user types. • Web maps in Map Viewer, including Arcade pop-ups and labels. • ArcGIS Field Maps: smart forms, Arcade calculated expressions and offline map areas. • ArcGIS Survey123 forms and report templates. • ArcGIS Dashboards. • ArcGIS Notebooks with scheduled tasks. REST API integration • ArcGIS API for Python and the ArcGIS REST API, including feature service queries and applyEdits. • Third-party REST APIs with token-based or OAuth authentication, ideally including third-party back-office systems such as ERP or finance platforms. • Mapping and syncing records between two systems in both directions, including incremental changes and matching keys. • Error handling, retries, logging and failure alerts for unattended jobs. • Scheduling jobs on a server or in ArcGIS Notebooks, with credentials stored securely. PDF automation • Exporting PDFs from ArcGIS Pro layouts and map series with arcpy.mp. • Filling PDF forms and document templates from data with Python libraries such as pypdf or ReportLab. • Merging maps, tables and forms into one document pack per job. Desirable • FME. • ArcGIS Experience Builder. • Utility network data.', 1, 'HOURLY', 258000.00, 1292000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('37c89b69-d10c-5bc7-ad38-ecf50582162b', '7e52f7aa-372b-50f1-aaee-c873b85bfc59', 'Thiết ké giao diện Mobile App (25M-2 tháng)', 'Mô tả dự án Ứng dụng hỗ trợ ra quyết định an toàn dành cho người di chuyển hoặc làm việc tại khu vực hẻo lánh, nơi tín hiệu viễn thông yếu hoặc mất kết nối. App vận hành theo định hướng “survival-first”, cho phép bản đồ và điều hướng hoạt động hoàn toàn offline, đồng thời hỗ trợ theo dõi vị trí thiết bị theo nhóm hoặc khu vực lân cận. Sản phẩm ưu tiên khả năng sử dụng nhanh, rõ ràng và ổn định trong điều kiện thực địa, hỗ trợ liên lạc, chia sẻ trạng thái và tiếp cận thông tin an toàn khi kết nối mạng không ổn định. Phạm vi công việc Thiết kế giao diện cho hơn 57 màn hình chính với khoảng 150-180 trạng thái UI khác nhau, bám sát các luồng trải nghiệm (user flows) từ onboarding, bản đồ và các tính năng thao tác hiện trường Xây dựng guideline giao diện thống nhất cho chế độ Day/Night nhằm đảm bảo khả năng sử dụng và tính nhất quán tổng thể Tối ưu trải nghiệm thao tác nhanh trên thiết bị di động, ưu tiên khả năng sử dụng trong điều kiện thực địa hoặc khi di chuyển Thiết kế icon, trạng thái và các thành phần trực quan phục vụ hiển thị dữ liệu, cảnh báo và kết nối hệ thống Đảm bảo thiết kế tuân thủ định hướng UX/UI và guideline tổng thể của dự án Phát triển 10 mockup độ phân giải cao (High-fidelity) phục vụ review và trình bày định hướng thiết kế Phối hợp với đội ngũ Flutter Developer trong quá trình triển khai và xử lý các giới hạn kỹ thuật ở từng giai đoạn phát triển Tham gia kiểm thử và đánh giá trải nghiệm người dùng để cải thiện độ rõ ràng và tính ổn định của thiết kế Thời gian & ngân sách Thời gian thực hiện chính: 02 tháng Tổng ngân sách: 25.000.000 VNĐ Bonus hoàn thành: 5-10.000.000 VNĐ nếu tiếp tục hỗ trợ maintain/UI support trong 04 tháng tiếp theo theo yêu cầu dự án Có bonus thêm nếu start trước 30/5 Gửi mail ứng tuyển về mail hr@slitigenz,io hoặc điền form: https://forms.gle/KLwyiJog9geDi2oeA', 1, 'FIXED', 24000000.00, 35000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('d2db249a-c268-5de3-a0ce-0fd190558a42', '2c2541b2-552f-525e-a2ca-c5dc58a1f8ab', 'Thiết kế giao diện cho trang web dạy tin học', 'Cần thuê người thiết kế giao diện cho website luyện thi HSG và luyện thi Tốt nghiệp môn Tin học. Phong cách trẻ trung, phù hợp với học sinh từ lớp 6 đến lớp 12, phù hợp với môi trường nhà trường và sư phạm, học trò. Màu sắc tươi sáng, hiện đại, hình ảnh thật không nhân tạo. Không khuyến khích làm việc với người không chuyên nghiệp. Nhắn tin mẫu và báo giá cho mình.', 1, 'FIXED', 2000000.00, 5000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('1203eb48-ebde-58b0-ad95-cab9a75ad680', 'c16977ce-975d-5382-8a06-173dd002028c', 'Cấu hình Chrome Headless chạy 3 Extension trên máy ảo, tối ưu hiệu năng', 'Tôi cần freelancer có kinh nghiệm Chrome, Chromium và Chrome Extension để cấu hình môi trường chạy trên máy ảo. Công việc cần thực hiện: - Cài đặt Chrome hoặc Chromium chạy chế độ Headless mới trên máy ảo Windows và Linux. - Cấu hình để chạy ổn định 3 Chrome Extension nội bộ. Mã nguồn và chi tiết extension sẽ cung cấp sau khi trao đổi. - Kiểm tra và sửa các lỗi tương thích khi extension chạy cùng Chrome Headless. - Tối ưu thời gian tải một website nghiệp vụ do tôi cung cấp, đồng thời đảm bảo hoạt động ổn định. - Test cùng một cấu hình trên Windows, Ubuntu và Debian. - Đo thời gian kết nối, thời gian phản hồi ban đầu, thời gian hiển thị nội dung, thời gian tải hoàn tất, mức sử dụng CPU và RAM. - Lập bảng so sánh kết quả giữa các hệ điều hành và cấu hình chạy. - Đề xuất hệ điều hành, phiên bản Chrome và cấu hình máy ảo phù hợp nhất dựa trên số liệu đo thực tế. - Viết script chạy, dừng và tự khởi động lại Chrome khi gặp lỗi. - Thiết lập log để theo dõi trạng thái và chẩn đoán lỗi. - Bàn giao mã nguồn đã chỉnh sửa, file cấu hình, script vận hành, báo cáo benchmark và tài liệu hướng dẫn. Yêu cầu freelancer: - Thành thạo Node.js, JavaScript và Chrome DevTools Protocol. - Biết Puppeteer hoặc Playwright để kiểm thử và benchmark là lợi thế. - Hiểu Manifest V3, service worker, quyền extension và cách load extension từ mã nguồn. - Có kinh nghiệm Windows Server, Linux hoặc máy ảo.', 1, 'FIXED', 7000000.00, 15000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('603218ff-7709-52c8-bb6b-78f101088087', 'af868273-3286-569c-9609-860f38c09caf', 'Senior TypeScript + AWS Engineer', 'AI platform that reads a trucking company''s quote and booking emails, sorts them, suggests the price and drafts the reply. Most code is written with Claude Code from prepared, step-by-step prompts (7 steps: skeleton, accounts and roles, business rules, Gmail connection, AI layer, screens, AWS). We need the human expert in the loop: you run or guide each step, review every pull request line by line, fix what the AI gets wrong, and merge only what you would sign your name under. You own the architecture, security and the Gmail integration. What you will do: Review and merge every pull request; keep tests green; push back on the plan when it is wrong. Build the Gmail integration: OAuth (Google Workspace Internal app first), watch + Pub/Sub + History API, idempotent processing, replies sent in the same thread, token storage in Secrets Manager. Make sure no incoming email is ever silently missed, and that we would know if one were. Keep the rule: we store extracted information, not full emails. Write short plain-English notes for a non-technical founder.', 1, 'HOURLY', 258000.00, 775000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('e14c443b-0feb-55ee-b106-eaffe25d49ce', '138b8d08-5032-57ee-8960-bf7058329bce', 'Mid-Level AWS Engineer for Bedrock', 'Abartys Health, an AWS Advanced Tier Services Partner based in San Juan, Puerto Rico, builds data, analytics, and generative AI platforms on AWS for health plans, laboratories, hospital systems, and nonprofits across the Americas. We are seeking a mid-level engineer to support client projects by building serverless backends, generative AI features on Amazon Bedrock, PostgreSQL data models on Aurora Serverless v2, and React front ends on AWS Amplify. You will also take over existing AWS builds, document them, and harden them before extending them. Projects are fixed-scope, 8 to 12 weeks, led by a senior architect, with human review built into every AI workflow. You will document your work and hand it over to client teams.', 1, 'HOURLY', 387000.00, 1033000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('4393731f-0464-5f65-aca8-025710aff5c5', '2980c0a1-fa22-581d-8045-19364ebd7a0a', 'AWS Rekognition Expert Needed to Solve Identical Twin Identity Collision', 'Summary ## Project Overview We have an existing, fully operational digital identity platform with working web and mobile applications, user registration, facial recognition, account creation, and identity verification. Our technology includes AWS Rekognition, AWS Face Liveness, Node.js, MongoDB, PostgreSQL, and AWS infrastructure. Everything is already developed and working. We are looking for a specialist to solve **one specific biometric identity collision problem** within our existing system. This is a development task, not a general consultation or research project. ## The Exact Problem Our system uses facial recognition to identify people and prevent duplicate identities. However, identical twins or individuals with extremely similar faces can be recognized as the same person. For example: 1. Person A is already registered with a unique identity. 2. Person B, who looks almost identical, attempts to register. 3. AWS Rekognition identifies Person B as Person A. 4. Person B reports, "This is not my account." 5. The system must determine whether this is genuinely a different individual or Person A attempting to create a second identity. 6. If they are different individuals, both must receive separate identities and securely access their own accounts. **The biggest challenge is proving that two different people exist without allowing one person to create multiple identities.** ## What Our Existing Developer Has Investigated Our developer has already performed a detailed technical investigation. We have identified the following challenges: - AWS Rekognition similarity scores may not reliably distinguish identical twins. - Increasing facial similarity thresholds can also reject legitimate users. - Capturing additional facial angles does not necessarily solve the problem. - AWS Face Liveness confirms a live presence but does not establish that two similar faces belong to different people. - Using personal PINs can help authenticate established collision identities, but it does not solve the initial problem of confirming two separate individuals. - Simply allowing users to report a collision and create another account introduces duplicate identity and impersonation risks. We have technical documentation and findings that can be shared with suitable candidates. ## Important Technical Restrictions Our solution **cannot depend on**: - National identity cards or government identity databases. - Passports or other external identity documents. - Fingerprint or iris recognition. - Additional biometric hardware or specialized devices. Some of our users may not have any identity documents. We want to work within our existing facial recognition technology, available software capabilities, and application infrastructure. Maximum automation is a major priority, but the solution must not compromise identity security. ## What You Need to Deliver We need you to develop and integrate a practical collision-resolution solution that: 1. Handles situations where two different individuals are recognized as the same person. 2. Provides a technically defensible method for establishing separate identities without enabling duplicate registrations. 3. Securely manages collision groups and account creation. 4. Allows future authentication using facial recognition together with personal PINs or other appropriate software-based credentials. 5. Protects existing accounts, certificates, and personal information. 6. Safely handles failed verification, interrupted sessions, repeated collision attempts, and cases where identity cannot be reliably established. 7. Integrates into our existing backend and application without rebuilding the platform. The solution must fail safely when the available evidence cannot establish a separate identity. Any unavoidable manual exception should be clearly defined and minimized. ## Working With Our Existing Developer Our existing backend developer knows the complete architecture and will coordinate with you throughout the work. He can explain the existing code, provide technical documentation, help with integration, and support testing. **Your primary responsibility will be the collision-resolution algorithm, its security logic, and the working implementation.** We are not looking for someone to take over the entire application. ## Who Should Apply Please apply only if you have strong experience in biometric identity verification, facial recognition algorithms, or similar identity collision problems. We are particularly interested in developers who have dealt with identical twins, biometric false matches, identity deduplication, or secure identity establishment. General experience integrating AWS Rekognition APIs is not sufficient. **We are looking for someone who understands this specific technical challenge and has a credible implementation approach.** We are not hiring someone simply to investigate the issue and prepare another report. The expected result is working code integrated into our existing project, with appropriate testing and documentation. Our existing developer will assist with the codebase and integration. ## Questions for Applicants Please answer these three questions: 1. Have you previously solved a similar biometric identity collision or duplicate identity problem? What approach did you use? 2. Given that we cannot use government IDs, identity documents, fingerprints, iris recognition, or additional hardware, how would you approach establishing that two individuals with nearly identical faces are genuinely different people? 3. Can you take responsibility for implementing the solution within our existing Node.js and AWS Rekognition system, working alongside our developer? **Please explain your actual proposed technical approach. Generic proposals, claims that AWS Rekognition alone can reliably distinguish identical twins, or applications offering only an assessment are not what we are looking for.**', 1, 'HOURLY', 646000.00, 1292000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('6519ce17-1fdf-5ec3-af0c-003b282d9c2a', 'd62dd7da-44e2-5c1c-a6c5-b71a1accfc60', 'AWS Setup Screen Share Help', 'Need someone available for a one-hour session to help me set up AWS through a screen share. I’m looking for clear guidance and hands-on support to get the setup completed efficiently. Please be comfortable explaining steps as we work through the process together.', 1, 'HOURLY', 258000.00, 517000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('9253b012-166e-5da2-a4ab-965b248cb2b1', '95fd3301-a3e1-5fa4-9751-0c7bc114ec71', 'USEST/ 2 to 5 work: Helm charts, Githubactins, argocd , eks', 'US EST 2to 5 Deploying applicaitn using Argocd. Proficientcy with hlem Proficiency with terrafom Proficiency with kubernetes Deploy helm charts , update helm charts through helm and Git hub actions. Write wrokflows and actions through github actions.', 1, 'HOURLY', 336000.00, 413000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('f96c3d57-9213-527e-9112-121114345f72', 'e5fe6c88-c9a3-553b-a131-80c5a17605cd', 'Lead Developer: SharePoint Online and AI Search (SPFx, Python Azure Functions, Microsoft Graph)', 'We’re Tribe Gen AI, an Australian consultancy that builds AI tools for businesses. We’re building a staff intranet on SharePoint Online for an Australian client, with an AI search that answers questions from approved SharePoint documents, with source links, using only the documents each person can open. You’ll own the build. Our engineering manager sets the architecture and reviews your work. What you’ll build - AI search backend: Python 3.12 Azure Functions calling Microsoft Graph on behalf of the signed-in user. Word and PDF extraction, chunking and caching. Answers through the Anthropic API (Claude), with citations, refusals and “no answer” handling. - Evaluation: a test set against agreed launch questions, then tuning of retrieval and prompts. - Logging and reporting: question logging with redaction, Application Insights dashboards and a monthly usage report. - Intranet: a SharePoint communication site with a Brand Center theme, home page and department pages, plus leadership news, Power BI embeds and people search. - Permissions reports: PnP PowerShell or Graph, to find overshared libraries before go-live. - Search interface: an SPFx web part in React and TypeScript, with answers, source links and feedback buttons. - Launch: deployment through the client’s IT provider, security review support, pilot fixes and guides for content owners. Must have - At least one LLM feature shipped on real documents (RAG or similar), with citations and an evaluation approach - Production Python, ideally Azure Functions = Microsoft Graph and Entra auth: app registrations, delegated permissions, on-behalf-of flow - SharePoint Online: communication sites, theming, news, audiences, permissions - SPFx in React and TypeScript - Experience working in a client’s tenant through their IT provider Nice to have - The Anthropic API - Application Insights / KQL - Power BI in SharePoint - Accessibility checks How we work - 20 to 40 hours a week, close to full time through most of November, lighter in December - At least 4 hours a day of overlap with Sydney time (AEDT) - Clear written English and short, regular updates. A short weekly check-in with our team. - Please quote your hourly rate in your proposal. - This role is for one individual contractor working under their own Upwork profile. We’re not able to accept agency teams.', 1, 'HOURLY', 517000.00, 904000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('617f010b-7646-5c59-964a-5eb546b82860', '070544e3-8e82-5a75-9687-ec9275ddad00', 'AI Product Engineer & DevOps', 'Chúng tôi đang tìm kiếm AI Product Engineer & DevOps có kinh nghiệm phát triển sản phẩm AI trên nền tảng Cloud. Bạn sẽ tham gia xây dựng và tích hợp các tính năng AI vào sản phẩm, phát triển API, triển khai hạ tầng Kubernetes, tự động hóa CI/CD và tối ưu vận hành hệ thống. Vị trí phù hợp với ứng viên có tư duy AI-first, yêu thích xây dựng sản phẩm và chủ động ứng dụng AI để nâng cao năng suất làm việc. Yêu cầu Từ 3+ năm kinh nghiệm phát triển sản phẩm. Thành thạo Python hoặc TypeScript/Node.js. Có kinh nghiệm xây dựng RESTful API, Webhook, WebSocket hoặc gRPC. Thành thạo Kubernetes, Terraform/Pulumi, CI/CD (GitHub Actions, Jenkins hoặc ArgoCD) và ít nhất một nền tảng AWS/Azure/GCP. Có kinh nghiệm với LangChain, LlamaIndex, Dify, LiteLLM, RAG, Vector Database hoặc các AI Framework như CrewAI, AutoGen, Semantic Kernel, Haystack là lợi thế. Chủ động sử dụng các công cụ AI Coding như Cursor, GitHub Copilot, Claude để nâng cao hiệu suất phát triển. Tham gia phát triển AI SaaS/Enterprise Product.', 1, 'FIXED', 36000000.00, 38000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('a125d9a4-173d-56b5-8a4b-1647b85aaea7', '24d2897f-d7f4-5fdd-8b67-821f3411b9d6', 'Cần đăng ký hoặc tìm tài khoản AWS SES mở sandbox', 'Xin chào, mình cần đăng ký AWS, kích hoạt SES, có thể hợp tác lâu dài. Chi tiết công việc xin vui lòng liên hệ. Cảm ơn.', 1, 'FIXED', 1000000.00, 7000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('ac681553-a400-5ce6-9b08-7959dc5079d5', '4196b2a3-33be-5728-9487-3edb21db89d1', 'Get Google Ads API Explorer access approved for my Google Cloud project', 'My Google Cloud project is stuck at Test access for the Google Ads API. Every Explorer application is rejected automatically within seconds ("does not meet the eligibility criteria"). I''ve tried two projects and two Google accounts. Already done: API enabled, OAuth consent screen published, Web client created, privacy and terms pages online, paid billing linked (not free trial). It''s for an internal tool that manages my own Google Ads accounts only. I need someone who got Explorer or Basic approved recently (after the Sept 2026 changes) to find the cause and guide me over screen share until a real API call works. No passwords shared.', 1, 'FIXED', 775000.00, 775000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('6ab3f3c1-82fa-552c-bf1f-9595a138429d', 'e05c2e2f-6574-51d0-bd54-e6be731b02ed', 'Oracle Cloud to GoDaddy VPS Migration – Full Server, Websites, Applications & Storage', 'I am looking for an experienced Linux Server Administrator / DevOps Engineer to migrate my existing production server environment from Oracle Cloud Infrastructure (OCI) to a GoDaddy VPS. My current Oracle server hosts: 1 backend 1 frontend website 4 applications Associated databases, storage buckets, files, configurations, and supporting services The objective is to move the complete working environment to the new GoDaddy VPS while preserving the existing architecture, configurations, functionality, and integrations. This is a production environment, so the migration must be handled carefully, with proper backups, testing, minimal downtime, and a rollback plan. Scope of Work 1. Audit the Existing Oracle Server Before starting the migration, review the current server and identify all components that need to be transferred, including: Operating system and installed packages Apache2 configuration, virtual hosts, and reverse proxy rules PHP, Laravel, Node.js, and other runtimes or services currently in use Frontend and backend deployment configurations All four applications and their dependencies Databases, users, permissions, and connection settings Storage buckets, uploaded files, media, and associated storage integrations SSL certificates, HTTPS configurations, domains, and subdomains Environment variables and application configuration files PM2 processes, background workers, queues, cron jobs, and scheduled tasks, where applicable Firewall rules, open ports, SSH configuration, and other relevant security settings Any additional services, scripts, or dependencies required for the applications to operate correctly The freelancer must identify dependencies and existing configurations before making changes. 2. Prepare and Configure the GoDaddy VPS Set up the destination server to support the existing environment, including: Installing and configuring the required operating system packages and software versions Configuring Apache2, virtual hosts, reverse proxies, and application routing Installing compatible PHP, Node.js, database software, and other required dependencies Configuring application processes and services to start automatically after a reboot Setting up appropriate file ownership, permissions, firewall rules, and SSH security Configuring SSL certificates and HTTPS Recreating the necessary server-level settings and application integrations The goal is to reproduce the current working environment on the new server without unnecessary architectural changes. 3. Migrate All Applications, Databases, Files & Storage Transfer and configure all required resources, including: The backend and frontend website All four applications and their associated server-side components Complete databases, including data, schemas, users, permissions, and relevant settings All required uploaded files, media, and storage assets Storage buckets and their contents, permissions, access policies, and application connections, where applicable Application environment files and service configurations All relevant integrations, scheduled jobs, and background processes If any storage bucket or other resource is hosted outside the Oracle server, the freelancer must identify its location and determine how to preserve or migrate it correctly. Important: Copying the website files alone is not sufficient. The entire application environment and its dependencies must be accounted for. 4. Testing and Verification Before completing the project, thoroughly test the new environment to confirm that: The backend and frontend are operational. All four applications and their server-side integrations work correctly. Database connections and existing data are intact. Uploaded files and media load correctly. Storage buckets and application access permissions work as expected. APIs, domain routing, SSL certificates, and HTTPS work correctly. Background workers, scheduled jobs, and application processes operate correctly. No critical errors appear in application or server logs. The applications continue running after a server restart. 5. DNS Cutover and Final Migration Once the destination server has passed testing: Coordinate the DNS changes required to point the relevant domains and subdomains to GoDaddy. Minimize service interruption during the final cutover. Perform a final data synchronization where necessary to avoid losing changes made during migration. Monitor the applications after the switch. Keep the original Oracle environment available until the new server has been verified and accepted. I do not want the old environment shut down before the new environment is confirmed to be working correctly. 6. Documentation and Handover At completion, provide: A summary of the migrated services and configurations A list of software versions and running services Details of any configuration differences or outstanding issues Instructions for restarting services and performing basic server maintenance Confirmation that backups and a rollback procedure are available A short handover explaining how the migrated environment is organized Required Experience Please apply only if you have demonstrable experience with: Oracle Cloud Infrastructure to VPS or cloud-server migrations GoDaddy VPS or equivalent Linux VPS administration Linux server administration and troubleshooting Apache2, virtual hosts, reverse proxies, and SSL PHP/Laravel and Node.js applications, where applicable MySQL/MariaDB or the database technology used in the existing environment Server-side application deployments and process management Cloud object storage, buckets, permissions, and file migrations Production server security, backups, DNS, and troubleshooting Experience migrating multiple applications running on a shared production server is strongly preferred. Deliverables and Acceptance Criteria The project will be considered complete when: All agreed websites, backend services, and four applications are migrated. Required databases, files, storage assets, and integrations are working. Apache and other necessary services are configured correctly. Domains, HTTPS, APIs, and application routing work as expected. All agreed functionality passes testing on the GoDaddy VPS. The freelancer provides the migration documentation and handover. The old Oracle environment can be retired only after my final approval. Before Applying Please answer the following questions in your proposal: Have you previously migrated a production server from Oracle Cloud to another VPS provider? Please describe a similar project. How would you audit the existing server to identify all applications, dependencies, configurations, databases, and storage resources before migration? How would you minimize downtime and prevent data loss during the final migration? What information would you need from me to estimate the work accurately? What is your proposed timeline and fixed-price estimate after reviewing the scope? I can provide the necessary server access and technical information to the selected freelancer through a secure process. Please note: This project is for infrastructure migration and configuration, not application redevelopment. Any proposed changes to the existing architecture must be discussed and approved before implementation. I am looking for a reliable, security-conscious professional who can take ownership of the migration and deliver a stable, fully tested environment.', 1, 'FIXED', 3875000.00, 3875000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('56438a04-9854-5f27-8c6e-acd8229b1811', 'a62651e4-bac2-5aec-9509-e2977de29477', 'ProCall Hub Deployment', 'Title: Deploy a Node.js 22 business app to a cloud VPS (Docker, Caddy, HTTPS, backups, monitoring) Estimated hours: 22-30 Description We''re a new home-services call center (experienced team) launching our internal business app in the next 30 days. The app is already built and runs locally. We need an experienced DevOps or Node.js engineer to put it on a production cloud server, make sure everything works, and hand us a simple runbook. About the app • Node.js 22, plain JavaScript, no npm packages; built-in http server with a small router • Data in one JSON file on disk (data/db.json); uploads in a data folder • Docker image (node:22-alpine) and docker-compose.yml with Caddy for HTTPS are included; also runs as a Linux service behind Caddy • Health check at /healthz; settings through environment variables • Code in a private GitHub repository (access given after hire and NDA) Scope 1. Help us choose and set up the hosting account (US East VPS with a permanent disk, snapshots and Docker; we''ll pay the host directly). 2. Harden the server: SSH keys only, firewall (80, 443 only), automatic security updates, non-root user. 3. Deploy production with docker-compose and Caddy; point myserviceprocall.com and set up HTTPS. 4. Set up a smaller staging copy on its own subdomain. 5. Persistent /data volume; daily server snapshots plus a nightly off-server copy of the data folder; run one test restore. 6. Uptime monitoring with text/email alerts, log rotation, and a simple status page. 7. A deploy script or GitHub Actions workflow: push to deploy to staging, one command to promote to production, one-step rollback. 8. Test the app end to end with us: sign-in, main screens, email sending (SMTP), file uploads, restart survival. 9. A short runbook: how to deploy, roll back, restore, rotate secrets and check health. Out of scope for this job (possible follow-on work): moving the data to PostgreSQL, file storage in the cloud, a background worker, new features and integrations. Deliverables: a working production and staging site over HTTPS, backups with one tested restore, monitoring, the deploy workflow, the runbook, and all accounts and keys handed over to us. Required skills: Linux server administration, Docker and docker-compose, Caddy or Nginx, DNS and SSL, Node.js, GitHub Actions, backups and monitoring. Nice to have: PostgreSQL, S3-compatible storage, experience with CRMs, call centers or field-service software. Timeline: start this week; finish within 7–10 days. Screening questions 1. Describe a Node.js app you deployed to a VPS with Docker. Which host, and how did you handle backups? 2. How would you keep the JSON data file safe across deploys and restarts? 3. Which host would you recommend for us, and why? 4. How many hours do you estimate, and what''s your fixed price for the scope above? 5. Are you available for follow-on work (a database migration and feature releases) over the next 3 months? The NDA and an agreement assigning all work product to Service ProCall are signed before code access.', 1, 'FIXED', 38748000.00, 38748000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('ad9134ad-3b09-5581-aebf-2a472c5bf578', 'eb4c92de-ce9f-5aff-91cf-0dcd92503825', 'Deploy FastAPI project lên VPS Almalinux', 'Tôi cần deploy fastapi lên vps đang chạy almalinux. Fastapi chạy docker, redis và kết nối mysql ngoài. - Cấu hình và triển khai ứng dụng FastAPI chạy bằng Docker / Docker Compose trên VPS AlmaLinux - Thiết lập container Redis phục vụ cache / queue cho ứng dụng - Cấu hình kết nối FastAPI tới MySQL server bên ngoài (qua IP/domain, port, user/password có sẵn) - Thiết lập các biến môi trường (ENV) phù hợp cho môi trường production *Ưu tiên thêm nếu có: Đã từng triển khai trên AlmaLinux / CentOS / Rocky Linux Có thể bàn giao kèm hướng dẫn deploy lại khi cần', 1, 'FIXED', 200000.00, 200000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('b32505f1-fc06-59c9-8a3f-8bb92c54899e', '27c22e95-c4af-5937-9bd0-0d9c702432df', 'TUYỂN FREELANCER FULLSTACK DEVELOPER — DỰ ÁN SaaS AI HOSTING', 'Mô tả dự án: Build nền tảng SaaS cho phép người dùng deploy ứng dụng AI automation (n8n, AI agents) lên cloud chỉ với 1 click — tương tự opencloud.com.vn. Có dashboard quản lý, hệ thống billing credit, quản lý instance Docker. Yêu cầu kỹ thuật: • Next.js / React (frontend) • Node.js hoặc Python (backend/API) • Docker, Coolify hoặc kinh nghiệm container • Supabase hoặc PostgreSQL • Tích hợp thanh toán (Stripe / SePay / VNPay) Bạn sẽ làm gì: • Build dashboard: auth, quản lý instance, billing • Tích hợp Coolify API để tự động tạo/xóa/start/stop container • Hệ thống credit: nạp tiền, trừ tự động theo giờ • Subdomain tự động cho từng khách hàng Ngân sách: Thỏa thuận (ưu tiên báo giá trọn gói theo milestone) ⏱ Thời gian: Part-time hoặc full-time đều được Remote 100% Liên hệ qua inbox hoặc comment SĐT/Zalo để trao đổi thêm!', 1, 'FIXED', 2000000.00, 10000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('50c39b30-d1fa-522c-9e5d-b9133eb86c4c', 'e403553e-b637-562c-8a9d-515f0449ab88', 'đưa web lên vps', 'Tôi dùng AI để code web xong, cần đưa code web lên vps', 1, 'FIXED', 500000.00, 1000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('d848b427-5f5b-5244-a716-cc7009180ea6', '06e27b80-0fff-5af8-b1cc-8278390d3c76', 'FREELANCER TECH OPS / WEB DEPLOYMENT & AUTOMATION SPECIALIST', 'Deploy Landing Page: Cấu hình domain (tên miền), trỏ DNS, thiết lập SSL để Landing Page hoạt động ổn định và bảo mật. Tích hợp SePay: Cấu hình cổng thanh toán tự động qua QR Code/Chuyển khoản ngân hàng bằng SePay lên trang thanh toán. Thiết lập luồng Checkout: Đảm bảo trải nghiệm mua hàng mượt mà (Khách bấm mua -> Điền thông tin -> Hiện QR Code SePay -> Quét mã -> Hệ thống nhận tiền thành công). Tự động hóa (Automation): Thiết lập các cổng kết nối (Webhook/Zapier/Make/LadiFlow...) để tự động hóa các tác vụ sau thanh toán: Bắn data đơn hàng về Google Sheets/CRM. Gửi email/ZNS xác nhận đơn hàng + gửi sản phẩm tự động cho khách ngay khi SePay báo check thành công. Testing: Test toàn bộ luồng (End-to-End) để đảm bảo không lỗi, không sót đơn trước khi bàn giao. Fix lỗi/tối ưu hoá các trang landing page cũ. **** Yêu cầu công việc Có kinh nghiệm deploy Landing Page (LadiPage, WordPress, Webflow, hoặc HTML/CSS code tay...). Đã từng làm việc với SePay (hoặc các bên tương tự như Casso, PayOS) và hiểu cơ chế hoạt động của Webhook. Thành thạo các công cụ tự động hóa cơ bản: Zapier, Make (Integromat), LadiFlow hoặc có khả năng cấu hình Webhook cơ bản. Tư duy logic tốt, cẩn thận (vì liên quan đến tiền tệ và data khách hàng). Làm việc đúng deadline, chủ động report tiến độ.', 1, 'FIXED', 500000.00, 1000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('e6eda578-f6bd-5711-a77d-7d6d8c769066', 'ed338b1f-c84b-540d-90ad-324dc0169221', 'Senior Engineer, Long-Term Engagement · Remote', 'We''re looking for a senior engineer who is exceptional at client communication. Your responsibility is to attend meetings with clients - covering discovery sessions, technical discussions, requirement clarification, and project follow-ups. You won''t be writing code. Requirements - At least 5 years of software engineering or technical consulting experience - Fluent, professional English - Availability during US business hours; US residency required - Strong timezone overlap and communication quality are what matter Who This Is For The right person for this role is likely a former engineering lead, solutions engineer, or senior developer who finds the client-facing side of the work more interesting than the execution side. We''re not looking for someone between projects. This is a long-term engagement. Compensation - Expected monthly earnings: $3,000 ~ $5,000 - Time commitment: under 20 hours per month - Compensation scales with the engagements you support - as the client portfolio grows, so does your earning potential This structure rewards someone who is genuinely invested in the success of the work, not just logging hours. To apply, include a brief note about your background in client-facing technical work and why this kind of role appeals to you.', 1, 'HOURLY', 1937000.00, 2325000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('ae635bdd-d041-554e-960d-e08bd3e938e1', '370a65ec-35ed-58f2-94ad-095e7dd467fd', 'CTO role', 'Looking to bring on a fractional CTO for a two sided market place/app with 4 revenue streams to start, in order to have the full team in place for our expected launch approaching soon.', 1, 'HOURLY', 1937000.00, 5166000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('b0806b5d-4244-5596-adcb-83b0eac7b08d', 'e6bb2f2b-4acf-5263-80b2-a439d4381bc2', 'Deploy a small Node.js app to Render from GitHub', 'Title: Deploy a small Node.js app to Render from GitHub (fix Dockerfile path, custom domain). Quick job, 3–5 hours Description I have a finished Node.js 22 web app (no npm packages) with a Dockerfile in server/deploy/ and a render.yaml blueprint. Render’s Blueprint deploy fails because it can’t find the Dockerfile. I need someone to get it live and working on Render. Scope Get the code into my private GitHub repository (I’ll add you as a collaborator). Fix the Dockerfile path and build context in render.yaml so the Render Blueprint deploys. Confirm the settings: persistent disk at /var/data, environment variables, health check /healthz. Connect my domain procallhub.app (DNS records and HTTPS). Test with me: sign-in, data survives a restart, a test email sends. Send a short note on what you changed and how I deploy updates. Budget: fixed price, $150–250. Most of the work is fixing one config file and checking settings. Timeline: within 2 days of hire. Requirements: experience with Render (or a similar platform such as Railway or Heroku), Docker and GitHub. You’ll sign a short NDA before access. I’ll invite you to GitHub and Render as a member; I won’t share my passwords.', 1, 'FIXED', 6458000.00, 6458000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('5e6820e8-e489-527a-9c1b-a80e2969fa19', '17978fd5-2dc4-599a-b5f7-f6b68eafee73', 'HỖ TRỢ CÀI ĐẶT WEB', 'Minh dân không chuyên, đã thiết kế nội dung web, có tên miền, có hosting nhưng chưa biết thiết lập. Nhờ người hỗ trợ online (công việc chắc tầm 10 phút đối với người biết)', 1, 'FIXED', 200000.00, 400000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('88eeea65-80ec-5b46-a1d2-4069972b502c', 'b654507d-a4f7-5b22-b43d-390995121428', 'Tuyển người có thể lấy được fcm_tokens cho app', 'Mình cần 1 bạn có thể giúp mình lấy được fcm_tokens để gửi thông báo đẩy cho app Mình dùng flutterflow , firebase', 1, 'FIXED', 500000.00, 500000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00');

