VALUES
    ('29265490-ad22-5f54-8772-930dea87f1f4', '8b911e37-2abc-59d5-99cb-eef5a8a9a0f1', 'To intigrate ERP with tds and gst api', 'I have ERP from where i want to intigrate it from tax reconilsation (GST and TDS) and system shoud able to file it from our AI or can suggest any other method', 1, 'FIXED', 12916000.00, 12916000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('e2eb031c-be10-55cf-a366-ffd17304009c', '14f03563-83fa-51e8-a22b-c7a4f4e1c69d', 'Senior SAP PI/PO Developer', 'Job Summary We are looking for a Senior SAP PI/PO Consultant with strong hands-on technical expertise in managing integration workflows, executing system upgrades, and ensuring system stability and performance within an SAP RISE-hosted environment. Experience: 10+ Years Key Responsibilities Lead and execute SAP PO system upgrades within the SAP RISE environment. Manage Transport Requests (TRs) across DEV, QA, and PROD landscapes. Monitor background jobs, system logs, message queues, and interfaces to maintain agreed system availability targets. Optimise system performance, manage high-volume processing, and proactively address performance bottlenecks. Troubleshoot integration failures and handle critical production incidents through root-cause analysis and resolution. Collaborate with SAP BASIS, functional teams, and business stakeholders to ensure smooth operations and timely issue resolution. Key Requirements 10+ years of hands-on SAP PI/PO technical and consulting experience. Proven experience with SAP RISE-hosted environments and SAP PO upgrade projects. Strong expertise in SAP PO adapters, message monitoring, NetWeaver Administrator (NWA), and transport management tools. Experience in production support, performance optimisation, and critical incident management. Excellent analytical, communication, and stakeholder-management skills', 1, 'FIXED', 7750000.00, 7750000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('8399aedc-2c4e-54c1-a1e7-de3cdaca513a', '14f03563-83fa-51e8-a22b-c7a4f4e1c69d', 'Senior SAP PI/PO Consultant', 'The initial engagement will be for a minimum of 3 months, with the possibility of extension based on business requirements. The budget will depend on the candidate’s proficiency and experience, and we can discuss and finalize it once the right resource is identified. Job Summary We are looking for a Senior SAP PI/PO Consultant with strong hands-on technical expertise in managing integration workflows, executing system upgrades, and ensuring system stability and performance within an SAP RISE-hosted environment. Experience: 10+ Years Key Responsibilities Lead and execute SAP PO system upgrades within the SAP RISE environment. Manage Transport Requests (TRs) across DEV, QA, and PROD landscapes. Monitor background jobs, system logs, message queues, and interfaces to maintain agreed system availability targets. Optimise system performance, manage high-volume processing, and proactively address performance bottlenecks. Troubleshoot integration failures and handle critical production incidents through root-cause analysis and resolution. Collaborate with SAP BASIS, functional teams, and business stakeholders to ensure smooth operations and timely issue resolution. Key Requirements 10+ years of hands-on SAP PI/PO technical and consulting experience. Proven experience with SAP RISE-hosted environments and SAP PO upgrade projects. Strong expertise in SAP PO adapters, message monitoring, NetWeaver Administrator (NWA), and transport management tools. Experience in production support, performance optimisation, and critical incident management. Excellent analytical, communication, and stakeholder-management skills', 1, 'FIXED', 10333000.00, 10333000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('7207306b-6eef-50a3-9bb8-26d79ce377f3', '0b8f7f90-4270-5eb6-b9b7-4408dcef2d2c', 'Senior Fullstack Developer - MedusaJS & Next.js & AWS - SaaS/ERP Ecosystem', 'Tiêu đề: Tuyển Senior Fullstack Developer (MedusaJS/Next.js) - Hệ sinh thái SaaS & ERP Mô tả dự án Tổng quan dự án: Chúng tôi là Swork, một nền tảng SaaS và Thương mại điện tử đang phát triển mạnh trong lĩnh vực bảo hộ lao động. Chúng tôi đang tìm kiếm một chuyên gia hoặc một nhóm nhỏ lập trình viên Senior để tiếp quản hệ thống, tối ưu hóa cốt lõi và xây dựng hệ thống ERP nội bộ. Stack kỹ thuật hiện tại: Backend: MedusaJS / Node.js. Frontend: Next.js / TypeScript / Tailwind CSS. Database: PostgreSQL (Cần tái cấu trúc và tối ưu hóa dữ liệu). Infrastructure: AWS (Đang chuyển hướng sang Serverless). Nhiệm vụ của bạn: Giai đoạn 1 (Ưu tiên): Tái cấu trúc (refactoring) sâu và ổn định hóa cơ sở dữ liệu PostgreSQL cũng như lõi MedusaJS. Giai đoạn 2: Phát triển hệ thống ERP nội bộ kết nối trực tiếp với Medusa API. Giai đoạn 3: Mở rộng Storefront SaaS và chuyển đổi hoàn toàn sang kiến trúc AWS Serverless. Yêu cầu kỹ năng: Có kinh nghiệm thực chiến với MedusaJS và kiến trúc Headless E-commerce. Thành thạo TypeScript và Node.js. Chuyên gia về PostgreSQL (có khả năng xử lý các đợt di cư dữ liệu phức tạp). Có kinh nghiệm sử dụng các sản phẩm AWS (Lambda, S3, RDS). Ưu tiên các ứng viên đã từng xây dựng logic nghiệp vụ cho ERP hoặc SaaS. Quyền lợi & Điều kiện: Hình thức làm việc: 100% Remote. Ngân sách: Mức lương cạnh tranh theo năng lực ($2,500 - $4,500/tháng). Hợp tác dài hạn: Chúng tôi tìm kiếm một đối tác kỹ thuật đồng hành lâu dài, không phải làm dự án một lần. Cách thức ứng tuyển: Vui lòng gửi Portfolio, profile GitHub và mô tả ngắn gọn kinh nghiệm của bạn với MedusaJS hoặc các kiến trúc hệ thống phức tạp tương tự.', 1, 'FIXED', 13000000.00, 39500000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('d8488282-badc-5c5a-8e3e-8e6e0935a5f6', '84c7e63d-4699-5d40-abef-de5e589af665', 'Triển khai phần mềm trên nền tảng ERPNEXT', 'Cần 2 bạn triển khai phần mềm theo yêu cầu trên nền tảng erpnext - larvel. 09Yêu cầu am hiểu về api erpnext, doctype erpnext, 81nắm được code python, nắm được 185code php laravel. 620Ưu tiên các bạn tại Hà Nội, Ưu tiên đã từng làm erpnext, oodoo,', 1, 'FIXED', 3000000.00, 5000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('b406c9de-3f0a-5891-a8fc-c8a21e4b4a93', '64cae3e9-1a7d-598c-b67c-1911ff3fe149', 'Tuyển SAP Basis Administrator', 'Job Title SAP Basis Administrator Location Ha Noi Employment Type Full-time Experience 3–8+ years (or as required) Job Summary We are seeking a skilled SAP Basis Administrator to manage, maintain, and support SAP landscapes, ensuring high availability, optimal performance, and system security. The ideal candidate will have hands-on experience in SAP system administration, installations, upgrades, patching, monitoring, and troubleshooting across multiple SAP environments. Key Responsibilities Install, configure, and maintain SAP systems Perform SAP kernel upgrades, support package implementations, and system refreshes. Administer SAP NetWeaver Application Servers and SAP HANA databases (basic administration). Monitor system performance and proactively resolve issues. Perform SAP client administration, including client copies and client exports/imports. Execute system start/stop procedures and perform health checks. Manage user administration in coordination with security teams. Configure and monitor background jobs, spool management, and batch processing. Perform backup validation and support disaster recovery activities. Monitor SAP logs, dumps, update records, and system alerts. Support SAP upgrades, migrations, and implementation projects. Troubleshoot SAP Basis-related incidents and provide root cause analysis. Collaborate with functional, technical, infrastructure, and database teams to ensure system stability. Maintain technical documentation, standard operating procedures, and system architecture documentation. Ensure compliance with organizational security and audit requirements. Required Skills Strong knowledge of SAP Basis administration. Experience with SAP NetWeaver architecture. Hands-on experience with SAP HANA administration (basic to intermediate). Knowledge of Linux/Unix and Windows operating systems. Experience with Oracle, HANA, SQL Server, or DB2 databases. Experience with SAP kernel upgrades and Support Package Stack implementation. Knowledge of SAP Solution Manager and monitoring tools. Strong troubleshooting and performance tuning skills. Familiarity with high availability (HA) and disaster recovery concepts. Knowledge of SAP system monitoring and log analysis. Good understanding of SAP security concepts and authorization administration. Strong analytical, communication, and problem-solving skills. Preferred Skills Experience with SAP S/4HANA migrations. Exposure to SAP Cloud solutions (SAP BTP, RISE with SAP). Experience with automation and scripting (Shell, Python, PowerShell). Knowledge of SAP Fiori administration. Familiarity with SAP Cloud ALM. Understanding of virtualization technologies and cloud platforms such as AWS, Azure, or Google Cloud. Qualifications Bachelor''s degree in Computer Science, Information Technology, or a related field. SAP Basis certification is preferred. Relevant SAP certifications in SAP HANA or SAP Technology are an advantage. Key Competencies Problem-solving and analytical thinking Team collaboration Customer-focused mindset Time management Communication skills Attention to detail Ability to work under pressure and manage multiple priorities Nice to Have Experience in SAP implementation, upgrade, or migration projects. Experience supporting 24×7 production environments. ITIL knowledge or certification. Exposure to DevOps or automation tools. Experience working in global support teams.', 1, 'FIXED', 30000000.00, 50000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('2f670a11-b5de-509e-b283-22011b0af9d2', 'caf05f7c-1f32-5ee5-bb19-7d7ef0c2fcda', 'Thuê Apple Enterprise Certificate', 'Cần thuê Apple Enterprise Certificate của Apple vui lòng liên hệ. Zalo [được ẩn bởi vlance]', 1, 'FIXED', 200000.00, 40000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('ae852c62-3623-534a-a53b-3d7bfd6f33b2', 'cf200f31-f5ee-5027-89b0-5671f7946746', 'Microsoft Access / VBA & Modernization Consultants — Construction Application Rebuild (Contract)', 'Title: Microsoft Access / VBA & Modernization Consultants — Construction Application Rebuild (Contract) About us Help4Access is a Microsoft Solutions Partner specializing in Microsoft Access and related legacy Microsoft systems. Our engagements are led by an experienced enterprise architect. We are assembling a small team of vetted contractors for a mid-sized construction / specialty-contractor client and similar upcoming projects. The project A mission-critical, internally built MS Access/VBA application used to manage construction jobs, forecast job costs and support financial reviews. Phase 1 is a paid discovery: review the application and workflows, recover undocumented logic, define requirements with field and office teams, and recommend a rebuild approach. Phase 2 (if awarded) is the rebuild and testing
INSERT INTO job (id, project_id, title, description, quantity, salary_type, budget_min, budget_max, status, created_at, updated_at)
VALUES
    ('6495565d-8458-55fe-b57a-4102ef80864f', 'b52f8407-7130-51f2-bc90-61083122fc25', 'Full Stack Audit and Overhaul', 'We need a full-stack developer to audit and overhaul an existing web and mobile-first app, with a focus on improving performance, usability, and overall quality. The work includes reviewing the current codebase, identifying issues, and implementing updates to enhance the user experience. You will also help refine the UI/UX and prepare the app for deployment to Google and iOS stores. The ideal freelancer can balance technical improvements with practical design enhancements to create a polished, reliable product.', 1, 'HOURLY', 387000.00, 904000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('0f99f6d8-998c-53a2-9ab2-7427652c3f60', '9f98f5b2-6a55-5173-b014-498e17391a55', 'Full-Stack Developer Needed to Build a Custom Learning Management System', 'I''m looking for an experienced full-stack developer to build a modern, responsive Learning Management System (LMS). The platform should support three primary roles: Admin, Instructor, and Student. **Key Features:** - Secure authentication and role-based access. - Course creation, editing, and publishing. - Course sections, video lessons, and downloadable resources. - Student enrollment and learning progress tracking. - Quizzes, assessments, and automatic grading. - Certificate generation and verification. - Admin dashboard for managing users, courses, and platform analytics. - Instructor dashboard for managing courses and monitoring student performance. - Responsive design for desktop, tablet, and mobile. **Preferred Tech Stack:** Next.js, React, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, Node.js, PostgreSQL, and Prisma. I''m looking for a developer who can deliver a fully functional application with clean code, secure backend logic, and a polished user experience—not just static UI screens. The project will be divided into five milestones, covering the foundation, course management, student learning, assessments and certificates, and final testing and deployment. Please share relevant portfolio projects, your proposed approach, estimated timeline, and budget when applying.', 1, 'FIXED', 258320000.00, 258320000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('cd1277a3-4696-5acc-8aec-94054a25531b', 'b88226ef-6fc3-5e8a-aa6c-70d6088a1067', 'Homepage Design for AI SaaS Company', 'We’re Floatbot.AI, a B2B SaaS company building AI agents for regulated industries. Our AI agents handle claims (FNOL), policy servicing, and customer conversations for insurers, MGAs, and contact centers, and integrate with platforms like Guidewire. We’re looking for a talented web designer to create a modern homepage layout that reflects the latest AI design trends. This is a paid trial project. If we love your work, we’ll engage you for the full website redesign in the next phase, with a larger budget. What we need • A homepage design (desktop, mobile version is a plus) in Figma or a similar tool • A modern, clean, AI-forward look: think leading AI and SaaS brands, with bold typography, smart use of whitespace, and subtle motion or interactive ideas • Sections such as: hero with a clear value proposition, AI agents/products, industries we serve, integrations (Guidewire, NICE CXone, Genesys, etc.), customer results and stats, and a call to action to book a demo (you can take from current website). • A design that builds trust with enterprise buyers in insurance and financial services, not just a flashy tech look Brand details • Primary brand color: #F46177 (coral pink), with light, airy backgrounds • We have existing AI agent characters (LISA and ADDI) that can be featured in the design • Logo and brand assets will be shared with the selected freelancer What we’re looking for in you • A strong portfolio of SaaS, AI, or B2B tech websites • An eye for current design trends and conversion-focused layouts • Clear communication and the ability to take feedback To apply, please share Links to 2–3 website designs you’re most proud of (AI or SaaS preferred) One AI or tech website you admire and why Your estimated turnaround time for the homepage We’re excited to find a long-term design partner for the full website. Looking forward to seeing your work!', 1, 'FIXED', 1292000.00, 1292000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('7dbf9d32-5056-5a7d-b87c-c03fd32542b6', '2d7bc313-8c41-591d-9716-31510c21cea3', 'Web Application Connectivity Testing in China', 'We are looking for someone physically located in mainland China to test our web application and verify that it works correctly from within the country. Important: You must be physically present in China. Testing via a VPN or proxy from outside China is not acceptable. Testing Requirements: - Test the application on a mobile phone using 4G and/or 5G mobile data. - Test the application on a laptop using Wi-Fi, preferably across multiple Wi-Fi networks. - Check that the website, links, and key features load and function correctly. - Identify any pages, links, or features that are blocked, slow, or inaccessible from China. - Provide screenshots or photos as proof of testing, along with a brief report of the results. Experience with website testing is helpful, but the main requirement is having access to devices and internet connections within mainland China. When applying, please confirm that you are physically located in mainland China and briefly describe the devices and internet connections you can use for testing.', 1, 'FIXED', 1292000.00, 1292000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('e17e2c63-192a-597e-84d6-045e19154b3b', '5e9d2390-223c-5689-a283-44a728c5cc86', 'Senior Full Stack Developer', 'We are looking for an experienced Senior Full Stack Developer to support the development, enhancement, and maintenance of our software platforms. You will work on web applications, backend services, APIs, database integrations, and cloud-based solutions, contributing to new features, existing platform improvements, and the resolution of technical issues. Our software solutions may involve industrial applications, energy and utilities, IoT, remote monitoring, and SCADA systems. Experience in these domains is a strong advantage. We are looking for a reliable, proactive professional who can work independently, collaborate effectively with our technical team, and deliver high-quality, maintainable software. Location: On-site (Rome) Contractor Compensation Range (Annualized): € 35,000.00 Contract duration: 1 year Scope of Work 1. Full Stack Development Develop and maintain web applications and backend services. Implement new features based on functional and technical requirements. Build reusable, modular, and maintainable software components. Develop and integrate REST APIs and third-party services. Contribute to testing, debugging, and code quality improvements. 2. Backend and System Integration Develop backend services using C# and the .NET ecosystem. Work with ASP.NET Core, Entity Framework, and related technologies. Integrate applications with databases, cloud services, and external systems. Contribute to distributed systems, microservices, and event-driven architectures where applicable. 3. Frontend Development Develop and maintain web interfaces using React and/or Angular. Work with JavaScript, TypeScript, HTML5, and CSS3. Build responsive, reusable, and maintainable frontend components. 4. Database Development Design, develop, and optimize database queries and stored procedures. Work with relational databases such as Microsoft SQL Server, PostgreSQL, or MySQL. Integrate non-relational databases such as MongoDB, Cosmos DB, Redis, or Elasticsearch. Support data migration, synchronization, and troubleshooting activities. 5. Cloud and DevOps Support application deployment and maintenance in cloud environments. Work with Microsoft Azure and/or Amazon Web Services (AWS). Contribute to CI/CD pipelines, automated deployments, and monitoring. Use Git, GitHub Actions, Docker, and Kubernetes as required by the project. 6. Maintenance and Troubleshooting Investigate and resolve application bugs and production issues. Analyze logs, application behavior, and source code to identify root causes. Improve application performance, reliability, and maintainability. Collaborate with the internal development and technical support teams. Required Skills and Experience: At least 5 years of professional experience in Full Stack Software Development. Strong experience with C# and the .NET ecosystem. Experience developing backend services and web APIs. Practical experience with React and/or Angular. Experience with relational databases and SQL. Familiarity with Git and collaborative software development workflows. Ability to analyze technical problems and deliver effective solutions. Ability to work independently, communicate clearly, and manage assigned tasks. Professional working proficiency in English, both written and spoken (minimum B2 level).', 1, 'FIXED', 1012795000.00, 1012795000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('8b6151b0-d50a-5745-a0a3-3bea6355d198', 'd320574c-4d53-5b12-baca-cb63381832df', 'Full Stack Development', 'Hi! I’m looking for a developer to complete an AI customer service SaaS. My previous developer stopped responding, so I need someone reliable to take over and deliver the project from start to finish. The design/prototype is almost finished, and I want to keep the same design in the final application. I need a fully functional, production-ready SaaS, including: * Frontend matching the Figma design. * Backend, database, user accounts, and separate workspaces for each business. * AI integration and the ability to configure each business’s chatbot using its own information. * All required APIs and connections for website chat, Facebook, and email. * Subscription billing and payment integration. * Testing, deployment, and a complete handover of the source code and documentation. Please review the design and let me know: 1. Can you handle the complete project? 2. What would the total price and delivery timeline be? If anything needs clarification before you can provide an accurate quote, please send me your questions. I’m looking for someone who can deliver a complete working product and communicate consistently throughout the project', 1, 'HOURLY', 387000.00, 387000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('28355941-2f56-5736-9e5d-8afdd96c5510', '11e0455c-9046-5537-aad2-aec47d8de48a', 'Senior Software Engineer — AI-Assisted Development | SaaS & Marketplac', '# Senior Software Engineer — AI-Assisted Development | SaaS & Marketplaces We''re looking for experienced software engineers for flexible, long-term collaboration. **Freelancers and agencies are both welcome!** We''re especially interested in experience with rental/property management, travel, booking platforms, marketplaces, loyalty/rewards, affiliate systems, and multi-tenant SaaS. **PHP/Laravel experience is preferred**, but we''re open to engineers with other technical backgrounds. **How We Work** We already use multiple AI coding agents for development and testing. We''re looking for experienced engineers to collaborate through **live screen-sharing sessions** for troubleshooting, code reviews, and technical guidance. No independent repository or server access is required. Agencies should identify the engineer who will personally participate. **How to Apply** Please **list the actual projects, websites, or applications you''ve worked on, with links wherever possible**. List as many as you like! No lengthy cover letter needed. **Previous Applicants:** Please don''t reapply. We''ve already integrated Upwork MCP and can review your earlier applications. **Remote | Worldwide | Flexible Hours | Long-Term Opportunity** We look forward to seeing what you''ve built!', 1, 'HOURLY', 258000.00, 775000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('e7606d03-3306-5b0f-978c-72619d6b31da', '101263a0-69f0-5394-a710-502714886609', 'Full-Stack Developer for AI SaaS', 'We are looking for an experienced full-stack developer with strong Lovable experience to help finalize Helm AI, an AI-powered General Manager designed to help businesses manage their daily operations. The majority of the product has already been developed using Lovable. We are not looking to rebuild it from scratch. We need someone who can take ownership of the existing applications, identify incomplete functionality, resolve bugs, ensure both platforms work together seamlessly, and prepare the product for launch. Applications 1. Helm AI Web App The main management platform for business owners and managers. It includes dashboards, AI management capabilities, financial reporting, sales analytics, inventory, staffing, scheduling, tasks, and other business management tools. 2. Helm Connect The complementary application for business operations and staff. It must work seamlessly with the main Helm web application, using synchronized business information, accounts, permissions, and operational data. Access to both Lovable projects and relevant technical documentation will be provided after hiring. Responsibilities 1. Complete integration between both applications Ensure both applications use a properly synchronized backend and database. Ensure updates made in one application correctly appear in the other. Fix authentication, user roles, permissions, and account synchronization. Resolve any integration errors, broken API calls, or inconsistent data. Ensure businesses, employees, tasks, and operational information remain synchronized. 2. Fix bugs and complete existing features Audit every page, button, form, workflow, and navigation element. Identify unfinished, broken, or placeholder functionality. Complete existing features according to the approved specifications. Resolve frontend and backend bugs. Fix loading issues, broken redirects, and application errors. Ensure the applications work properly across desktop and mobile screen sizes. 3. Verify core Helm functionality Review and test existing functionality across: AI General Manager and AI chat Business dashboards and analytics Sales and financial reporting Inventory management Employee management and scheduling Tasks, alerts, and notifications Business onboarding and waitlist/approval workflows Multi-business and multi-location management Industry-specific experiences, including restaurants and car rentals Third-party integrations already implemented or configured Any missing integrations, credentials, or features requiring substantial new development must be documented during the initial audit. 4. Improve the overall experience Ensure smooth navigation and responsive design. Remove unnecessary friction from onboarding. Verify that users see the correct functionality for their roles and business type. Improve error handling and application performance. Make both applications consistent and professional. 5. Perform complete quality assurance Test important user journeys from beginning to end. Verify data synchronization and persistence. Test account creation, authentication, permissions, and business onboarding. Check for database errors, security issues, and failed integrations. Resolve all identified critical and high-severity defects within the agreed scope. Document remaining lower-priority issues and any external blockers. Required Experience Strong hands-on experience with Lovable. React, TypeScript, and modern full-stack development. Supabase/PostgreSQL or equivalent backend experience. API integrations and authentication. Debugging existing SaaS applications. Database synchronization and access controls. End-to-end testing and production deployment. Expected Deliverables Initial technical audit with a prioritized issue list. Properly synchronized Helm Connect and Helm web applications. Completed and repaired functionality within the agreed scope. Tested critical workflows across both platforms. Working deployment and documented changes. A final testing report, outstanding-issues register, and technical handover. We expect clear communication and regular progress updates. The project will be accepted after successful testing of agreed functionality, not simply after code changes are made. Budget $1,000 fixed price, divided into milestones. Please apply only if you have experience working with existing Lovable applications and can clearly explain how you would approach the audit, integration, debugging, and final testing. Include examples of Lovable projects you have completed, your experience connecting multiple applications to a shared backend, and your estimated completion timeline. We are looking for someone reliable who can help us take Helm AI from its current state to a stable, functional, launch-ready product.', 1, 'FIXED', 25832000.00, 25832000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('111ba24d-bcf6-53d9-b4d9-1ac9fb0bc062', 'ce5d68ae-736e-5998-984e-6ef990f34ee7', 'Next.js Developer Needed to Add New Features to an Existing Website', 'I have an existing website built with Next.js and TypeScript, and I’m looking for a developer to add a few new features. The website is already built, so the main task is to review the existing codebase, understand the current functionality, and implement the requested updates without breaking existing features. Scope of Work: • Review the existing Next.js project. • Discuss and clarify the required features. • Implement new features using the existing code structure. • Maintain the current UI and design unless changes are required. • Test the updates and fix any issues caused by the changes. • Provide a brief summary of the completed work. Requirements: • Experience with Next.js, React, and TypeScript. • Ability to work with an existing codebase. • Clear communication and regular progress updates. • Ability to follow instructions and meet agreed deadlines. Budget: Hourly contract Rate: $3 per hour Initial budget target: Approximately $10, depending on the scope and time required. Please explain your relevant experience and how you would approach adding features to an existing Next.js website.', 1, 'HOURLY', 77000.00, 103000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('382a4b55-8ba7-5198-9557-e8f632dd4f5b', '0e836f60-6b9a-5d9a-ba49-4f4168e1b412', 'Python, TypeScript, Next.js Developer', 'Part-Time Full Stack Developer (Next.js, Python & AI) – 15 Hours/Week We are looking for an experienced Full Stack Developer to support an existing AI-powered SaaS platform. Initially, the focus will be on QA, testing, debugging, and bug fixing, followed by developing new features and improving AI functionality. Requirements: • Strong experience with Next.js, React, TypeScript (frontend and backend). • Python experience, particularly AI/LLM integrations and workflows. • Experience with PostgreSQL, APIs, and cloud-based applications. • Strong QA/testing skills, preferably Playwright or similar tools. • Proficiency with AI coding tools such as Claude Code, Cursor, or Copilot. • Ability to work independently, understand existing code, and deliver clean, tested solutions. Engagement: • 15 hours per week, long-term. • Must have good communication skills. • Individual freelancers ONLY. No agencies or development companies. • All communication must remain on Upwork. Do not contact us outside Upwork. Please share your relevant experience with Next.js, Python, AI development, and testing.', 1, 'HOURLY', 129000.00, 207000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('50f932d9-06a9-5369-8ca4-431a9a432b4d', '2f8662fd-35bc-5355-aed9-c642f9374e7b', 'Full-Stack Web Developer for Cleaning Website', 'I''m looking for an experienced full-stack web developer to build a complete, professional website for my cleaning company. I have already created the visual designs for the website pages and will provide them as reference images. I need someone who can accurately convert these designs into a fully functional, mobile-friendly website. The website should include cleaning packages with automatic pricing, online appointment booking, Google Maps address verification with service-area restrictions, customer information and cleaning preferences, Stripe integration to securely save payment methods and charge customers after service completion, automated email and SMS confirmations, and an admin dashboard to manage bookings, cleaners, pricing, and payments. I''m looking for someone who can handle the entire project, from development to launch.', 1, 'HOURLY', 181000.00, 387000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('60639381-5c9a-5d3f-b55d-0e0346cc9a3f', 'c1c16d31-625a-5ddf-948d-5ba5ae972a5d', 'AI Interior Design SaaS MVP Developer | Python, React & AI', 'We’re looking for an experienced Full-Stack AI Developer to help us build an MVP for an AI-powered interior design product. The idea is to create a platform where users can upload a photo of their room, provide details about their preferred style, colors, room type, and requirements, and receive AI-powered interior design concepts and recommendations. We already have the core product idea and are looking for someone who can help us turn it into a clean, functional MVP that we can test with real users. The MVP will include user authentication, a dashboard for managing design projects, room and image uploads, design preferences, AI-generated room concepts, multiple design variations, furniture and decor recommendations, project history, saved designs, backend APIs, database integration, and basic cloud deployment. On the AI side, we expect to use image understanding, image generation, LLM APIs, prompt engineering, image processing, and AI-powered recommendations. We’re open to your suggestions on which models and approach would work best for the MVP. The goal is to keep the initial version practical and cost-effective while making sure the architecture can scale as the product grows. For the frontend, we’re considering React or Next.js with TypeScript and Tailwind CSS. The backend can be built with Python using FastAPI or Django, with PostgreSQL or Supabase for the database. For AI, experience with OpenAI, Claude, Gemini, image generation APIs, computer vision, and frameworks such as LangChain or LangGraph would be valuable. AWS, Docker, and CI/CD experience is also preferred. We’re looking for someone with strong experience building SaaS MVPs and AI-powered applications, particularly someone who can work across the frontend, backend, AI integrations, and deployment. Experience with image generation or computer vision would be a strong plus. We’d like the developer to help us define the MVP scope, recommend the right architecture and AI approach, and then build the first working version. When applying, please share a brief introduction, relevant AI or SaaS projects you’ve worked on, your experience with image generation or AI applications, your preferred approach and tech stack for this MVP, your estimated timeline and availability, and any relevant work or GitHub links. Please also provide your estimated fixed price for building the complete MVP, along with an approximate timeline. If you believe the scope should be adjusted to stay within a specific budget, feel free to suggest a more suitable MVP approach. If the MVP goes well, there is potential for a longer-term engagement as we continue developing the product.', 1, 'FIXED', 258000.00, 258000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('73ab1f21-a1a7-50b6-9bd0-4a2a6d688d64', 'bfb3fd8b-ce5a-58f8-a4cf-fd401682be57', 'Full-Stack Software Engineering Advisor For Production Ready App', 'I’ve been building my app with Claude (AI coding assistant) and it’s close to production, but progress keeps getting stuck in loops: fixes that break other things, repeated rework, going in circles. The current estimate to finish is 400–1,200 hours, and I think a clear plan could cut that down a lot. What I need: • Review the codebase and identify what’s actually left before launch • Spot where and why the AI keeps looping • Write a clear, step-by-step plan, broken into tasks and prompts I can give Claude to avoid the loops and get to production • Give your own realistic hour estimate I have an engineering advisor but want fresh eyes to speed things up. This could lead to ongoing work. The technology stack: Mobile app: React Native 0.81 + Expo 54 + React 19, written in TypeScript Navigation and styling: Expo Router, NativeWind / Tailwind CSS Camera and images: Expo Camera, Image Picker, Image Manipulator Backend API: Supabase Edge Functions, using TypeScript / Deno Database, authentication, files: Supabase PostgreSQL, Auth, Storage, SQL RPCs and row-level security Image recognition and extraction: Google Gemini
INSERT INTO job (id, project_id, title, description, quantity, salary_type, budget_min, budget_max, status, created_at, updated_at)
VALUES
    ('ef5a5f61-ae7d-578c-9aa8-36a67bead9d3', '478e6f21-4507-59d8-967e-6550784cec39', 'I want to review my code from a senior guy its lagacy code wirrting in asp.net and vb.net', 'I have lagacy application delvoped in Asp and vb .net and backend as MS SQL we are facing perfromace issue need to verify and fix it along with matinance', 1, 'FIXED', 12916000.00, 12916000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('c4bc0d66-7a3d-52ec-9456-d24459772d9b', 'b407f722-8a97-5ad3-a438-5a787a0ddbf2', 'Fix One Minor UI Issue in an Existing React App', 'I’m looking for a developer to fix one reproducible visual issue on one screen of an existing React application. The task covers a small spacing, alignment or overflow problem. I’ll provide the relevant source files, a screenshot showing the issue and the expected appearance. Deliverables: - Correct the agreed UI issue. - Check the affected screen at mobile and desktop widths. - Provide the updated code, before-and-after screenshots and a brief explanation. This task excludes new features, backend changes, authentication, payment integrations and app-store submission. Please describe your experience with React UI fixes and confirm whether the supplied issue fits this budget before accepting.', 1, 'FIXED', 387000.00, 387000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('fecdebbf-bb61-5dcc-b19b-5444d9821185', 'f41d6fca-2223-5287-b80e-1a5f610e8565', 'Expert .NET Developer', 'We’re seeking an expert .NET developer to build and maintain a robust web application for our business. You’ll work on core application development, improve performance, and support ongoing enhancements. The ideal freelancer can take ownership of key features, collaborate with stakeholders, and deliver reliable, scalable solutions. This is a long-term opportunity for someone who can contribute consistently and help shape the product over time.', 1, 'HOURLY', 646000.00, 1214000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('642b1a18-508f-5ef2-8d0e-0e9254e4d7a6', '9b2147ec-c73a-59b0-93fe-1106fc01f1aa', 'Drupal Website Developer Needed', 'We need a developer to build a small 7-page website and add a few forms, including multilingual support. The project includes a homepage, about page, services page, contact page, and additional pages for a small business. The site should be clean, functional, and easy to manage. Experience with Drupal and multilingual websites is important. Please share relevant examples of similar projects and your approach to delivering a simple, user-friendly site.', 1, 'FIXED', 6458000.00, 6458000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('dab51815-8397-5dcf-939a-5ed837f5370d', 'f86137d7-a969-5c9b-b7c3-ac952258d9a0', 'Technical Consultant / Project Manager | Software Engineering Background', 'We are looking for an experienced Technical Consultant or Project Manager with a strong hands-on software development background to join our team for a long-term, part-time collaboration. This opportunity is ideal for someone who has worked extensively as a software engineer and is now interested in combining technical expertise with project coordination, consulting, and client communication. At least 70% of your professional experience must involve hands-on software development or coding. We welcome developers from various technical backgrounds, including frontend, backend, full-stack, desktop, mobile, cloud, and enterprise application development. Experience with technologies such as C#, .NET, JavaScript, Python, and Java is valuable, but we are not limiting this opportunity to a particular programming language or technology stack. What matters most is your ability to understand complex software systems, communicate technical concepts clearly, and make sound engineering decisions. You should be comfortable discussing project requirements with clients, collaborating with developers, reviewing technical approaches, identifying potential issues, and helping projects move forward efficiently. Candidates with experience in AI development, LLM integrations, AI agents, or intelligent automation are especially welcome, although AI experience is not mandatory. We value professionals who combine strong technical judgment with excellent communication, problem-solving, and organizational skills. Previous experience in technical consulting, project management, engineering leadership, or client-facing development would be a strong advantage. This is a U.S.-only, fully remote, part-time contract opportunity with flexible working hours and the potential for long-term collaboration. Compensation will depend on your experience, technical background, and responsibilities. If you have a solid software engineering background and enjoy working with both clients and development teams, we''d be happy to hear from you. Please share your technical experience, previous development responsibilities, and any relevant consulting or project management experience.', 1, 'HOURLY', 1550000.00, 2067000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('b2bc8228-130a-51d4-8eee-1285c71f66f2', 'e645343f-7949-55ed-aa0b-1d1a25a90613', 'Senior Rust Engineer Needed', 'We are seeking a senior Rust engineer to help build and maintain a reliable, high-performance system. You will work on core development, improve system stability, and support ongoing maintenance. The ideal candidate has strong experience delivering production-ready software and collaborating with a team to solve complex technical challenges. This is a long-term opportunity for someone who can contribute to a stable, scalable product.', 1, 'HOURLY', 1162000.00, 2067000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('db662d8e-f1cf-59a3-8901-210719eec9c7', '16a36012-fd9f-5d95-bd44-93880034f343', 'Assistant for Complex Information Simplification', '• "My purpose is to transform complex information into clear, efficient solutions to successfully overcome any challenge. / My goal is to simplify complex processes to deliver fast, structured, and effective answers to every problem. If you excel at handling information and can work with high precision, we would love to have you join our team.', 1, 'HOURLY', 387000.00, 1292000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('6689521e-17a8-5eea-92d6-bbef62694471', '03e68a2b-f5fd-5e69-ae7a-df97dd62232e', 'Developer needed: community platform with members, events and subscriptions (MVP)', 'I am looking for an experienced developer to build the first version of an English-language community website for people aged 35 and over. The goal is to help members meet new people and join activities together. Required features - Member profiles with photo, age, town and interests - Activity calendar with per activity: maximum number of participants, age range, location and audience (mixed, women only or men only) - Sign up, cancel and an automatic waiting list - Members can propose activities
INSERT INTO job (id, project_id, title, description, quantity, salary_type, budget_min, budget_max, status, created_at, updated_at)
VALUES
    ('5240e426-34da-58be-9721-b73c0fac8847', '479fb665-db9b-53d9-8215-33658bc2d2e2', 'Security Engineer for Agentic AI', 'The client operates at the intersection of enterprise Media Asset Management (MAM) and cutting-edge generative media. We build and scale industry-leading generative AI models, including hyper-realistic digital humans (ATMAN) and multilingual voice synthesis (VAANI), for world-class enterprise clients in entertainment, sports, healthcare, and retail. We are looking for a Security Engineer for Agentic AI to make the agents, tools, and models the Client''s teams rely on safe by default. You will own the security of Construct, our sovereign agent gateway for model routing, MCP tool hosting, and multi-agent orchestration: how agents authenticate, what they can reach, how they handle untrusted input, and how every action is logged. This is an application and AI security role, not a cloud security role. Our Cloud Security Engineer owns GCP , Kubernetes, network, and infrastructure-as-code posture. You own the controls above it, in agents, tools, models, and their data flows, and you share secrets, sandbox runtimes, and security telemetry with them. You work as part of a team led by the Lead Engineer for Agentic AI, together with the AI Architect , Senior Engineers, ML Engineers and Product Management. You also work closely with Security and compliance. You own and build the security controls
INSERT INTO job (id, project_id, title, description, quantity, salary_type, budget_min, budget_max, status, created_at, updated_at)
VALUES
    ('b14f2997-3cd7-53ea-9b46-a3282d49c035', 'decf14b0-e074-560e-a37e-2136287f2d56', 'Power BI dashboard', 'Need to build a dashboard from scratch. Develop an interactive dashboard to monitor student lifecycle stages, support targeted communications, and measure student engagement and enrolment outcomes.', 1, 'FIXED', 9041000.00, 9041000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('b7ae5a27-f08d-5c8c-9ceb-4ef54633d8c2', '6ee0930d-f18a-5cb1-ba49-d0ede66d08d0', 'Build a Business Website, Custom CRM Dashboard & AI-Powered WhatsApp Automation', 'Build a Business Website, Custom CRM Dashboard & WhatsApp Automation System Project Description We are an India-based fire-safety business providing fire extinguishers, safety equipment, installation, inspection, servicing, and annual maintenance services. We are looking for an experienced developer or small development team to help strengthen our online presence and streamline our customer acquisition and management processes. Scope of Work * Business Website: Develop a professional, mobile-friendly website showcasing our products and services, with product catalogue pages, enquiry forms, and clear calls to action to generate business leads. * SEO & Analytics: Implement technical and on-page SEO, performance optimization, local SEO foundations, and analytics to track website traffic, enquiries, lead sources, and conversions. * Custom CRM Dashboard: Build a dashboard to manage leads, customers, enquiries, pipeline stages, follow-ups, tasks, and activity history. Website enquiries should flow directly into the CRM, with reporting to track performance. * AI-Powered WhatsApp Automation: Integrate WhatsApp Business automation that can respond to enquiries, qualify potential customers, capture lead information, and route qualified leads into the CRM. The dashboard should help track conversations, lead status, and outcomes. * Business System Integration: Connect relevant existing business systems where appropriate, with reliable data synchronization and clear error handling. We prefer a practical, secure, maintainable solution that can be delivered in phases. We are open to recommendations on the technology stack and implementation approach. What to Include in Your Proposal Please share relevant portfolio examples, your recommended approach, an estimated timeline, and a milestone-wise cost breakdown covering the website, SEO and analytics, CRM, and WhatsApp automation separately. Also identify recurring hosting, API, messaging, and AI usage costs, key assumptions, and post-launch support charges. We are looking for a developer who can deliver a reliable working system with testing, deployment, and a smooth handover.', 1, 'FIXED', 12916000.00, 12916000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('cf26263f-af6d-523b-814d-603b1dde9521', '9bf5dab3-0257-5dbc-b920-f2f088518840', 'React + Supabase + n8n Developer: Admin Dashboard & Workflow Automation', 'We are Ivory Nexus Solutions, a tech company based in Abidjan, Côte d''Ivoire. Our product, RecuAI, is a bilingual (EN/FR) WhatsApp assistant that uses AI to track business expenses for professionals and SMEs in Francophone Africa. The production stack is already in place: self-hosted n8n, Supabase (PostgreSQL with business logic in database functions), Twilio WhatsApp, AI extraction via the Claude and Gemini APIs, and a React user dashboard. We now need an internal system admin dashboard so our team can monitor the platform and manage plans without going through n8n, plus the n8n workflow changes that support it. SCOPE - PHASE A 1. Reporting (read-only), with date-range filters (today, week, month, custom): - Users by status (active, banned, limit reached, deleted, pending privacy, plan expired) - Users per plan (Free, Standard, Pro, including Pro groups and members) - Expenses submitted over time - AI API usage (Claude and Gemini calls) - Payments collected (by plan, method and period) 2. Plan management: - Admin can upgrade or renew a user''s plan from the dashboard (replacing the current n8n admin flow) - Support for free promotions and manual payments (e.g.', 1, 'HOURLY', 258000.00, 517000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('1b7be2af-25ec-546b-88f0-523a26ebc111', 'aef5957d-9962-50da-8645-84dbc1ffe7e6', 'PowerBI support reporting and business intelligence initiatives.', 'About the Role We are looking for an experienced Power BI specialist to support reporting and business intelligence initiatives. The ideal candidate will have strong technical expertise, analytical and problem-solving skills, and the ability to work independently while managing client communications and delivering solutions aligned with business requirements. This role requires someone who can translate business needs into effective reporting solutions, manage deliverables with minimal supervision, and maintain regular communication with the client throughout the engagement. This role have to overlap a few hours with the US/Canada Eastern Timezone. This is an immediate hire. Key Responsibilities Crystal Reports to Power BI Conversion - Analyze existing Crystal Reports, including report layouts, formulas, parameters, filters, grouping, and underlying data sources. - Convert and recreate Crystal Reports in Power BI while maintaining data accuracy, business logic, and reporting functionality. - Identify differences between Crystal Reports and Power BI and recommend suitable solutions. - Validate converted reports against the original reports to ensure consistency and accuracy. - Troubleshoot data discrepancies, report issues, and performance bottlenecks. Power BI Development - Design, develop, and maintain interactive Power BI reports and dashboards. - Connect to various data sources, including SQL databases and other structured data sources. - Develop data models, relationships, calculated columns, and measures using DAX. - Use Power Query (M) for data extraction, transformation, and cleansing. - Optimize report performance, data models, and DAX calculations. - Publish and manage reports in Power BI Service, including scheduled refreshes, workspaces, and access permissions, as required. - Perform testing and quality checks to ensure reports meet business and technical requirements. Client Communication and Project Delivery - Independently communicate with the client to gather requirements, clarify business needs, and confirm report specifications. - Translate business requirements into technical solutions and reporting deliverables. - Lead technical discussions and explain proposed solutions directly to the client. - Provide regular status updates on completed reports, work in progress, outstanding requirements, blockers, and next steps. - Align directly with the client on completed reports, gather feedback, and incorporate requested changes. - Proactively identify issues, communicate risks, and recommend solutions to keep deliverables on track. - Manage assigned tasks independently and ensure timely delivery of agreed requirements. Documentation and Quality Assurance - Document report logic, calculations, data sources, and relevant technical configurations. - Maintain clear records of completed deliverables, outstanding tasks, and client feedback. - Ensure the accuracy, reliability, and maintainability of reports. - Follow appropriate data security, confidentiality, and quality standards. Required Skills and Qualifications - Demonstrated hands-on experience with Crystal Reports and Microsoft Power BI, particularly in converting or migrating reports between the two platforms. - Strong proficiency in Power BI Desktop, Power BI Service, DAX, and Power Query (M). - Experience with SQL, relational databases, data modelling, joins, aggregations, and data transformations. - Strong understanding of report performance optimization and troubleshooting. - Experience validating report outputs and reconciling data against source reports. - Excellent verbal and written English communication skills. - Ability to independently manage client discussions, understand business requirements, and explain technical concepts clearly. - Strong analytical, problem-solving, and stakeholder management skills. - Ability to work independently, manage priorities, and deliver within agreed timelines. Experience and Certification Requirements: Candidates must demonstrate relevant technical experience through their resume and/or supporting certifications.', 1, 'HOURLY', 517000.00, 827000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('17253e00-88b3-58e4-aabb-d225226bdcba', '3f1f3486-5d1b-5089-beea-173f342ffb51', 'Full-Stack Developer Needed for Business Dashboard Development', 'We are looking for an experienced Full-Stack Developer to build a modern, responsive business management dashboard within 5 days. The project includes secure user authentication, an admin dashboard, customer management, task tracking, data tables with search and filtering, basic analytics, and REST API integration. The preferred technology stack is React.js or Next.js for the frontend, Node.js for the backend, and PostgreSQL or MongoDB for the database. The application should have a clean, professional interface, secure access controls, and smooth functionality across desktop and mobile devices. The developer will be responsible for frontend and backend development, database setup, API integration, testing, bug fixes, and deployment. The total fixed budget is $1,000, with a strict 5-day deadline for the agreed MVP scope. Final deliverables must include a fully functional web application, complete source code, deployment, and basic technical documentation. We are looking for a reliable developer who can start immediately, communicate clearly, and deliver quality work on time. All project payments and milestones will be managed through Upwork.', 1, 'FIXED', 25832000.00, 25832000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('4b377bae-f055-53df-903b-8bd53e18209c', 'd894a3ae-9bb0-5071-9bbb-f69cc05badd2', '4 tasks Flutter and React accuracy, localisation, dashboard user flow', 'Summary Hello my name is Simon from IGC Loyalty Flutter Developer (Indoor Navigation / Sensor Fusion / Mapbox) Pilot Project', 1, 'FIXED', 200000.00, 600000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('1717207c-7fcd-5329-a8fd-f1d0c3df5e7a', '25596efc-8dd2-55f6-a708-540c3b186ac5', 'Looker Studio Developer: Patient Acquisition Dashboard (Google Ads + GA4 + HubSpot)', 'I run a digital marketing consultancy and need a 4-page Looker Studio dashboard for a healthcare clinic client. It should show how Google Ads spend turns into leads, booked calls and paying patients, with cost per stage, conversion rates between stages, and a breakdown by channel and campaign. Data sources are Google Ads, GA4 and HubSpot, with funnel stages based on HubSpot lifecycle stages. Part of the job is recommending the best way to bring HubSpot data into Looker Studio, either a paid connector or a Google Sheets bridge. This is a fixed-price contract in two milestones: layout approval, then final delivery with a short handover note documenting the calculated fields and blends. Budget is $400–500. Shortlisted candidates will sign an NDA through Upwork before receiving the full brief.', 1, 'FIXED', 10333000.00, 10333000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('4bd5d001-5d07-5780-be8a-5561ac8ccd7e', '3f41ad54-67a3-52bc-b9e2-d5e47b30a0e9', 'Tableau Reports for Marketing', 'Objectives: ● Understand how our marketing channels are performing as compared to spend (i.e. channel-level ROI) ● Deliver ‘Bowtie Model’ (as outlined below) Project Requirements: ● Need ability to upload channel-level spend on a monthly basis ○ Until spend is uploaded, ROI will be infinite ● Need ability to see channel-level transactions and/or revenue ○ Use “Campaign Channel” field on opportunity ○ Show all channels at all times, even if revenue and/or spend are $0 ● Sample table with all the data we want provided after NDA is signed', 1, 'FIXED', 19374000.00, 19374000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('5c48e8ce-f40b-5355-bd06-b66c81dd1d9a', '47102a03-d497-5a1a-8263-31e5393d66ee', 'Xây dựng ứng dụng tự động crawler dữ liệu từ các website (Website có mã Captcha)', '*MÔ TẢ CÔNG VIỆC Chúng tôi cần xây dựng một công cụ/hệ thống tự động hóa (Bot) để tối ưu hóa quy trình tải và xử lý dữ liệu từ một website hệ thống nội bộ. Các tác vụ cụ thể bao gồm: 1. Web...', 1, 'FIXED', 5000000.00, 8000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('739842f2-34bf-5c19-8846-fc165cc8b200', '47102a03-d497-5a1a-8263-31e5393d66ee', 'Xây dựng ứng dụng tự động crawler dữ liệu từ website (có website cần đăng nhập bằng tài khoản và mật khẩu)', 'TUYỂN DỤNG LẬP TRÌNH VIÊN PHÁT TRIỂN ỨNG DỤNG TẢI DỮ LIỆU TỰ ĐỘNG Hình thức: Remote Mô tả công việc Chúng tôi cần tuyển một lập trình viên xây dựng ứng dụng desktop trên Windows có chức năng tự động đăng nhập và tải dữ liệu hàng loạt từ một website mà chúng tôi có tài khoản và quyền truy cập hợp lệ. Website này không yêu cầu nhập mã captcha. Ứng dụng cần thay thế quy trình thủ công hiện tại: thay vì đăng nhập, tra cứu và chọn nút tải dữ liệu bằng tay, ứng dụng sẽ làm tự động theo danh sách cấu hình sẵn, rồi sắp xếp dữ liệu tải về một cách gọn gàng. Chức năng chính của ứng dụng • Quản lý nhiều tài khoản đăng nhập và nhiều mã đối tượng tra cứu cho mỗi tài khoản. • Tự đăng nhập và giữ phiên đăng nhập để dùng cho cả buổi làm việc. • Tra cứu dữ liệu theo khoảng thời gian và theo các bộ lọc do người dùng chọn. • Tải tệp về, đổi tên và sắp xếp vào thư mục theo mẫu người dùng đặt. • Tải song song nhiều luồng để tăng tốc độ, kèm cơ chế giới hạn tốc độ hợp lý để không gây quá tải cho website. • Đồng bộ tăng dần: ghi nhớ dữ liệu đã tải, các lần sau chỉ tải phần mới. • Lưu tiến độ để tiếp tục khi bị gián đoạn (mất mạng, hết phiên), tự thử lại khi gặp lỗi tạm thời. • Giao diện quản lý danh sách, nút điều khiển chạy/dừng/tạm dừng và thanh tiến độ trực quan. • … Chi tiết cụ thể vui lòng liên hệ Công nghệ yêu cầu Chúng tôi định hướng công nghệ như sau, ưu tiên ứng dụng nhẹ, tốn ít tài nguyên và dung lượng nhỏ, tốc độ tải cao và ổn định: • Ngôn ngữ chính: Go (Golang) hoặc rust • Giao diện: thư viện giao diện gốc Windows cho Go (Walk) hoặc Fyne. (Nếu ứng viên mạnh về C#, chấp nhận phương án thay thế: C# với WinForms trên .NET Framework 4.8.) • Kết nối mạng: thư viện chuẩn net/http của Go, hỗ trợ HTTP/2, giữ kết nối (connection pooling) và quản lý cookie/phiên. • Phân tích HTML: goquery hoặc tương đương. • Cơ sở dữ liệu cục bộ: SQLite (ví dụ modernc.org/sqlite, thuần Go) để lưu cấu hình, danh sách, tiến độ và chỉ mục đồng bộ tăng dần. • Xử lý song song: goroutine kết hợp worker pool. Yêu cầu ứng viên • Thành thạo Go, có kinh nghiệm làm việc với HTTP client, xử lý song song và quản lý phiên đăng nhập. (Hoặc thành thạo C# nếu theo phương án thay thế.) • Có kinh nghiệm phân tích cấu trúc HTML của website và trích xuất dữ liệu. • Hiểu biết về SQLite và thiết kế lưu trữ dữ liệu cục bộ. • Biết xây dựng giao diện desktop trên Windows. Sản phẩm bàn giao • Mã nguồn đầy đủ kèm hướng dẫn build. • Tệp cài đặt hoặc tệp thực thi hoàn chỉnh. • Tài liệu hướng dẫn sử dụng cơ bản. Cách thức ứng tuyển: 1. Viết mô tả về một ứng dụng tương tự đã thực hiện kèm video minh họa 2. Đường dẫn GitHub/GitLab hoặc mã nguồn dự án đã làm. Ưu tiên công cụ tải hoặc thu thập dữ liệu, ứng dụng desktop, hoặc dự án có xử lý song song.', 1, 'FIXED', 3000000.00, 5500000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('5469413d-1faf-542f-b4bf-90dea0977497', '3933bc76-6ae1-523c-bab3-689201c14da0', 'Web Scraping for University Data', 'Need a freelancer to extract structured data from university websites, including program names, descriptions, requirements, and other relevant details. The work involves identifying reliable sources, collecting accurate information, and organizing the results in a clear format. Experience handling website structures and maintaining data consistency is important. This is a short-term project for someone who can deliver clean, organized data efficiently.', 1, 'FIXED', 6458000.00, 6458000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('46f6734b-4de9-5be5-a90f-eb91c17e58fe', '049bf063-7653-5615-a3c3-d4fd4c344bf1', 'Web Scraping for Price Data', 'Need help scraping product prices from 8 to 10 websites for specific options. This is a small project requiring a freelancer to extract the requested data and share the completed code along with full details after the work is done. Experience with web scraping and reliable data collection is important for this task.', 1, 'FIXED', 1343000.00, 1343000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('da93cd5b-f487-57bf-b734-878262be71c1', 'd763d8e4-49f3-5847-adbd-4528c77d0104', 'Python Data Scraping Web+PDF from Public Filings', 'Scraping public US investment fund tax supplements and webpages. These are oftentimes PDFs or basic HTML tables. Looking for an engineer that can provide: normalized extracted data and a runnable Python file or Jupyter notebook that generates it from a list of fund issuers. Accuracy is crucial and pure LLM solutions are too inaccurate. Expertise in extracting tabular data accurately, web scraping, Python, and working asynchronously are all required. Nice to have but not required: - Data engineering experience with ability to manage and create scalable process helping us make timely updates to fund tax information for our customers - Experience with EDGAR filings - US personal tax and investment industry domain knowledge', 1, 'HOURLY', 517000.00, 2583000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('0302fc5e-46bf-528b-a1e5-c43c9561d8b1', 'ca558c35-a80b-5fcb-830d-9b73c11320b8', 'Data Scraping and Validation Specialist', 'We need a freelancer to scrape data from a website and validate the results against a provided list of 1,000 names. The work includes extracting the correct name, phone number, and email address for each entry, then checking each record against the source list to ensure accuracy. You will also identify and document any missing or incorrect entries. This is a short-term project for someone who can work independently, communicate clearly, and deliver organized, reliable results.', 1, 'HOURLY', 77000.00, 129000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('8f53bc5e-6ba6-55cd-8fa1-afa4605e413a', 'ca558c35-a80b-5fcb-830d-9b73c11320b8', 'Data Mining and Verification Specialist', 'We need a reliable freelancer to extract and verify data from online sources for a long-term project. The work includes researching companies, collecting accurate information, and organizing it into a clean spreadsheet. You should be detail-oriented, able to work independently, and comfortable handling repetitive tasks with high accuracy. This is a full-time role with potential for ongoing work for the right candidate.', 1, 'HOURLY', 77000.00, 129000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('73837a59-0213-52a8-83b9-6d057a2a3f54', '3dfda3d9-a01c-58aa-a3bd-6b3a779f9e65', 'Scrape business emails from Google', 'I want to scrape the email addresses from small businesses especially Bend and Breakfast emails in a radius of 60 miles from a town in the UK', 1, 'FIXED', 517000.00, 517000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('35c1e8da-aa5e-58a7-b6ae-8f23ba078b35', '67f2a0b7-dd7c-5bab-9cb8-3fbc1c90125e', 'Selenium crawl dữ liệu hiển thị trên website', 'Dữ liệu cần lấy như: - Text, tiêu đề, mô tả - Ảnh, link - Các thông tin được render động bằng JavaScript (load sau khi trang hiển thị) Xử lý các tình huống phổ biến khi crawl dữ liệu. Xuất dữ liệu ra định dạng theo yêu cầu (CSV / Excel / JSON / Database…). Code cần rõ ràng, dễ đọc, có thể chạy lại và bảo trì khi cần. Ưu tiên ứng viên: - Đã từng làm các dự án thu thập dữ liệu phục vụ phân tích, báo cáo hoặc nghiên cứu thị trường - Có kinh nghiệm tối ưu tốc độ crawl và hạn chế lỗi khi chạy script', 1, 'FIXED', 200000.00, 200000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('6cec7579-8870-5955-9846-bcc663bea943', '1a088d55-803b-5f13-8935-091ea18b3a70', 'Cần freelancer Web Scraping thu thập dữ liệu công khai xuất file Excel (2024 - 2026)', 'Cần tìm một bạn lập trình viên có kinh nghiệm cào dữ liệu (Web Scraping) từ 1 website cổng thông tin điện tử: 1. Phạm vi dữ liệu: Lấy toàn bộ dữ liệu thông báo đấu giá công khai từ tháng 07/2024...', 1, 'FIXED', 1000000.00, 1500000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('39e6b20e-5aef-544c-bb41-bac593487790', '607be5c4-f258-5484-b4ec-771d01bc2065', 'Scraping AI responses on travel sites', 'I am working on a project comparing AI search outputs from different travel sites: booking.com, Trip.com Genie (https://us.trip.com/tripgenie/) and Priceline Penny (https://www.priceline.com/penny). I have 1,200 search prompts to feed to each of these sites. Here is a sample prompt: "I am a 20-year-old undergraduate student traveling on a limited budget, looking for a hotel in Boston. I need accommodation under $200 per night for 2026-11-24 to 2026-11-25 (1 night). Recommend up to 10 hotels." Your job will need to capture the list of recommended hotel list. It is a straightforward task but the freelancer may need to be able to automate browsers and use IP proxies as needed. The delivery needs to be in 12 hours with both code, app as well as the excel showing the query, one of the three channel names, the matching output (a list of hotels including the name of the hotel, url of the hotel, price for each).', 1, 'FIXED', 12916000.00, 12916000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('3a3e34c7-6b2a-5341-b7a5-d2173b687fe5', '79e915b7-2ef5-5b31-8fbd-c4e903b82346', 'Independent Python Data Pipeline & Source-Control Audit — EBDIS/KBYG.', '## Project Overview I am seeking an experienced **Senior Python Engineer / Independent Software Auditor** to conduct a focused technical verification of an existing AI-assisted financial research system called **EBDIS/KBYG (Evidence-Based Decision and Investment System)**. This is a personal, non-commercial research project. The architecture, Python implementation, technical documentation, and extensive offline testing have already been developed. **The objective is independent verification of the existing system, NOT rebuilding or developing a new system.** We are preparing for a controlled historical market-data study covering 2018–2022 and require an independent assessment before starting data acquisition. ## Scope of Work ### 1. Python Code and Data Pipeline Audit Review the existing Python implementation, including: - REST API requests and historical-data acquisition. - Pagination and API error handling. - JSON validation, duplicate detection, and data integrity. - SHA-256 checksums and provenance verification. - Evidence preservation, atomic file operations, and recovery. - Security, reliability, and fail-closed controls. ### 2. Three Core Components **RA10 — Data Acquisition and Provenance** Verify API request integrity, pagination continuity, original HTTP evidence, source receipts, token confidentiality, and audit-trail reliability. **RA11 — Historical Market Calendar** Verify NYSE trading calendars for 2018–2022, including holidays, exceptional closures, early closing sessions, daylight-saving transitions, and timestamp accuracy. **RA12 — Dataset Integrity** Verify historical-data completeness, source-to-dataset traceability, RAW/CANONICAL reconstruction, missing or duplicate bars, and correct symbol/date assignments. ### 3. Governance and Security Verification Review six defined technical controls (GOV-01 through GOV-06) relating to: - Pagination-token security. - Original data custody and restricted access. - Source-generation metadata. - API endpoint restrictions. - HTTP timestamps and clock integrity. - Atomic preservation and crash recovery. Review whether the components are correctly integrated and whether the existing evidence is sufficient to support an acquisition-readiness decision. ### 4. Financial Data and Existing Evidence The research uses six US securities: SPY, AAPL, MSFT, JPM, XOM, and WMT. The frozen historical acquisition plan specifies 5-minute SIP equity bars over 2018–2022, with 360 symbol-month windows, a maximum of 2,000 HTTP attempts, and a maximum of 5 million raw rows. Written clarification from Alpaca concerning personal research use is available. The reviewer should examine the technical evidence and identify any unresolved source-use or agreement-applicability concerns. A formal legal opinion is not required. ## Required Deliverables We require **one consolidated independent technical audit report** containing: 1. Reviewer''s qualifications and independence declaration. 2. Exact source files and SHA-256 hashes examined. 3. Technical findings for RA10, RA11, and RA12. 4. Individual PASS, HOLD, or FAIL findings for GOV-01 through GOV-06. 5. Assessment of system integration and data integrity. 6. Identified defects, risks, and necessary corrections. 7. Final recommendation on readiness for consideration of a separately authorized historical-data acquisition. 8. A dated, signed or otherwise attributable technical assessment. An evidence-supported HOLD or FAIL outcome is acceptable. We require an objective professional assessment, not a predetermined approval. ## Important Project Conditions - This is initially an **offline, read-only audit**. - No access to private API credentials or server passwords. - No market-data downloads or live trading. - No cloud execution or model training. - No unnecessary repetition of already accepted tests. - No modifications to existing accepted code without prior approval. - All project materials must remain confidential. The existing system must not be redesigned or simplified without explicit authorization. ## Preferred Qualifications - Strong professional Python experience. - REST API and ETL pipeline development. - Independent source-code review and software testing. - Data engineering and provenance verification. - Linux, filesystem security, logging, and recovery. - Experience with financial market data is highly desirable. - Ability to deliver a documented independent technical assessment. ## Budget and Engagement This is a **fixed-scope, preferably fixed-price assignment**. A complete technical review package is available, including source code, documentation, previous verification results, and audit decision templates. Please provide: - Relevant experience with similar independent audits. - Estimated time required. - Proposed fixed-price quotation. - Availability and expected delivery schedule. - Any essential additional information required. **We are looking for a reliable independent assessment that allows us to proceed toward historical data acquisition and scientific research without unnecessary redevelopment or delays.**', 1, 'FIXED', 14208000.00, 14208000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('f4a6664a-7b91-57b1-88c1-7c7cf7bb2154', '83c3fdbc-fc15-5357-9b9c-9623d300c44d', 'Production Support Engineer (Databricks, DBT, Snowflake, SQL, Python, AWS S3, Aurora/MySQL, CDC)', 'Job Description: Data Platform Production Support Engineer (Databricks, DBT, Snowflake, SQL, Python, Spark, AWS S3, Aurora/MySQL, CDC) Work Location: 100% Remote Role Type: Offshore Production Support / On-Call Incident Response Engagement Model: Part-Time, Shared Support Work Schedule: Monday–Friday, 4:00 AM–2:00 PM Eastern Time Technologies: Databricks, DBT, Snowflake, SQL, Python, Spark, AWS S3, Aurora/MySQL, CDC Role Overview We are seeking a Data Platform Production Support Engineer with hands-on experience supporting modern data platforms. The ideal candidate will troubleshoot production data pipelines, monitor workflows, investigate failures, recover jobs, execute backfills, and implement minor operational fixes through established CI/CD processes. This is a shared, part-time production support engagement, not a dedicated full-time position. The engineer will work with the offshore delivery team and coordinate with the onshore lead to ensure timely incident handling, service continuity, and effective knowledge transfer. Key Responsibilities Monitor production data pipelines, Databricks Workflows, and PagerDuty alerts. Investigate and troubleshoot failures across Databricks, dbt, Snowflake, and SQL-based data pipelines. Perform job recovery, reruns, and backfills to restore normal operations. Diagnose pipeline failures using Python and Spark where required. Implement minor operational fixes through existing GitHub, CircleCI, and Databricks Asset Bundles workflows. Support data pipelines involving AWS S3, Aurora/MySQL, and Change Data Capture (CDC). Manage incidents from initial investigation through service restoration or a clear handoff to the appropriate engineering team. Escalate production pipeline issues if a solution is not identified within 15 minutes. Maintain incident tickets, operational documentation, and runbooks. Complete end-of-window handoffs with the onshore lead, communicating incident status, outstanding issues, and required follow-up actions. Required Skills and Experience Hands-on experience troubleshooting Databricks Workflows, dbt, and Snowflake. Strong SQL skills for data pipeline troubleshooting and diagnosis. Working knowledge of Python and Spark for investigating data-processing failures. Working knowledge of AWS S3, Aurora/MySQL, and CDC-based data pipelines. Familiarity with GitHub, CircleCI, and Databricks Asset Bundles. Experience monitoring production workloads, investigating incidents, recovering failed jobs, and executing backfills. Understanding of production support practices, incident escalation, ticket management, and runbook maintenance. Ability to work independently, prioritize incidents, and communicate effectively with distributed engineering teams. Support Schedule and Coverage Coverage: Monday–Friday, 4:00 AM–2:00 PM Eastern Time. Coverage model: Shared support availability across the delivery team. Handoff: End-of-window handoff to the onshore lead. Monthly operations capacity: 20-30 hours', 1, 'HOURLY', 258000.00, 387000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('0c2b277e-349d-5d98-975c-4fad4c809ce3', 'f5eb2708-98fe-5160-9ed5-b4ab984f3bc3', 'Databricks Developer', 'Looking for a Data Engineer/Analyst who has experience with Databricks. Experience with PostgreSQL and AWS cloud is an added advantage. No agencies...', 1, 'HOURLY', 155000.00, 310000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('cb18e504-c39c-5e96-bcc1-104f43ca720a', '1a6c4506-4200-538d-a809-727dd31a8f63', 'Cần freelancer Việt Nam làm Portal B2B bằng Softr + Airtable cho doanh nghiệp nail', 'Công việc cần làm 1. Dựng portal trên nền tảng Softr (không cần code), gồm: Trang Sign In / Sign Up dành cho đại lý Trang Dashboard (thống kê đại lý, thông báo, nút đặt hàng) Trang Products (danh mục sản phẩm + giá sỉ + tồn kho) Trang Place Order (đại lý nhập số lượng theo SKU để đặt đơn) Trang Order History (lịch sử đơn hàng + trạng thái) Trang Resources (download catalog, hình ảnh, SDS…) 2. Kết nối portal với database Airtable hoặc Google Sheet, gồm 4 bảng: Dealers Products Orders Order_Items 3. Thiết kế giao diện (UI) sạch, chuyên nghiệp theo chuẩn B2B – màu xanh – trắng – xám, giống dashboard của Shopify. 4. Thiết lập phân quyền đại lý (đại lý chỉ xem được đơn của họ) 5. Chạy test toàn bộ flow đặt đơn → lưu vào database → hiển thị lịch sử đơn.', 1, 'FIXED', 3000000.00, 10000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('3982217a-e827-542d-a1dd-0c44650b4082', '29ffce26-66d3-5a4b-b30d-13c1d8a37f46', 'Data analyst/BI expert to help automate a series of analytics reports', 'Looking for someone who can help with turning raw and scattered data into great dashboards.', 1, 'HOURLY', 904000.00, 1937000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('18bd9307-1d3a-5e75-b4ac-1b815b72dc9b', 'c1572adb-3a65-5ac2-af95-1b5b94b4b41d', 'Senior Data Analyst Needed', 'We are seeking a senior data analyst to support our team with complex data analysis, reporting, and insights. The ideal candidate will have experience working with large datasets, translating business needs into actionable recommendations, and collaborating with cross-functional teams. You will be responsible for analyzing data, identifying trends, and delivering clear reports that help drive decision-making. This is a part-time opportunity for someone who can work independently and contribute to ongoing data projects with accuracy and efficiency.', 1, 'FIXED', 258000.00, 258000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('d3ce428e-d659-528b-a640-79ea0327bedb', '2596f3e2-741e-51b2-a010-bf056c2bdf01', 'Website Analytics Rockstar', 'Spacebox Web Data Analytics Specialist Freelance / Contract · Hong Kong preferred · Cantonese preferred About the engagement Spacebox is looking for a hands-on specialist to make our website, blog, and other landing pages’ data reliable and actionable. Our measurement stack includes GA4 and Mixpanel, with GA4 data connected to BigQuery & Google Search Console. We also use HubSpot, Typeform, and WATI across our lead journeys. The goal is to establish a dependable tracking layer, document what is measured and how, and deliver live reporting that helps Product and Marketing understand acquisition, conversion, user behavior journeys, and drop-off across our digital surfaces. Key questions we’d like accurate answers for: For each web-based funnel (Website/ Blog/ Unbounce Landing Pages etc.): - How do we make sense of the data we have at the moment? - What is the daily/weekly/monthly traffic volume, broken down by New vs Returning? - What is the source of the traffic volume - Paid vs Organic, each further clearly broken down by campaign and medium values - How do we filter out test, returning and other traffic groups that may not be relevant as potential new leads? - What % of the potential new lead traffic clicked on a specific CTA, including proper CTA and event naming conventions? - What % of potential new lead traffic actually submitted a CTA? - How do we reliably pass as much metadata as possible to track WATI and Typeform Leads, and if possible Phone calls originating from a web page? - What is the drop-off rate across various pages/ funnels? What you’ll do - Audit and clarify the current data - Review GA4, Mixpanel, BigQuery, existing dashboards, campaign/UTM conventions, and relevant lead sources. - Identify why key numbers differ, where traffic is classified as “Unassigned,” and which events or properties are missing or duplicated. - Recommend a clear source of truth for each metric, with known limitations and confidence levels documented. - Distinguish test, employee/internal, bot, sales-created, duplicate, existing-customer, and potential-new-lead activity. - Keep “new vs. returning” visible as a useful segmentation rather than automatically excluding all returning visitors. - Build a consistent tracking plan - Create a documented event and property dictionary covering event names, definitions, trigger points, required properties, platform mappings, and QA steps. - Align GA4 and Mixpanel tracking so acquisition reporting and user-level journey analysis can be compared appropriately. - Establish consistent campaign, source, medium, landing-page, language, and funnel naming conventions. - Define a practical process for testing events and recording future tracking changes. - Improve lead attribution - Assess how to pass useful campaign and journey metadata from web pages into Typeform and WATI, and onward to HubSpot where applicable. - Investigate whether web-originating phone calls can be attributed reliably with our current setup
INSERT INTO job (id, project_id, title, description, quantity, salary_type, budget_min, budget_max, status, created_at, updated_at)
VALUES
    ('b8875df7-e88c-5168-abe4-246e1259c00a', 'b5849f81-60f6-5d40-825d-cb42d56cf7c8', 'Multi-Device Mobile Game Crowdtesting & First-Time User Experience (FTUE) Study (25-35 Testers)', 'We are an award-winning digital learning studio seeking a Crowdtesting Coordinator, Beta Testing Lead, or Mobile Game QA Team Manager who manages a panel of 25–35 distinct, real human playtesters (each using their own personal physical iOS/iPadOS or Android device) to conduct a structured First-Time User Experience (FTUE), 48-hour retention, and post-play player sentiment study across our 6-title educational game & interactive media catalog over a staggered 6-week schedule. (Note: Exact product titles and download links will be shared with selected candidates upon onboarding via our shared Google Sheet tracker.) IMPORTANT — TEAM / PANEL REQUIREMENT: We are NOT looking for a single QA engineer testing alone on multiple lab devices. Because the purpose of this study is measuring authentic First-Time User Experience (FTUE), real-world device telemetry, 48-hour Day-2 install retention, and post-play player sentiment across a diverse cohort of real consumers, you MUST be able to coordinate 25–35 separate real people using their own personal physical mobile/tablet devices. PROJECT & BUDGET STRUCTURE ($1,000 TOTAL CAP ACROSS 3 STAGGERED 2-WEEK MILESTONES) Total project budget is capped at $1,000 USD across 3 two-week waves (approx. $330–$350 per 2-week milestone, or hourly equivalent strictly capped at $1,000 total): • Milestone 1 (Weeks 1–2): - 2 Mobile Educational Simulation/Strategy Games (iOS & Android) • Milestone 2 (Weeks 3–4): - 3 Interactive History Apps & Digital Publications (iOS, iPadOS, Android) • Milestone 3 (Weeks 5–6): - 1 Web/VR Historical Experience + 2 Companion Interactive Media Series REQUIRED 2-PART DELIVERABLE FOR EVERY TESTER (REAL-DEVICE PLAYTEST PROTOCOL) 1. Part A — Verified 25–30 Minute Live Gameplay Session + Telemetry Log: - Each tester installs the assigned live title on their personal physical device and completes a 25–30 minute first-time play session (finishing Chapter 1 / Mission 1). - Each tester submits: (a) 2 timestamped in-game progress screenshots proving real gameplay completion, and (b) a 3-bullet UX / bug / device-performance log in our shared Google Sheet tracker. 2. Part B — 48-Hour Day-2 Retention Check & Written Post-Play Player Experience Summary: - Each tester keeps the application installed on their personal device for at least 48 hours (Day-2 retention check) and completes a short (2–4 sentence) authentic written Post-Play Player Experience & Sentiment Summary referencing specific gameplay mechanics they experienced, following the step-by-step completion checklist in our shared Google Sheet tracker. 3. Strict Staggered Drip Schedule (2–3 Testers Per Day): - Testers must be scheduled at a natural staggered pace of 2–3 testers per day across each 2-week wave (never all on the same day), using 100% real physical devices (zero emulators, zero bots, zero VPN spoofing). TO APPLY: Please confirm in your proposal: 1. How many distinct human playtesters (on separate personal iOS, iPadOS, and Android physical devices) you can coordinate across each 2-week wave. 2. That you can manage both Part A (25–30 min gameplay + 2 timestamped screenshots) and Part B (48-hour retention + written Post-Play Player Experience Summary per our Google Sheet tracker checklist) on a staggered 2–3 testers/day schedule. 3. Confirmation that the $1,000 total budget cap across the 3 milestones ($330–$350 per 2-week wave) works for your team.', 1, 'FIXED', 25832000.00, 25832000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('1cc1ae56-c1c4-5f2c-a058-be88d10c9690', '00e69ab8-61ae-547c-92bb-7250826eaea1', 'Tìm các dự án AI hoặc game có sẵn demo/MVP để mua lại và phát triển tiếp', 'Mình đang tìm các sản phẩm AI, game, web app hoặc tool hữu ích đã có demo, MVP hoặc bản chạy thử sử dụng được để mua lại source code hoặc hợp tác phát triển tiếp. Không giới hạn ý tưởng, chỉ cần sản phẩm có giá trị với người dùng, có khả năng thương mại hóa và có thể bàn giao source code rõ ràng. Ưu tiên các sản phẩm thuộc lĩnh vực AI, automation, game mobile/web, mini SaaS hoặc các công cụ có tính ứng dụng thực tế. Khi ứng tuyển, vui lòng gửi: tên sản phẩm, mô tả ngắn, link demo/video demo, công nghệ sử dụng, tính năng đã có, tình trạng source code, hình thức bàn giao, mức giá mong muốn và thời gian bàn giao. Không nhận source code không chạy được, sản phẩm vi phạm bản quyền, tool spam/scam/hack/cheat hoặc dự án không rõ quyền sở hữu. Ngân sách linh hoạt theo chất lượng sản phẩm và mức độ hoàn thiện.', 1, 'FIXED', 1000000.00, 50000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('8229e473-d504-5dea-bb96-367ee19c4c71', 'c58b47d0-8d68-5dac-9010-b25827de3899', 'AI Training Platform Software Engineers', 'We are seeking experienced Software Engineers with hands-on experience working on AI training platforms, data annotation projects, and Large Language Model (LLM) evaluation workflows. The ideal candidate has completed projects or worked as an AI coding expert, software engineering evaluator, AI trainer, or technical annotator through platforms such as DataAnnotation, Handshake, AfterQuery, Mercor, Outlier, micro1, or similar AI training companies. We are particularly interested in engineers who understand how to evaluate AI-generated code, solve complex programming problems, review technical responses, and improve the quality, accuracy, and reliability of AI models. This opportunity is ideal for engineers who combine strong software development skills with practical experience in AI training, coding assessments, and LLM evaluation. Key Responsibilities - Complete and evaluate software engineering tasks used to train and improve AI models. - Review AI-generated code for correctness, efficiency, readability, security, and adherence to best practices. - Solve complex programming challenges and provide high-quality reference solutions. - Evaluate AI model responses to coding, debugging, system design, and software architecture questions. - Identify errors, edge cases, logical inconsistencies, and weaknesses in AI-generated solutions. - Write clear technical explanations, code reviews, and structured feedback. - Create, validate, or improve coding problems, test cases, rubrics, and evaluation criteria. - Work with programming languages, frameworks, databases, APIs, and development tools relevant to your expertise. - Follow project guidelines, quality standards, and deadlines while maintaining accuracy and consistency. Required Qualifications - Professional experience as a Software Engineer, Full-Stack Engineer, Backend Engineer, Frontend Engineer, or related technical role. - Demonstrated hands-on experience with at least one AI training, coding evaluation, or data annotation platform, such as DataAnnotation, Handshake, AfterQuery, Mercor, Outlier, micro1, or an equivalent service. - Strong programming and debugging skills in one or more languages, such as Python, JavaScript/TypeScript, Java, C++, Go, or C#. - Experience reviewing, testing, debugging, or evaluating code written by other developers or AI systems. - Solid understanding of algorithms, data structures, software engineering principles, and testing methodologies. - Ability to explain technical concepts clearly and identify subtle errors in code. - Strong written communication, attention to detail, and independent problem-solving skills. Preferred Qualifications - Experience contributing to AI coding, LLM training, model evaluation, or reinforcement learning from human feedback (RLHF) projects. - Experience writing prompts, assessing model outputs, ranking responses, or creating evaluation rubrics. - Familiarity with automated testing, unit testing, integration testing, and code quality tools. - Experience with APIs, databases, cloud services, distributed systems, or full-stack application development. - Experience evaluating AI-generated solutions for correctness, performance, maintainability, and security. - A portfolio, sample work, or verifiable description of relevant AI training projects. Application Requirements - Please include the following information in your proposal: 1. Professional Background: Briefly describe your software engineering experience, including your primary programming languages, frameworks, and technical specialties. 2. AI Training Platform Experience: Which platforms have you worked with? Please specify DataAnnotation, Handshake, AfterQuery, Mercor, Outlier, micro1, or any other relevant platforms. Project Types: What types of tasks have you completed? Examples include coding evaluations, AI response ranking, code generation, debugging, software engineering assessments, data annotation, and LLM evaluation. 3. Experience Duration: Approximately how long have you been working on AI training or coding evaluation projects? 4. Technical Expertise: Which programming languages and technical areas can you confidently evaluate or work with? 5. Availability: How many hours per week can you commit, and what is your general availability? NOTE: My minimum expectation is 8 hours/day, and you also need to work on weekends if possible 6. Relevant Experience: Share a brief example of a challenging technical task you completed as part of an AI training or evaluation project. Do not share confidential project materials or proprietary assessment content. - Engagement Details Job Type: Contract / Freelance Work Arrangement: Remote Experience Level: Intermediate to Expert Project Duration: To be discussed based on project requirements and candidate fit Workload: Flexible, depending on availability and project needs How to Apply If you have strong software engineering skills and practical experience with AI training platforms, we would like to hear from you. Please submit a proposal answering all seven application questions above. Candidates with relevant hands-on experience, strong technical judgment, and a demonstrated ability to evaluate AI-generated code will receive priority consideration. We are looking for engineers who can demonstrate both real software development expertise and a clear understanding of AI training and evaluation workflows.', 1, 'HOURLY', 258000.00, 517000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('2497a9b5-6677-552e-8671-2da4f55bdaf9', 'e8bf189c-7e28-5d7d-8120-ea72fb4546d2', 'AI Automation Engineers & AI Platform Developers Needed for Ongoing Work', 'We are an Arizona-based company looking to expand our services and build long-term relationships with skilled engineers specializing in AI automation, AI-powered applications, software platforms, and custom AI solutions. We regularly work with software companies, app developers, and businesses looking to integrate AI into their products and workflows. As we scale our services, we are looking for reliable technical professionals who can support us with ongoing projects. **Areas of Expertise We Need:** - AI automation and workflow development - AI agents and AI-powered tools - AI platform integration and API development - Custom AI applications and software solutions - Integration with existing apps, SaaS platforms, and business systems - Process automation and system optimization **What We Are Looking For:** - Strong technical problem-solving skills - Hands-on experience with relevant AI tools, platforms, and technologies - Ability to understand project requirements and recommend practical solutions - Good communication and dependable delivery - Availability for recurring projects and long-term collaboration **How to Apply:** Please briefly describe your core expertise, the AI platforms and technologies you work with, and the types of projects you can handle. Include relevant project examples or work samples. We are interested in building a reliable network of engineers for ongoing collaboration, not just hiring for a single project.', 1, 'FIXED', 77496000.00, 77496000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('150ffcd3-4d69-59a8-865e-54f720a5cb44', '9b75006a-89b7-5aa7-892d-34464210eed5', 'AI Automaion Expert / Data Science & AI ML Engineer', 'AI Automation Expert | Data Science, Machine Learning & AI-Powered Workflows Project Overview We are looking for a skilled **AI Automation Expert with strong experience in Data Science, Artificial Intelligence (AI), and Machine Learning (ML)** to design, develop, and implement intelligent automation solutions that streamline business operations, reduce manual work, and improve decision-making. The ideal candidate should be able to understand real-world business challenges and translate them into practical, scalable AI-powered solutions. You should have hands-on experience building automation workflows, integrating AI models and third-party APIs, processing and analyzing data, and deploying machine learning solutions that deliver measurable business value. Key Responsibilities **1. AI-Powered Workflow Automation** - Design and build intelligent workflows to automate repetitive, time-consuming business processes. - Connect different applications, databases, APIs, and business tools to create seamless automation pipelines. - Use AI to automate tasks such as document processing, data extraction, classification, summarization, report generation, and information handling. - Identify opportunities to replace manual processes with reliable, efficient automation systems. 2. AI Agents and Large Language Models (LLMs) - Develop AI agents and AI assistants that can understand requests, retrieve information, and perform specific tasks. - Integrate LLMs such as OpenAI GPT and other suitable AI models into business workflows. - Build retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) systems that allow AI applications to answer questions using company documents, databases, or internal knowledge bases. - Implement appropriate safeguards, validation, and error handling to improve the reliability of AI-generated outputs. **3. Data Science and Machine Learning** - Collect, clean, transform, and analyze structured and unstructured data. - Develop predictive models for forecasting, classification, customer behavior analysis, anomaly detection, and other business use cases. - Apply statistical analysis and machine learning techniques to identify patterns, trends, and actionable insights. - Evaluate model performance, improve accuracy where appropriate, and prepare models for practical deployment. **4. API Integration and System Development** - Integrate AI services, external APIs, databases, CRMs, and other business applications. - Build automation pipelines using tools such as n8n, Make, Zapier, or Python-based solutions, depending on project requirements. - Develop custom scripts and backend components where standard automation tools are insufficient. - Ensure workflows are maintainable, secure, scalable, and properly documented. **5. Testing, Optimization, and Deployment** - Test workflows and models against real-world scenarios. - Monitor performance, troubleshoot errors, and optimize execution speed and cost. - Implement logging, exception handling, and human approval steps where necessary. - Document the solution and provide guidance for ongoing maintenance and future improvements. ## Required Skills and Experience - Strong practical experience in AI automation and workflow development. - Solid knowledge of Data Science, Machine Learning, and statistical analysis. - Proficiency in Python and relevant libraries such as pandas, NumPy, scikit-learn, or similar tools. - Experience working with LLM APIs, prompt engineering, and AI application frameworks. - Experience integrating REST APIs, webhooks, databases, and third-party services. - Familiarity with automation platforms such as n8n, Make, or Zapier. - Understanding of data cleaning, model evaluation, testing, and deployment. - Strong analytical and problem-solving skills, with the ability to translate business requirements into technical solutions. ## Nice to Have - Experience building AI agents, RAG pipelines, and document-processing systems. - Familiarity with vector databases and embedding models. - Experience with cloud platforms, Docker, and deploying AI applications. - Knowledge of business intelligence, forecasting, and predictive analytics. - Experience integrating AI solutions with CRM, ERP, marketing, sales, or customer-support systems. - Understanding of data privacy, security, and responsible AI practices. Expected Deliverables Depending on the project scope, deliverables may include: - A working AI automation workflow or AI-powered application. - Integrated APIs, AI models, and relevant business systems. - A predictive model or data analysis pipeline, where required. - Testing results and performance documentation. - Technical documentation, setup instructions, and handover support. How to Apply Please include the following in your proposal: 1. A brief overview of your experience with AI automation, Data Science, and Machine Learning. 2. Examples of similar projects you have completed, including your specific contribution and the results achieved. 3. The technologies and tools you would recommend for this type of work. 4. Your approach to understanding business requirements and developing a reliable solution. 5. Your availability, estimated timeline, and preferred pricing model. We value practical problem-solving, clear communication, and solutions that deliver measurable business outcomes. We are interested in building reliable AI systems that solve real problems—not just prototypes or demonstrations. Please share relevant portfolio projects or GitHub repositories where available.', 1, 'HOURLY', 491000.00, 517000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('2470607b-2bd5-531c-a7b0-72f878aca38e', '73f9ca6d-53d2-50e0-b831-194bc675a762', 'AI Architect required for Multi-Agent Workflow, Tenant Isolation & Cost Optimization', 'We run a high-volume commercial services and logistics business handling thousands of weekly requests across hundreds of client accounts and vendor networks. Our operations desk is bottlenecked by unstructured emails, quote requests, and status updates. We have an early prototype for an automated multi-agent workflow, but we need an experienced architect to solve three critical production hurdles: Token & Cost Spikes: Unbounded prompt loops and redundant LLM calls are driving up inference bills. Tenant Isolation: We manage competing client accounts and cannot risk rate sheets or proprietary data leaking across accounts in shared memory/vector stores. Agent Governance: Autonomous agents calling external internal APIs occasionally loop, fail schema validation, or execute actions without an audit trail. We need an Enterprise AI Systems Architect for a focused 8-hour paid architecture audit & scoping sprint. A successful sprint will lead directly to a fixed-price contract to build out the full system. Deliverables for the 8-Hour Sprint: Multi-Agent Routing & Guardrails: Map a deterministic supervisor-agent routing pattern (LangGraph / custom state machine) with loop limits and human-in-the-loop gates for external API calls. Tenant Segregation Blueprint: Define strict tenant data isolation in vector search (pgvector/Qdrant) and session memory so client data is cryptographically or namespace-partitioned. Cost Optimization & Caching Strategy: Specify model tiering (fast/low-cost models for routine parsing, frontier models for complex reasoning) and semantic caching to slash token spend. Phased Implementation Roadmap: Deliver a concise 1-page architecture schematic with fixed-bid milestones for our engineering team to execute. Stack Requirements: Custom Python & API-first backends (FastAPI, LangGraph/LlamaIndex, PostgreSQL/pgvector). Zapier/Make experience required - stateful execution, deterministic schema validation, and full code ownership. To Apply, Answer Directly: How do you technically enforce tenant isolation in vector search to prevent cross-account leaks? What guardrail do you use to stop autonomous multi-agent loops from runaway API and token costs? State your fixed price or hourly rate for this 8-hour sprint.', 1, 'HOURLY', 1033000.00, 1808000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('577156f0-e9c1-525d-b058-5e5448ad6c3b', 'd8341e22-87f9-554e-ac2a-0e6b8348f990', 'Build a semi-autonomous AI sales agent with Claude Code', 'ABOUT US Glenso is a young Dutch company that places engineers and technicians from South Africa with technical companies in the Netherlands (energy infrastructure, installation, machine building, shipbuilding). We also run a remote drafting team in Cape Town. We sell B2B, mostly to Dutch companies, and we need a steady flow of qualified sales conversations. WHAT WE WANT An AI sales agent built on Anthropic''s Claude (Claude Code / Claude Agent SDK) that does the sales legwork every working day: - finds companies that need our people (open vacancies, new projects, our own lists) - identifies the decision-makers and their verified business contact details - researches what the person and the company published online (LinkedIn posts, articles, interviews, talks, company news, projects) and turns it into personalisation hooks - writes short, personal emails and follow-up sequences in Dutch and English - sends approved emails from our Microsoft 365 / Outlook mailbox - follows up, reads and sorts replies, drafts answers and proposes meeting times - logs everything in a CRM and sends me a daily briefing and a weekly report SEMI-AUTONOMOUS The agent runs on a schedule and does all research and writing on its own. In version 1 I approve every first email with one click before it goes out. Autonomy must be adjustable per step, so we can later let it send follow-ups and handle simple replies by itself. REFERENCE This video shows the kind of Claude Code setup we like as a starting point: a set of Claude Code skills for company research, decision-maker mapping and cold outreach. https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JqXkPlX_4gQ We want that idea production-ready: connected to our mailbox and CRM, running on a schedule, with an approval step, Dutch-language output, and compliant with Dutch and EU rules (GDPR and the Dutch rules on commercial email). MUST-HAVE SKILLS - Agents built with Claude: Claude Code (skills, subagents, headless mode), Agent SDK, Anthropic API, tool use and MCP servers. Please show us something you built. - Microsoft Graph API: Outlook mail and calendar, Entra app registration, OAuth. - Web research and scraping pipelines (Playwright, Firecrawl or similar) and data enrichment APIs (Apollo, Hunter, Lusha, Kaspr or similar). - Python or TypeScript, scheduled jobs, simple cloud hosting in the EU, logging. - Email deliverability: SPF, DKIM, DMARC, warm-up, sending limits. - Working knowledge of GDPR for B2B outreach. Dutch is a plus, not a must. DELIVERABLES - A working agent running in our own accounts (Anthropic, Microsoft 365, CRM, hosting) - Source code in our GitHub repository
INSERT INTO job (id, project_id, title, description, quantity, salary_type, budget_min, budget_max, status, created_at, updated_at)
VALUES
    ('3876048b-31fa-5be3-8998-9b52b4e07b47', '6b6b849d-cb06-555d-9b51-eed83ea9a78c', 'CONTENT SÁNG TẠO NỘI DUNG VÀ QUẢN LÝ FANPAGE CHO DOANH NGHIỆP', 'Viết content, quản lý fanpage, sáng tạo nội dung số. Phối hợp với khách hàng để điều chỉnh nội dung theo phản hồi, đảm bảo bài đăng phù hợp với hình ảnh thương hiệu và nhóm khách hàng mục tiêu. Đề xuất hướng nội dung mới nhằm giúp fanpage duy trì sự chuyên nghiệp, đều đặn và có tính kết nối với người theo dõi. Yêu cầu sản phẩm bàn giao: - Nội dung cần đúng chủ đề, đúng định hướng được cung cấp. - Bài viết có bố cục rõ ràng, dễ đọc, phù hợp với nền tảng đăng tải. - Nội dung đảm bảo tính chỉn chu, không sử dụng thông tin thiếu căn cứ hoặc câu chữ dễ tạo kỳ vọng sai lệch. - Bàn giao đúng thời gian, có thể chỉnh sửa hợp lý theo phản hồi của khách hàng.', 1, 'FIXED', 500000.00, 1000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('a9346f1d-ca4f-5dde-8e74-4805d3de594f', '78994709-4499-5885-81a8-5528539d09ee', 'Tuyển Dev Build Web Nội Bộ Cho Team AI Content', 'Hi ae, bên mình đang cần tìm 1 bạn dev/freelancer hoặc team nhỏ để build web nội bộ cho startup AI content. Bên mình làm về AI Newsletter, AI Tutorials và AI Video Content, team có Writers, Creators, Leader, có cả remote và offline. Mục tiêu là build một hệ thống để team có thể: - Tracking tiến độ công việc hằng ngày. - Quản lý task theo Writers / Creators. - Check-in đầu ngày, báo cáo cuối ngày, review theo tuần. - Theo dõi task urgent, task quá hạn, task đang chờ feedback. - Có dashboard tổng quan để leader/founder dễ follow-up. Mình đã có sẵn brief bằng tiếng Việt, gồm scope, flow vận hành, UI/UX direction và yêu cầu bàn giao. Bạn nào từng làm web app nội bộ, dashboard, task management, CRM mini, internal tools thì apply, mình sẽ gửi brief để estimate thời gian và báo giá. P/S: Ưu tiên bạn/team quen build nhanh bằng AI coding tools như Cursor, Claude Code, v0, Lovable, Windsurf… nhưng vẫn hiểu fullstack cơ bản, database, auth, deploy và bàn giao source code sạch.', 1, 'FIXED', 3000000.00, 20000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('5d242e84-67f1-5386-a7a6-4e8f04b183b7', 'cd52aee2-227c-50af-aca2-3c4c22c97245', 'Tìm và annotate các dữ liệu cho các class thuộc PPE như Gloves, Harness, Shoes,...', '1. Mô tả công việc: Tìm kiếm thông tin, hình ảnh và thông số kỹ thuật của các sản phẩm Thiết bị bảo hộ lao động (PPE) như: Dây đai an toàn (Harness), Găng tay (Gloves),... trên Internet. Trích xuất và nhập các dữ liệu tìm được (tên, mô tả, chất liệu, tiêu chuẩn an toàn,...) vào file Excel hoặc Google Sheets theo form có sẵn. 2. Yêu cầu: Có máy tính cá nhân, sử dụng thành thạo Excel/Google Sheets. Kỹ năng tìm kiếm thông tin bằng tiếng Việt và tiếng Anh tốt. Cẩn thận, tỉ mỉ và có trách nhiệm với số liệu (vì đặc thù đồ bảo hộ cần thông số chính xác). Điểm cộng: Biết sử dụng các công cụ cào dữ liệu (Web scraping) hoặc đã từng làm data sản phẩm. 3. Quyền lợi: Thu nhập: Khoán theo dự án, Thoả thuận. Cần gấp nên rất thoải mái deal Thời gian làm việc tự do, 100% online nhưng ưu tiên người ở Đà Nẵng Được hướng dẫn cụ thể trước khi bắt đầu công việc.', 1, 'FIXED', 3000000.00, 10000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('343c9bf8-74b2-5f8f-931e-9005e8b1fb89', 'da070d23-b41b-56a6-a938-d6d3c4f0c17e', 'Thiết kế và lập trình vòng tay thông minh tích hợp Gemini AI Live', 'Mục tiêu: Phát triển sản phẩm MVP vòng tay thông minh mỏng nhẹ, không màn hình, có khả năng giao tiếp thời gian thực với AI Gemini Live. Phạm vi công việc: - Tư vấn và lựa chọn linh kiện phù hợp (ESP32 hoặc chip tương đương) đảm bảo tiêu chí mỏng nhẹ và tiết kiệm năng lượng. (Người thuê sẽ chịu tri phí mua phần cứng) - Lập trình Firmware điều khiển, tích hợp API Gemini Live AI. - Tối ưu hóa hệ thống thu âm, lọc nhiễu để đảm bảo chất lượng đàm thoại rõ ràng. - Thiết kế giải pháp đóng gói đảm bảo tiêu chuẩn chống nước.', 1, 'FIXED', 5000000.00, 6000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('facfd9cc-e6b2-50cc-b8b3-60d06f17b401', 'efe0ff71-aa27-5622-89fc-24d5d3a61290', 'Tìm Lập Trình Viên Nuxt 3 & Node.js: Triển Khai TikTok Pixel + CAPI', 'System LMS đang vận hành trên nền tảng Nuxt 3 (SSR/Vue 3) và Backend Node.js (Express / TypeScript). Hiện tại hệ thống đã triển kiến trúc Meta Tracking (Pixel + CAPI). Toàn bộ kiến trúc đã có sẵn 2...', 1, 'FIXED', 1500000.00, 2000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('e0afb118-6eca-5401-aa37-3039192a3185', '2f0d2a9c-b9c0-5675-bc89-403243c155a5', 'Law Firm Seeking AI Automation & Systems Integration Specialist: Ongoing, As-Needed Support', 'We’re an immigration and personal injury law firm looking for a reliable remote technology partner to help improve how our systems work together and troubleshoot issues as they arise. Our first priority is replacing our current website chatbot with a better solution. Beyond that, we’d like to build an ongoing relationship with someone we can turn to for automations, integrations, and general technical support. **Initial project: Website chatbot replacement** - Review our current chatbot, how it’s used, and what we need it to do. - Recommend and implement a replacement that supports prospective client inquiries and intake. - Connect it with the appropriate systems so inquiries reach the right place and follow-up happens reliably. - Test the setup and provide clear documentation so we can manage it going forward. **Other projects and support may include:** - Building and maintaining automations that reduce manual work. - Connecting software through APIs, webhooks, and tools such as Zapier or Make. - Troubleshooting business phone systems, call routing, and related integrations. - Helping with website updates and technical issues. - Verifying that website forms, calls, and other leads are being tracked correctly so we can understand which advertising efforts generate inquiries. - Recommending practical uses of AI that improve day-to-day operations. **Who we’re looking for** Someone with a strong background in APIs, systems integration, automation, and troubleshooting. You should be comfortable investigating an unfamiliar setup, explaining the options in plain English, and following an issue through to resolution. Experience with law firms, client intake, Clio, RingCentral, website chatbots, and advertising conversion tracking is a plus. Careful handling of confidential client information is essential. We don’t expect one person to specialize in everything, but we do need someone who can identify what they can handle directly and when another specialist is needed. **Working arrangement** This is an hourly, ongoing, as-needed role. Workload will vary, with specific projects and occasional troubleshooting requests. We’re looking for reasonable responsiveness during U.S. Eastern business hours and clear communication about availability and turnaround times. We should own the accounts, integrations, and documentation for anything implemented. **Please include in your proposal:** 1. An example of a chatbot or intake system you implemented and how it connected to other software. 2. An example of an API integration or automation you built, including how you handled failures. 3. Your experience with phone systems and lead/conversion tracking. 4. Your hourly rate, typical availability, and usual response time for support requests. Please describe your personal role in the examples you provide.', 1, 'HOURLY', 387000.00, 904000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('0d897cd8-fc6c-561b-90d2-672fc8de3b13', '244d77a5-d9a1-59a9-aebc-16eda7d2acaf', 'AI Trainers for Response Evaluation', 'We’re looking for AI trainers to evaluate AI responses, improve output quality, and support AI model training. You’ll review generated responses, identify issues, and help refine outputs to ensure accuracy and consistency. Strong analytical skills and attention to detail are essential. Previous AI training experience is a plus. This is a remote, freelance opportunity with competitive pay.', 1, 'HOURLY', 491000.00, 1033000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('5b11c6e6-2590-5884-ad84-28451029908b', 'fefbdbf4-50b5-56e6-b250-7703dec4a3c0', 'Technical Account Manager – AI Automation & Software Delivery', 'Remote | Long-term engagement | UK working hours About Opten Group Opten Group is a UK-based AI implementation company specialising in bespoke AI software, workflow automation and system integrations. We develop and manage solutions that connect existing business systems, automate operational processes and improve efficiency for our clients. As our client base grows, we’re looking for a Technical Account Manager to join our team on a long-term basis, working directly with our founders, clients and external development engineers. About the Role We need someone who combines excellent client communication skills with a strong technical understanding of software development, APIs, cloud infrastructure and AI automation. You’ll act as the main technical point of contact between Opten, our clients and our development team. Your role will involve managing day-to-day client requirements, attending meetings, helping scope new functionality, coordinating development work and ensuring technical issues are investigated and resolved efficiently. You’ll also provide practical technical support to our lead developer, including troubleshooting, testing and smaller development tasks where appropriate. This is not a sales role, traditional project management position or full-time developer role. We’re looking for somebody who can bridge the gap between clients and engineering while taking ownership of technical delivery. Key Responsibilities Client Management & Communication * Act as a primary technical contact for existing clients. * Attend client meetings, understand requirements and provide clear technical updates. * Explain technical issues, solutions and delivery timescales in straightforward business language. * Manage client expectations, priorities and outstanding requests. * Build strong relationships and maintain confidence in our delivery. Technical Scoping & Delivery * Translate business requirements into clear technical specifications for developers. * Assess feasibility, dependencies and approximate development effort. * Coordinate work with our existing development engineer. * Maintain visibility of development progress, outstanding actions and testing. * Support the scoping and implementation of new client projects. Technical Support & Troubleshooting * Investigate application errors, integration failures and issues affecting live client workflows. * Understand API requests, responses, logs and application behaviour. * Assist with monitoring and troubleshooting cloud-hosted applications, particularly AWS. * Conduct functional testing and validate changes before client handover. * Resolve straightforward technical issues independently where possible. * Assist with smaller code changes or development tasks when required. Essential Requirements * Excellent spoken and written English is mandatory. You must be fully comfortable leading meetings with UK clients, discussing technical requirements and producing professional written updates. * Previous experience in a Technical Account Manager, Technical Consultant, Technical Delivery Manager, Solutions Engineer or similar client-facing technical role. * Strong understanding of software applications, backend systems, APIs and cloud infrastructure. * Practical experience troubleshooting software or integration issues. * Experience working with software developers and translating client requirements into actionable technical tasks. * Understanding of AWS or comparable cloud hosting environments. * Ability to work independently, prioritise competing requests and take ownership of issues through to resolution. * Availability during UK business hours. Desirable Technical Experience * Experience with Python, JavaScript or TypeScript, with the ability to understand existing code and make smaller changes. * AI/LLM integrations and workflow automation. * REST APIs, webhooks and third-party system integrations. * Microsoft Graph API, Outlook integrations and CRM systems. * SFTP, document processing and data extraction. * Git, application logs, databases and deployment processes. We don’t expect you to be an expert in every technology, but you must be technically capable enough to investigate problems and work effectively alongside experienced software engineers. The Ideal Candidate We’re looking for someone who is technically confident, organised, proactive and particularly strong at communicating with clients. For example, if a client reports that an automation is updating records incorrectly, you should be able to understand the issue, investigate the technical cause, communicate the next steps, coordinate a fix with the developer where necessary and ensure the resolution is properly tested. You should be comfortable taking responsibility for an issue from the initial client conversation through to resolution. Working Arrangements * Fully remote, long-term position. * Initially part-time, with the potential to increase hours. * Must have regular availability during UK working hours. * Direct collaboration with Opten’s founders and existing developers. * Individual freelancers only, no agencies. How to Apply Please provide: 1. A brief summary of your experience managing technical client relationships and software delivery. 2. An example of a technical issue you’ve personally investigated and helped resolve. 3. Details of your experience with APIs, AWS, software integrations and development teams. 4. Your availability and proposed hourly rate. 5. A short video introduction in English (approximately 1–2 minutes) explaining your relevant experience and how you would approach managing technical requests from clients. Strong English communication skills and the ability to confidently lead client discussions are essential for this position. We’re looking for someone interested in becoming a dependable, long-term part of Opten’s technical delivery team.', 1, 'HOURLY', 387000.00, 775000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('f8e3ea2d-66a9-560f-a8aa-75ccbd9113f3', '25b9e3ae-9bb1-57bc-9acb-01aa4751d564', 'Flutter Developer for Stock Tickers Learning App (iOS + Android)', 'I am building a flashcard learning app called Stock Tickers. It teaches users the ticker symbols and company information for all 503 stocks in the S&P 500 index. Version 1 is a LEARNING APP ONLY - no game mode, no multiplayer, no accounts. A game mode may be added later as a separate phase. I will provide the complete card dataset (all 503 cards with company information) after an NDA is signed. WHAT I NEED: A Flutter app for both iOS and Android from one codebase, with a clean, professional design. The app must include: - Tap-to-flip flashcards (front: ticker symbol only
INSERT INTO job (id, project_id, title, description, quantity, salary_type, budget_min, budget_max, status, created_at, updated_at)
VALUES
    ('7473037a-9fde-585a-b698-4784a70c2fb6', 'd86fc847-6637-5bbe-a2fa-fe1bbd65b07e', 'Django Developer Needed for CRM Optimization, Google OAuth & Long-Term Work', 'I’m looking for an experienced Django developer to improve an existing CRM application. The project involves enhancing a few existing features, integrating Google authentication, and optimizing overall application performance. Requirements: At least 4+ years of hands-on Django development experience. Previous experience building or maintaining CRM applications or similar business management systems. Integrate Google OAuth authentication with the existing login system. Optimize slow Django views, database queries, and API response times. Improve existing features and resolve bugs without affecting current functionality. Review the existing codebase and suggest practical improvements where needed. Tech Stack: Django, Django REST Framework, PostgreSQL, Google OAuth. I’m looking for someone who can understand an existing codebase, identify performance bottlenecks, and implement clean, maintainable solutions rather than simply patching issues. Potential for Long-Term Collaboration This project may lead to ongoing work. If we’re a good fit, you understand the requirements well, and the initial improvements go smoothly, I’d be happy to continue working together on future CRM enhancements, new features, and performance improvements. When applying, please share: A brief overview of your Django experience. Examples of CRM or similar applications you’ve worked on. Your approach to Google authentication and Django performance optimization. Please apply only if you have relevant hands-on experience and can work confidently with an existing application.', 1, 'FIXED', 2583000.00, 2583000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('a5519632-d4c7-5eef-9dd7-f794b12ccf54', '8e2e86c4-cea0-5dbf-a9bb-f61f93d63e6c', 'Dựng lại mô hình IAM', 'tài liệu mô hình và giải thích cho IAM service cho ứng dụng Digibanking các hệ thống cần xác thực qua jwt bao gồm: hệ thống digibank, hệ thống back office, các core service gọi chéo nhau cần có phân quyền cần có sso cần có maker tạo yêu cầu phân quyền, cần có checker duyệt yêu cầu phân quyền Đầu ra bao gồm: UC Diagram, Class Diagram, Sequence Diagram và giải thích ( tài liệu sử dụng maimeid', 1, 'FIXED', 210000.00, 210000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('572c24b5-6eec-58fe-a25d-2cdacba4de0b', '91225600-4c26-57c9-b91a-d2fc622a7f72', 'Tạo ứng dụng iOS bảo mật xác thực MFA của Apple khi tải kho ứng dụng từ App Store.', 'Yêu cầu giao diện chi tiết, trong suốt, kết nối với cơ sở dữ liệu database, SQL server, máy điện thoại phải cập nhật lên phiên bản mới nhất để vá các lỗ hổng bảo mật, ứng dụng phải cập nhật phiên bản mới nhất từ App Store.', 1, 'FIXED', 5000000.00, 20000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('5fac3b54-ac5b-52f8-b51f-08d0456e835d', '578c1861-2880-5ec0-a680-1774fd6d8c7c', 'Senior Cybersecurity & IT Auditor', 'We are seeking an experienced cybersecurity and IT auditor to conduct an independent security and infrastructure review of our travel technology platform. The engagement will focus on application security, authentication, API and third-party integrations, database and sensitive data handling, hosting and infrastructure configuration, dependencies, vulnerabilities, logging, monitoring, backup readiness, and production operational risks. This is a read-only, non-disruptive audit with no penetration testing, exploitation, production changes, or live transactions unless separately authorized. Please include relevant certifications, audit experience, methodology, estimated timeline, and a fixed-price proposal.', 1, 'HOURLY', 517000.00, 1033000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('f685492a-d203-5271-a808-f360006451fd', 'bceaa25d-fcbb-532b-abc5-54b46e6b26db', 'pentesting audit - CREST accreditation required', 'About the engagement We want an independent penetration test of our multi-tenant SaaS platform, with results we can share with customers during their security due diligence. The platform runs AI agents that answer phone calls, website chat, WhatsApp and SMS for business customers. Each customer is a tenant, and each tenant has one or more branches. It processes personal data, including contact records, call recordings and transcripts. Our priority is proof that no tenant, branch or outside party can see or change another''s data, including by talking to our AI agents. The platform and what''s in scope All five components below are in scope. • Web application and admin panel (PHP / Laravel), behind login • REST API (PHP / Laravel), by API token • Website chat widget: AI agent, public, no login • WhatsApp and SMS agents: AI agent, public, reached by messaging our numbers • Voice AI service (Python / FastAPI): live phone calls, public, reached by calling our numbers Hosting is serverless on AWS with an Aurora MySQL database. Sign-in uses email and password with MFA (authenticator app or email code), plus Microsoft single sign-on. What we want tested Four areas, in priority order. 1. Tenant isolation and authorisation ◦ Cross-tenant access to records and settings through the web app, API and admin panel: conversations, recordings, transcripts, contacts, configuration ◦ Branch scoping inside a tenant: staff limited to one branch must not reach another branch''s data ◦ Role escalation across our three user roles, at both object and function level ◦ Leaks through exports, reports, dashboards, search and file downloads 2. Authentication and sessions ◦ Login, password reset, MFA enrolment and bypass, Microsoft SSO account linking ◦ Session handling, API token scope and revocation ◦ Standard OWASP checks (injection, XSS, CSRF) on the in-scope screens and endpoints 3. Public AI chat channels: website chat, WhatsApp, SMS ◦ Direct and indirect prompt injection ◦ Disclosure of system prompts, other customers'' data or another tenant''s data ◦ Aligned to the OWASP Top 10 for LLM Applications 4. Voice AI: phone calls ◦ Prompt injection and manipulation by voice ◦ Bypassing caller identity checks ◦ Calls go to staging numbers we provide, within an agreed call budget How testing works Testing is grey-box: you get accounts and documentation, but no source code. We''d rather your days go on finding issues than on mapping the app. We provide: • A staging environment in its own AWS account, mirroring production, with synthetic data only (no real personal data) • Two tenants, each with two branches, and accounts for every role in both • An API endpoint list and a role and permission matrix • Staging phone, WhatsApp and SMS numbers, and the staging chat widget • Agreed caps on AI and call usage for the test window • IP allow-listing for your source addresses, and a named escalation contact Who we''re looking for We prefer a CREST-accredited company. CREST-certified testers at a company that isn''t accredited can also apply. Say clearly which one you are. • CREST-accredited company: send your listing on the CREST Marketplace. The attestation letter must say "Performed by [your company], a CREST-accredited member company". • CREST-certified testers at a company that isn''t accredited: tell us the CREST certification each named tester holds (CRT, CCT APP or equivalent). The attestation letter must say "Performed by a CREST Registered Penetration Tester (CRT)", or the certification actually held. Accreditation applies to companies and certification to people. Claiming accreditation you don''t hold rules your proposal out, and we check the Marketplace. We also need: • Proven experience testing authorisation in multi-tenant SaaS • Hands-on LLM and prompt-injection testing
INSERT INTO job (id, project_id, title, description, quantity, salary_type, budget_min, budget_max, status, created_at, updated_at)
VALUES
    ('c31335ea-653c-570f-ae97-84aff3888036', '0004b1fb-5192-5fab-84c5-7aa95b643719', 'Full-Stack Website Developer | Customer Portal, Order Tracking & Landing Pages', '### About Us We are a growing digital marketing agency based in the United States looking for an experienced and affordable full-stack developer to help us deliver website and web application projects for our clients. We are currently exploring a project for a manufacturing company that is establishing its own independent online presence and needs a professional website, customer portal, and order management capabilities. We are looking for someone reliable, technically skilled, and interested in building a long-term working relationship with our agency. ### Project Overview The goal is to develop a professional, modern website with customer-facing functionality that allows the business to manage its online presence, customer interactions, and potentially its ordering process. **Potential Project Requirements:** **1. Website Development** - Professional, modern, responsive business website - Custom landing pages for different products and services - Mobile-friendly design - Contact forms and lead capture - Basic SEO optimization - Fast loading speeds and clean user experience **2. Customer Portal** - Secure customer login and registration - Customer account dashboard - Ability for customers to view orders and order history - Order status and tracking functionality - Potential order submission and management features - Integration with existing order management software where possible **3. Integrations** - CRM integration, preferably GoHighLevel - Third-party API integrations - Forms connected to CRM workflows - Potential payment and e-commerce integrations - Scalable backend architecture **4. Additional Functionality (Potential Future Phases)** - Affiliate and referral sales pages - Fundraising campaign landing pages - Customer-specific ordering pages - Additional automations and integrations These are preliminary requirements. The final project scope will be determined after further discussions with the client. ### What We''re Looking For - Proven experience in full-stack website development - Experience building secure customer portals and dashboards - Experience with order management systems or e-commerce functionality - Strong knowledge of APIs, databases, and backend integrations - Ability to recommend cost-effective development solutions - Good English communication skills - Reliable delivery and attention to detail - Competitive pricing and efficient development practices Experience integrating with GoHighLevel is a plus but not required. ### Budget & Working Relationship We are a growing agency working with budget-conscious clients, so cost efficiency is important. We are looking for someone who can deliver high-quality work at competitive rates without sacrificing reliability. We are open to discussing fixed-price milestones once the scope is finalized. This could lead to additional website development projects as our agency continues to grow. ### How to Apply Please include the following in your proposal: 1. Examples of websites or customer portals you have personally developed. 2. Your experience building order management or order-tracking systems. 3. The technologies and platforms you recommend for this type of project. 4. Your hourly rate and an estimated price range for a project of this nature, including your assumptions. 5. Your estimated development timeline. 6. Whether you are available for additional projects in the future. We are especially interested in developers who can suggest practical, affordable solutions rather than building unnecessary custom functionality. We look forward to reviewing your work and potentially developing a long-term partnership.', 1, 'HOURLY', 155000.00, 387000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('ce24ca57-21b0-54f5-8cbf-e3698477f7b5', 'ccdb00c4-73ad-53bb-950c-a6836f7597bb', 'Thiết kế landingpage Bất động sản', 'Tôi cần thiết kế một landing page để upload lên hosting và tên miền có sẵn, yêu cầu đẹp và giao diện chuyên nghiệp phù hợp để giới thiệu về dự án. Tôi cung cấp hình ảnh, logo đầy đủ', 1, 'FIXED', 200000.00, 500000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('d12ee530-607b-5617-910b-61d1a9a7eba3', 'dcd9f35b-8ce2-5afe-b4b9-69a287cd17ba', 'Chuyển thông tin pdf lên landingpage của website có sẵn', 'Mình cần đưa thông tin profile công ty lên trên landingpage để khách hàng dễ xem các dự án và quy trình thực hiện dự án. Số lượng dự án khoảng :20 landingpage mỗi landingpage khoảng 2 -3 page Ngân sách mình có 300-500k/landingpage', 1, 'FIXED', 300000.00, 500000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('5a7a3376-f575-5a96-a4bf-6cdc52e75cac', '8d795a3c-3e00-5a28-922a-baf9d05726f4', 'Thiết kế Landingpage bán hàng- thu thập data học thử miễn phí', 'làm tương tự như website này: https://www.hoangmanhcuong.com/', 1, 'FIXED', 1000000.00, 3000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('7a3a0158-16f3-55a3-acbc-80eda438be8b', '8d795a3c-3e00-5a28-922a-baf9d05726f4', 'Thiết kế lập trình Landingpage bán hàng- thu thập data học thử miễn phí', 'Thiết kế lập trình Landingpage bán hàng- thu thập data học thử miễn phí Tạo 1 landing page giống theo mẫu tương tự hoangmanhcuong.com Mục tiêu: - tăng tỷ lệ đăng ký học thử - thu thập data phụ huynh/học sinh - tối ưu chuyển đổi - giao diện tạo cảm giác uy tín, học thuật, hiện đại - phù hợp mobile trước tiên (mobile-first) Phong cách: - tối giản - sang trọng - hiện đại - màu chủ đạo Đỏ + trắng - typography rõ ràng - có animation nhẹ - chuẩn UI/UX hiện đại 2026 Landing page gồm các section: 1. Hero section - headline cực mạnh - subheadline - CTA đăng ký học thử miễn phí - hình ảnh học sinh học tập nghiêm túc - số liệu thành tích 2. Pain points Các vấn đề phụ huynh gặp: - học nhiều nhưng không hiểu bản chất - mất gốc - thiếu tư duy - học lệch - áp lực thi cử 3. Giải pháp - học theo tư duy - cá nhân hóa - AI hỗ trợ - theo dõi tiến bộ - luyện chuyên sâu 4. Thành tích học sinh - card before/after - điểm số - trường chuyên đỗ 5. Quy trình học - test đầu vào - phân lớp - học thử - theo dõi tiến bộ - thi thử 6. Feedback phụ huynh 7. FAQ 8. Form đăng ký Form gồm: - Họ tên phụ huynh - Số điện thoại - Họ tên học sinh - Lớp hiện tại - Mục tiêu - Nút đăng ký Yêu cầu kỹ thuật: - dùng React + TailwindCSS - responsive hoàn toàn - hiệu ứng mượt - loading nhanh - SEO tốt - code sạch - dễ deploy lên Vercel Tích hợp: - Google Sheets để lưu dữ liệu form - Google Apps Script API - gửi dữ liệu khi submit form - có validate form - thông báo submit thành công Viết luôn: 1. Frontend React code 2. Google Apps Script backend 3. hướng dẫn kết nối Google Sheet 4. hướng dẫn deploy Vercel 5. cấu trúc thư mục project Google Sheet columns: - Timestamp - ParentName - Phone - StudentName - Grade - Goal Sau khi submit: - hiện popup cảm ơn - tự động redirect tới Zalo OA/Facebook Messenger Bonus: - thêm floating CTA button - thêm sticky mobile CTA - thêm tracking Facebook Pixel - thêm Google Analytics - thêm schema SEO Output: - full source code production-ready - chia file rõ ràng - comment dễ hiểu - thiết kế chuyên nghiệp như startup edtech cao cấp', 1, 'FIXED', 2000000.00, 3000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('40514fc6-7978-5735-87c6-750bd68d0064', '7b10fba0-e5a8-58a2-ba5c-6e40c4e8e129', 'Nhận thiết kế Landing Page bán hàng chuẩn SEO, tối ưu tốc độ tải trang trên mọi thiết bị', 'Kỹ năng: SEO, Bán hàng, Bất động sản, code, Landing page, Zalo', 1, 'FIXED', 200000.00, 210000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('03dccdad-f4a2-5a12-a2f8-b50e52b6af1a', '73ea0a42-4380-58ae-b703-f259c461c96d', 'Outsource - Custom/Clone landing page', 'Sử dụng tốt framer & các công cụ AI khác để gen web , phong cách high-end, high-tech, animation mượt, chuyên nghiệp, section cơ bản , có kinh nghiệm 3D. Không cần backend, ko Cms sâu, ko SEO phức tạp Cung cấp : Concept,hình ảnh, reference trang đẹp để custom Tài khoản AI hỗ trợ gen hình ảnh, 3D,Spline, Midjourney, Framer.. Hợp tác lâu dài Budget theo sản phẩm yêu cầu Mỗi ngày sẽ có nhiều sản phẩm order tuỳ thuộc vào kinh nghiệm và chất lượng cv .', 1, 'FIXED', 200000.00, 700000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('ba054b38-8754-578c-94df-4486df5e684f', 'b17d632f-0a46-511d-83ce-c9749e73722a', 'Redesign Sydney Car Detailing Website', 'Polished Detailing is a mobile car detailing and ceramic coating business in Sydney. We need our existing WordPress website redesigned and restructured into a clean, premium, fast, conversion-focused site, built on strong SEO, local SEO and AI-search (GEO) foundations. We have a reference website in mind for the layout, structure and calls to action, which we’ll share with shortlisted freelancers. All of our text and images must be our own. Current pages: Home, Services, Ceramic Coating, Packages (currently at /specials-offers/), Contact Us, Blog. New structure Pages: Home, Car Detailing, Ceramic Coating, Contact Us, FAQs, Blog Please use these URLs: /car-detailing/, /ceramic-coating/, /contact-us/, /faqs/, /blog/ Main menu: Car Detailing | Ceramic Coating | Contact Us | FAQs | Blog. The logo links to Home, with no separate Home menu item A Book Online button in the header on every page, with a Call Now button alongside it Hero section on the Home page and service pages: a centred headline, our Google rating and review count, and Book Online and Call Now buttons, all visible without scrolling Merge our existing Services page and Packages page into the Car Detailing page (Interior, Exterior and Complete packages, prices by small, medium and large vehicle, and what’s included) Car Detailing and Ceramic Coating should work as landing pages: benefits, process, before-and-after photos, Google reviews, a short FAQ section linking to the full FAQs page, and repeated centred Book Online and Call Us Now sections Ceramic Coating pricing with a Standard / XL vehicle toggle FAQs page organised by: Car Detailing, Ceramic Coating, Mobile Service and Bookings, Pricing and Preparation Quote form only on the Contact Us page (“Get Your Free Quote”) The existing blog stays and is managed separately. Please keep all posts and their URLs intact, or 301 redirect any that change SEO and technical requirements SEO-friendly URLs, proper H1/H2 structure, unique title tags and meta descriptions, strong internal linking, canonical URLs 301 redirects from all old URLs, an updated XML sitemap, and a broken-link check Indexability and crawlability checks. Thank-you pages hidden from Google (noindex) Schema / structured data where relevant (local business, FAQ, reviews) A clear structure for AI search (GEO): Business → Services → Expertise → Customer questions Original content only, with no thin or duplicate pages Must-haves Keep our booking popup (FluentBooking with a Stripe deposit) working Google reviews: we’d like a vertically scrolling Google reviews widget with a centred heading above it. We’re open to replacing our current widget, as long as it’s lightweight and doesn’t slow the page Keep our Google Ads and Tag Manager tracking intact, with one tag container only and no duplicates Keep it on our current hosting (cPanel/LiteSpeed in Sydney), built on a staging copy first Please don’t change DNS records without checking with us, as we have separate subdomain landing pages for our Google Ads Handover with full admin access when finished Speed (important) Our site is currently slow, especially on mobile (PageSpeed score about 44 on mobile and about 68 on desktop). We’re aiming for a mobile score of 70 or more and a desktop score of 90 or more, mobile page weight under about 3 MB, compressed WebP images with lazy loading, no autoplaying YouTube embed, any hero video a short, compressed clip (a few MB at most) with a poster image, and no unnecessary plugins. WordPress, plugins and PHP have just been brought up to date and page caching is on, so please keep them current and send before-and-after PageSpeed results for both mobile and desktop. Content and platform We’ll supply some photos, videos and wording, and we’d like help with copy and photos where needed. WordPress and Elementor are preferred, but we’re open to your recommendation if you can explain why and if booking, payments and tracking keep working. Budget and timing: fixed price preferred, not hourly. Please quote your best price, what’s included, and split the work into milestones. We’re open to phasing the work if that suits you. No fixed deadline, but please give an estimated timeframe. Please include in your proposal Examples of similar WordPress / SEO projects Your experience with local SEO and GEO / AI search optimisation How you’ll keep the site fast on mobile and desktop Your fixed price, what’s included, and the milestones Your estimated timeframe Any ongoing support available after completion We’re looking for someone who can implement this structure and also give sensible SEO recommendations, not just build the pages exactly as instructed.', 1, 'FIXED', 10333000.00, 10333000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('36e08e8c-c9d8-5859-9527-ee3cc87cd473', 'ebd54b84-7cd8-52ce-a0a5-63bdefd95880', 'Redesign Chef Personal Website', 'I’m looking for a detail-oriented website designer to redesign a chef’s website. I want someone who can bring my ideas to life but also offer creative input and guidance where needed, rather than simply using a template. The overall style should be clean, minimal and editorial, with plenty of white space and a good balance between text and photography. I’d like one section to feel like a food magazine or editorial column, with thoughtfully designed layouts rather than a standard blog format. I prefer a more refined, understated look and don’t want oversized food photography dominating every page. Typography, spacing and the smaller details are just as important as the images. The website needs to be designed specifically for mobile, with a separate, considered layout for laptop and desktop rather than simply adapting the mobile or desktop version to fit.', 1, 'HOURLY', 77000.00, 258000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('3840fe29-d369-5f25-aa84-56e6095b3d47', '6734e713-3217-524a-b0e1-dc047b528b08', 'Website Redesign and Domain Transfer', 'I need help recreating my current website with a modern, user-friendly design and moving the existing domain to the new site. The current site is built in WordPress, but I find it difficult to make updates on my own, so I’d prefer a simpler platform that is easier to manage. The new site should include only a few standard pages and a working contact form. I also need assistance fixing any issues with the domain itself to ensure everything transfers smoothly.', 1, 'FIXED', 7750000.00, 7750000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('a81c66c4-5ea3-5464-a9b9-1f7801b43c57', '20ba8275-b1a0-54c7-a341-c722d9a6b197', 'Gymdesk Website Redesign', 'I’m looking for someone with experience working within Gymdesk to redesign and improve the appearance of my Brazilian Jiu-Jitsu academy’s website. The site is already functional, and I want a cleaner, more modern, and professional look while keeping the existing platform, membership features, and registration functions intact. I’d like to improve layout, fonts, spacing, image placement, and overall visual presentation, with a strong homepage, clearly organized kids’ and adult programs, easy-to-find class schedules, and simple navigation. Please share relevant examples of similar work and your estimated cost for this project.', 1, 'FIXED', 7750000.00, 7750000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('5a11a6a2-00b9-55de-afd2-39daf0a6aadb', '1ba87380-01c7-53c8-9662-9c952cd1e948', 'Squarespace Developer Needed to Fix Homepage Responsiveness ASAP', 'I''m looking for an experienced Squarespace developer to fix the responsiveness of my website''s homepage across desktop, tablet, and mobile devices. Fix homepage responsiveness across desktop, tablet, and mobile devices. Ensure images, text, buttons, and other sections display properly on mobile screens. Check for horizontal scrolling, overlapping elements, and inconsistent spacing. Maintain the existing website design, branding, and functionality. Test the homepage across different screen sizes before completion. Proven experience with Squarespace website development. Please apply only if you are available to start immediately.', 1, 'FIXED', 1033000.00, 1033000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('176bc7b3-30fe-522d-ab04-e180fcc58be1', '4292eda0-8ccf-535e-a605-1439f0e437ff', 'Squarespace Website Design Optimization', 'I need help optimizing my Squarespace website to improve its overall design and user experience. The work includes refining the layout, improving visual consistency, and making the site more polished and professional. I’m looking for someone who can assess the current design, suggest improvements, and implement changes that enhance the site’s appearance and usability. Please share relevant examples of similar projects and your approach to website optimization.', 1, 'HOURLY', 387000.00, 775000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('10ef9de5-38e6-5314-a691-6e2e6e80e940', '4292eda0-8ccf-535e-a605-1439f0e437ff', 'Fix Mobile Layout on Squarespace Website', 'I need a Squarespace designer to fix a few layout issues on my website, especially on mobile. The website is already built
