VALUES
    ('ebc91ca0-afd0-5257-ac12-75cafff8d584', 'eec38ab1-a74d-59ff-a82a-2f91830f40c0', 'Wordpress Blocksy Theme Support', 'I''m developing a wordpress site using the Blocksy theme and sometimes need help with layouts, design and CSS. I want someone that can handle my simple requests on a case by case bases.', 1, 'HOURLY', 258000.00, 258000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('244546ab-d7f1-53a3-aec0-59de475ab2d8', '93b50392-164f-5fbf-9bfd-4e9b80a96cd0', 'Finish Wordpress Website add pages and make amends', 'I already have an existing website and i need a website wordpress developer to help me finish the updates.regular work for the right developer', 1, 'FIXED', 2067000.00, 2067000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('4403972c-bd81-5579-8608-6b7affa82283', 'b18be6b4-79a0-5af4-b66b-3c871a255e47', 'WordPress Developer & UI/UX Designer Needed', 'Expert WordPress Developer & UI/UX Designer Needed for a Science News Publication with Paid Memberships. (The homepage prototype is attached here to give you an idea on the expected design layout). Domain name + hosting + content writing will be owned and managed by me. Project Overview: I am seeking an experienced WordPress developer to design and build The Longevity Gazette (longevitygazette.com), a physician-led digital publication dedicated to longevity science, preventive medicine, healthspan, and emerging medical research. Our vision is to create a scientific journalism platform with the editorial elegance of a newspaper or magazine, combined with modern digital subscriptions and membership functionality. This is a new website project, currently in the planning phase. I have prepared extensive editorial content, membership requirements, website specifications, and brand guidelines. See the attached pdf file and png file. I am looking for a developer who can translate these into an exceptional, fast, secure, scalable WordPress website. A) Technology & Hosting:-- Self-hosted WordPress.org Hostinger KVM 2 VPS Lightweight, custom Gutenberg-compatible theme Responsive, mobile-first UI/UX Secure and scalable WordPress architecture Easy editorial content management without coding I prefer a clean, maintainable solution rather than a heavy multipurpose theme or unnecessary plugins. B) Scope of Work:-- 1. Website Design & Development:— Custom, premium newspaper-style visual design Homepage with featured stories, editorial sections, and subscription promotions Article templates for free and premium content Seven primary editorial sections Author profiles, search, archives, and navigation About, editorial standards, contact, legal, and institutional pages Responsive desktop, tablet, and mobile layouts 2. Paid Membership & Subscription System:-- The website must offer three membership tiers from launch: Free Reader: $0 Gazette Member: $x/month or $xx/year Founding Member: $xx/year Required functionality includes: Secure registration and login Free and premium article access Subscription checkout and recurring payments Member dashboard and account management Automatic renewals, cancellations, and failed-payment recovery Subscription receipts and transactional emails Founding Member price protection: The $xx annual base renewal rate must remain protected while membership is continuously active, subject to the defined subscription rules Stripe is our preferred payment provider, subject to technical compatibility. Checkout.com may be considered as an alternative. The developer must recommend an appropriate WordPress membership solution and explain its compatibility with our requirements. 3. Newsletter Integration:-- We will publish a free weekly newsletter called The Longevity Briefing. Requirements include: Newsletter signup forms Independent newsletter consent, separate from membership registration Branded email templates Newsletter scheduling and subscriber management Public newsletter archive Unsubscribe functionality Reliable email deliverability configuration 4. Technical SEO & International Visibility:-- SEO must be integrated from the beginning, including: Yoast SEO or Rank Math Editable SEO titles and descriptions Structured data for articles, authors, and the publication XML sitemaps and appropriate news sitemap functionality Google Search Console and analytics integration Google News and Discover technical readiness SEO-friendly URLs and internal linking Correct indexing treatment for premium articles Core Web Vitals and mobile performance optimisation 5. Security, Performance & Administration:-- Secure WordPress and VPS configuration SSL, backups, and security hardening Optimised caching and image delivery Staging environment Role-based editorial permissions Accessibility-conscious design Administrator documentation and training Testing before launch Design Direction:— I already have the homepage prototype(attached below). I want an elegant, authoritative, minimalist editorial design—not a generic blog. Our preferred palette includes ivory, deep navy, muted teal, and charcoal, with excellent typography and generous whitespace. Deliverables:-- Fully developed WordPress website on our hosting Configured membership, payment, and newsletter systems Technical SEO implementation Responsive and performance-tested website Complete administrator access and ownership of project assets Documentation, training, and post-launch bug-fix support Experience building subscription-based digital publications is strongly preferred.', 1, 'FIXED', 7750000.00, 7750000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('5c9f45b2-7161-5f15-b5a1-6485ba3459cd', '75ea062a-6695-5287-b7e4-dc7adcfe8c2f', 'WordPress membership configuration', 'I have an Arabic learning website on WordPress + Elementor. The membership system is already installed ([plugin name]), but it’s not activated or configured, so all my content is still open to everyone. I need a developer to configure it and make it work correctly. What needs to be done: Paid plan: activate my one paid membership plan with full access to all learning content, with PayPal as the payment method. I’m in Jordan, so Stripe is not available. Free samples: set selected lessons as free, but require an email signup to access them. Restrict content: all other learning pages become members-only. Non-members see a short preview and a “Join” button. Member pages: make sure signup, login, account, and password reset pages work and look consistent with my site. Test everything: free signup, paid signup, PayPal payment, access rules, and cancellation. Handover: a short written or recorded guide showing me how to set any new page as free, paid, or preview.', 1, 'FIXED', 1292000.00, 1292000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('b2515d7c-ffc7-5de0-a1a4-abb44d19eefa', '296cf5fc-2478-579f-a39e-7b778c11a1a8', 'PHP Update on 2 Wordpress Sites', 'I am looking for someone with experience updating Wordpress sites. I have two websites that have outdated PHP and need updating. I utilize Cloudflare and WP Engine for these. Note that the designs themselves and sites are outdated, but I am only looking for PHP updates to keep the sites secure. Please share experience in updating sites, plugins and fixing general site health.', 1, 'HOURLY', 387000.00, 904000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('c056c1ea-e485-5f79-8286-d26de5519de2', '8d4c8e07-660a-5cdf-b6ad-e6c05ec63cef', 'Redesign WordPress Homepage', 'I need a freelancer to redesign the homepage of my existing WordPress site, which is hosted on Bluehost and uses the Neve theme. This is a design and layout update project, not a full rebuild or platform migration. The work will focus on improving the homepage structure, visual presentation, and navigation, including restructuring the menu for better usability. Please apply if you have experience with WordPress site updates and can deliver a polished, user-friendly homepage redesign.', 1, 'HOURLY', 258000.00, 775000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('beae14e8-ac90-5a94-949b-e198a070aabb', '8d4c8e07-660a-5cdf-b6ad-e6c05ec63cef', 'WordPress Developer with Elementor', 'We’re looking for a developer to build and maintain a website using WordPress and Elementor. The work includes creating pages, improving site performance, and supporting ongoing updates. You should be comfortable working independently, communicating clearly, and helping keep the site running smoothly. If you have experience with similar projects and can deliver reliable results, we’d love to hear from you.', 1, 'HOURLY', 129000.00, 517000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('e51482a4-466d-5311-acb1-68eb8a44733d', '7e5dbf18-5fe7-5715-bee7-6f76fdc9b644', 'WordPress Developer for a Clean, Simple Website for a Construction Advisory Business', 'WordPress Website Designer & Developer Needed | Premium, Modern Construction Advisory Website We''re looking for a talented WordPress designer/developer to create a beautiful, modern and professional website for an independent construction advisory business based in Vancouver, BC. Our priority is exceptional design, simplicity and long-term flexibility. The business provides independent construction advisory services to homeowners, property owners and investors, helping clients navigate construction projects from initial planning through completion. What We''re Looking For We envision a sophisticated, high-end website with a clean, contemporary aesthetic, strong typography, thoughtful layouts and a polished overall user experience. We''re leaning toward a single-page website, with clearly organized sections introducing the business, its services, the owner and how to get in touch. We''re open to adding one or two additional pages if recommended, but don''t want unnecessary complexity. This is primarily an informational and lead-generation website. We don''t need e-commerce, complicated functionality or extensive development. We can provide a brand reference deck, colour palette, photographs and content to help guide the design. Key Requirements Beautiful, premium design: Modern, minimal, visually impressive and professional. We want something distinctive and thoughtfully designed, not a generic template. WordPress: Built on self-hosted WordPress using a reputable, widely supported theme and editing system. Easy to manage and expand: We must be able to independently update text, images, layouts and sections. The website should also support future additions, including new pages, features and integrations, without requiring a complete rebuild. Responsive design: An excellent experience across desktop, tablet and mobile. Performance and SEO: Fast loading, optimized images and foundational SEO best practices. Contact functionality: Simple contact form and an option to integrate a booking link. Ownership and accessibility: Full ownership and administrator access, with hosting and domain registered under our own accounts. Security and backups: Basic security measures, updates and a reliable backup solution. Simple handover: Brief instructions or a walkthrough showing how to make common website edits. We want to avoid unnecessarily restrictive themes, excessive plugins, proprietary systems or setups that create long-term dependency on a particular developer. Future Flexibility While the initial website will be relatively simple, we want the foundation to accommodate future growth. This could include additional service pages, a blog, scheduling tools, client resources or other integrations. We aren''t looking to build these features now, only to ensure the website can evolve without unnecessary limitations or expense. Please Include in Your Proposal Links to 2–3 websites you''ve personally designed and developed, ideally with a similar premium, modern aesthetic. Your recommended WordPress theme and editing system, and why you would choose them. Your fixed-price quote and estimated completion timeline. What''s included in your price, particularly design revisions, hosting setup and launch. Any anticipated ongoing costs, including hosting, licences or maintenance. We''re looking for someone with a strong eye for design who can deliver a polished, professional result without overcomplicating the build.', 1, 'HOURLY', 362000.00, 723000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('e4533bf2-7ac0-5917-9094-c5caccf0f9dc', '475f3306-8087-5031-a923-47da5ae3760b', 'WordPress Website Completion and SEO Setup', 'I need a WordPress expert to finish building my website and install the SORO SEO plugin. The work includes completing remaining pages, improving site structure, and setting up the plugin so it is ready for use. I’m looking for someone who can work efficiently, communicate clearly, and help ensure the site is polished and functional before launch.', 1, 'HOURLY', 387000.00, 775000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('6346a771-aa9e-5d74-9edd-d7a34660c4db', '2d1d5b90-bf75-522a-9f1b-e0842ad8ab4b', 'WordPress Developer for SiteGround', 'I am looking for an experienced WordPress developer to resolve technical and security issues on an established membership website hosted on SiteGround. The site currently runs PHP 7.4.34, which is outdated and unsupported, and previous upgrade attempts have caused the site to crash. One compatibility issue involving an outdated OptimizePress plugin has already been partially addressed, but additional problems remain. I need someone who can identify the remaining issues, successfully upgrade PHP, and ensure the website continues functioning correctly.', 1, 'HOURLY', 362000.00, 723000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('3ade57fd-8cf5-5d8c-b1a4-c7496a8d037f', '4f74df5d-fa03-5527-b936-13d491740a0e', 'WordPress Developer Needed to Add Favicon to My WordPress Website', 'I need an experienced web designer/developer to help me add a favicon to my existing WordPress website. The website was built by a previous developer who used a custom-built theme, and the dashboard does not look like the standard WordPress dashboard I am familiar with. I have tried to locate where I can upload or change the favicon myself, but I have not been able to find the right settings. I am looking for someone who understands WordPress custom themes and can identify the correct way to add the favicon without affecting the existing website design or functionality. *What I need:* - Add my favicon to the website. - Identify where the favicon is controlled within the custom theme or website settings. - Ensure the favicon displays correctly in browser tabs. - Check that the changes do not affect the existing website layout or functionality. This should be a small task for someone with the right WordPress development experience. I would appreciate a developer who can explain briefly where the favicon is managed so I can update it myself in the future if needed. Please share your experience working with custom WordPress themes and let me know how you would approach this task.', 1, 'FIXED', 129000.00, 129000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('e0e73a79-593b-5698-913c-7e2cb5483b9f', 'fd8b9fb4-0a45-5633-af52-9329c423a5a8', 'WordPress Divi Theme Website Updates', 'I need help making updates to an existing WordPress website built with the Divi theme. The work includes improving the homepage, updating key pages, and making layout and design changes to improve the overall user experience. I’m looking for someone who can work efficiently, communicate clearly, and deliver clean, polished results. Experience with WordPress and Divi is important, and the ability to implement changes accurately and quickly is a plus.', 1, 'HOURLY', 387000.00, 775000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('07ed7131-cb8d-5fa3-90c0-e5d5bef6dc11', '498ddbb1-6de8-5c67-a305-d582dffa0f0e', 'Tuyển Freelancer / Đối Tác Thiết Kế & Nâng Cấp Website WordPress (Dự án 2026)', '1. Hiện trạng website Website giới thiệu doanh nghiệp, dịch vụ, giải pháp, tin tức và sản phẩm. Nền tảng & mã nguồn: WordPress Theme hiện tại: Flatsome Thông tin chi tiết về doanh nghiệp, website và định hướng thương hiệu sẽ được trao đổi cụ thể hơn khi hai bên thống nhất hợp tác. 2. Mục tiêu dự án Làm mới toàn bộ giao diện và trải nghiệm website theo định hướng thương hiệu và chiến lược phát triển giai đoạn 2026. Thể hiện hình ảnh doanh nghiệp hoạt động trong lĩnh vực năng lượng tái tạo – công nghệ – phát triển bền vững: Renewable Energy ESG Net Zero Hệ thống lưu trữ năng lượng, giải pháp tổng thể Nâng cao: Trải nghiệm người dùng (UX) Khả năng truyền tải thông tin Hiệu quả hỗ trợ marketing và bán hàng 3. Yêu cầu đối với freelancer / đối tác Đề xuất concept thiết kế UI/UX mới: Hiện đại, chuyên nghiệp, thẩm mỹ cao Phù hợp lĩnh vực năng lượng – công nghệ – phát triển bền vững Đề xuất cấu trúc nội dung website mới, bao gồm: Trang giới thiệu Dịch vụ / Giải pháp Sản phẩm Dự án Tin tức Nội dung và cấu trúc cần bám sát định hướng phát triển năm 2026 Hồ sơ năng lực / profile thương hiệu của doanh nghiệp đang được hoàn thiện và sẽ gửi bổ sung khi bắt đầu triển khai 4. Giải pháp kỹ thuật Ứng viên có thể đề xuất: Nâng cấp, tối ưu trên theme Flatsome hiện tại, hoặc Đề xuất theme WordPress mới phù hợp hơn Yêu cầu chung: Tính ổn định cao Dễ quản trị, dễ mở rộng Tối ưu SEO & tốc độ tải trang Có khả năng tích hợp webshop / bán hàng online trong tương lai 5. Kỳ vọng đầu ra Giao diện website mới: Desktop Mobile Bản demo / mockup thể hiện rõ concept thiết kế Đề xuất: Phương án kỹ thuật Lộ trình triển khai Các hạng mục công việc chi tiết 6. Ưu tiên Freelancer / đội nhóm đã từng triển khai website cho: Doanh nghiệp B2B Lĩnh vực năng lượng, công nghiệp, công nghệ, ESG Có portfolio rõ ràng, tư duy UI/UX và định hướng thương hiệu tốt Chủ động tư vấn, không chỉ thực hiện theo yêu cầu có sẵn', 1, 'FIXED', 5000000.00, 12000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('95167212-1f3d-505e-9fcd-c9a20d1cd13d', '498ddbb1-6de8-5c67-a305-d582dffa0f0e', 'CHỈNH SỬA & NÂNG CẤP GIAO DIỆN WEBSITE WORDPRESS', 'CẦN FREELANCER CHỈNH SỬA & NÂNG CẤP GIAO DIỆN WEBSITE WORDPRESS Mình đang vận hành website của công ty Logistics được gần 1 năm, website đã có sẵn tên miền, hosting và nội dung cơ bản. Hiện tại mình muốn tìm freelancer có kinh nghiệm WordPress để chỉnh sửa và nâng cấp giao diện website theo hướng chuyên nghiệp, hiện đại và tạo sự tin tưởng hơn với khách hàng. Thông tin website: * Lĩnh vực: Logistics, vận chuyển hàng hóa Việt Nam - Đức - Châu Âu. * Website đang hoạt động ổn định. * Không phải website bán hàng, không có chức năng thanh toán online. * Chỉ là website giới thiệu dịch vụ và thông tin doanh nghiệp. Yêu cầu công việc: * Chỉnh sửa và sắp xếp lại giao diện trang chủ. * Thiết kế lại banner chính chuyên nghiệp hơn. * Bố trí lại các mục dịch vụ, quy trình vận chuyển, thông tin liên hệ. * Đồng bộ màu sắc theo nhận diện thương hiệu. * Tối ưu hiển thị trên điện thoại và máy tính. * Thay thế ảnh minh họa bằng ảnh thực tế (văn phòng, kho hàng, quy trình làm việc) do công ty cung cấp. * Tối ưu cơ bản tốc độ tải trang. Lưu ý: * Không yêu cầu code website mới từ đầu. * Không yêu cầu chức năng phức tạp. * Ưu tiên sử dụng nền tảng và giao diện hiện có để tiết kiệm chi phí. Yêu cầu ứng viên: * Có kinh nghiệm chỉnh sửa website WordPress. * Gửi kèm một số website đã thực hiện. * Báo giá trọn gói và thời gian hoàn thành. Ngân sách dự kiến: 2.000.000 - 3.000.000 VNĐ Nếu làm tốt, mình sẽ tiếp tục thuê thêm các hạng mục SEO và tối ưu website trong thời gian tới.', 1, 'FIXED', 2000000.00, 3000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('75d34286-f724-5b50-99a3-da13ed2bb7d5', '7ec29fc4-d4c5-54cb-9c28-762151412753', 'Thiết kế website wordpress giống giao diện mẫu', 'Cần tuyển 1 bạn thiết kế website wordpress giống giao diện mẫu : https://audocph.com/collections/seating Và việc làm hàng tuần là chỉnh sửa thêm tính năng cho các website cũ. Trả theo giờ làm (100k/h). Vui lòng gửi mình thẳng báo giá cho làm web như trên trước nhé, gửi kèm những website bạn đã làm luôn', 1, 'FIXED', 1000000.00, 2500000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('952a1b8c-3d7e-5bff-b8a7-664298dac5fe', 'c362457c-d105-5192-bff9-91fb4c46e801', 'Cần hỗ trợ sửa cấu trúc web wordpress', 'Website wordpress của tôi đã có đầy đủ thông tin nhưng hiện cấu trúc bị rối, tôi đã thiết kế lại cấu trúc, cần người hỗ trợ: - audit website - sắp xếp lại cấu trúc SEO - content map 50 bài - outline pillar page.', 1, 'FIXED', 2000000.00, 4000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('a23b9b5b-f4f2-5a8e-a198-78777b21883e', 'fed1b4d4-02f6-58a1-96c4-ddb4af362a6b', 'Chuyển UI Figma thành web wordpress', 'Chuyển UI Figma thành web wordpress. 3 trang. web dùng up thông tin , tin tức . yêu cầu cao về UI giống thiết kế', 1, 'FIXED', 1000000.00, 5000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('dcd832c6-7567-5315-9fb1-d7902abd912e', '55da7457-3207-5041-bb12-406af28ecdc6', 'Cần dev wordpress trang profile cá nhân.', 'Mình cần một bạn dev wordpress, dev cho mình trang profile cá nhân, có sẳn html rồi. mh cần động ở phần dự án, và blogs (blogs có search), còn lại tĩnh cũng được. Bạn nào nhận nhắn cho mình và gửi cho mình các link dự án đã thực hiện nhé.', 1, 'FIXED', 500000.00, 700000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('89fa9ea7-7a6e-51f9-a92d-22c0d56d9b86', 'be469f5b-9183-5d23-b88a-893e33a83c55', 'FULL STACK Website Nước hoa trên nền tảng WordPress', 'Mình cần tìm Freelancer thiết kế & phát triển website nước hoa chuyên nghiệp, tối ưu trải nghiệm người dùng, chuẩn SEO và dễ quản lý lâu dài.', 1, 'FIXED', 2500000.00, 4000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('09d6c9e0-6c04-5191-8790-889d75fe83ee', 'c9d58dfc-6b85-587a-bd27-faf32d47296a', 'Xây dựng website wordpress', 'Hi, mình cần freelance/ đơn vị làm website wordpress bao gồm thiết kế, lên nội dung và dựng trên wordpress. Bạn nào làm thì nhắn mình nhé.', 1, 'FIXED', 5000000.00, 10000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('9906dec6-a74e-5568-abf0-7980d3e9cda0', '4a8d2eea-42aa-5b9e-b7a5-f408fcf4d99d', 'Cài đặt file LLMS.txt vào website WordPress', 'Cần freelancer hỗ trợ thêm file LLMS.txt vào website WordPress đang hoạt động. Yêu cầu thực hiện đúng vị trí, kiểm tra để file có thể truy cập bình thường sau khi thêm, và báo lại khi hoàn tất. Ưu tiên người có kinh nghiệm thao tác với WordPress và file website.', 1, 'FIXED', 200000.00, 300000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('585eb9d6-d513-50f9-ac75-f37055f689db', '1ab1f1cc-d84c-5efe-aa2d-c978714047a6', 'Xây dựng Landing Page WordPress tối ưu chuyển đổi (Elementor + AI tools)', 'Chúng tôi đang tìm freelancer WordPress để hỗ trợ xây dựng và tối ưu các landing page phục vụ digital marketing cho thị trường US/EU. Công việc tập trung vào execution nhanh, tối ưu chuyển đổi và làm việc với các công cụ AI (không yêu cầu code phức tạp). Công việc cụ thể: - Build và customize landing page trên WordPress (Elementor) - Sử dụng AI tools (10Web AI Builder) để tăng tốc sản xuất - Chỉnh sửa layout theo brand guideline (font, spacing, UI consistency) - Setup form đăng ký (lead form) + email notification Tối ưu tốc độ website (Core Web Vitals cơ bản) Hỗ trợ A/B testing (duplicate & chỉnh sửa version landing page) Fix các issue nhỏ liên quan đến UI/UX và responsive Yêu cầu: - Có kinh nghiệm WordPress (ưu tiên Elementor) - Hiểu cơ bản về landing page và conversion (CTA, bố cục, UX) - Cẩn thận, attention to detail tốt - Có thể làm việc nhanh, phản hồi nhanh theo feedback - Có thể đọc hiểu và trao đổi tiếng Anh cơ bản - Ưu tiên có kinh nghiệm làm với AI tools (hoặc sẵn sàng học) Lưu ý: - Đây không phải role dev code nặng, mà thiên về build landing page nhanh + tối ưu hiệu quả marketing.', 1, 'FIXED', 15000000.00, 30000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('fd8aca3b-a0dc-564a-be4a-562398ad876d', '4c172890-0df4-5eef-8c45-77d6b005915f', 'LANDING PAGE BUILDER (ELEMENTOR & AI TOOLS)', '1. Mô tả công việc - Build & Customize: Thiết kế và tùy chỉnh Landing Page trên WordPress (Elementor) cho thị trường Đông Nam Á. - AI Speed Up: Sử dụng các công cụ AI (10Web AI Builder,...) để tối ưu tốc độ sản xuất trang. - Branding: Chỉnh sửa Layout chuẩn Brand Guideline (Font, Spacing, UI Consistency). - Optimization: Setup Lead form, Email notification, tối ưu Core Web Vitals cơ bản và hỗ trợ A/B Testing. - Responsive: Đảm bảo hiển thị hoàn hảo trên mọi thiết bị và fix các lỗi UI/UX nhỏ. 2. Yêu cầu ứng viên - Kỹ năng: Thành thạo WordPress & Elementor. - Công nghệ: Ưu tiên ứng viên thạo các công cụ AI hỗ trợ build web -Năng lực: Cẩn thận, tỉ mỉ (Attention to detail), tốc độ phản hồi feedback nhanh. - Hình thức: Freelance/Part-time (Ưu tiên các bạn làm việc nhanh, đúng deadline).', 1, 'FIXED', 10000000.00, 20000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('4d1aea88-8493-58a0-a11c-a6d033c92610', '8b95c1dc-7c12-511e-aeb6-63b18eacb220', 'Tạo Landing Page trên web wordpress, thêm google conversion tag vào trang web sẵn có', 'Tôi đã có website WordPress sẵn, cần freelancer tạo thêm 1 landing page mới để chạy quảng cáo Google Ads cho dịch vụ tranh vẽ. Yêu cầu cụ thể: Thiết kế 1 landing page hiện đại, tối giản, tập trung tăng chuyển đổi khách hàng. Landing page cần đồng bộ với website hiện tại. Tương thích tốt trên điện thoại và máy tính. Có các phần chính: giới thiệu dịch vụ, hình ảnh mẫu tranh, quy trình đặt hàng, đánh giá khách hàng, form liên hệ / nút đặt hàng. Gắn Google Conversion Tag / Google Ads Conversion Tracking để theo dõi chuyển đổi quảng cáo. Có thể hỗ trợ cài đặt Google Analytics và Google Tag Manager là lợi thế. Tối ưu tốc độ tải trang và trải nghiệm người dùng. Ưu tiên freelancer có kinh nghiệm WordPress, landing page và tracking Google Ads. Vui lòng gửi portfolio hoặc các dự án tương tự đã từng thực hiện.', 1, 'FIXED', 500000.00, 3000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('46e5e821-40e1-5764-811c-2d569af47538', '2858040d-f00d-5c9d-bef7-e22efca5283a', 'TÌM NGƯỜI CỨNG TAY NGHỀ, RÀNH WORDPRESS TẠI TP.HCM - LÀM WEB TIẾNG ANH THỦ CÔNG 100% - NGÂN SÁCH 6 TRIỆU', 'Tôi cần tìm một freelancer cứng tay nghề, có kinh nghiệm dày dặn và hiện đang sinh sống tại Saigon để hỗ trợ hoàn thiện cấu hình website viết lách bằng tiếng Anh. Website này tôi làm nghiêm túc để đăng bài mỗi ngày nên cần hệ thống phải cực kỳ ổn định. Tôi đã chuẩn bị sẵn file Theme Elegant Magazine chuẩn quốc tế mua từ ThemeForest. Công việc cụ thể bao gồm: - Trỏ domain từ Namecheap về Hostinger bằng nameserver hoặc DNS chuẩn xác. - Cài đặt WordPress, thiết lập chứng chỉ bảo mật SSL/HTTPS. - Upload theme Elegant Magazine có sẵn và kích hoạt bản cấu hình giống mẫu demo 100%. - Import toàn bộ bài viết từ Substack sang bằng file .zip. Yêu cầu: Đọc hiểu nội dung tiếng Anh để tự tay rà soát, sửa lỗi định dạng bài viết, lỗi vỡ hình ảnh và bố trí các khối SECTION (Featured, Trending, Latest Posts...) ngăn nắp, đúng mạch nội dung quốc tế, không làm lộn xộn. - Tích hợp tính năng Thu thập Email (Newsletter/Subscription): Cấu hình form đăng ký nhận bài viết mới để độc giả điền email trực tiếp trên website. - Tích hợp nút Buy Me a Coffee: Chèn nút hoặc liên kết ủng hộ (Donate) từ nền tảng Buy Me a Coffee vào các vị trí hợp lý trên bài viết và giao diện. - Tối ưu hệ thống thư viện media để upload ảnh từ Canva lên nhanh, nhẹ, giúp website đạt tốc độ tải trang nhanh dưới 1 giây. - Bàn giao tài khoản quản trị WordPress và hướng dẫn tôi cách tự đăng bài, sửa chữ trong các khối SECTION và vận hành cơ bản. Vui lòng đọc kỹ yêu cầu sau: BẮT BUỘC CAM KẾT KHÔNG DÙNG AI: Nếu phát hiện dùng AI làm ẩu giao sản phẩm lỗi, tôi sẽ từ chối nghiệm thu. Chỉ tuyển người tại TP.HCM: Để có thể tiện trao đổi, kiểm tra trực tiếp và hỗ trợ lâu dài nếu cần. Quy trình bảo mật: Vui lòng làm nháp mượt mà trên máy tính cá nhân (Localhost) trước. Khi tôi duyệt bản demo hoàn hảo giống mẫu 100%, tôi mới tự tay quẹt thẻ mua gói Hostinger Business riêng chính chủ đứng tên tôi để đưa web lên mạng, đảm bảo riêng tư tuyệt đối. Giá tiền công chốt cứng: 6.000.000 VNĐ. Làm hợp đồng điện tử và ký quỹ an toàn 100% qua sàn vLance. Không giao dịch bên ngoài.', 1, 'FIXED', 5500000.00, 6000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('9de775ec-997e-5921-a5fb-2e4fd4ef3b11', '78b62e7c-8dcc-53bd-b1c8-bf6a8ed71ef5', 'Xây dựng website WordPress iG Link', 'iGreenLink Canada là công ty có hơn 14 năm kinh nghiệm cung cấp dịch vụ chuyển hàng và chuyển tiền từ Canada về Việt Nam, phục vụ cộng đồng người Việt tại Canada từ năm 2012. Chúng tôi cần xây dựng một website WordPress chuyên nghiệp, hiện đại, thay thế hoàn toàn website Wix hiện tại với các trang đã được thiết kế, cần chuyển template các trang này vào website. Website mới có các tính năng như thanh toán online qua Interac, kết nối API với phần mềm nội bộ của công ty, xây dựng cho chatbot AI và mobile PWA, etc', 1, 'FIXED', 8000000.00, 12000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('2e83aa68-924a-5a2a-8d69-8a030b87ac63', '70cf9770-377e-5530-a69f-5090ebcafe89', 'Tìm kỹ thuật viên WordPress fix lỗi hiển thị giao diện Flatsome và vá bảo mật trang Tin tức.', 'Cần tìm kỹ thuật viên sửa lỗi hiển thị giao diện Flatsome, lỗi mất icon và lỗi hiển thị banner sau khi restore dữ liệu. Quét bảo mật và vá plugin cho trang web tin tức. Mình chỉ cấp tài khoản quản trị wordpress phụ để làm việc, tuyệt đối không cung cấp tài khoản hosting. Chi tiết công việc cụ thể từng hạng mục mình sẽ gửi trực tiếp cho bạn khi nhắn tin trao đổi', 1, 'FIXED', 500000.00, 1000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('d2fc69b9-a580-5646-ba6b-0dc186c3abea', '72902381-21f7-5fb1-b8d9-aca8ddcd23b2', 'Thiết kế giao diện và cài đặt website wordpress', 'Mình đã kết nối hosting với tên miền xong. Cần tìm bạn thiết kế giao diện web wordpress bán tour nước ngoài và cài đặt. Ngoài tính năng bán tour có thêm bán combo tour, người dùng tùy chọn dịch vụ abcd... tự tính tổng thanh toán... Ngôn ngữ: Tiếng Anh', 1, 'FIXED', 500000.00, 1500000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('4394e629-c8b6-5235-b3f0-443b6e643d2a', '30b5c824-2f70-583b-aa15-56c46bfe021c', 'Tuyển Freelancer Website WordPress – Ngách Sức khỏe', 'Nội dung: Công việc: Thiết kế & tối ưu 01 Website vệ tinh (chuẩn SEO, tốc độ PageSpeed > 90). Yêu cầu: Am hiểu Flatsome/GeneratePress, biết cấu trúc Schema chuyên sâu, tối ưu Litespeed Cache và xử lý ảnh WebP. Ưu tiên người biết kết nối Webhook (n8n/Make). Ngân sách: Thỏa thuận theo gói (Gói nghiệm thu theo checklist). Quyền lợi: Hợp tác lâu dài cho hệ thống 10+ Brand của Group. Inbox gửi Portfolio và các dự án Web đã tối ưu tốc độ.', 1, 'FIXED', 2000000.00, 4000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('a99bed7f-2174-5902-8a43-5896f081b5c7', 'ee119b75-e417-5979-87bb-83dd9f2acbe8', 'WordPress Developer for Small Website Task - 24 Hour Delivery', 'Hi, I''m looking for an experienced WordPress developer to help me with [describe your task, e.g. fixing layout issues / customizing a theme / setting up a landing page / plugin configuration]. This is a small, clearly defined task that should be completed within 1 day. **What I need:** - [Task 1, e.g. Fix header/footer layout issues on mobile] - [Task 2, e.g. Install and configure a contact form plugin] - [Task 3, e.g. Improve page speed / fix a plugin conflict] **Requirements:** - Strong experience with WordPress (themes, plugins, customization) - Familiar with [Elementor / WooCommerce / custom PHP / CSS] (remove what''s not needed) - Clean work without breaking the existing site - Good communication in English - Ability to start immediately and deliver within 24 hours **Project details:** - Budget: $50 fixed price - Deadline: 1 day from the time of hiring - Site access (admin login) will be shared securely after hiring - Backup will be taken before any changes **To apply, please:** 1. Share 1-2 links of WordPress sites you have worked on 2. Confirm that you can finish the task within 24 hours 3. Start your proposal with the word "READY" so I know you read this post If the work is good, there is potential for more projects and long-term collaboration. Thank you, and I look forward to your proposals!', 1, 'FIXED', 1292000.00, 1292000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('1531aca6-3adf-5fec-b358-189aefdcba99', '70c4d7a2-a81c-500d-bc2c-babb5bb22032', 'WordPress Developer Needed to Build a 20+ Page Marketing Agency Website', 'I’m looking for an experienced WordPress developer to build a professional website for my marketing agency. I already have a domain and WordPress hosting with Hostinger, so I need someone who can set up and develop the complete website. The website will have 20+ pages and should look modern, professional, and trustworthy. It should also be responsive, fast-loading, and easy for me to manage and update in the future. Scope of Work -Set up WordPress on my existing Hostinger hosting. -Design and develop a professional website with 20+ pages. -Create a modern, clean design that reflects a digital marketing agency. -Ensure the website works smoothly on desktop, tablet, and mobile devices. -Create service pages, about us, contact us, and other required pages. -Set up contact forms and clear calls to action to generate leads. -Optimize website speed and basic technical SEO settings. -Install and configure essential plugins. -Ensure the website has a clean structure and is easy to navigate. -Make sure I can easily edit content and add new pages later. -Test the complete website before launch. Requirements -Strong experience in WordPress website development. -Experience building websites for marketing agencies or service-based businesses. -Good understanding of responsive design, website speed, and basic SEO. -Ability to handle a 20+ page website efficiently. -Good communication and attention to detail. To Apply Please share: - Examples of WordPress websites you have built, preferably for marketing agencies. - Which page builder you recommend (Elementor, Gutenberg, or another option) and why. - Your estimated timeline and fixed price for this project. - Whether you will help with the initial website structure and page layout. I’m looking for someone who can deliver a high-quality website with a professional design and solid functionality. Important: To confirm that you have read the complete job description, please start your proposal with the word "bingo". Proposals that don''t follow this instruction may be ignored. Please submit your proposal with relevant portfolio examples and your estimated cost.', 1, 'FIXED', 3100000.00, 3100000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('22424f75-f8ca-5725-b5c2-274097bfa5a3', '37a1a933-3bd7-5f51-8b6f-5877befebc22', 'WordPress page updates – spacing and mobile layout', 'I need help adjusting the spacing, heading size, and mobile button alignment on one WordPress page. I’d like to make the changes myself while you guide me over a screen-sharing call. I’ll share the page and show you what I want to update.', 1, 'FIXED', 1292000.00, 1292000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('470ce64c-df45-5c69-a4f1-39a1b2e717cb', '1de3a55a-f06f-5147-90b3-9242ce1efa35', 'WordPress & Elementor Expert Needed for Bug Fixes, Mobile Issues & Website Audit', 'WordPress / Elementor Website Audit, Bug Fixes & Mobile Optimisation We are Spaces & Me, an interior design consultancy based in Greater Noida, India. Our existing website, https://spacesandme.in, is built using WordPress, Elementor and the Antra theme, and hosted on Hostinger. The website is already developed and live. We are not looking for a redesign or a new website. We need an experienced WordPress developer to identify and resolve existing functionality, responsiveness and technical issues. Known Issues 1. Homepage: Desktop - Fix the functionality and destination links of the "Let''s Talk" and "Contact Us" buttons in the homepage slider. - Correct header visibility on the third slider image. - Make the entire service title/row clickable, rather than only the arrow. 2. Homepage: Mobile - Correct text formatting and positioning on the third slider image. - Make service titles/rows clickable. - Fix the mobile navigation link to the "Our Work" page. 3. Header & Footer - Investigate and resolve existing header/footer display and functionality issues. - Ensure consistent behaviour across desktop, tablet and mobile. 4. Additional Website Audit - Identify broken links, non-functional buttons and navigation issues. - Check mobile responsiveness across the main pages. - Check contact forms, WhatsApp links and enquiry functionality. - Identify unnecessary plugins, scripts or leftover WooCommerce elements. - Review website loading performance and recommend practical improvements. - Identify any other technical issues affecting usability. Requirements - Strong experience with WordPress, Elementor and third-party WordPress themes. - Proficiency in PHP, JavaScript, HTML and CSS. - Experience troubleshooting existing websites without disrupting their design. - Familiarity with Hostinger, LiteSpeed Cache and responsive website optimisation is preferred. Deliverables 1. Brief initial audit identifying issues and recommended fixes. 2. Resolution of the agreed issues. 3. Testing on desktop, tablet and mobile. 4. Confirmation that existing website functionality remains intact. 5. Short completion report detailing the changes made and any outstanding recommendations. Important Conditions - A complete website backup must be taken before making changes. - Preferably, changes should be tested in a staging environment. - No unnecessary plugins or major design changes without prior approval. - Existing content, branding and visual design must be preserved. - Any additional work outside the agreed scope must be approved in advance. Budget: Approximately $90 fixed price. Timeline: Preferably 1–2 weeks. To Apply: Please share examples of similar WordPress/Elementor troubleshooting projects and briefly explain how you would approach diagnosing the issues on our existing website. We are looking for a reliable developer who can also assist with occasional website maintenance in the future.', 1, 'FIXED', 2325000.00, 2325000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('3b67832c-21ba-5e3a-832e-78460c6d16a8', '1de3a55a-f06f-5147-90b3-9242ce1efa35', 'WordPress Website Minor Fixes and Updates', 'I need a WordPress developer to make a few minor updates and fixes to my website. The work includes fixing small design issues, updating images and content, checking mobile responsiveness, and ensuring all website features work correctly. The developer should have basic knowledge of WordPress, PHP, HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.', 1, 'FIXED', 387000.00, 387000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('50f904e1-c01d-5321-9631-a3d39612a358', '1de3a55a-f06f-5147-90b3-9242ce1efa35', 'Fix a Small Website Issue on my wordpress website', 'I’m looking for a WordPress developer to fix a small issue on my existing WordPress website. The issue may involve a minor layout problem, Elementor display issue, CSS styling error, broken link, or another small WordPress functionality bug. Scope of Work - Identify the cause of the reported issue. - Fix the bug without affecting other parts of the website. - Check that the fix works on desktop and mobile, where applicable. - Test the affected page after making the change. - Briefly explain what was fixed. Requirements - Experience with WordPress website customization and bug fixing. - Familiarity with Elementor and basic CSS/HTML troubleshooting. - Ability to work carefully on an existing website. - Clear communication and attention to detail. Budget - $5 fixed price for one small, clearly defined bug. - Please note that this budget is for a minor fix only. Larger issues or additional tasks will require a separate agreement. To Apply Please briefly describe your WordPress bug-fixing experience and mention how you would safely troubleshoot an issue on an existing website.', 1, 'FIXED', 129000.00, 129000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('508c6d0e-67c2-5174-bd59-c02c66ddd3fe', '8c7fc643-5210-572f-98c3-f4647c6cea52', 'Hacked WordPress Site: Malware Removal + Fix', 'Description: My WordPress site on Hostinger keeps getting hacked. Malware was found in the index file, and an unknown admin user appeared after I reset passwords. The attacker is getting in through WordPress. Hostinger shows a WordPress core update, a theme update, 13 plugin updates, and 60 vulnerabilities. Hostinger has run a basic malware cleanup, but I need someone to find the entry point and make sure it stays fixed. Scope: • Back up the current state, then update WordPress core, the Astra theme, and all plugins • Remove unused, abandoned, or vulnerable plugins • Hunt for backdoors (plugins, themes, uploads, mu-plugins, database users and options, wp-config, .htaccess) • Remove unknown admin users and reset secret keys and credentials • Check Search Console (both the Domain and URL-prefix properties) for unknown owners, • Confirm the site and domain settings are correct and working • Harden the site (firewall, 2FA, auto-updates) and confirm it stays clean for 72 hours • Send a short written report of what you found and fixed After the cleanup: monthly maintenance with updates, weekly malware scans, offsite backups, uptime monitoring, and a 24-hour response time. Requirements: • WordPress malware cleanup experience • Hostinger/hPanel experience preferred • Can start today • Secure access only (temporary admin user and Hostinger collaborator access, no shared passwords) • Interested in a long-term working relationship Please include: • A similar hack you''ve cleaned • How soon you can start • Your monthly maintenance price', 1, 'FIXED', 6458000.00, 6458000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('37ac02b3-3d89-5ed3-8951-f76921c017a9', '7a97c4f8-2645-5923-b2b0-96c5e45b58d1', 'WordPress & Technical SEO Expert – Speed & Tracking Fixes', 'Job Category: Web Design & Development ➔ WordPress Development (or SEO ➔ Technical SEO) Hi, I am looking for a premier WordPress Developer who is also highly skilled in Technical SEO and paid conversion tracking. We have a solid business and great content, but our website has structural, speed, and backend tracking errors that must be professionally resolved. The site is built on WordPress using WPBakery Page Builder and LiteSpeed Cache. It is currently sitting in a staging subdirectory path: prepservicetexas.com/ai-staging. You will be given full access to the WordPress admin dashboard, cPanel hosting file manager, Google Analytics 4, and Google Ads. Scope of Work: 1. WordPress Development & Server Fixes: - Safely migrate and push the staging site files from the /ai-staging subfolder to the live root domain (prepservicetexas.com) when structural optimizations are complete. - Fix the active WP Mail SMTP dashboard error so our lead forms reliably dispatch emails. - Clean up the directory by safely deleting old, indexed demo theme template pages (e.g., /cyber-security/, /cloud-computing/, /shop-2/). - Restructure our primary top navigation header menu to add a multi-tiered "Services" dropdown. 2. Speed & Core Web Vitals Optimization: - Fix our slow mobile page speed (currently 46/100) by compressing, converting to WebP/AVIF format, and adjusting preloading parameters for our main homepage hero banner to bring down an 11.6s Largest Contentful Paint (LCP) metric. 3. Technical SEO & AI Readiness: - Add a proper, optimized H1 heading to the homepage and write clean titles/descriptions according to our target audit constraints. - Inject custom JSON-LD LocalBusiness Schema markup directly onto the homepage header. - Create and upload a clean plain-text /llms.txt file to the root directory for AI search agent discovery. 4. Analytics & Conversion Tracking: - Reconnect Google Site Kit and clear the active "URL changed" path error message. - Set up custom event tracking in GA4 for form submissions, phone clicks, and click-to-chat links, and map them securely into our Google Ads dashboard as verified conversion actions. Requirements: - Deep experience with WordPress core files, WPBakery Page Builder, and LiteSpeed Cache server optimization configurations. - Proven background tracking paid search conversions using GA4 and Google Ads tags. - Ability to execute this end-to-end completely hands-off. Please provide your estimated timeline and a fixed-price project quote. Thank you!', 1, 'FIXED', 3875000.00, 3875000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('54d69895-7d1e-5d9c-b17c-d4dcaab6dd30', '9bb327e4-e267-5ee4-9f5a-a79859ce629e', 'WordPress Content Migration Specialist (Post Import, Redirects & QA)', 'We are launching a rebuilt WordPress marketing site and need a migration specialist to move existing content into the new environment. Page design and template builds are already handled in-house. This role covers bulk content migration, redirect mapping, and QA. This is an execution-focused role. The site structure, post types, templates, and plugin stack are already defined. Scope Approximately 500 posts across several post types: blog, video, downloads, news, and case studies Responsibilities Migrate posts from the existing site into the new environment''s custom post types and templates Rebuild a limited number of pages in Elementor Pro using predefined templates, as needed Carry over Yoast SEO metadata (titles, descriptions, canonicals) Build and implement redirect mapping for old URLs QA migrated content: links, images, formatting, categories, and featured images Follow a documented workflow for staging → QA → production Follow strict plugin and process guidelines Candidates must have experience with: Large WordPress content migrations (150+ posts/pages) Custom post types and ACF fields Redirect mapping and avoiding redirect chains Yoast SEO Elementor Pro Staging environments and controlled deployments Working within an approved plugin stack Following detailed documentation and processes This role is best suited for someone who enjoys clean, detail-oriented execution and structured implementation work. Please start your proposal with the word ''Migration'' so we know you read the full description.', 1, 'HOURLY', 387000.00, 775000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('5a51f458-77ff-51a9-b179-c9b0f810ccf1', 'cfcd1c1d-5869-5839-beaa-e1a037f26aee', 'Elementor Developer: Technical SEO and Speed Fixes on Wordpress', 'About us Jade Optical is a luxury optical boutique in Doral, FL (since 2009), carrying Ray-Ban through Cartier. We’re upgrading our existing WordPress/Elementor site so more Google visitors book appointments, and so we show up in Google Maps and in AI search (ChatGPT, Gemini, Google AI Overviews). The work (about 25–35 hours) We have a written audit and a 39-item task list. You’ll handle the technical items, in this order: 1) Backups (UpdraftPlus) and staging setup 2) Content and image fixes (alt text, removing specific wording) from a written list 3) Simplifying the booking flow (currently patients enter their info twice) 4) A mobile sticky bar (Book / Call / Text) and navigation cleanup 5) An FAQ page plus schema markup (LocalBusiness/Optician + FAQPage) in Rank Math or Yoast 6) Google Search Console + GA4 setup, with booking-click tracking 7) Business listings (Bing Places, Apple Business Connect, Yelp, Healthgrades) 8) Building 6–8 new pages from an approved design system (our designer provides the style
