    ('81d39565-7ac0-5824-94ec-885c2a7aabad', 'f42d5211-17a1-5f93-9209-d35e29e309e8', 'Web Development and Design', 'We are seeking a skilled web developer to create and maintain a user-friendly website. The ideal candidate will have experience in web development and design, with a strong understanding of modern web technologies. The role involves collaborating with our team to deliver high-quality web solutions that meet our business needs.', 1, 'HOURLY', 387000.00, 775000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('27effd85-ae1e-5d3d-a919-f3a732f9169a', '65b03cc5-93ce-5c3a-9e00-8d7ec1280c70', 'Web Developer for Complete Redesign - Poster', 'We''re seeking an experienced web developer to lead a complete redesign of our website poster. You''ll work closely with our design team to bring innovative ideas to life, ensuring a modern and user-friendly interface. The ideal candidate will possess strong skills in web development and have a keen eye for aesthetics. We''re looking for someone who can effectively communicate and collaborate with our team to ensure the redesign aligns with our brand vision.', 1, 'HOURLY', 982000.00, 1240000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('2302f24d-a0f9-5052-96e9-de7265e6e51c', '324d0511-2f5e-51ca-9232-3a3052f2bfba', 'Creative Web Design & Development for Surecheck | Interactive, Motion-Driven Website', 'Applications are only are approved through Upwork. Please dont contact us on other platforms. When applying, please send examples of relevant work. SURECHECK WEBSITE REDESIGN BRIEF Brand: Surecheck Current website: https://surecheck.info/ Main creative reference: https://www.marvis.com/en/ Project scope: Complete website redesign, visual modernization, and development 1. PROJECT OVERVIEW & OBJECTIVES The objective of this project is to completely modernize Surecheck''s digital presence by creating a contemporary, highly dynamic, and interactive website that reflects the brand''s identity and positioning. We aim to create a modern and visually distinctive digital experience that combines a strong medical identity with dynamic design, interactive elements, and innovative product presentation. The website should communicate the precision, reliability, and credibility of Surecheck while delivering an engaging and contemporary user experience. The new website should have a strong visual identity, with animation, movement, and interaction integrated into the overall design concept. Key objectives: - Completely modernize the website''s visual identity and overall design. - Strengthen Surecheck''s positioning as a modern, innovative, and trustworthy brand. - Make the product the central visual element of the website. - Create a highly dynamic and immersive user experience. - Improve the visual presentation of information and overall usability. - Develop a flexible platform that allows easy content management and future updates. 2. TARGET AUDIENCE Our primary target audience consists of young women, with a particular focus on Gen Z and Millennials. These audiences are accustomed to dynamic visual content, interactive digital platforms, and contemporary design. The website should reflect these expectations through an engaging visual experience and a modern approach to digital communication. At the same time, we need to consider the nature of the product category. Some visitors will come to the website looking for specific information about pregnancy tests, instructions for use, or result interpretation. For these users, information must remain clear, accessible, and reliable. 3. VISUAL CONCEPT & DESIGN DIRECTION Overall Visual Style: Modern Medical Aesthetic We are looking for a modern, dynamic, and visually impactful design that combines a contemporary medical aesthetic with innovative interactive elements. The website should maintain a clear medical character, communicating precision, reliability, and trust. This should be reflected in the typography, color combinations, graphic elements, product presentation, and overall visual language. We want a distinctive and contemporary design that feels sophisticated and technologically advanced while maintaining the credibility expected from a medical product. Main Creative Reference: Marvis Our primary reference is the Marvis website: https://www.marvis.com/en/ What we particularly appreciate about Marvis is its overall digital experience: the continuous movement, dynamic presentation of content, smooth transitions between sections, and creative product-focused storytelling. We would like to achieve a similar level of visual impact and interactivity while developing an original design specifically for Surecheck. The reference should guide the approach to motion, transitions, and interaction rather than the brand''s visual identity itself. Dynamic & Interactive Experience Movement should be a fundamental part of the website''s design, rather than an additional decorative feature. From the moment users enter the website, they should experience a visually engaging and dynamic environment. We want the website to feel alive, with elements sliding, transforming, scaling, and transitioning smoothly as users navigate and scroll. The experience should feel continuous, avoiding the impression of separate static sections placed one below another. The main elements we would like to explore include: Immersive Experience A visually impactful introduction that immediately captures the user''s attention. This could include an animated opening sequence, product animation, video, or interactive visual composition. Scroll-Driven Animations Scrolling should actively control the movement and transformation of visual elements. Products, text, and graphics could slide across the screen, rotate, scale, or transition into new compositions as the user scrolls. Seamless Transitions We want smooth and creative transitions between sections, creating a continuous visual experience. Elements from one section could transform or move into the next, connecting different parts of the website through animation. Dynamic Layouts & Typography Large-scale typography, unconventional layouts, animated text, and creative compositions that add visual rhythm and movement to the website. Microinteractions Interactive buttons, hover effects, and subtle animations that make the interface feel responsive and engaging. All animations should be thoughtfully integrated into the design and contribute to the overall user experience. The Product as the Visual Hero The Surecheck product should be the main visual hero of the website. Similar to the product-focused approach used by Marvis, we want the product itself to play a central role in the visual communication. Rather than relying on standard product images placed alongside text, we are looking for creative ways to integrate the product into the website experience. Potential approaches include: - Large-scale, high-quality product visuals. - 3D product renders and animations. - Product movement and transformations triggered by scrolling. - Interactive demonstrations of product features. - Creative compositions where the product interacts with typography and graphic elements. - Dynamic transitions in which the product moves between different sections. The product should be instantly recognizable, visually prominent, and accurately represented in terms of its shape, proportions, and branding. Medical Identity & Credibility Despite the creative and highly dynamic direction, the website must maintain a strong medical character. We want to communicate medical credibility through a contemporary visual language. This can be achieved through precise product presentation, clean compositions, carefully selected typography, a structured approach to information, and graphic elements that convey accuracy and professionalism. The overall design should feel innovative and visually distinctive while reinforcing trust in Surecheck as a medical product. 4. HOMEPAGE EXPERIENCE The homepage should be the strongest expression of the new visual concept. We want it to create an immediate impression and introduce users to the Surecheck brand through an engaging and interactive experience. Hero Section The opening section should deliver strong visual impact from the first seconds of interaction. We would like the agency to explore possibilities such as: - A short animated introduction or brand video. - A large-scale 3D product visualization. - An interactive composition featuring the Surecheck product. - A strong brand message integrated into the animation and visual storytelling. The opening should establish the overall visual direction and encourage users to explore the website further. Dynamic Product Presentation The product should be integrated into the homepage through animation and interactive storytelling. For example, as users scroll, the product could slide into view, move toward the center of the screen, change scale, rotate, or transition into another visual composition. We expect the agency to propose an original approach that makes the product a central part of the website experience. Brand Communication The homepage should also allow us to present current brand campaigns, initiatives, and key communication messages. These elements should be easy to update while remaining consistent with the overall visual concept. Educational Content Relevant educational content and selected articles should be presented in a visually engaging way, encouraging visitors to explore additional information. 5. PRODUCT PRESENTATION Product pages should be visually redesigned to follow the same creative direction as the homepage. We want product information to be presented in a modern, clear, and engaging format. Potential features include: - Interactive product presentations. - 3D product renders or animated product visuals. - Dynamic presentation of key product features and benefits. - Interactive instructions for use. - Short video or animated demonstrations. - Clear visual explanations of how to interpret test results. - Easily accessible frequently asked questions. While product pages should remain visually engaging, clarity and usability are particularly important when communicating instructions and medical information. 6. WEBSITE STRUCTURE & NAVIGATION The new website should retain Surecheck''s existing information architecture, which will serve as the foundation for the project. The current website will be provided as the reference for the existing content and page structure. We expect a complete redesign of how the content is visually presented, how individual pages are designed, and how users interact with the website. Navigation should be modern, intuitive, and seamlessly integrated into the overall dynamic visual concept. Improvements to the user experience may be proposed, provided that the existing website architecture is maintained. The primary focus is the visual transformation of the existing website, with particular emphasis on motion design, interactivity, seamless transitions, and product-focused visual storytelling. 7. BLOG & EDITORIAL CONTENT The blog is an important part of Surecheck''s digital communication and should be visually redesigned in line with the new website concept. We want a modern editorial experience with strong typography, impactful imagery, and engaging content presentation. Key expectations include: - A visually engaging blog landing page. - Large imagery and contemporary typography. - Clear content categories and intuitive navigation. - Excellent readability across desktop and mobile devices. - Related article recommendations. - Support for embedded video and interactive content. The marketing team should be able to publish, edit, and manage articles independently through the CMS. 8. MOBILE EXPERIENCE The website should be developed with a.', 1, 'FIXED', 180824000.00, 180824000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('e7ac4e14-547a-53f5-a985-d499d19f0385', 'aa055f2d-d62c-5072-a21a-770c80be1d9c', 'Simple Responsive Website for Service Provider', 'Need a simple, clean website for a service provider business that works well on desktop and mobile. The site should include a homepage, about page, services page, and contact page, with clear navigation and a professional layout. It should also link to GoHighLevel for lead capture and customer communication. Please share examples of similar projects and your approach to building a fast, user-friendly site.', 1, 'HOURLY', 129000.00, 646000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('e4e6a7ad-55ad-567b-aea8-c12000c49433', '7b32b22a-5e60-59e8-a191-e7fcf3716c5e', 'Mobile App Developer Needed with Flutter experience for Bug Fixes & Feature Improvements', 'We''re looking for an experienced Flutter developer to improve an existing mobile application for Android and iOS. The project involves fixing existing bugs, improving app performance, refining UI components, and implementing a few small feature updates. Responsibilities: Fix bugs and improve app stability Optimize Flutter app performance Improve existing UI/UX components Implement minor feature enhancements Test and ensure smooth functionality on Android and iOS Looking for a reliable developer who can deliver clean, maintainable code and communicate effectively. Required Skills Mobile App Development Flutter Dart Android App Development iOS Development Firebase API Integration Bug Fixes', 1, 'FIXED', 6458000.00, 6458000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('c2295e54-35d6-5afe-89ba-7cf3494e4a33', 'dd3e90fe-3060-545a-a4b7-c66617ddc24c', 'Remove Business from Directory', 'We need help removing our business listing from a directory. The work includes identifying the correct listing, contacting the directory, and completing the removal process. Experience with directory listings and online removal requests is important. Please share examples of similar work and your approach to handling this task efficiently.', 1, 'FIXED', 1292000.00, 1292000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('c8d864c7-c9c2-59ab-8a94-87fb305ca7c2', 'f451ddf2-7efa-5905-8eed-d48ce49536ab', 'Remove Businesses from Directory', 'We need a freelancer to remove businesses from a directory based on a provided list of company names. The work involves matching each company name to the correct listing, verifying the details, and removing the entry from the directory. This is a straightforward data management task for someone who can work carefully and accurately. Please apply if you have experience with directory updates and can complete this task efficiently.', 1, 'FIXED', 2583000.00, 2583000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('f05d444d-0393-5f1d-94f1-893fb02bdf1c', '86381677-b59c-5d12-9211-4dd8f85565a1', 'The Wellness Collective — Two Funnels and Membership Setup', 'I’m looking for an experienced Systeme.io specialist to build the foundations of two connected funnels for my wellness business in Queensland, Australia. 1. Client funnel * Introduce The Wellness Collective and our practitioners and services. * Capture client enquiries and email subscribers. * Set up automated welcome and follow-up emails. * Direct clients to our existing Square booking system. 2. Practitioner funnel * Explain our vision and practitioner offering. * Collect practitioner applications and relevant information. * Set up automated application acknowledgements and follow-ups. * Allow me to review applications and personally meet and approve each practitioner before they can join or pay. 3. Memberships and payments * Separate client and practitioner membership options. * Support a one-off joining fee plus recurring membership payments. * Investigate and configure Australian bank-account direct debit through GoCardless. * Confirm how joining fees and recurring payments will work together before implementation. * Ensure practitioner membership payments are only initiated after my approval. 4. Handover and ownership * Build everything directly inside accounts I own and control. * Keep my existing Square website and Square Appointments operational. * Test the funnels, emails, payment flows and mobile experience. * Provide recorded training so I can maintain the system myself. * Clearly identify any additional subscription, payment-processing or integration costs. Please include in your quote: 1. Examples of Systeme.io funnels you have personally built. 2. Your experience with GoCardless and recurring Australian direct debit payments. 3. A fixed price and estimated completion time. 4. What is and isn’t included, including copywriting. 5. Any ongoing costs or likely limitations. 6. Confirmation that I will retain full ownership and administrator access. 7. Whether you provide post-launch support. I’m looking for a practical, cost-effective solution that I can manage independently once it is built.', 1, 'FIXED', 12916000.00, 12916000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('c0cce4fc-71e9-5c58-8787-e5bc3a3472ee', '0fa2ed50-a252-50ed-a828-c85084051c99', 'Qualtrics Development & Integration Specialist', 'Qualtrics Developer – Assessment Customization, Scoring & Google Workspace Integration About the Project CoreWise is a values-based assessment and alignment platform designed to help individuals and professionals understand what matters most, measure alignment, and track progress across five life domains. We currently have a functioning assessment built in Qualtrics, with an existing backend integration to Google Workspace. We are looking for an experienced Qualtrics developer to review our existing system, understand its architecture, and customize it into targeted assessments for different professional audiences. **This is not a project to build a new assessment from scratch.** We want to leverage and improve our existing investment while creating a scalable, modular assessment structure. Scope of Work 1. Review Existing Qualtrics Assessment - Audit the current assessment structure, survey flow, scoring, and embedded data. - Understand the existing Google Workspace integration and data architecture. - Identify opportunities to reuse existing components and improve efficiency. 2. Customize Assessment for specific customer segments - Preserve and adapt the existing Core Values assessment. - Create or customize specific domain assessments. - Implement conditional logic, scoring, and relevant assessment pathways. - Develop a follow-up check-in experience to track changes and progress. - Maintain a consistent user experience and branding. 3. Integrate with Existing Google Workspace Backend - Review existing data transfer processes between Qualtrics and Google Workspace. - Ensure assessment responses are captured and stored accurately in both systems. - Map data fields appropriately for reporting and future analysis. - Maintain compatibility with existing Google Sheets, Google Apps Script, APIs, or other integrations currently in use. - Support reliable data connections across initial assessments and subsequent check-ins. 4. Build for Scalability - Structure the assessment to support additional professional audiences. - Enable reuse of common components such as Core Values and check-ins. - Establish an organized, maintainable architecture that can support future customization. 5. Testing and Documentation - Test the assessment experience, scoring, branching logic, and data integrations. - Identify and resolve errors. - Provide technical documentation outlining the architecture, integrations, and instructions for future modifications. -The project will be established as complete once we have an active customized assessment, and the steps and process are detailed to the owner via recorded video meeting. Required Qualifications - Demonstrated expertise with Qualtrics XM, including Survey Flow, Display Logic, Embedded Data, scoring, and workflows. - Experience customizing complex assessments rather than basic surveys. - Strong understanding of Qualtrics APIs, webhooks, and integrations. - Experience integrating Qualtrics with Google Workspace, particularly Google Sheets and Google Apps Script. - Proficiency with JavaScript, JSON, and data mapping. - Experience designing modular, scalable assessment structures. - Strong troubleshooting, quality assurance, and documentation skills. - Ability to review and build upon another developer''s existing work. Preferred Qualifications - Experience with psychometric, behavioral, values-based, coaching, or financial wellness assessments. - Experience creating longitudinal assessments and tracking participant progress over time. - Familiarity with automated reporting, dashboards, and data visualization. - Understanding of data privacy, access controls, and secure handling of participant information. - Ability to advise on technical improvements without unnecessarily rebuilding the existing system. Initial Deliverables 1. Technical audit of existing Qualtrics assessment and Google Workspace integration. 2. Recommendations for modular assessment architecture. 3. Functional customized assessment, including Core Values, specific categories, and Check-in sections. 4. Verified data integration with the existing backend. 5. Successful end-to-end testing. 6. Documentation and handoff via a video-recorded call. To Apply Please include: 1. Examples of Qualtrics assessments you have customized or developed. 2. Your experience integrating Qualtrics with Google Workspace or Google Sheets. 3. Your experience working with existing Qualtrics projects developed by someone else. 4. How you would approach building multiple professional versions from one core assessment. 5. Your rate and estimated effort for an initial technical audit. We are looking for a reliable technical partner who can support the continued evolution of CoreWise as the platform expands.', 1, 'FIXED', 30998000.00, 30998000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('b82d2cb1-468e-53a5-8590-bb703922e689', '203776dd-5298-54f9-8061-3b9fe8eab5c5', 'Build 300 Website Pages', 'I have a website design already created and need help building out 300 pages properly. The work includes creating each page, ensuring the layout matches the provided design, and making sure everything is set up correctly for smooth performance. I’m looking for someone who can work efficiently, communicate clearly, and deliver high-quality results on time.', 1, 'HOURLY', 387000.00, 775000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('34c2186f-c32e-530b-87a8-3dbfcbfa9188', '00c3b05a-472c-5eeb-86a4-dc75f4199b32', 'Website Tech Support for Contact Page', 'I need help troubleshooting my website to make sure the contact page is working properly and that I receive emails correctly. I also want to confirm that when products are downloaded, they are actually sent to the customer’s email. Please review the current setup, identify any issues, and fix them so everything functions reliably. The goal is to ensure a smooth customer experience and dependable communication through the site.', 1, 'HOURLY', 258000.00, 517000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('5f043c65-3c0a-5191-aaf3-bca59e8f628a', '65be3596-9973-5958-bfc6-0f23986ecc71', 'Website build', 'Need a website built, artwork is already done, need hosting for the next 3 years on something we would control.', 1, 'FIXED', 2583000.00, 2583000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('b9cb1db9-49e4-5fd2-ae25-b24245ae5208', '9cea725d-58c8-5deb-bb33-26bf100bbce2', 'Web Developer for Complete Redesign', 'We are seeking an experienced web developer to lead a complete redesign of our existing website. The ideal candidate will transform our online presence by focusing on modern aesthetics, user experience, and responsiveness. You will collaborate with our team to ensure brand consistency and incorporate feedback efficiently. Proficiency in HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and design tools is essential. A strong portfolio showcasing previous redesigns is required to demonstrate expertise in the field.', 1, 'HOURLY', 982000.00, 1240000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('a84bbb0a-572a-5b7c-b2b1-f98b148f0661', 'b32ba739-a1ee-54a5-8825-097243da3bf6', 'Web Development for Painting Company', 'I need a professional web developer for my local residential int/ext painting company. The site should be clean, professional, and easy to navigate, with clear information about services, pricing, and contact details. I’m looking for someone who can create a polished online presence that reflects my business and helps attract local customers. Check out dieselpainting.com to get an idea of what I looking for.', 1, 'FIXED', 25832000.00, 25832000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('c04c3e74-3ce0-5d8b-9300-d3125d8b9373', '089c3ef9-58cd-5cc9-a316-21a1c56f6aad', 'Rapid UI Designer for Mobile App', 'We need a UI designer to start TODAY (within a few hours) on a consumer-focused app project. The work includes modernizing existing components, designing new elements, and creating parts of screens quickly rather than a full redesign. You should be able to export assets in code, share updates rapidly, and provide real-time feedback on UX, navigation, and responsiveness. This is a part-time role for someone who can work fast, communicate clearly, and show experience designing mobile apps that feel modern, fresh, and fun to use.', 1, 'HOURLY', 387000.00, 904000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('7edd40e6-1ed5-598a-965d-7cc092328388', '12e5f875-bbfb-5a9a-820e-384c61cc2ad6', 'Clean website 403 file issues', 'I have websites on our Bluehost that have a 403 forbidden issue. The hosting has malware, so all of our websites on the hosting are bad. They do not open up. So I need someone to grab the website files, clean it on a different hosting, then send the clean files back. $10 per website. I will start with 1 at a time.', 1, 'FIXED', 258000.00, 258000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('98fa9be5-46f4-541e-869e-32b520cba6ce', '001469b2-d22a-552f-bc82-ec47844fa5ea', 'Website desing', 'I am founder of companion app. I am seeking a UI/UX design developer.', 1, 'HOURLY', 310000.00, 723000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('ed6717b6-50e5-53a6-bb12-2d56a15e0e09', 'c2954d0e-0c3b-546a-9e2f-8f3e74531862', 'Rediseño de Sitio Web', 'Solamente se reciben propuestas en español. Rediseño de centrokidoz.com. Un diseño moderno y limpio, mucho más rápido y preparado para los buscadores con inteligencia artificial, conservando el contenido y el posicionamiento que ya tienen en Google. (nuevo diseño propuesto: https://kidoz-demo.pahee.workers.dev/) El nuevo sitio conservará el contenido y el posicionamiento en Google, , y quedará preparado para aparecer tanto en Google como en las respuestas de herramientas de inteligencia artificial como ChatGPT, Gemini, Perplexity y Copilot. Diseño nuevo Tema propio de WordPress, sin Porto ni WPBakery (actual, con la misma línea visual adaptada a Kidoz. Plantillas para especialidades, médicos, enfermedades, ultrasonidos y artículos, y diseño propio para las páginas principales. Velocidad Tema liviano, imágenes al tamaño en que se muestran y sin archivos que frenen la carga. La meta es cumplir los Core Web Vitals de Google en celular en los dos sitios. Paso del contenido sin perder el SEO Los sitios siguen en WordPress, en el mismo hosting y con los mismos dominios. Cada página pasa a su plantilla nueva con las mismas direcciones, textos y encabezados, y con los títulos y descripciones de Yoast. La propuesta contempla el diseño y desarrollo completo del sitio unificado, incluyendo: · Diseño UX/UI moderno, cálido y profesional, pensado para padres de familia. · Tema liviano, sin constructores pesados, enfocado en velocidad. · Diseño responsive para computadora, tablet y dispositivos móviles. · Página de inicio. · Especialidades, con una página para cada una de las más de 25 especialidades. · Directorio médico con filtro por especialidad y por sede. · Páginas de sedes: Rohrmoser y Curridabat (Clinykids), con mapa, horario, teléfono y WhatsApp de cada una. · Servicios destacados: desarrollo y comportamiento, materno fetal, vacunación, laboratorio y electroencefalograma. · Consejos de salud (blog), con plantillas ya diseñadas para que la clínica siga publicando. · Solicitud de cita por WhatsApp, llamada o formulario, según la sede. · Integración de las reseñas de Google. · Corrección de ortografía, enlaces y datos de contacto. · Certificado SSL, configuración de seguridad y herramientas de analítica. · Publicación y puesta en producción. 5. SEO — · Investigación de palabras clave para pediatría y especialidades en Costa Rica. · Optimización SEO On-Page: títulos, meta descripciones, encabezados y URLs. · SEO técnico: velocidad, Core Web Vitals, indexación, sitemap y robots.txt. · SEO local para ambas sedes y optimización de los perfiles de Google Business. · Datos estructurados médicos: clínica, médicos y especialidades. · Google Search Console y Google Analytics. · Optimización mensual de páginas estratégicas. · Reporte mensual de posicionamiento y tráfico. 6. GEO — Optimización para buscadores con IA — El GEO (Generative Engine Optimization) prepara el sitio para que la clínica sea recomendada en las respuestas de herramientas de inteligencia artificial cuando un padre pregunta, por ejemplo, por un pediatra o una especialidad en San José. · Optimización para ChatGPT, Gemini, Perplexity, Copilot y los resúmenes con IA de Google. · Firma “Revisado por” de un médico en cada página de salud, para reforzar la confianza del contenido. · Contenido en formato de preguntas y respuestas sobre especialidades y padecimientos frecuentes. · Datos estructurados que las IA puedan leer con facilidad. · Alta en Bing Webmaster Tools, fuente que utilizan varias herramientas de IA. · Medición mensual del tráfico que llega desde herramientas de IA y de las menciones de la clínica. Medimos cada página antes y después del cambio. Preparación para buscadores con IA Datos estructurados médicos (clínica, médicos y especialidades), firma "Revisado por" de un médico en cada página de salud, alta en Bing Webmaster Tools y medición mensual del tráfico que llega desde ChatGPT, Copilot, Perplexity y Gemini. se siguen publicando igual que ahora: el editor de WordPress queda con bloques ya diseñados para que los artículos nuevos salgan con el estilo del sitio. Incluye una capacitación y la documentación del tema. El código del tema se entrega en un repositorio a nombre de la clínica. We will accept only proposals in Spanish # Website Redesign – centrokidoz.com Redesign of centrokidoz.com with a modern, clean, and significantly faster website, optimized for traditional search engines and AI-powered search tools, while preserving the existing content and Google search rankings. The new website will retain its current content and Google search visibility while being optimized to appear in both traditional Google search results and responses generated by artificial intelligence platforms such as ChatGPT, Gemini, Perplexity, and Copilot. ## 1. Website Design and Development **New Design** A custom WordPress theme, replacing the current Porto theme and WPBakery page builder, with a modern visual identity tailored to Kidoz. The website will include dedicated templates for medical specialties, physicians, medical conditions, ultrasound services, and articles, along with custom designs for the main pages. **Website Performance** A lightweight theme, properly sized images, and the elimination of unnecessary files and scripts that slow down page loading. The goal is to meet Google''s Core Web Vitals standards on mobile devices for both websites. **Content Migration Without Losing SEO** Both websites will remain on WordPress, using the same hosting provider and existing domain names. Each page will be migrated to its new template while preserving its current URL, content, headings, and Yoast SEO titles and meta descriptions. ## 2. Scope of the Website Redesign The proposal includes the complete design and development of a unified website, covering: - Modern, welcoming, and professional UX/UI design, specifically developed for parents and families. - Lightweight WordPress theme without resource-intensive page builders, prioritizing speed and performance. - Fully responsive design for desktop computers, tablets, and mobile devices. - Homepage design and development. - Medical specialties section, with individual pages for each of the more than 25 specialties. - Physician directory with filters by', 1, 'FIXED', 38748000.00, 38748000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('b51ba558-4053-5870-8e93-7338333ccb03', 'cf886fe6-7c22-567d-986d-4e7fa97db16a', 'Làm giao diện như mẫu có sẳn và ghi lại nội dung cho chuẩn SEO Google', 'Làm giao diện như mẫu có sẳn và ghi lại nội dung cho chuẩn SEO google. Mục tiêu công việc - Thiết kế giao diện website dựa trên mẫu có sẵn (client cung cấp) - Biên tập & chuẩn hóa nội dung website theo chuẩn SEO Google, phục vụ mục tiêu hiển thị và tăng khả năng tiếp cận người dùng trên công cụ tìm kiếm. YÊU CẦU ỨNG VIÊN - Có kinh nghiệm: 1. Thiết kế giao diện web (UI/UX cơ bản) 2. Viết hoặc biên tập nội dung website - Hiểu SEO Onpage Google ở mức cơ bản - Ưu tiên đã từng làm: Landing page
INSERT INTO job (id, project_id, title, description, quantity, salary_type, budget_min, budget_max, status, created_at, updated_at)
VALUES
    ('213cc126-8b55-5230-8cbc-049de6701f0e', '9497fe7c-bdb7-5fba-ad64-c42aa554fe53', 'UI/UX Design for Travel App Refresh', 'We need a UI/UX designer to refresh an existing travel app with a modern facelift. The goal is to improve the overall look and feel while keeping the app functional and user-friendly. The app is built in Ionic, so HTML-based design output is preferred. Experience with mobile app redesigns and a strong sense of modern visual style are important for this project. You can find the current app and screenshots here: - iOS: https://apps.apple.com/us/app/guibo/id1375069250 - Android: https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.schneidergeo.guibo Please showcase travel related app design projects you have done in the past.', 1, 'HOURLY', 387000.00, 1292000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('36140254-50ed-52ba-94ca-38bdf4c18d8b', 'f2aeed57-a274-529e-b7c0-f89dc6738bf2', 'Vacation/short term rental direct booking website needed', 'Need a vacation/short term rental direct booking website for 2 small properties near Disney. Set up so that I can change the verbiage in the sections as needed throughout the year. As well as rate updates. I have a domain name. I like the looks of: https://lotolanding.com/ https://lotolanding.com/house-rules/ https://www.orlandoadventurehomes.com/availability https://www.plumguide.com/homes/1427205/paris-reverie#gallery https://www.plumguide.com/search?listingId=9006&location=Paris--France&placeId=ChIJD7fiBh9u5kcRYJSMaMOCCwQ&propertyTypes=1&utm_medium=homepage https://www.thethinkingtraveller.com/results', 1, 'FIXED', 1292000.00, 1292000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('a8c960e3-4d88-5555-9746-9f751e9fb6f5', 'c6191fb5-474f-5393-b899-d3b16fa7eaeb', 'Thiết kế web bán du lịch', 'Các trang bao gồm: Trang chủ, form lấy thông tin của khách hàng, bán vé xe, bán combo xe + khách sạn nhiều tỉnh thành. Thiết kế giao diện dễ sử dụng, thân thiện với người dùng, hiển thị tốt trên cả máy tính và điện thoại. Hỗ trợ hướng dẫn quản trị cơ bản sau khi bàn giao. *Có kinh nghiệm thiết kế website dịch vụ hoặc website du lịch. *Có khả năng xây dựng giao diện hiện đại, tối ưu trải nghiệm người dùng. *Biết sử dụng các nền tảng phổ biến như WordPress, Laravel, hoặc framework phù hợp để phát triển website. *Có khả năng tư vấn thêm về cấu trúc website, bố cục nội dung và giải pháp kỹ thuật. *Ưu tiên ứng viên có sản phẩm demo hoặc portfolio các website đã thực hiện.', 1, 'FIXED', 500000.00, 1000000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('e4844a32-8fea-5114-82bd-69fc85b625b3', '68e33c9e-09ec-5747-b645-0817708081fd', 'Squarespace Website Redesign for Christmas Airbnb Promotion', 'I’m looking for a skilled Squarespace designer to redesign the homepage of a client’s website for the Christmas season. The client operates an Airbnb property business, and we want to give their existing homepage a festive Christmas look while promoting a special holiday offer to attract more bookings. Scope of Work - Redesign the existing Squarespace homepage with a clean, festive Christmas theme. - Add Christmas-inspired visuals, colours, and seasonal design elements without making the website look cluttered. - Create an attractive hero section highlighting the Christmas Airbnb offer. - Showcase the property with high-quality images and highlight its key features. - Add clear calls to action to encourage guests to enquire or book. - Ensure the design works smoothly across desktop, tablet, and mobile. - Maintain the brand’s identity while giving the homepage a fresh seasonal look. Requirements - Proven experience with Squarespace website design and redesign. - Strong skills in homepage design, layout, and visual presentation. - Experience designing landing pages for hospitality, Airbnb, or property businesses is a plus. - Good understanding of mobile responsiveness and conversion-focused design. Please share examples of Squarespace websites you’ve designed and briefly explain how you would approach this Christmas homepage redesign. I’m looking for someone who can deliver a polished seasonal design that helps the client showcase their property and promote their Christmas offer effectively.', 1, 'FIXED', 1292000.00, 1292000.00, 'RECRUITING', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-27 00:00:00+00'),
    ('aec2d043-f9ff-546a-8ab8-ed7ead91962c', 'dd374504-d984-58b2-9c89-7d93affb0557', 'React Developer for customer OBAR/Paragon Open MLS Integration on Lovable Site', 'I would like a completed, launch-ready BuyTheOuterBanks.com website based on the existing Lovable/React project, replacing the aging Blue Roof site without rebuilding the website from scratch. Retain and complete the existing Lovable/React project rather than replace its established foundation. The scope includes premium coastal design refinement, approved responsive pages including Commercial, approved content migration, lead capture and email notifications to my email address, live residential and commercial listings through direct OBAR / Paragon OpenMLS integration, SEO migration, production configuration, QA, launch, and handoff of the SoftDoes GitHub repository to me. From Blue Roof BuytheOuterBanks.com Remove sample listings, unverified sales, placeholder testimonials, unsupported claims, misleading sample data, and nonoperational portal or saved-search links before launch. Migrate BuyTheOuterBanks.com from Blue Roof with verified redirects, canonicals, sitemap, robots configuration, relevant schema, analytics or Tag Manager, Search Console, DNS, HTTPS, and email continuity, followed by agreed post-launch monitoring. Verify access to Blue Roof exports, Search Console, Analytics or GTM-KB2S8SQC, approved content, media, and coordinated Namecheap DNS changes before dependent work. Include the Commercial page in the initial launch scope and use my referenced Google Drive form as the requirements source. Review the actual form before finalizing fields or behavior rather than treating the current Lovable placeholder as complete. Use a SoftDoes-owned GitHub repository for development, version control, backup, collaboration, release history, and rollback. Transfer repository ownership to my GitHub account at final handoff in accordance with the approved payment and intellectual property terms. Keep Blue Roof active until required content exports and production validation are complete, and use a documented Namecheap DNS launch and rollback procedure that preserves existing email-related records. Use client-approved Privacy Policy and Terms content
